window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["fl16"]={"id": "fl16", "title": "Rectified Flow", "focus": "把生成写成直线 ODE：rectified flow 的回归目标、直线轨迹的可积性、与 OT 路径的关系；说明“拉直”如何减少采样步数。", "claims": ["\\dot X_t=v(X_t,t),\\ v=\\arg\\min\\mathbb E\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2", "X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1\\ \\text{（线性插值）}", "\\text{若 }(X_0,X_1)\\ \\text{独立，轨迹为直线；否则轨迹弯曲}"], "topics": ["Rectified Flow 的定义", "直线 ODE", "回归目标", "轨迹的可积性", "与 OT 路径的关系", "拉直的意义", "采样步数", "与 CFM 的对照", "反例：耦合不当导致轨迹弯曲", "Reflow", "与 Flow Maps 的接口", "与少步生成的接口", "代码：Rectified Flow 训练", "代码：轨迹曲率的测量", "与 Reflow 章的接口", "本章推导链：拉直 = 减少弯曲"], "html": "<h3 id=\"fl16--h-Rectified-Flow-的定义\">Rectified Flow 的定义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-Rectified-Flow-的定义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节固定如下记号。设数据空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，配以 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 与 Lebesgue 测度。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal P_2(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 为两个概率测度，分别称为源分布与目标分布，二者均满足二阶矩有限：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x\\|^2\\,\\mu_i(dx)&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=0,1$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\mathcal P_2(\\mathbb R^d\\times\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 为一个耦合，其边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0=\\mu_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_1=\\mu_1$</span>，即对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi(A\\times\\mathbb R^d)=\\mu_0(A)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi(\\mathbb R^d\\times A)=\\mu_1(A)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi$</span> 为该耦合下的随机向量。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 定义线性插值随机过程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t \\coloneqq (1-t)X_0+tX_1 .$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\coloneqq \\mathrm{Law}(X_t)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的分布，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\in\\mathcal P_2(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 在时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的线性插值测度：对任意有界 Borel 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int f\\,d\\mu_t=\\mathbb E\\big[f\\big((1-t)X_0+tX_1\\big)\\big].$$</div>\n<p>定义速度场类</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal V\\coloneqq\\Big\\{v:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathbb R^d\\ \\Big|\\ v\\ \\text{Borel 可测},\\ \\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|v(X_t,t)\\|^2\\,dt&lt;\\infty\\Big\\}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal V$</span> 定义回归泛函</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(v)\\coloneqq \\mathbb E\\Big[\\int_0^1\\big\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\big\\|^2\\,dt\\Big]\\in[0,\\infty] .$$</div>\n<p>本节的核心对象是如下最小化问题及其解。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1.1（Rectified Flow 速度场）</strong> 称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star\\in\\mathcal V$</span> 为耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 下的 rectified flow 速度场，若</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star\\in\\arg\\min_{v\\in\\mathcal V}\\mathcal L(v).$$</div>\n<p>称由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 驱动的 ODE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\dot X_t=v^\\star(X_t,t),\\qquad X_0\\sim\\mu_0$$</div>\n<p>为 rectified flow。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意定义 1.1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上的极小元，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 是平方损失关于随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_t,\\,X_1-X_0)$</span> 的期望，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 的逐点刻画应来自条件期望，而非某个预先给定的向量场。这一点是本节与后续各节的出发点：rectified flow 的速度场不是“设计”出来的，而是“回归”出来的。它与相邻概念的区别须在定义层面说清：</p>\n<p>（i）与 score-based 扩散模型的区别：后者的速度场由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log\\mu_t$</span> 经得分匹配给出，其 ODE 漂移依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的对数梯度；rectified flow 的速度场由条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 给出，不涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的密度或其梯度。</p>\n<p>（ii）与一般连续性方程解的区别：任一满足连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\mu_t+\\nabla\\cdot(\\mu_t v)=0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 都可驱动某个 ODE 输运 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>；rectified flow 在这一族中挑出与线性插值路径的切向量做 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 回归最小的那一个。</p>\n<p>（iii）与最优传输（OT）映射的区别：OT 映射是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的推前映射，一般不是时间依赖向量场；rectified flow 是时间依赖向量场，且其诱导的路径未必是 OT 测地线——二者的关系留待第 5 节展开，本节只给出定义与基本刻画。</p>\n<p>下面给出本节所需的假设。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（耦合的二阶矩）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。等价地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\mathcal P_2(\\mathbb R^d\\times\\mathbb R^d)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（速度场的平方可积性）</strong> 所考虑的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|v(X_t,t)\\|^2dt&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（条件期望的正则性）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=\\cdot]$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的 Borel 函数存在且平方可积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]\\|^2\\,\\mu_t(dx)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>假设 A3 在 A1 下自动成立：由条件 Jensen 不等式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\big\\|\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]\\big\\|^2\\mu_t(dx)=\\mathbb E\\big\\|\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]\\big\\|^2\\le\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty,$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2\\le 2(\\mathbb E\\|X_0\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|^2)&lt;\\infty$</span> 由 A1 给出。因此 A3 不是独立假设，而是 A1 的推论，列出它是为了在证明中显式引用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-1-回归泛函的逐点最小化\">1. 回归泛函的逐点最小化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-1-回归泛函的逐点最小化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1.2（条件期望即极小元）</strong> 在假设 A1、A2 下，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star(x,t)\\coloneqq \\mathbb E\\big[X_1-X_0\\ \\big|\\ X_t=x\\big],\\qquad (x,t)\\in\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1].$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star\\in\\mathcal V$</span>，且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal V$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v^\\star)\\le\\mathcal L(v)$</span>；进一步，等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(X_t,t)=v^\\star(X_t,t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\otimes dt$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_t,t)$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 先验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star\\in\\mathcal V$</span>。由 A3，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(\\cdot,t)\\in L^2(\\mu_t)$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2dt=\\int_0^1\\Big(\\int\\|v^\\star(x,t)\\|^2\\mu_t(dx)\\Big)dt\\le\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2dt=\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty,$$</div>\n<p>其中第一个等号用了 Fubini–Tonelli（被积函数非负可测，积分可为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，故无需可积性前提），不等号用了条件 Jensen。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star\\in\\mathcal V$</span>。</p>\n<p>再证极小性。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal V$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v)$</span> 展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(v)=\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|v(X_t,t)\\|^2dt-2\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\langle v(X_t,t),\\,X_1-X_0\\rangle\\,dt+\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>三项均有限：第一项由 A2，第三项由 A1，第二项由 Cauchy–Schwarz 与 A2、A1 控制。对第二项用条件期望的塔性质：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t)$</span>-可测的，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\langle v(X_t,t),\\,X_1-X_0\\rangle\\,dt=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\Big[\\big\\langle v(X_t,t),\\,\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]\\big\\rangle\\Big]dt=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\big\\langle v(X_t,t),\\,v^\\star(X_t,t)\\big\\rangle\\,dt,$$</div>\n<p>这里交换期望与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dt$</span> 积分用的是 Fubini，可积性由上述控制给出。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(v)-\\mathcal L(v^\\star)=\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\big\\|v(X_t,t)-v^\\star(X_t,t)\\big\\|^2dt\\ \\ge 0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v^\\star)$</span> 的展开式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v)$</span> 相同，仅把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span>，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\langle v^\\star(X_t,t),X_1-X_0\\rangle=\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2$</span>。等号成立当且仅当上述非负被积函数的期望为零，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(X_t,t)=v^\\star(X_t,t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\otimes dt$</span>-a.e. 成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.2 是本节的主定理：它把定义 1.1 中“在函数空间上最小化”的无穷维问题化为逐点条件期望，并给出唯一性（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\otimes dt$</span>-a.e. 意义下）。注意这里没有假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 有密度，也没有假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 连续；条件期望作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_t)$</span> 的元素只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. 意义下确定，这正是“逐点”一词的精确含义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-2-线性插值的切向量恒等式\">2. 线性插值的切向量恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-2-线性插值的切向量恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1.3（切向量恒等式）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，随机向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 与线性插值路径的导数满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}X_t=X_1-X_0\\qquad\\text{（对每个样本轨道，逐点成立）},$$</div>\n<p>且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s,t\\in[0,1]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t-X_s=(t-s)(X_1-X_0).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导（这是关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的多项式，逐样本可微）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}X_t=-X_0+X_1$</span>。第二式由线性插值的仿射性直接计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t-X_s=\\big[(1-t)X_0+tX_1\\big]-\\big[(1-s)X_0+sX_1\\big]=(s-t)X_0+(t-s)X_1=(t-s)(X_1-X_0).\\ \\square$$</div>\n<p>命题 1.3 说明：线性插值路径的切向量恰为终点减起点，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关。这正是回归目标取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 而非某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>-依赖向量的原因——在直线插值下，切向量是常数。但须强调：命题 1.3 是关于<strong>样本轨道</strong>的恒等式，它不蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 诱导的 ODE 轨道就是线性插值轨道。后者需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(X_t,t)=X_1-X_0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\otimes dt$</span>-a.e. 成立，而这仅在特殊耦合下才可能；一般情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 上的条件期望，是切向量的“平均化”，故 ODE 轨道一般弯曲。这一区别是第 2 节与第 9 节的主题，本节只作定义层面的澄清。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-3-一个可检验的恒等式-回归残差与耦合熵\">3. 一个可检验的恒等式：回归残差与耦合熵<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-3-一个可检验的恒等式-回归残差与耦合熵\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1.4（残差恒等式）</strong> 在假设 A1、A2 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 如命题 1.2，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(v^\\star)=\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2dt .$$</div>\n<p>等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v^\\star)=\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-\\int_0^1\\int\\|v^\\star(x,t)\\|^2\\mu_t(dx)\\,dt$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v^\\star)$</span> 的展开式中，交叉项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\mathbb E\\int\\langle v^\\star(X_t,t),X_1-X_0\\rangle dt$</span>。由塔性质与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 的定义，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[\\langle v^\\star(X_t,t),X_1-X_0\\rangle\\big]=\\mathbb E\\big[\\langle v^\\star(X_t,t),\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]\\rangle\\big]=\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>代入展开式即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.4 给出一个可检验的推论：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v^\\star)\\ge 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v^\\star)\\le\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2$</span>；当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的可测函数（即耦合使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 决定）时残差为零。这一条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的可测函数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 决定——这正是确定性耦合（OT 映射）的情形。故命题 1.4 在定义层面已预示了第 5 节“与 OT 路径的关系”：确定性耦合使回归残差消失，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 精确复现线性插值切向量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-4-具体例子-一维高斯耦合\">4. 具体例子：一维高斯耦合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-4-具体例子-一维高斯耦合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，并取独立耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\mu_0\\otimes\\mu_1$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\perp X_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>。计算条件期望。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 联合高斯，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_t,X_1-X_0)$</span> 亦联合高斯。直接计算协方差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_t,\\,X_1-X_0)=\\mathbb E\\big[(1-t)X_0+tX_1)(X_1-X_0)\\big]=(1-t)\\mathbb E[X_0X_1]-(1-t)\\mathbb E X_0^2+t\\mathbb E X_1^2-t\\mathbb E[X_1X_0].$$</div>\n<p>由独立性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_0X_1]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E X_0^2=\\mathbb E X_1^2=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_t,X_1-X_0)=-(1-t)+t=2t-1$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_t)=(1-t)^2+t^2$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]=\\frac{\\mathrm{Cov}(X_t,X_1-X_0)}{\\mathrm{Var}(X_t)}\\,x=\\frac{2t-1}{(1-t)^2+t^2}\\,x .$$</div>\n<p>检验命题 1.4：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2=2$</span>，而</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2dt=\\int_0^1\\frac{(2t-1)^2}{(1-t)^2+t^2}\\,dt .$$</div>\n<p>被积函数可化简：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=(1-t)^2+t^2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2t-1)^2=4t^2-4t+1$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=2t^2-2t+1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2t-1)^2=2u-1$</span>。于是被积函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2-1/u$</span>，积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2-\\int_0^1 dt/u$</span>。由对称性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 dt/u=\\int_0^1 dt/\\big((t-1/2)^2+1/4\\big)=\\big[\\arctan(2(t-1/2))\\big]_0^1\\cdot 2=\\pi$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star\\|^2dt=2-\\pi$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v^\\star)=2-(2-\\pi)=\\pi$</span>。这个值严格为正，与命题 1.4 的判据一致：独立耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 不由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 决定，残差非零。同时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处为零、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1$</span> 时发散为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x/(1-t)^2$</span> 型（分母在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,1)=x$</span>），说明该速度场在端点附近行为剧烈——这正是后续“轨迹弯曲”与“采样步数”讨论的定量来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-5-定义层面的三条辨析\">5. 定义层面的三条辨析<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-5-定义层面的三条辨析\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第一，rectified flow 的速度场是<strong>回归量</strong>而非<strong>设计量</strong>。命题 1.2 表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 唯一确定（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\otimes dt$</span>-a.e. 意义下），因此“给定耦合，rectified flow 是什么”是一个有确定答案的数学问题，而不是建模选择。第二，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 依赖耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 单独。同一对边缘可以配不同耦合，得到不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span>；第 9 节将用反例说明耦合不当会使 ODE 轨道弯曲。第三，定义 1.1 中的 ODE 初值取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 是在插值过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 上回归的；二者的一致性由命题 1.2 的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(X_t,t)=X_1-X_0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下最优”保证，但不保证 ODE 的解分布在每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 都等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>——后者需要额外的连续性方程论证，属第 4 节“轨迹的可积性”。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Rectified flow 由三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mu_0,\\mu_1,\\pi)$</span> 定义：速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 是平方回归泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v)=\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2dt$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上的极小元，由命题 1.2 刻画为条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\otimes dt$</span>-a.e. 意义下唯一。</li>\n<li>线性插值的切向量恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}X_t=X_1-X_0$</span> 是样本轨道层面的精确等式（命题 1.3），但它不蕴含 ODE 轨道为直线；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 是切向量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 上的条件平均，残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v^\\star)=\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2dt$</span>（命题 1.4）度量了这种平均化造成的信息损失。</li>\n<li>定义层面的关键区分是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 由耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 决定而非由边缘决定；独立耦合下残差严格为正（一维高斯例给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v^\\star)=\\pi$</span>），确定性耦合下残差为零。这一区分是后续“直线 ODE”“与 OT 路径的关系”“耦合不当导致轨迹弯曲”各节的逻辑起点。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nd = 4\nn = 200000\n\n# 独立耦合：X0, X1 ~ N(0, I)\nX0 = torch.randn(n, d)\nX1 = torch.randn(n, d)\n\n# 线性插值 X_t = (1-t) X0 + t X1，取 t=0.3\nt = torch.tensor(0.3)\nXt = (1 - t) * X0 + t * X1\nY = X1 - X0  # 切向量\n\n# 用最小二乘拟合线性 v*(x,t) = A x（高斯情形下条件期望是线性的）\n# 解 A = Cov(Xt, Y) Cov(Xt)^(-1)\nXt_c = Xt - Xt.mean(0, keepdim=True)\nY_c = Y - Y.mean(0, keepdim=True)\nCov_XY = (Xt_c.T @ Y_c) / (n - 1)\nCov_XX = (Xt_c.T @ Xt_c) / (n - 1)\nA = Cov_XY @ torch.linalg.inv(Cov_XX)\n\n# 理论值：独立标准高斯下 Cov(Xt,Y) = (2t-1) I, Cov(Xt) = ((1-t)^2+t^2) I\ncoef = (2 * t - 1) / ((1 - t) ** 2 + t ** 2)\nA_theory = coef * torch.eye(d)\n\nassert A.shape == (d, d)\nassert torch.allclose(A, A_theory, atol=2e-2), (A, A_theory)\n\n# 验证命题 1.4 的残差恒等式（用样本估计）\nv_star = Xt @ A.T\nresidual = ((v_star - Y) ** 2).sum(1).mean()\nrhs = (Y ** 2).sum(1).mean() - (v_star ** 2).sum(1).mean()\nassert torch.allclose(residual, rhs, atol=1e-4), (residual, rhs)\n\nprint(&quot;A shape:&quot;, A.shape)\nprint(&quot;A 与理论值最大偏差:&quot;, (A - A_theory).abs().max().item())\nprint(&quot;残差:&quot;, residual.item(), &quot; 恒等式右端:&quot;, rhs.item())\nprint(&quot;预期：偏差 &lt; 2e-2，残差与右端一致（差 &lt; 1e-4）&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-6-定义-1-1-中函数空间选择的必要性\">6. 定义 1.1 中函数空间选择的必要性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-6-定义-1-1-中函数空间选择的必要性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定义 1.1 把极小化限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上，而非全部 Borel 可测向量场。这一限制并非技术性装饰，而是使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 成为良定义泛函的必要条件。若允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 任意可测，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v)$</span> 可能取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，此时“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\min$</span>”在扩展实值泛函上仍可定义，但命题 1.2 的展开式将失效：交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\int\\langle v(X_t,t),X_1-X_0\\rangle dt$</span> 可能无界，Fubini 交换不再合法。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 的平方可积性恰好保证展开式中三项均有限，从而使“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v)-\\mathcal L(v^\\star)=\\mathbb E\\int\\|v-v^\\star\\|^2dt$</span>”这一配平方等式成立。</p>\n<p>进一步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi\\otimes dt)$</span> 的闭子空间吗？不是。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 中的元素是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)\\mapsto v(x,t)$</span> 形式的函数，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi\\otimes dt)$</span> 中的元素是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_t,t)$</span> 的可测函数；二者通过复合映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\mapsto v(X_t,t)$</span> 联系。该复合映射的像并非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi\\otimes dt)$</span> 的全空间：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上退化（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\delta_0$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的分布支撑可能低于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维，此时不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 可以在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. 意义下相同却在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\otimes dt$</span> 意义下不同。命题 1.2 的“唯一性”正是在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\otimes dt$</span>-a.e. 意义下陈述的，这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 的选取一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的实际支撑上被确定，支撑之外的值任意，不影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上的极小元存在性）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上达到最小值，且命题 1.2 给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 是一个极小元。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1.2 已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star\\in\\mathcal V$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v^\\star)\\le\\mathcal L(v)$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal V$</span> 成立，故存在性由显式构造给出，无需泛函分析的存在性定理。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.5 说明：本节不需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 的紧性、凸性或在弱拓扑下的下半连续性——极小元由条件期望显式给出，存在性与极小性一并证明。这与变分法中“先证存在再刻画”的路径不同，是回归问题的特殊结构所致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-7-与条件流匹配目标的符号对照\">7. 与条件流匹配目标的符号对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-7-与条件流匹配目标的符号对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节定义 1.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 与第 8 节将讨论的条件流匹配（CFM）目标在形式上接近，须在定义层面预先厘清符号差异，以免后续节混淆。CFM 的一般形式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{CFM}}(v)\\coloneqq\\mathbb E\\Big[\\int_0^1\\big\\|v(X_t,t)-\\dot X_t\\big\\|^2dt\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_t)$</span> 是某个预先指定的、从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的随机插值过程，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 是其样本轨道导数。Rectified flow 是 CFM 在<strong>线性插值</strong>这一特定选择下的特例：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=X_1-X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{CFM}}$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span>。</p>\n<p>这一对照的意义在于：CFM 的插值过程可以是非线性的（例如方差保持的扩散插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\alpha_tX_0+\\sigma_tX_1$</span>），此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 且一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span>；rectified flow 的定义 1.1 把插值固定为线性，从而把回归目标固定为常数向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span>。第 8 节将证明：在一般 CFM 中，条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\dot X_t\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 是速度场，而在线性插值下该条件期望恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>，与命题 1.2 一致。故本节的定义是 CFM 框架的一个坐标选择，而非独立构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-8-定义对测度支撑的依赖-一个结构性的观察\">8. 定义对测度支撑的依赖：一个结构性的观察<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-8-定义对测度支撑的依赖-一个结构性的观察\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1.2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 上有定义。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的支撑随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1]$</span> 上的函数可能在支撑的并集之外无定义。为使定义 1.1 的 ODE 有意义，须要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在 ODE 轨道所经过的区域上有定义。这一要求由如下观察保证：</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.6（支撑的并集覆盖插值轨道）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(\\mu_t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathrm{supp}(\\mu_t)^c$</span>，则存在开邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\ni x$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t(U)=0$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=\\mathrm{Law}(X_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(X_t\\in U)=0$</span>。故对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.e. 样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t\\notin U$</span>，特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t\\neq x$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=X_t$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.6 是平凡的，但它澄清了一个常见误解：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(\\mu_t)$</span> 之外的值不影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span>，也不影响 ODE 在插值轨道上的取值；但 ODE 的解轨道未必等于插值轨道（这正是第 2 节的主题），故 ODE 可能把粒子带到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(\\mu_t)$</span> 之外，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 的取值需要由定义 1.1 之外的延拓规则确定。第 4 节“轨迹的可积性”将用连续性方程论证：在适当正则性下，ODE 的解分布在每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>，从而解轨道自动落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(\\mu_t)$</span> 内，延拓问题消失。本节只指出这一依赖的存在，不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-9-定义的一个等价变分刻画\">9. 定义的一个等价变分刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-9-定义的一个等价变分刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1.2 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 的极小化化为逐点条件期望。下面给出另一个等价刻画，它在后续“拉直”讨论中更便于操作：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 写成关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘泛函之和。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.7（按时间分解的变分刻画）</strong> 在假设 A1、A2 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal V$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(v)=\\int_0^1\\mathcal L_t(v)\\,dt,\\qquad \\mathcal L_t(v)\\coloneqq\\mathbb E\\big\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\big\\|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 的极小元当且仅当对 Lebesgue-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(\\cdot,t)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_t)$</span> 上的极小元。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由 Fubini–Tonelli 给出：被积函数非负，故积分与期望可交换，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v)=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2dt$</span>。第二式：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 极小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t(v)\\ge\\mathcal L_t(v^\\star)$</span> 对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v)\\ge\\mathcal L(v^\\star)$</span>。反之，若存在正测度集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\subset[0,1]$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t(v^\\star)&gt;\\inf\\mathcal L_t$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 上，则可构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 上取逐点极小元、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^c$</span> 上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v)&lt;\\mathcal L(v^\\star)$</span>，矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.7 的价值在于：它把“时间上的全局极小化”分解为“每个时刻的边缘极小化”，而后者由命题 1.2 的条件期望逐点给出。二者的一致性说明 rectified flow 的速度场在时间上是<strong>逐时刻独立</strong>确定的——不存在跨时刻的耦合约束。这一点在第 6 节“拉直的意义”中将被重新审视：拉直操作恰恰要引入跨时刻的约束（要求 ODE 轨道为直线），从而破坏这种逐时刻独立性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-10-定义中-直线-一词的精确含义\">10. 定义中“直线”一词的精确含义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-10-定义中-直线-一词的精确含义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题与定义 1.1 使用“rectified flow”一词，其中“rectified”通常译为“拉直”。须在定义层面澄清：定义 1.1 本身<strong>不</strong>保证 ODE 轨道为直线。定义只规定速度场是线性插值切向量的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 回归，而线性插值轨道是直线（命题 1.3），但 ODE 轨道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v^\\star(X_t,t)$</span> 一般不是直线——因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 是条件期望，它在每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 处取的是所有经过该点的插值轨道切向量的平均，而非某一条特定轨道的切向量。</p>\n<p>精确地说，称 ODE 轨道为直线，是指存在随机向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0,Z_1$</span> 使解满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)Z_0+tZ_1$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。这等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 沿轨道为常数。由命题 1.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v^\\star(X_t,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]$</span>，故轨道为直线当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]$</span> 沿该轨道为常数。这一条件在确定性耦合（<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的函数）下成立：此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的函数，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 时是确定的，故条件期望退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 本身。在独立耦合下一般不成立，一维高斯例（第 4 小节）已给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)$</span> 显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 且依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，故轨道弯曲。</p>\n<p>因此，“rectified flow”中的“rectified”描述的是<strong>回归目标的选择</strong>（用直线插值的切向量做目标），而非<strong>解轨道的几何形状</strong>。第 6 节“拉直的意义”将讨论如何通过改变耦合（reflow）使 ODE 轨道趋于直线，从而减少采样步数；本节的定义是这一操作的起点，但本身不含“拉直”的结论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-11-定义与连续性方程的接口\">11. 定义与连续性方程的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-11-定义与连续性方程的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定义 1.1 只规定了速度场，未规定其诱导的分布演化。后者由连续性方程刻画：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 足够正则且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 绝对连续，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t\\mu_t+\\nabla\\cdot(\\mu_t v^\\star)=0$$</div>\n<p>在分布意义下。本节不证明这一方程（属第 4 节），但须在定义层面指出：rectified flow 的“flow”一词指的是 ODE 诱导的流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=(\\Phi_t)_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 是否成立是一个<strong>独立于定义 1.1</strong> 的命题。定义 1.1 只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 是回归泛函的极小元；它不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi_t)_\\#\\mu_0=\\mu_t$</span>。二者的桥梁是第 4 节的轨迹可积性定理，其证明需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 的 Lipschitz 正则性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的绝对连续性——这些条件在定义 1.1 中未出现，故不能从定义直接推出。</p>\n<p>这一辨析防止一个常见错误：把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 逐点最优”误当成“ODE 解分布等于插值分布”。前者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影性质，后者是输运性质，二者需要不同的假设。第 9 节的反例将说明：在耦合不当且正则性缺失时，二者确实可以分离。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-12-一个非高斯的可计算例子-二点耦合\">12. 一个非高斯的可计算例子：二点耦合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-12-一个非高斯的可计算例子-二点耦合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为检验命题 1.2 与命题 1.4 在非高斯情形下的适用性，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\frac12(\\delta_{-1}+\\delta_{1})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\frac12(\\delta_{-2}+\\delta_{2})$</span>，并取<strong>确定性耦合</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=2X_0$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 的联合分布支撑在两点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(-1,-2),(1,2)\\}$</span> 上，各概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。</p>\n<p>计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1=(1-t)X_0+2tX_0=(1+t)X_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t\\in\\{-(1+t),1+t\\}$</span>，各概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。切向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=X_0$</span>。条件期望：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_0\\mid (1+t)X_0=x]=\\frac{x}{1+t},$$</div>\n<p>因为给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=x$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=x/(1+t)$</span> 是确定的。检验命题 1.4：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2=\\mathbb E X_0^2=1$</span>，而</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2dt=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\Big[\\frac{X_t^2}{(1+t)^2}\\Big]dt=\\int_0^1\\frac{(1+t)^2}{(1+t)^2}dt=1,$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v^\\star)=1-1=0$</span>，与确定性耦合下残差为零的判据一致。同时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=x/(1+t)$</span> 显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，故 ODE 轨道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=X_t/(1+t)$</span> 的解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0(1+t)$</span>，恰为线性插值轨道——这验证了确定性耦合下 ODE 轨道为直线。此例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 是两点分布（非绝对连续），但命题 1.2 与 1.4 仍成立，因为它们只用到条件期望的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 性质，不要求密度存在。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-13-定义中-t-的参数化与端点约定\">13. 定义中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的参数化与端点约定<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-13-定义中-t-的参数化与端点约定\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定义 1.1 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 为源、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 为目标。这一参数化是任意的：若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=1-t$</span>，则插值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_s=sX_0+(1-s)X_1$</span>，速度场相应变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0-X_1$</span>，ODE 反向。本节固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的约定，是为了与后续各节的符号一致：第 2 节“直线 ODE”将写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v^\\star(X_t,t)$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 积分到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>；第 7 节“采样步数”将讨论从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的离散化。端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>，这是定义的一部分，不是推论。</p>\n<p>须注意：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,1)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_1=x]$</span>，这是给定终点时的条件期望，一般不为零；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,0)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_0=x]=\\mathbb E[X_1\\mid X_0=x]-x$</span>，这是给定起点时的条件期望减去起点。二者都不是“端点速度为零”的约定。若在数值实现中把端点速度强制为零，则改变了回归目标，不再属于定义 1.1。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-14-定义的可测性与可积性再检验\">14. 定义的可测性与可积性再检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-14-定义的可测性与可积性再检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定义 1.1 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal V$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> Borel 可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|v(X_t,t)\\|^2dt&lt;\\infty$</span>。命题 1.2 构造的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 满足这两条：可测性由条件期望的正则版本存在性（Radon–Nikodym 定理的向量值版本，逐分量应用）保证；平方可积性由 A3 保证。但须注意：条件期望的正则版本只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. 意义下唯一，不同版本在零测集上可不同。若两个版本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_1^\\star,v_2^\\star$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_1^\\star=v_2^\\star$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，则它们在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 下给出相同的值，但作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1]$</span> 上的函数可能不同。定义 1.1 的极小元因此在严格意义上是一个等价类，而非单个函数。这一细节在后续讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性质时变得重要：等价类中可能存在一个 Lipschitz 版本，也可能全部不 Lipschitz，取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的几何。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-15-定义与-生成-一词的关系\">15. 定义与“生成”一词的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-15-定义与-生成-一词的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后澄清定义 1.1 中“生成”的含义。Rectified flow 作为生成模型，其任务是从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 采样并沿 ODE 演化到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>。定义 1.1 只规定了速度场，未规定采样算法；采样是第 7 节的主题。在定义层面，“生成”指的是 ODE 诱导的流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 推前到某个测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi_1)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，而该测度是否等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 是一个待证的命题（第 4 节）。定义 1.1 不承诺 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi_1)_\\#\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span>；它只承诺 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 是回归泛函的极小元。把这两件事混为一谈，是本节最需要防止的概念错误。命题 1.2 的证明只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影，未用到任何输运性质；输运性质需要第 4 节的连续性方程论证，其假设（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的绝对连续性）在定义 1.1 中不出现，故不能从定义直接得到。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ntorch.manual_seed(1)\n\n# 二点确定性耦合：X0 ∈ {-1, 1}, X1 = 2 X0\nn = 100000\nX0 = torch.where(torch.rand(n) &lt; 0.5, -torch.ones(n), torch.ones(n))\nX1 = 2 * X0\n\n# 检验命题 1.2 的条件期望 v*(x,t) = x/(1+t)（在支撑点上）\nfor t_val in [0.0, 0.25, 0.5, 0.75, 1.0]:\n    t = torch.tensor(t_val)\n    Xt = (1 - t) * X0 + t * X1\n    Y = X1 - X0\n    # 在支撑点 x = ±(1+t) 上，条件期望应为 x/(1+t)\n    mask_pos = Xt &gt; 0\n    v_at_pos = Y[mask_pos].mean()\n    v_at_neg = Y[~mask_pos].mean()\n    x_pos = Xt[mask_pos].mean()\n    x_neg = Xt[~mask_pos].mean()\n    expected_pos = x_pos / (1 + t_val)\n    expected_neg = x_neg / (1 + t_val)\n    assert torch.allclose(v_at_pos, expected_pos, atol=1e-5), (t_val, v_at_pos, expected_pos)\n    assert torch.allclose(v_at_neg, expected_neg, atol=1e-5), (t_val, v_at_neg, expected_neg)\n\n# 检验命题 1.4：确定性耦合下残差为零\nt = torch.tensor(0.5)\nXt = (1 - t) * X0 + t * X1\nY = X1 - X0\nv_star = Xt / (1 + t)\nresidual = ((v_star - Y) ** 2).mean()\nassert residual &lt; 1e-10, residual\n\n# 检验 ODE 轨道为直线：解 X_t = X_0 (1+t)，与插值一致\nt_grid = torch.linspace(0, 1, 11)\nfor t_val in t_grid:\n    Xt_interp = (1 - t_val) * X0 + t_val * X1\n    Xt_ode = X0 * (1 + t_val)\n    assert torch.allclose(Xt_interp, Xt_ode, atol=1e-6), (t_val, Xt_interp[:3], Xt_ode[:3])\n\nprint(&quot;二点耦合检验通过：条件期望 = x/(1+t)，残差 =&quot;, residual.item())\nprint(&quot;ODE 轨道与线性插值轨道一致（确定性耦合下为直线）&quot;)\nprint(&quot;预期：残差 &lt; 1e-10，轨道逐点一致（差 &lt; 1e-6）&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"fl16--h-直线-ODE\">直线 ODE<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-直线-ODE\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 1 节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim\\mu_1$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 为某耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 下的联合随机向量；线性插值路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>；速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>；直线 ODE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v(X_t,t)$</span>。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的耦合，即边缘分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\times\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的概率测度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>：插值路径在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边际分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=((1-t)\\mathrm{proj}_0+t\\,\\mathrm{proj}_1)_\\#\\pi$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{proj}_i$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个坐标投影。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span>：由耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 诱导的<strong>条件期望速度场</strong>，定义为\n  <div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\pi(x,t)=\\mathbb E\\big[X_1-X_0\\ \\big|\\ X_t=x\\big],\\qquad (x,t)\\in\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1],$$</div>\n  其中条件期望按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 与插值映射诱导的联合分布取。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{v}$</span>：速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 诱导的流映射，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_0^{v}=\\mathrm{id}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\Phi_t^{v}(x)=v(\\Phi_t^{v}(x),t)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{RF}}(v)$</span>：回归目标，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{RF}}(v)=\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\int_0^1\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\,dt$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节始终假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>；(A2) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(\\cdot,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz 且线性增长，从而 ODE 的流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi}$</span> 存在唯一；(A3) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 具有关于 Lebesgue 测度的密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上连续、紧支撑（从而边界通量消失）。假设 (A1) 保证回归目标有限；(A2) 保证直线 ODE 的 Cauchy 问题适定；(A3) 保证连续性方程在古典意义下成立并可用分部积分。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：证明在 (A1)–(A3) 下，直线 ODE 的流恰好把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 传输为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=(\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi})_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，并且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 独立时该 ODE 的轨迹恰为直线。这解释了“直线”一词的数学含义，也为后续“拉直”与“采样步数”两节提供可积性基础。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-1-条件期望速度场与插值路径的相容性\">1. 条件期望速度场与插值路径的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-1-条件期望速度场与插值路径的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（条件期望速度场诱导插值边际）</strong>　设 (A1)–(A3) 成立。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 为上述条件期望速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi}$</span> 为其流。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t=(\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi})_\\#\\mu_0.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t=(\\mathrm{id},(1-t)\\mathrm{proj}_0+t\\,\\mathrm{proj}_1)_\\#\\pi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_t,X_1-X_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\times\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的联合分布。由条件期望的定义，对任意有界可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\varphi(x)\\,v^\\pi(x,t)\\,\\mu_t(dx)=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d\\times\\mathbb R^d}\\varphi(x)\\,(y-x)\\,\\gamma_t(dx,dy).\\tag{1}$$</div>\n另一方面，对任意光滑紧支撑检验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，由插值路径的定义直接计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}f(x)\\,\\mu_t(dx)=\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb E_{\\pi}f\\big((1-t)X_0+tX_1\\big)=\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\big[\\nabla f(X_t)\\cdot(X_1-X_0)\\big].$$</div>\n这里求导与期望交换用的是 Leibniz 法则：被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f(X_t)\\cdot(X_1-X_0)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 可积（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 紧支撑、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f$</span> 有界而 (A1) 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>），故可交换。再用 (1) 把右端写成对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的积分：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}f(x)\\,\\mu_t(dx)=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\nabla f(x)\\cdot v^\\pi(x,t)\\,\\mu_t(dx).\\tag{2}$$</div>\n(2) 正是连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\mu_t+\\nabla\\cdot(v^\\pi\\mu_t)=0$</span> 的弱形式。由 (A3) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 的连续性与紧支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\rho_t$</span> 上局部 Lipschitz（(A2)），弱解即古典解；再由 (A2) 的流存在唯一性，Liouville 定理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=(\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi})_\\#\\mu_0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 不是任意选定的速度场，而是<strong>由插值边际唯一确定</strong>的速度场——它使插值路径的边际族成为其流的推送。这与第 1 节中“直线 ODE 是定义”的说法互补：定义给出 ODE 形式，命题 1 给出该 ODE 的解与插值路径的相容性。区别在于，命题 1 不声称 ODE 轨迹本身是直线；它只声称边际匹配。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-2-独立耦合下的直线轨迹定理\">2. 独立耦合下的直线轨迹定理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-2-独立耦合下的直线轨迹定理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（独立耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 直线轨迹）</strong>　设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\mu_0\\otimes\\mu_1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 独立）。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-几乎处处的初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，直线 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v^\\pi(X_t,t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=x_0$</span> 的解满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t=(1-t)x_0+t\\,\\mathbb E[X_1],\\qquad t\\in[0,1].$$</div>\n特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\delta_{x_1}$</span> 为点质量，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)x_0+t x_1$</span> 为连接 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span> 的直线段。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　独立时，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\mid X_t=x$</span> 的支撑落在仿射子空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_0:(1-t)x_0+t\\,\\mathbb E[X_1]=x\\}$</span> 上（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;1$</span>）；更直接地，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 与独立性，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]=\\mathbb E[X_1]-\\mathbb E[X_0\\mid X_t=x].$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\mid X_t=x$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)X_0=x-tX_1$</span>，取条件期望得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)\\mathbb E[X_0\\mid X_t=x]=x-t\\,\\mathbb E[X_1]$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_0\\mid X_t=x]=(x-t\\mathbb E[X_1])/(1-t)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;1$</span>）。代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\pi(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1]-\\frac{x-t\\,\\mathbb E[X_1]}{1-t}=\\frac{\\mathbb E[X_1]-x}{1-t}.$$</div>\n于是 ODE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=(\\mathbb E[X_1]-X_t)/(1-t)$</span>，这是关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的线性 ODE，解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t=(1-t)x_0+t\\,\\mathbb E[X_1],$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处由连续性延拓。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 是“直线”一词的严格来源：<strong>独立耦合下，条件期望速度场恰使每条轨迹成为直线</strong>。注意命题 2 只对独立耦合成立；对一般耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 的相关结构，轨迹一般弯曲——这一点的定量刻画留到第 9 节反例节，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-3-回归目标的等价刻画\">3. 回归目标的等价刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-3-回归目标的等价刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（回归目标的投影解释）</strong>　设 (A1) 成立。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{RF}}(v)=\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\int_0^1\\|v(X_t,t)\\|^2\\,dt-2\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\int_0^1 v(X_t,t)\\cdot(X_1-X_0)\\,dt+\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2,$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{RF}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_t\\times dt;\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 中的唯一极小元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span>，极小值为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{RF}}(v^\\pi)=\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\int_0^1\\|X_1-X_0-v^\\pi(X_t,t)\\|^2\\,dt=\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\int_0^1\\mathrm{Var}\\big[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t\\big]\\,dt.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　展开平方即得第一式。对第二式，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{RF}}(v)$</span> 写成对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 的积分：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{RF}}(v)=\\int_0^1\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\Big(\\|v(x,t)\\|^2-2v(x,t)\\cdot\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]+\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2\\mid X_t=x\\Big)\\,\\mu_t(dx)\\,dt.$$</div>\n这里用了 Fubini：被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 可积，因 (A1) 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中。对每个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span>，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)$</span> 的二次型在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=v^\\pi(x,t)$</span> 处取极小，极小值为条件方差。逐点极小化与积分交换由单调收敛与 (A1) 保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 的关键在于：<strong>回归目标的极小元是条件期望，而非某个全局常数</strong>。这区分了 Rectified Flow 与“直接把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 当作固定标签回归”的朴素做法——后者只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为点质量耦合时等价。命题 3 也为第 3 节“回归目标”提供数学基础，本节只作陈述与证明，不重复展开训练算法。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-4-一个可检验的恒等式-直线-ODE-的能量恒等式\">4. 一个可检验的恒等式：直线 ODE 的能量恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-4-一个可检验的恒等式-直线-ODE-的能量恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（能量恒等式）</strong>　设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 任意。则沿直线 ODE 的流，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}\\|X_t\\|^2=2\\,\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}\\langle X_t,v^\\pi(X_t,t)\\rangle,$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\mu_0\\otimes\\mu_1$</span> 时右端等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\big(\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|^2-\\mathbb E\\|X_t\\|^2\\big)/(1-t)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=(\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi})_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}\\|X_t\\|^2=\\mathbb E_{\\mu_0}\\|\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi}(x_0)\\|^2$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导，用链式法则与 ODE：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb E_{\\mu_0}\\|\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi}(x_0)\\|^2=2\\,\\mathbb E_{\\mu_0}\\langle \\Phi_t^{v^\\pi}(x_0),\\dot\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi}(x_0)\\rangle=2\\,\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}\\langle X_t,v^\\pi(X_t,t)\\rangle.$$</div>\n求导与期望交换由 (A2) 的线性增长与 (A1) 保证（控制收敛）。独立情形代入命题 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(x,t)=(\\mathbb E[X_1]-x)/(1-t)$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 是一个可直接数值检验的恒等式：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 的估计，沿流采样并比较左右两端。第 14 节代码将用它测量轨迹曲率，本节只给出恒等式本身。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-5-具体例子-一维高斯独立耦合\">5. 具体例子：一维高斯独立耦合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-5-具体例子-一维高斯独立耦合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal N(m,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\mu_0\\otimes\\mu_1$</span>。由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(x,t)=(m-x)/(1-t)$</span>，直线 ODE 解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tm$</span>。验证命题 1：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t\\sim\\mathcal N(tm,(1-t)^2)$</span>，与插值边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=\\mathcal N(tm,(1-t)^2)$</span> 一致。验证命题 4：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}\\|X_t\\|^2=t^2m^2+(1-t)^2$</span>，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(m\\,\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}X_t-\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}X_t^2)/(1-t)=2(m\\cdot tm-t^2m^2-(1-t)^2)/(1-t)=2(tm^2(1-t)-(1-t)^2)/(1-t)=2tm^2-2(1-t)$</span>，与左端导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2tm^2-2(1-t)$</span> 相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个例子同时说明：即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 不同，独立耦合下轨迹仍是直线；直线性来自<strong>耦合的独立性</strong>，而非边际的简单性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-6-直线性的坐标判据与曲率张量\">6. 直线性的坐标判据与曲率张量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-6-直线性的坐标判据与曲率张量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 只给出独立耦合下的直线结论，但“轨迹是否弯曲”需要一个不依赖耦合类型的定量判据。为此引入轨迹的<strong>曲率向量</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 为直线 ODE 的解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v^\\pi(X_t,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot X_t=\\partial_t v^\\pi(X_t,t)+\\nabla_x v^\\pi(X_t,t)\\,v^\\pi(X_t,t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\pi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> Jacobi 矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\nabla_x v^\\pi\\,v^\\pi)_i=\\sum_{j=1}^d\\partial_{x_j}v^\\pi_i\\,v^\\pi_j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>。定义曲率向量\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa_t=\\ddot X_t-\\frac{\\langle \\ddot X_t,\\dot X_t\\rangle}{\\|\\dot X_t\\|^2}\\dot X_t,\\qquad \\dot X_t\\neq 0,$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot X_t$</span> 垂直于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 的分量。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\equiv 0$</span> 当且仅当轨迹为直线（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t\\neq 0$</span> 的开区间上）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（曲率的协变表示）</strong>　设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微。则沿直线 ODE，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa_t=\\big(\\nabla_x v^\\pi\\big)^\\top_{\\perp v^\\pi}\\big(\\partial_t v^\\pi+\\nabla_x v^\\pi\\,v^\\pi\\big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\cdot)^\\top_{\\perp v^\\pi}$</span> 表示到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 的正交补上的投影，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\nabla_x v^\\pi)^\\top_{\\perp v^\\pi}$</span> 应理解为先把向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v^\\pi+\\nabla_x v^\\pi\\,v^\\pi$</span> 投影到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 的正交补，再作用；等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=P_{v^{\\pi\\perp}}\\ddot X_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{v^{\\pi\\perp}}=I-\\frac{v^\\pi(v^\\pi)^\\top}{\\|v^\\pi\\|^2}$</span> 为到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 正交补的投影矩阵。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot X_t=\\partial_t v^\\pi(X_t,t)+\\nabla_x v^\\pi(X_t,t)\\dot X_t$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v^\\pi(X_t,t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot X_t=\\partial_t v^\\pi+\\nabla_x v^\\pi\\,v^\\pi$</span>。曲率向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot X_t$</span> 减去其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 方向上的分量，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=P_{\\dot X_t^\\perp}\\ddot X_t$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v^\\pi$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的意义在于：<strong>曲率完全由速度场的时空 Jacobi 结构决定</strong>，与轨迹的初值无关（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 光滑处）。这为第 14 节代码测量曲率提供公式：只需在采样轨迹上估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v^\\pi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\pi$</span>，再作正交投影。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（独立耦合的曲率消失）</strong>　在命题 2 的独立耦合设定下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\equiv 0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(x,t)=(\\mathbb E[X_1]-x)/(1-t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\pi=-I/(1-t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v^\\pi=(\\mathbb E[X_1]-x)/(1-t)^2$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t v^\\pi+\\nabla_x v^\\pi\\,v^\\pi=\\frac{\\mathbb E[X_1]-x}{(1-t)^2}-\\frac{1}{1-t}\\cdot\\frac{\\mathbb E[X_1]-x}{1-t}=0.$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot X_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 6 与命题 2 互为印证：独立耦合下速度场沿轨迹的时空全导数恰为零，这正是直线轨迹的微分刻画。反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\not\\equiv 0$</span>，则耦合必非独立——这一逆命题的定量形式（曲率与耦合相关性的关系）属于第 9 节反例节，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-7-可积性与采样步数的初步联系\">7. 可积性与采样步数的初步联系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-7-可积性与采样步数的初步联系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>直线 ODE 的可积性指：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span>，能否用有限步数值积分以可控误差从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 采样到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>。这一问题的数学核心是<strong>流的 Lipschitz 常数</strong>与<strong>曲率上界</strong>的关系。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t=\\sup_{x}\\|\\nabla_x v^\\pi(x,t)\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}$</span> 为速度场在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的算子 Lipschitz 常数（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\mu_t$</span> 上取上确界），<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=\\sup_t\\|\\kappa_t\\|$</span> 为曲率上界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（前向 Euler 的局部误差界）</strong>　设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L=\\sup_t L_t&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>。则前向 Euler 格式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{k+1}=X_k+h\\,v^\\pi(X_k,t_k)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/N$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=kh$</span>，在单步上的局部截断误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|X(t_{k+1})-X_{k+1}\\big\\|\\le \\frac{h^2}{2}\\big(K+L^2\\big)+o(h^2),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X(t)$</span> 为从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 出发的精确解。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　精确解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 处 Taylor 展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X(t_{k+1})=X_k+h\\,v^\\pi(X_k,t_k)+\\frac{h^2}{2}\\ddot X(t_k)+o(h^2).$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot X(t_k)=\\partial_t v^\\pi+\\nabla_x v^\\pi\\,v^\\pi$</span>，其范数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial_t v^\\pi\\|+\\|\\nabla_x v^\\pi\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\|v^\\pi\\|$</span> 控制。由命题 5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot X(t_k)$</span> 分解为沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 的分量与曲率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span>；沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 的分量范数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_x v^\\pi\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\|v^\\pi\\|=L\\|v^\\pi\\|$</span>，曲率分量范数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>。合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\ddot X(t_k)\\|\\le K+L\\|v^\\pi\\|$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v^\\pi\\|\\le L$</span>（在紧支撑上由线性增长与 (A1) 控制），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\ddot X(t_k)\\|\\le K+L^2$</span>。与 Euler 步相减即得局部误差界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 给出一个可直接检验的结论：<strong>局部误差由曲率上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 与 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 共同控制</strong>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=0$</span>（独立耦合）时，误差退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2L^2)$</span>，即纯线性 ODE 的 Euler 误差；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&gt;0$</span>（一般耦合）时，误差多出一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2K)$</span>，这正是“轨迹弯曲导致需要更多步数”的数学来源。全局误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步累积，标准 Gronwall 论证给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h(L+K))$</span> 量级，其完整推导属于第 7 节“采样步数”，本节只建立局部界与曲率的联系。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 8（独立耦合的 Euler 精确性）</strong>　在命题 2 的独立耦合设定下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 为线性（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 为点质量或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 均为高斯且同协方差），则前向 Euler 在任意步数下给出精确的边际传输。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　独立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\delta_{x_1}$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(x,t)=(x_1-x)/(1-t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 线性。线性 ODE 的 Euler 格式与精确解在每步上一致到一阶，但边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的传输只需一阶矩匹配；由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 经仿射映射得到，而 Euler 每步也是仿射映射，复合仍为仿射，故边际精确。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 8 说明：直线性不仅减少曲率误差，还在特定情形下使少步采样<strong>精确</strong>。这为第 7 节“采样步数”与第 12 节“少步生成”提供理论锚点，本节只给出判据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-8-与最优传输路径的初步对照\">8. 与最优传输路径的初步对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-8-与最优传输路径的初步对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>直线 ODE 的轨迹在独立耦合下是直线，但直线未必是最优传输（OT）路径。OT 路径由<strong>位移凸性</strong>刻画：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 的 Wasserstein-2 最优耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span>，插值边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{\\mathrm{OT}}=((1-t)\\mathrm{proj}_0+t\\,\\mathrm{proj}_1)_\\#\\pi^{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span> 满足测地凸性，其速度场为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\mathrm{OT}}(x,t)=\\mathbb E_{\\pi^{\\mathrm{OT}}}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>。与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 的形式相同，区别仅在耦合：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span> 是最优耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 是任意耦合。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（OT 速度场是直线 ODE 速度场的特例）</strong>　设 (A1)–(A3) 成立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span> 恰为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span> 为耦合的直线 ODE 速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\pi^{\\mathrm{OT}}}$</span>；且对任意耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{RF}}(v^{\\pi^{\\mathrm{OT}}})\\le \\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{RF}}(v^\\pi),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{RF}}$</span> 按各自耦合的插值边际取期望。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　第一句由定义直接得到：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span> 的定义就是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span> 下的条件期望。第二句：由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{RF}}(v^\\pi)$</span> 的极小值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\int_0^1\\mathrm{Var}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]\\,dt$</span>。OT 耦合在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 时条件方差最小（这是 OT 的位移凸性等价刻画之一），故其回归损失不超过任意耦合的回归损失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 澄清了一个常见混淆：<strong>直线 ODE 与 OT 路径共享同一速度场形式，但耦合不同</strong>。独立耦合给出直线轨迹但未必是 OT；OT 耦合给出测地线但未必是直线（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 为点质量或高斯同协方差）。第 5 节“与 OT 路径的关系”将展开这一对照，本节只建立速度场形式的统一。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-9-一个非独立耦合的显式例子\">9. 一个非独立耦合的显式例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-9-一个非独立耦合的显式例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mu_1=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，但耦合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(\\mathrm{id},\\mathrm{id})_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0$</span> 几乎必然。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，插值边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=\\mu_0$</span> 恒定。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]=0$</span>，直线 ODE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=0$</span>，轨迹为常值——这是退化的“直线”（零速度）。曲率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=0$</span> 但速度为零，命题 5 的投影在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=0$</span> 处无定义，需单独处理。这个例子说明：<strong>曲率判据要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t\\neq 0$</span></strong>，零速度轨迹的直线性应视为平凡情形。</p>\n<p>再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，耦合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(\\mathrm{id},-\\mathrm{id})_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=-X_0$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-2t)X_0$</span>，插值边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=\\mathcal N(0,(1-2t)^2)$</span>。由命题 1，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\pi(x,t)=\\mathbb E[-2X_0\\mid (1-2t)X_0=x]=-\\frac{2x}{1-2t},\\qquad t\\neq 1/2.$$</div>\n直线 ODE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=-2X_t/(1-2t)$</span>，解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-2t)X_0$</span>，与插值路径一致。轨迹在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处经过原点，速度发散，曲率在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 附近无界。这个例子说明：<strong>即使边际简单，非独立耦合也可导致速度场奇异与轨迹弯曲（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处退化）</strong>，定量分析属于第 9 节反例节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-10-曲率与耦合相关性的定量关系\">10. 曲率与耦合相关性的定量关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-10-曲率与耦合相关性的定量关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 5 与推论 6 建立了“独立耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 曲率消失”的单向蕴含。为使第 9 节反例节的定量分析有据可依，本节给出反方向的定量刻画：曲率范数被耦合的协方差结构所控制。为此引入<strong>耦合协方差张量</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1（耦合协方差张量）</strong>　设 (A1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi$</span>。定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Sigma_\\pi=\\mathbb E_\\pi\\big[(X_1-X_0-\\mathbb E_\\pi(X_1-X_0))(X_1-X_0-\\mathbb E_\\pi(X_1-X_0))^\\top\\big]\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d},$$</div>\n即位移向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 的协方差矩阵。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\pi=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 几乎必然为常数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\pi$</span> 的非对角块编码了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 的相关性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（曲率的协方差上界）</strong>　设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的支撑包含于半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 的球内。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\kappa_t(x)\\|\\le \\frac{\\|\\Sigma_\\pi\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}^{1/2}}{t(1-t)}\\big(1+\\|x\\|/R\\big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=P_{v^{\\pi\\perp}}(\\partial_t v^\\pi+\\nabla_x v^\\pi\\,v^\\pi)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\kappa_t\\|\\le\\|\\partial_t v^\\pi\\|+\\|\\nabla_x v^\\pi\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\|v^\\pi\\|$</span>。由条件期望的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求偏导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t X_t=X_1-X_0$</span>，由 Leibniz 法则（被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 可积）得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t v^\\pi(x,t)=\\mathbb E\\big[(X_1-X_0)\\otimes\\partial_t X_t\\mid X_t=x\\big]=\\mathbb E\\big[(X_1-X_0)(X_1-X_0)^\\top\\mid X_t=x\\big],$$</div>\n其算子范数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Sigma_\\pi\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}^{1/2}$</span> 加上均值项控制；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 支撑于半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 的球内时，均值项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]\\|\\le\\|x\\|/R$</span>（由插值的凸组合性质）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\pi$</span> 作类似估计：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Jacobi 矩阵是条件协方差对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的导数，其范数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Sigma_\\pi\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}^{1/2}/(t(1-t))$</span> 控制（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的敏感度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-t$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 的敏感度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>）。合并两项即得所述上界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 的意义：<strong>曲率上界由耦合协方差张量的算子范数与插值时间的倒数共同控制</strong>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\pi\\to 0$</span>（位移退化）时曲率上界趋于零，与推论 6 的独立情形相容；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 1$</span> 时上界发散，这解释了第 9 节例子中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 附近的奇异行为——该例的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\pi$</span> 非零且插值时间接近退化点。第 9 节反例节将用此上界构造曲率无界的显式耦合。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-11-直线-ODE-的流映射与逆映射\">11. 直线 ODE 的流映射与逆映射<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-11-直线-ODE-的流映射与逆映射\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>直线 ODE 的可积性不仅涉及前向采样，还涉及<strong>逆映射</strong>：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span>，能否用反向 ODE 恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>？这一问题的数学基础是流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi}$</span> 的可逆性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（流映射的可逆性与逆 ODE）</strong>　设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi}:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚，其逆 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi})^{-1}$</span> 由反向 ODE\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{ds}Y_s=-v^\\pi(Y_s,t-s),\\qquad Y_0=\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi}(x_0),\\ s\\in[0,t],$$</div>\n给出，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t=x_0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　全局 Lipschitz 与连续性保证 ODE 的流存在唯一且对初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 可微（标准常微分方程理论）。反向 ODE 的向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-v^\\pi(\\cdot,t-s)$</span> 同样全局 Lipschitz，故其流存在唯一。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_s=\\Phi_{t-s}^{v^\\pi}(\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi}(x_0))$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_0=\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi}(x_0)$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{ds}Y_s=-\\frac{d}{du}\\Phi_u^{v^\\pi}\\Big|_{u=t-s}=-v^\\pi(\\Phi_{t-s}^{v^\\pi}(\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi}(x_0)),t-s)=-v^\\pi(Y_s,t-s).$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_s$</span> 满足反向 ODE，由唯一性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t=\\Phi_0^{v^\\pi}(\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi}(x_0))=x_0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 11 说明：<strong>直线 ODE 的流映射是双 Lipschitz 同胚</strong>，其逆由时间反演的 ODE 给出。这与扩散模型的反向 SDE 有本质区别：反向 SDE 的漂移包含得分函数项，而直线 ODE 的反向 ODE 仅需速度场的负值——这是“直线 ODE 无需得分估计即可反向采样”的数学根据。第 8 节“与 CFM 的对照”将展开这一区别，本节只建立可逆性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-12-直线-ODE-与连续性方程的古典解\">12. 直线 ODE 与连续性方程的古典解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-12-直线-ODE-与连续性方程的古典解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 用弱形式建立了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 的相容性。在 (A3) 的密度假设下，这一相容性可提升为古典意义下的连续性方程，为第 4 节“轨迹的可积性”提供更强的正则性基础。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12（古典连续性方程）</strong>　设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微。则密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 满足古典连续性方程\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t\\rho_t(x)+\\nabla\\cdot\\big(\\rho_t(x)\\,v^\\pi(x,t)\\big)=0,\\qquad (x,t)\\in\\mathbb R^d\\times(0,1).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=(\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi})_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 有连续紧支撑密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span>。Liouville 定理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(\\Phi_t^{v^\\pi}(x_0))=\\rho_0(x_0)\\exp\\big(-\\int_0^t\\nabla\\cdot v^\\pi(\\Phi_s^{v^\\pi}(x_0),s)\\,ds\\big)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导并用链式法则即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho_t+\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_t v^\\pi)=0$</span>。求导与积分交换由 (A2) 的线性增长与 (A3) 的紧支撑保证（控制收敛）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 12 的意义：<strong>直线 ODE 的速度场使插值边际的密度演化成为古典解</strong>，而非仅弱解。这为第 4 节“轨迹的可积性”中讨论数值格式的收敛阶提供正则性前提——Euler 格式的局部误差估计（命题 7）要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 连续可微，而命题 12 恰好保证这一条件在 (A3) 下成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-13-直线-ODE-的变分刻画\">13. 直线 ODE 的变分刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-13-直线-ODE-的变分刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出直线 ODE 的一个变分刻画，把“直线性”与“能量最小”联系起来，为第 6 节“拉直的意义”提供数学接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13（直线 ODE 的能量极小性）</strong>　设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 任意。在所有满足连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\mu_t+\\nabla\\cdot(\\mu_t u)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(\\cdot,t)\\in L^2(\\mu_t)$</span> 的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 唯一极小化能量\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E(u)=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}\\|u(X_t,t)\\|^2\\,dt.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{RF}}(v)$</span> 的极小元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span>，极小值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_\\pi\\int_0^1\\mathrm{Var}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]\\,dt$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E(u)=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}\\|u\\|^2\\,dt$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{RF}}$</span> 的关系为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{RF}}(u)=\\mathcal E(u)-2\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}\\langle u,v^\\pi\\rangle\\,dt+\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2,$$</div>\n其中交叉项由 (1) 式等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}\\langle u,v^\\pi\\rangle\\,dt$</span>。在连续性方程约束下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E(u)$</span> 的极小元满足 Euler–Lagrange 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=v^\\pi$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 变分并用分部积分），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 唯一极小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 13 说明：<strong>直线 ODE 的速度场是给定插值边际族下能量最小的速度场</strong>。这与 OT 路径的能量极小性形式相同，区别仍在耦合：OT 耦合在所有耦合中极小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E$</span>，而直线 ODE 在固定耦合下极小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E$</span>。第 6 节“拉直的意义”将用此刻画说明：拉直操作通过改变耦合降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E$</span>，从而减少采样步数。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>直线 ODE 的速度场由条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 唯一确定；命题 1 证明其流把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 传输为插值边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>，这是“直线 ODE 与插值路径相容”的精确含义。</li>\n<li>命题 2 证明：当且仅当耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为独立耦合时，直线 ODE 的每条轨迹为直线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)x_0+t\\,\\mathbb E[X_1]$</span>；一般耦合下轨迹弯曲，其定量刻画属于反例节。</li>\n<li>命题 3 与命题 4 给出两个可检验结论：回归目标的极小元是条件期望而非固定标签；沿流的能量恒等式可用于数值验证轨迹曲率，为后续“拉直”与“采样步数”两节提供可计算的判据。</li>\n<li>命题 5 与推论 6 给出曲率的协变表示：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=P_{v^{\\pi\\perp}}(\\partial_t v^\\pi+\\nabla_x v^\\pi\\,v^\\pi)$</span>，独立耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\equiv 0$</span>，反之曲率非零则耦合必非独立；这为第 14 节代码测量曲率提供公式。</li>\n<li>命题 7 与推论 8 建立可积性与曲率上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>、Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的联系：前向 Euler 局部误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2(K+L^2))$</span>，独立耦合且速度线性时 Euler 在任意步数下精确传输边际；这为第 7 节“采样步数”与第 12 节“少步生成”提供判据。</li>\n<li>命题 9 澄清直线 ODE 与 OT 路径的关系：两者共享条件期望速度场形式，区别仅在耦合；OT 耦合的回归损失不超过任意耦合，但 OT 轨迹未必是直线，独立耦合轨迹是直线但未必是 OT。</li>\n<li>命题 10 给出曲率与耦合协方差张量的定量关系：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\kappa_t\\|\\le\\|\\Sigma_\\pi\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}^{1/2}(1+\\|x\\|/R)/(t(1-t))$</span>，把推论 6 的单向蕴含补足为可计算的上界，为第 9 节反例节提供构造依据。</li>\n<li>命题 11 与命题 12 建立直线 ODE 的可逆性与古典正则性：流映射为双 Lipschitz 同胚、逆由时间反演 ODE 给出，密度满足古典连续性方程；这两条为第 4 节“轨迹的可积性”与第 8 节“与 CFM 的对照”提供正则性前提。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"fl16--h-回归目标\">回归目标<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-回归目标\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 16 章第 1、2 节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span> 为源分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim\\mu_1$</span> 为目标分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 为某耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 下的联合随机变量；线性插值路径为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>；直线 ODE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v(X_t,t)$</span>。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>速度场类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span>：取为可测映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，满足 (i) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto v(x,t)$</span> 局部 Lipschitz；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,1]}\\mathbb E\\|v(X_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>；(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto v(x,t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 可测。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上的范数取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v\\|_{\\mathcal V}^2=\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|v(X_t,t)\\|^2\\,dt$</span>。</li>\n<li>回归泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L:\\mathcal V\\to[0,\\infty]$</span>：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(v)=\\mathbb E\\Big[\\big\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\big\\|^2\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>其中期望遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]$</span>，二者独立。\n- 条件期望速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 给定下由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 的联合分布唯一确定（几乎处处）。\n- 曲率泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)=\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|\\nabla_x v(X_t,t)\\dot X_t-\\partial_t v(X_t,t)\\|^2\\,dt$</span>，用于第 14 节；本节只作定义性引用。</p>\n<p>正则性假设（RA）：(a) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_0\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>；(b) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0\\otimes\\mu_1$</span> 绝对连续或至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>；(c) <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal V$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_t,t)$</span> 的支撑上平方可积。假设 (a)(b) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star\\in\\mathcal V$</span>；假设 (c) 仅在曲率与可积性小节使用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-回归泛函的变分刻画\">回归泛函的变分刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-回归泛函的变分刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.1（回归目标的条件期望解）</strong> 在假设 (RA)(a)(b) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上的唯一极小元（几乎处处意义）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(v)-\\mathcal L(v^\\star)=\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|v(X_t,t)-v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2\\,dt\\ge 0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal V$</span>，展开平方：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(v)=\\mathbb E\\|v(X_t,t)\\|^2-2\\mathbb E\\langle v(X_t,t),X_1-X_0\\rangle+\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>中间项用条件期望改写。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t,t)$</span> 为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_t,t)$</span> 生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 平方可积，故条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid\\sigma(X_t,t)]$</span> 存在且平方可积（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影）。由投影的变分性质，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t,t)$</span>-可测的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|v-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|v-v^\\star\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>此处用到三项展开与交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\langle v-v^\\star,v^\\star-(X_1-X_0)\\rangle=0$</span>：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v-v^\\star$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t,t)$</span>-可测，提出后内层条件期望为零。将上式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分并用 Fubini（被积函数非负可测，无需可积性前提，Tonelli 定理），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(v)=\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|v-v^\\star\\|^2\\,dt+\\mathcal L(v^\\star).$$</div>\n<p>非负项为零当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=v^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_t,t)$</span> 的分布支撑上几乎处处成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.3.2（梯度恒等式）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 关于参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_\\theta v_\\theta(X_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L(v_\\theta)=2\\mathbb E\\big[\\langle v_\\theta(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0),\\ \\nabla_\\theta v_\\theta(X_t,t)\\rangle\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微，且由 Cauchy–Schwarz 与平方可积性，其梯度被可积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v_\\theta-(X_1-X_0)\\|\\cdot\\|\\nabla_\\theta v_\\theta\\|$</span> 控制（两项均 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span>，乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span>）。由 Leibniz 积分求导法则（Dominating Convergence 的推论）可交换期望与梯度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是第 13 节代码中自动微分训练目标的数学依据：目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等，故必须用上式而非仅比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 数值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-与直线-ODE-速度的相容性\">与直线 ODE 速度的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-与直线-ODE-速度的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 诱导直线轨迹）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 如命题 16.3.1，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto v^\\star(x,t)$</span> 局部 Lipschitz。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span>，初值问题</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\dot Z_t=v^\\star(Z_t,t),\\quad Z_0=X_0$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上存在唯一解，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 关键在于验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(X_t,t)=X_1-X_0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\otimes\\mathrm{Unif}$</span> 下几乎处处成立。由条件期望定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(X_t,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t,t]$</span>。而给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 是确定函数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t,t)\\subseteq\\sigma(X_0,X_1,t)$</span>；反向不成立。要证等号，需用线性插值的可逆性：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\mapsto(X_t,X_1-X_0)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\times\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的线性同构（矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\begin{pmatrix}1-t&amp;t\\\\-1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}$</span> 行列式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t,X_1-X_0)=\\sigma(X_0,X_1)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t,t)$</span> 可测，条件期望退化为自身。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0,1$</span> 为端点，用连续性延拓。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z_t=X_1-X_0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0=X_0$</span>，解得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=X_0+t(X_1-X_0)=X_t$</span>。局部 Lipschitz 保证解唯一。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：回归目标的最优解恰是使直线插值成为 ODE 解的速度场。注意这与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 是概率流 ODE 速度”是两回事——后者由连续性方程与得分函数确定，二者仅在特定耦合下重合（见第 5 节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-具体例子-一维高斯情形\">具体例子：一维高斯情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-具体例子-一维高斯情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim\\mathcal N(m,1)$</span>，耦合为独立耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\mu_0\\otimes\\mu_1$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 的条件分布：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 在约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)X_0+tX_1=x$</span> 下独立高斯的条件期望可算。由独立性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]=\\mathbb E X_1-\\mathbb E X_0+\\frac{\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1-X_0,X_t)}{\\mathrm{Var}(X_t)}(x-\\mathbb E X_t).$$</div>\n<p>计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E X_t=(1-t)\\cdot0+t\\cdot m=tm$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_t)=(1-t)^2+t^2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1-X_0,X_t)=\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1,(1-t)X_0+tX_1)-\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0,(1-t)X_0+tX_1)=t\\cdot1-(1-t)\\cdot1=2t-1$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star(x,t)=m+\\frac{2t-1}{(1-t)^2+t^2}\\,(x-tm).$$</div>\n<p>检验端点：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,0)=m-x$</span>，即从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 出发朝均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 走；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,1)=m+(x-m)=x$</span>，速度等于位移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 的条件均值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=x$</span> 处应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x-\\mathbb E[X_0\\mid X_1=x]=x$</span>（独立性下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E X_0=0$</span>），一致。此例中轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z_t=v^\\star(Z_t,t)$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 线性，解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=tm+(1-t)X_0$</span> 加上一个由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2t-1$</span> 项驱动的修正——注意独立耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 非线性于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，故轨迹并非直线，这与 canonical claim“若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 独立，轨迹为直线”表面冲突，需澄清：该 claim 指的是<strong>插值路径</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 本身是直线（对每个样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 固定后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto X_t$</span> 是直线），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 诱导的 ODE 轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t$</span> 在独立耦合下一般<strong>不</strong>等于插值路径，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(X_t,t)\\neq X_1-X_0$</span> 几乎处处（条件期望不退化）。命题 16.3.3 的等号成立依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_t,X_1-X_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数等价，这在独立耦合下不成立。此例正是第 9 节“耦合不当导致轨迹弯曲”的定量实例：独立耦合给出非直线 ODE 轨迹，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=X_1$</span> 的恒等耦合给出直线。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-回归目标的统计估计与可积性\">回归目标的统计估计与可积性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-回归目标的统计估计与可积性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.4（经验风险的相合性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0^{(i)},X_1^{(i)})_{i=1}^n$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的 i.i.d. 样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]$</span> 独立。定义经验风险</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_n(v)=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n\\big\\|v(X^{(i)}_{t_i},t_i)-(X^{(i)}_1-X^{(i)}_0)\\big\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>在 (RA)(a)(b) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal V$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_n(v)\\to\\mathcal L(v)$</span> 几乎必然，且若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 为有限 VC 类或 Donsker 类，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{v\\in\\mathcal V}|\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_n(v)-\\mathcal L(v)|\\to0$</span> 几乎必然。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一项由强大数定律：被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_i=\\|v(X^{(i)}_{t_i},t_i)-(X^{(i)}_1-X^{(i)}_0)\\|^2$</span> 独立同分布且由 (RA)(a)(b) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal V$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E f_1&lt;\\infty$</span>。第二项为标准经验过程结论，此处不展开（属于第 13 节代码的统计基础，非本节证明义务）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明第 13 节代码中 mini-batch 估计的无偏性与相合性；但注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_n$</span> 的极小元不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span>（过拟合），需正则化，这属于代码节内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-回归目标与曲率的联系\">回归目标与曲率的联系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-回归目标与曲率的联系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.5（曲率下界）</strong> 在 (RA)(a)(b)(c) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 为命题 16.3.1 的极小元且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 非退化（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的确定性函数），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v^\\star)&gt;0$</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\star(X_t,t)\\dot X_t\\neq\\partial_t v^\\star(X_t,t)$</span> 在正测度集上成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 沿插值路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span>，全导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}v^\\star(X_t,t)=\\nabla_x v^\\star\\cdot\\dot X_t+\\partial_t v^\\star$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v^\\star)=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}v^\\star(X_t,t)=0$</span> 几乎处处，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(X_t,t)$</span> 沿路径为常数。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(X_t,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t,t]$</span>，若其为常数则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t,t)$</span> 退化，与假设矛盾。反之若某点处不相等，由连续性在邻域正测度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题为第 14 节曲率测量代码提供理论依据：曲率泛函可检验回归解是否真正“拉直”轨迹。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>回归泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v)=\\mathbb E\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2$</span> 的唯一极小元是条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>，其变分分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v)=\\mathcal L(v^\\star)+\\mathbb E\\int\\|v-v^\\star\\|^2$</span> 给出梯度恒等式，是训练目标的数学基础。</li>\n<li>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_t,X_1-X_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数等价（如恒等耦合的极限情形）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 诱导的 ODE 轨迹等于线性插值路径；独立耦合下二者不等，轨迹弯曲，曲率泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v^\\star)&gt;0$</span>。</li>\n<li>经验风险 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_n$</span> 相合于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span>，但极小元需正则化；曲率下界命题将“拉直”量化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的减小，衔接第 14 节测量与第 6 节拉直意义。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\nimport numpy as np\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nnp.random.seed(0)\n\n# 一维高斯例子：验证命题 16.3.1 的 v^* 公式与命题 16.3.3 的轨迹\nd = 1\nm = 2.0\nn = 200000\n\nX0 = torch.randn(n, d)              # N(0,1)\nX1 = m + torch.randn(n, d)          # N(m,1)，独立耦合\nt = torch.rand(n, 1)                # Unif[0,1]\n\nXt = (1 - t) * X0 + t * X1\ntarget = X1 - X0\n\n# 解析 v^*(x,t) = m + (2t-1)/((1-t)^2+t^2) * (x - t m)\ndef v_star(x, t):\n    denom = (1 - t)**2 + t**2\n    return m + (2 * t - 1) / denom * (x - t * m)\n\nv_pred = v_star(Xt, t)\nresidual = v_pred - target\n\n# 命题 16.3.1：E||v^* - target||^2 应等于 L(v^*) 且小于任意扰动\nL_star = (residual**2).mean().item()\nperturb = 0.1 * torch.randn_like(v_pred)\nL_pert = ((v_pred + perturb - target)**2).mean().item()\nassert L_pert &gt; L_star, &quot;扰动应增大回归风险&quot;\n\n# 命题 16.3.3：恒等耦合（X0=X1）时轨迹为直线\nX1_id = X0.clone()\nXt_id = (1 - t) * X0 + t * X1_id\nassert torch.allclose(Xt_id, X0), &quot;恒等耦合插值恒为 X0&quot;\n\n# 独立耦合下 v^*(X_t,t) != X1-X0（几乎处处），验证轨迹弯曲\nmismatch = (v_pred - target).abs().mean().item()\nassert mismatch &gt; 0.1, &quot;独立耦合下条件期望不退化&quot;\n\nprint(&quot;L(v^*) =&quot;, round(L_star, 4))\nprint(&quot;L(v^*+perturb) =&quot;, round(L_pert, 4))\nprint(&quot;独立耦合下 |v^*-target| 均值 =&quot;, round(mismatch, 4))\nprint(&quot;恒等耦合插值形状:&quot;, tuple(Xt_id.shape), &quot;预期 (200000, 1)&quot;)\nprint(&quot;断言全部通过&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>前述命题均在欧氏坐标下写出。为与第 5 节 OT 路径的无坐标表述衔接，此处明确维度与指标约定：状态空间取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>，配标准内积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle$</span> 与范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为向量场，其分量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^a(x,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1,\\dots,d$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,1)$</span>-型张量，分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\nabla_x v)^a{}_b=\\partial_b v^a$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=1,\\dots,d$</span>；沿曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t$</span> 的全导数按链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}v^a(Z_t,t)=(\\nabla_x v)^a{}_b\\dot Z_t^b+\\partial_t v^a$</span>，重复指标求和。曲率泛函中的被积式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v(X_t,t)\\dot X_t-\\partial_t v(X_t,t)$</span> 是向量，其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\nabla_x v)^a{}_b\\dot X_t^b-\\partial_t v^a$</span>，与坐标选取无关（在正交变换下协变）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.6（回归目标的坐标协变性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q\\in O(d)$</span> 为正交矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=Qx$</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_Q(y,t)=Q\\,v(Q^{\\top}y,t)$</span>。则在 (RA)(a)(b) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v_Q)=\\mathcal L(v)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_Q^\\star(y,t)=Q\\,v^\\star(Q^{\\top}y,t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由正交性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|Qz\\|=\\|z\\|$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(QX_0,QX_1)$</span>，其联合分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 下的推前，插值路径变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$QX_t$</span>，位移变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(X_1-X_0)$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(v_Q)=\\mathbb E\\|Qv(Q^{\\top}QX_t,t)-Q(X_1-X_0)\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2=\\mathcal L(v).$$</div>\n<p>极小元由命题 16.3.1 的唯一性给出，条件期望与正交变换交换（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影的等距性）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题保证第 13 节代码中用任意正交参数化（如旋转数据增强）训练时不改变回归目标的几何含义；也说明曲率泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 在正交变换下不变，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_x v\\,\\dot X_t-\\partial_t v\\|$</span> 是向量范数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-回归目标与连续性方程的接口\">回归目标与连续性方程的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-回归目标与连续性方程的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>回归目标只约束速度场在插值路径分布上的取值，并不直接约束其在整个空间的行为。第 4 节将证明：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 足够正则，则它诱导的流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Z_t)$</span> 的推前测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=(Z_t)_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 满足连续性方程。本节先给出该结论所需的边界条件与一个恒等式，作为回归目标与测度传输的桥梁。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.7（沿路径的密度演化恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度有密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t\\in C^1(\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1])$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 满足 (RA)(c) 与边界通量消失条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\|x\\|\\to\\infty}\\rho_t(x)v^\\star(x,t)=0$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t\\rho_t(x)+\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_t(x)v^\\star(x,t))=\\mathbb E\\big[\\delta_{X_t}(x)\\,\\nabla\\cdot v^\\star(X_t,t)\\big]-\\nabla\\cdot\\big(\\rho_t(x)\\,\\mathbb E[v^\\star(X_t,t)\\mid X_t=x]\\big),$$</div>\n<p>右端在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(X_t,t)=X_1-X_0$</span> 几乎处处成立时恒为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的定义，对任意试验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int\\varphi\\,d\\mu_t=\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb E\\varphi(X_t)=\\mathbb E\\langle\\nabla\\varphi(X_t),X_1-X_0\\rangle.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 满足连续性方程，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int\\varphi\\,d\\mu_t=\\int\\langle\\nabla\\varphi,v^\\star\\rangle\\,d\\mu_t$</span>。两式相减得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\langle\\nabla\\varphi(X_t),X_1-X_0-v^\\star(X_t,t)\\rangle=0.$$</div>\n<p>由命题 16.3.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0-v^\\star(X_t,t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t,t)$</span> 正交（条件期望的投影性质），故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t)$</span>-可测的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi(X_t)$</span> 内积期望为零。将右端写成密度形式即得所述恒等式；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(X_t,t)=X_1-X_0$</span> 几乎处处时残差项消失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：回归目标的最优解<strong>当且仅当</strong>条件期望退化时才是概率流 ODE 速度。一般情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 只保证插值路径的切向速度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_t)$</span> 意义下最优，而不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 的流演化。这一区别是第 5 节“与 OT 路径的关系”的核心：OT 路径的速度场由连续性方程与最优传输计划共同确定，而回归目标只确定条件期望，二者在恒等耦合（<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=T(X_0)$</span> 确定性映射）下重合。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-有限样本下的偏差分解\">有限样本下的偏差分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-有限样本下的偏差分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 13 节代码用参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 与经验风险 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_n$</span> 训练。为说明训练误差与真实回归目标的差距，给出如下分解。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.8（偏差—方差分解）</strong> 在 (RA)(a)(b) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta\\in\\mathcal V$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{\\text{样本}}\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_n(v_\\theta)=\\mathcal L(v_\\theta),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Var}(\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_n(v_\\theta))=\\frac1n\\mathrm{Var}\\big(\\|v_\\theta(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\big).$$</div>\n<p>且若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 在样本上过拟合至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_n(v_\\theta)=0$</span>，则一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v_\\theta)&gt;0$</span>，其下界为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(v_\\theta)\\ge\\mathcal L(v^\\star)+\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|v_\\theta-v^\\star\\|^2\\,dt.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由样本独立同分布与期望线性性；第二式由方差的可加性。第三式直接由命题 16.3.1 的变分分解，非负项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta\\neq v^\\star$</span> 时严格为正。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的实践含义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_n$</span> 的无偏性不保证其极小元无偏；参数化类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v_\\theta\\}$</span> 若不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span>，则近似误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf_\\theta\\mathcal L(v_\\theta)-\\mathcal L(v^\\star)$</span> 与估计误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(\\hat v_\\theta)-\\inf_\\theta\\mathcal L(v_\\theta)$</span> 需分别控制。第 13 节代码中的早停与权重衰减正是控制后者。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-一个可检验的恒等式-端点速度的闭式\">一个可检验的恒等式：端点速度的闭式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-一个可检验的恒等式-端点速度的闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 16.3.9（端点条件）</strong> 在 (RA)(a)(b) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在端点满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star(x,0)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_0=x],\\qquad v^\\star(x,1)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_1=x].$$</div>\n<p>特别地，若耦合为恒等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=T(X_0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,0)=T(x)-x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,1)=x-T^{-1}(x)$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 可逆时）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t,t)=\\sigma(X_0)$</span>，条件期望即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_0]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_1$</span>，同理。恒等耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=T(X_0)-X_0$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 可测，条件期望退化；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=T^{-1}(X_1)$</span> 代入。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出端点速度的可检验闭式，是第 13 节代码中检查训练收敛的判据：若模型在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处的输出与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_0]$</span> 的样本估计不符，则回归目标未被充分优化。它也说明端点速度一般不等于位移本身，除非耦合退化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-与-CFM-目标的对照-仅作接口-不展开\">与 CFM 目标的对照（仅作接口，不展开）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-与-CFM-目标的对照-仅作接口-不展开\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 8 节将系统对照条件流匹配（CFM）目标。此处只指出一个代数事实：CFM 目标写作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|v(X_t,t)-\\dot X_t\\|^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 是插值路径的时间导数；在本文的线性插值下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=X_1-X_0$</span> 几乎处处，故两个目标在数值上相同。差别在于 CFM 通常允许一般路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\alpha_tX_0+\\sigma_tX_1$</span> 与一般时间调度，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=\\dot\\alpha_tX_0+\\dot\\sigma_tX_1$</span> 不再是位移，回归目标的最优解仍是条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\dot X_t\\mid X_t]$</span>，命题 16.3.1 的证明逐字适用（只需把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span>）。因此本节结论对 CFM 的一般路径同样成立，这是第 8 节对照的出发点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-曲率与回归残差的定量关系\">曲率与回归残差的定量关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-曲率与回归残差的定量关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 14 节代码测量轨迹曲率。为使该测量有理论依据，给出残差与曲率的联系。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.10（残差控制曲率）</strong> 在 (RA)(a)(b)(c) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal V$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v$</span> 有界。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(v)\\le 2\\,\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\big(\\|\\nabla_x v(X_t,t)\\|^2\\,\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2+\\|\\partial_t v(X_t,t)+\\nabla_x v(X_t,t)(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\big)\\,dt.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 沿插值路径，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=X_1-X_0$</span>。曲率被积式可拆为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x v\\,\\dot X_t-\\partial_t v=\\nabla_x v\\,(X_1-X_0-v)+\\big(\\nabla_x v\\,v-\\partial_t v\\big)+\\nabla_x v\\,(X_1-X_0-v)\\cdot(-1),$$</div>\n<p>更直接地，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v\\,\\dot X_t-\\partial_t v=\\nabla_x v\\,r+\\big(\\nabla_x v\\,v-\\partial_t v\\big)-\\nabla_x v\\,r$</span> 的整理需谨慎；正确的拆分为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x v\\,\\dot X_t-\\partial_t v=\\nabla_x v\\,(\\dot X_t-v)+\\big(\\nabla_x v\\,v-\\partial_t v\\big).$$</div>\n<p>第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v\\,(\\dot X_t-v)=-\\nabla_x v\\,r$</span>，第二项为沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的李导数。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|a+b\\|^2\\le2\\|a\\|^2+2\\|b\\|^2$</span> 与算子范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_x v\\|$</span> 有界，取期望并用 Fubini 得所述上界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：回归残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v-(X_1-X_0)\\|$</span> 越小，曲率上界越紧；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=v^\\star$</span> 且残差为零时，曲率完全由李导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\star\\,v^\\star-\\partial_t v^\\star$</span> 决定。第 14 节代码据此用残差与李导数两项估计曲率，避免直接数值微分轨迹的高方差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-小结之外的收束-回归目标的三个等价刻画\">小结之外的收束：回归目标的三个等价刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-小结之外的收束-回归目标的三个等价刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 16.3.1、16.3.3、16.3.7，回归目标的最优解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 有三个等价刻画：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi\\otimes\\mathrm{Unif})$</span> 意义下对位移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 的条件期望投影；(ii) 使线性插值路径成为 ODE 解的速度场（当且仅当条件期望退化）；(iii) 使插值分布沿流演化的连续性方程残差为零的速度场（同一条件下）。三者的等价性依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t,t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_0,X_1)$</span> 的等价，而这正是第 9 节反例的切入点：独立耦合破坏该等价，使 (i) 成立而 (ii)(iii) 不成立，轨迹弯曲。第 6 节“拉直的意义”将把这一破坏量化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的正值，并用 Reflow（第 10 节）迭代减小它。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ntorch.manual_seed(1)\n\n# 验证命题 16.3.6：正交协变性\nd = 3\nn = 50000\nX0 = torch.randn(n, d)\nX1 = torch.randn(n, d) + 1.0\nt = torch.rand(n, 1)\nXt = (1 - t) * X0 + t * X1\ntarget = X1 - X0\n\n# 任取一个线性 v（保证在 V 中），检验 L(v_Q) == L(v)\nA = torch.randn(d, d)\ndef v(x, t):\n    return x @ A.T + t\n\nQ, _ = torch.linalg.qr(torch.randn(d, d))  # 正交矩阵\ndef v_Q(y, t):\n    return (v(y @ Q.T, t)) @ Q.T\n\nL_v = ((v(Xt, t) - target)**2).mean().item()\nL_vQ = ((v_Q(Xt @ Q.T, t) - target @ Q.T)**2).mean().item()\nassert abs(L_v - L_vQ) &lt; 1e-4, &quot;正交变换应保持回归风险&quot;\n\n# 验证推论 16.3.9：恒等耦合端点速度\nT = lambda x: 2 * x + 1          # 线性可逆映射\nX1_id = T(X0)\nXt_id = (1 - t) * X0 + t * X1_id\n# t=0 处 v^* = T(x)-x = x+1\nv0 = X0 + 1\nassert torch.allclose(v0, T(X0) - X0), &quot;端点 t=0 速度应为 T(x)-x&quot;\n\n# 验证命题 16.3.10 的上界在残差为零时退化为李导数项\n# 取 v = target 的线性近似不可行（target 依赖样本），改用解析 v^* 的一维例子\nm = 2.0\nX0_1d = torch.randn(n, 1)\nX1_1d = m + torch.randn(n, 1)\nt1 = torch.rand(n, 1)\nXt1 = (1 - t1) * X0_1d + t1 * X1_1d\ndef v_star_1d(x, t):\n    denom = (1 - t)**2 + t**2\n    return m + (2 * t - 1) / denom * (x - t * m)\nr = v_star_1d(Xt1, t1) - (X1_1d - X0_1d)\nresidual_norm = (r**2).mean().item()\nassert residual_norm &gt; 0, &quot;独立耦合残差非零&quot;\n\nprint(&quot;L(v) =&quot;, round(L_v, 4), &quot; L(v_Q) =&quot;, round(L_vQ, 4))\nprint(&quot;恒等耦合端点速度形状:&quot;, tuple(v0.shape), &quot;预期 (50000, 3)&quot;)\nprint(&quot;一维独立耦合残差均值:&quot;, round(residual_norm, 4))\nprint(&quot;断言全部通过&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"fl16--h-轨迹的可积性\">轨迹的可积性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-轨迹的可积性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim\\mu_1$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 为给定耦合（联合分布）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>；线性插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>；速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为回归目标\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v=\\arg\\min_{v}\\ \\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\big\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\big\\|^2 .$$</div>\n本节新引入的符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{s}(x)$</span>：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 为速度场的 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z_r=v(Z_r,r)$</span> 从时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 位置 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 出发的解流（flow map），<span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\in[s,1]$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 时简记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(x)=\\Phi_t^{0}(x)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_x:[0,1]\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>：单条轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_x(t)=\\Phi_t(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_x(0)=x$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t,x)=\\|\\partial_t\\gamma_x(t)-\\partial_t \\ell_x(t)\\|$</span> 不引入；本节改用曲率型量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C(t)=\\mathbb E\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2$</span> 作为“非直线度”的度量（其与轨迹弯曲的关系在第 14 节代码中测量，本节只做解析刻画）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(v)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 关于空间变量的 Lipschitz 常数上界。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节贯穿以下假设，逐条在命题中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与平方可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_0\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>；映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)\\mapsto v(x,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d)\\otimes\\mathcal B([0,1])$</span> 可测，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|v(X_t,t)\\|^2dt&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 空间 Lipschitz 与时间连续性</strong>：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L&lt;\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v(x,t)-v(y,t)\\|\\le L\\|x-y\\|$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y,t$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto v(x,t)$</span> 连续。由 (A2) 与 (A1)，ODE 对每个初值有唯一全局解，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 关于初值是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{Lt}$</span>-Lipschitz 的（Picard–Lindelöf 与 Gronwall）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 线性插值的可积速度</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto (1-t)x_0+tx_1$</span> 绝对连续，其导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>（由 (A1) 推出）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 条件期望的正则版本</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 为回归目标的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_t)$</span>-投影。假设存在版本使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)\\mapsto v^\\star(x,t)$</span> 满足 (A2)。这是本节情境下的实质假设：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 具有密度且条件期望关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz 时成立；若仅有可测版本，则 ODE 解的存在性需改用 Carathéodory 框架，本节不展开。</p>\n<p><strong>核心定义（可积轨迹）</strong>。称耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 下的轨迹族“可积”，若对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span>，存在绝对连续曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma:[0,1]\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(0)=x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(1)=x_1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\gamma(t)=v(\\gamma(t),t)$</span> 对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。可积性即“直线插值的端点被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的流连接”。注意这与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 是 OT 最优耦合”是不同概念：可积性只要求端点匹配，不要求路径测度意义下最优；后者在第 5 节处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-一-回归目标的逐点刻画\">一、回归目标的逐点刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-一-回归目标的逐点刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（回归目标的投影结构）</strong>。在 (A1)、(A3)、(A4) 下，回归目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_t\\otimes dt)$</span> 中唯一，且对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v(x,t)=v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E_{\\pi}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。目标泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v)=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2dt$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 可分。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span>，最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\mid X_t]$</span> 的解是条件期望（Hilbert 空间投影定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 中逐坐标成立）。由 (A3) 该条件期望平方可积，由 Fubini（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 的有限性由 (A1)、(A3) 保证）可逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 取最小，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=v^\\star$</span> a.e.。唯一性来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 严格凸性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（非直线度的恒等式）</strong>。在命题 1 的条件下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal C(t):=\\mathbb E\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2 .$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=X_1-X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=X_t$</span>。由条件期望的塔性质，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|Y-v^\\star(Z)\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|Y\\|^2-\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(Z)\\|^2$</span>，因为交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\mathbb E\\langle Y-v^\\star(Z),v^\\star(Z)\\rangle=2\\mathbb E\\langle \\mathbb E[Y-v^\\star(Z)\\mid Z],v^\\star(Z)\\rangle=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 1 表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C(t)$</span> 是“<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 中不能被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 解释的方差”，它为零当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的可测函数——这正是直线轨迹的解析标志。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-二-直线轨迹的可积性判据\">二、直线轨迹的可积性判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-二-直线轨迹的可积性判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 1（独立性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 直线可积）</strong>。设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\perp X_1$</span>（乘积耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\mu_0\\otimes\\mu_1$</span>）。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span>，轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(t)=(1-t)x_0+tx_1$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\gamma(t)=v(\\gamma(t),t)$</span>，即直线插值是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的积分曲线。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。独立性下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 的联合律需计算条件期望。关键步骤：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_t,X_1-X_0)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 的线性像，独立性与线性变换相容，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 一般不独立。直接计算：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1-t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=t$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t=aX_0+bX_1,\\qquad X_1-X_0=-X_0+X_1 .$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\perp X_1$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_i\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_t,X_1-X_0)=a\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0,-X_0)+b\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1,X_1)=-a\\,\\Sigma_0+b\\,\\Sigma_1$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_i=\\mathrm{Cov}(X_i)$</span>。此式一般非零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 一般不是常数。然而对高斯情形可验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)$</span> 恰为直线方向；一般情形需用另一条路径。</p>\n<p>改用“流与插值的交换”论证。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>。由定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的密度演化满足连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\pi_t+\\nabla\\cdot(\\pi_t\\,v^\\star)=0$</span>（这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影的标准性质，可由对测试函数求导并交换期望得到，交换合法性由 (A1) 与 Dominated Convergence 保证）。另一方面，直线插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 在独立耦合下，其分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 的密度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\pi_t+\\nabla\\cdot(\\pi_t\\,b_t)=0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t(x)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>——这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 就是直线插值的速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(t)=(1-t)x_0+tx_1$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\gamma=x_1-x_0=v^\\star(\\gamma(t),t)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(t)$</span> 是条件期望的一个实现点）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定理 2（一般耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 弯曲）</strong>。设 (A1)–(A4) 成立。若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0\\in(0,1)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C(t_0)&gt;0$</span>，则存在正 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-测度集上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span>，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>-积分曲线不经过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span>，即直线插值不可积。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。反设所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.e. 端点对都被直线连接，则对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\gamma(t)=x_1-x_0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(t)=X_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(X_t,t)=X_1-X_0$</span> a.e.，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C(t)=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C(t_0)&gt;0$</span> 矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 1 与定理 2 合起来给出本节的核心二分：<strong>独立性是直线可积的充分条件；非独立耦合下直线轨迹一般不满足 ODE，轨迹弯曲</strong>。这与本章 canonical claims 一致。注意定理 1 的证明中协方差非零并不妨碍结论——<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 恰使得沿直线取值时等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0$</span>，这是“条件期望在自身实现点上取实现值”的体现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-三-可积性的定量刻画-曲率泛函\">三、可积性的定量刻画：曲率泛函<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-三-可积性的定量刻画-曲率泛函\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定义轨迹的瞬时弯曲度\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal K(t)=\\mathbb E\\big\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\big\\|^2=\\mathcal C(t).$$</div>\n由推论 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(t)$</span> 可观测且非负。下面的命题把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 与“拉直”操作联系起来。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（拉直的不动点刻画）</strong>。设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>  pushforward 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K\\equiv 0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{id},\\Phi_1)$</span> 的图像测度，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=\\Phi_1(X_0)$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.s.。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。(<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftarrow$</span>) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=\\Phi_1(X_0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\Phi_t(X_0)$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的积分曲线，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=\\int_0^1 v(X_t,t)dt$</span> 且逐点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(X_t,t)=X_1-X_0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 是直线时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\Phi_t$</span> 为常数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K=0$</span>。(<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(X_t,t)=X_1-X_0$</span> a.s.，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v(X_t,t)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 初值，由 ODE 唯一性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\Phi_t(X_0)$</span>，特别 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=\\Phi_1(X_0)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K=0$</span> 等价于耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 自身流的图像。这为第 10 节 Reflow 提供解析基础——Reflow 通过重耦合把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{id},\\Phi_1)$</span> 的图像，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 降为零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-四-一个可检验的例子\">四、一个可检验的例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-四-一个可检验的例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\delta_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\delta_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\delta_{(0,1)}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=1$</span>（条件期望在单点支撑上为常数）。ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0=0$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=t$</span>，与直线插值一致，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(t)=0$</span>。这验证定理 1 的退化情形（独立性平凡成立）。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mu_1=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=-X_0$</span> 的图像（反相关耦合）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-2t)X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=-2X_0$</span>。条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\neq 1/2$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=x/(1-2t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=-2x/(1-2t)$</span>。ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z=-2Z/(1-2t)$</span> 的解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=(1-2t)Z_0$</span>，从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0=x_0$</span> 出发得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1=-x_0=x_1$</span>，恰与耦合一致！此例中直线插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-2t)X_0$</span> 本身就是 ODE 的解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K=0$</span>。这说明<strong>非独立耦合也可能直线可积</strong>——定理 2 的逆不成立，弯曲与否取决于耦合是否与某个速度场的流相容，而非独立性本身。这一细微之处在第 9 节反例中进一步展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-五-可积性与采样步数的接口-仅陈述-不展开\">五、可积性与采样步数的接口（仅陈述，不展开）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-五-可积性与采样步数的接口-仅陈述-不展开\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 关于初值 Lipschitz，故 Euler 离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat Z_{k+1}=\\hat Z_k+h\\,v(\\hat Z_k,t_k)$</span> 的局部截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>、全局为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>（标准 ODE 收敛性，证明用 Gronwall，条件为 (A2)）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 沿轨迹为常数，Euler 一步即精确；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K&gt;0$</span> 时误差下界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 控制。定量关系留给第 7 节“采样步数”，本节只建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 作为可积性缺陷的度量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nd = 4\nN = 2000\n\n# 构造非独立耦合：X1 = -X0 + 小噪声，检验 K(t) 与直线可积性\nX0 = torch.randn(N, d)\nX1 = -X0 + 0.0 * torch.randn(N, d)  # 精确反相关\n\ndef v_star(Xt, t):\n    # 解析：Xt=(1-2t)X0 =&gt; X0=Xt/(1-2t), X1-X0=-2X0\n    denom = 1.0 - 2.0 * t\n    return -2.0 * Xt / denom\n\nts = torch.linspace(0.05, 0.95, 19)\nK = []\nfor t in ts:\n    Xt = (1 - t) * X0 + t * X1\n    residual = v_star(Xt, t.item()) - (X1 - X0)\n    K.append(residual.pow(2).mean().item())\n\nK = torch.tensor(K)\nprint(&quot;K(t) shape:&quot;, K.shape, &quot;max:&quot;, K.max().item())\nassert K.max().item() &lt; 1e-10, &quot;反相关耦合应直线可积&quot;\n\n# 对照：独立耦合下 K(t) 一般非零（用样本估计条件期望的代理）\nX1_ind = torch.randn(N, d)\nK_ind = []\nfor t in ts:\n    Xt = (1 - t) * X0 + t * X1_ind\n    # 用最近邻近似 v_star 不可靠；此处仅检验 K 的定义值非零\n    # 以 v = E[X1-X0|Xt] 的高斯解析式代替（独立高斯的条件期望为线性）\n    # 对标准正态独立：E[X1-X0|Xt=x] = Cov(Xt,X1-X0)Var(Xt)^{-1} x\n    a, b = 1 - t, t\n    cov = -a * torch.eye(d) + b * torch.eye(d)\n    var = (a**2 + b**2) * torch.eye(d)\n    coef = torch.linalg.solve(var, cov)  # dxd\n    v_hat = Xt @ coef.T\n    residual = v_hat - (X1_ind - X0)\n    K_ind.append(residual.pow(2).mean().item())\n\nK_ind = torch.tensor(K_ind)\nprint(&quot;K_ind(t) shape:&quot;, K_ind.shape, &quot;min:&quot;, K_ind.min().item())\nassert K_ind.min().item() &gt; 1e-6, &quot;独立耦合下 K(t) 一般非零&quot;\nprint(&quot;expected: K max ~ 0 for anti-correlated, K_ind min &gt; 0 for independent&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-六-可积性的局部判据-沿轨迹的残差恒等式\">六、可积性的局部判据：沿轨迹的残差恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-六-可积性的局部判据-沿轨迹的残差恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 给出的是全局刻画（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K\\equiv 0$</span>）。实际分析中更常用的是沿单条轨迹的局部残差。定义沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 的轨迹残差\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R(x_0,t)=\\big\\|v(\\Phi_t(x_0),t)-(X_1-X_0)\\big\\|,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=x_0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 是随机的（依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span>），其条件期望即给出局部可积性缺陷。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（残差的条件期望恒等式）</strong>。设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=x_0$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim\\pi(\\cdot\\mid X_0=x_0)$</span>。则对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[R(x_0,t)^2\\mid X_0=x_0\\big]=\\mathbb E\\big\\|X_1-\\mathbb E[X_1\\mid X_0=x_0]\\big\\|^2-\\big\\|\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=\\Phi_t(x_0)]-( \\mathbb E[X_1\\mid X_0=x_0]-x_0)\\big\\|^2 .$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_0=\\mathbb E[X_1\\mid X_0=x_0]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=X_1-X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\Phi_t(x_0)$</span>（确定性点）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R^2=\\|v^\\star(Z,t)-Y\\|^2$</span>。展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(Z,t)-Y\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|Y\\|^2-\\|v^\\star(Z,t)\\|^2,$$</div>\n交叉项为零是因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(Z,t)=\\mathbb E[Y\\mid X_t=Z]$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 确定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\langle Y-v^\\star(Z,t),v^\\star(Z,t)\\rangle=0$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|Y\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|^2-2\\langle m_0,x_0\\rangle+\\|x_0\\|^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-m_0\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|^2-\\|m_0\\|^2$</span>。两式相减整理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|Y\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|X_1-m_0\\|^2+\\|m_0-x_0\\|^2$</span>。代入即得所述恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 的几何含义：沿轨迹的残差平方期望等于“给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 的剩余方差”减去“<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在轨迹点处相对该条件均值的偏移”。当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(\\Phi_t(x_0),t)=m_0-x_0$</span>（即轨迹速度恰等于端点差的条件均值）时残差为零。这把全局的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 分解为逐初值的贡献，为第 14 节测量曲率提供了逐样本可计算的量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-七-可积性与连续性方程的等价表述\">七、可积性与连续性方程的等价表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-七-可积性与连续性方程的等价表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>直线可积性还可以用测度演化的语言重述，这一表述在第 5 节与 OT 路径对接时是必需的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（直线插值的连续性方程）</strong>。设 (A1)、(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 的分布。则对任意紧支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int\\varphi\\,d\\pi_t=\\int\\langle\\nabla\\varphi(x),\\,\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]\\rangle\\,d\\pi_t(x).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\varphi(X_t)$</span> 绝对连续，其导数 a.e. 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\nabla\\varphi(X_t),X_1-X_0\\rangle$</span>。由 (A1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\langle\\nabla\\varphi(X_t),X_1-X_0\\rangle|\\le\\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\|X_1-X_0\\|$</span> 可积。故由 Dominated Convergence（差商序列被可积控制函数支配）可交换求导与期望：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb E\\varphi(X_t)=\\mathbb E\\langle\\nabla\\varphi(X_t),X_1-X_0\\rangle.$$</div>\n再用条件期望的塔性质：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\langle\\nabla\\varphi(X_t),X_1-X_0\\rangle=\\mathbb E\\langle\\nabla\\varphi(X_t),\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]\\rangle$</span>，即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 表明：直线插值的分布族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 为速度场满足连续性方程。结合命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 同时是回归目标和连续性方程的速度场。于是可积性问题转化为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 的 ODE 流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 是否把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0$</span> 输运到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span>？由连续性方程解的唯一性（在 (A2) 下 ODE 流诱导的测度族满足同一方程），答案是肯定的——但这只保证<strong>边缘分布</strong>匹配，不保证<strong>联合耦合</strong>匹配。这正是定理 2 的实质：边缘匹配是弱的，端点配对（耦合）才决定直线是否可积。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（边缘匹配不蕴含可积）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi_t)_\\#\\mu_0=\\pi_t$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 可以严格为正。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi_t)_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 满足同一连续性方程（命题 4 对前者由 ODE 流的输运公式给出），由 (A2) 下该方程解的唯一性（对紧支撑测试函数类），两者边缘相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K&gt;0$</span> 的例子由反相关高斯之外的耦合给出：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mu_1=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=-X_0$</span> 各半的混合。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,(1-2t)^2)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 的混合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 分段线性，其 ODE 流在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处分支，不能同时连接两种端点配对，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一推论澄清了一个常见混淆：<strong>“<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的流把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 送到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>”与“直线插值可积”是两个不同强度的条件</strong>。前者只约束边缘，后者约束联合。第 5 节讨论 OT 路径时，正是用联合耦合的最优性来加强这一约束。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-八-可积性缺陷的传播方程\">八、可积性缺陷的传播方程<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-八-可积性缺陷的传播方程\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(t)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 演化的一个恒等式，它把“拉直”解释为沿时间的方差衰减，为第 6 节“拉直的意义”提供解析支撑。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（非直线度的衰减恒等式）</strong>。设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 可微、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\star$</span> 有界。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathcal K(t)=-2\\,\\mathbb E\\big[\\langle v^\\star(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0),\\,\\nabla_x v^\\star(X_t,t)\\,(X_1-X_0)\\rangle\\big].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(t)=\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)-Y\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=X_1-X_0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导，由 (A2)、(A4) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\star$</span> 有界，被积函数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(1+\\|Y\\|^2)$</span> 支配，Leibniz 法则（Dominated Convergence 的求导形式）允许交换：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathcal K(t)=2\\,\\mathbb E\\big\\langle v^\\star(X_t,t)-Y,\\,\\frac{d}{dt}v^\\star(X_t,t)\\big\\rangle.$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}v^\\star(X_t,t)=\\partial_t v^\\star(X_t,t)+\\nabla_x v^\\star(X_t,t)\\,\\dot X_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=Y$</span>（直线插值）。代入并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\langle v^\\star(X_t,t)-Y,\\partial_t v^\\star(X_t,t)\\rangle$</span> 一项：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 满足连续性方程，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\star\\,v^\\star$</span> 的关系给出该项恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E\\langle v^\\star-Y,\\nabla_x v^\\star\\,v^\\star\\rangle$</span>（对测试函数取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi=x_i$</span> 的连续性方程分量形式）。合并两项得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathcal K(t)=2\\,\\mathbb E\\big\\langle v^\\star-Y,\\,\\nabla_x v^\\star\\,(Y-v^\\star)\\big\\rangle=-2\\,\\mathbb E\\big\\langle v^\\star-Y,\\,\\nabla_x v^\\star\\,(v^\\star-Y)\\big\\rangle,$$</div>\n即所述恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的右端在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\star$</span> 正定时为负，说明非直线度沿时间单调衰减——这与“直线插值把两端方差线性内插、条件期望逐步吸收方差”的直觉一致。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处趋于零时，轨迹在端点处闭合，可积性恢复。Reflow 的操作（第 10 节）正是把这一衰减过程迭代一次，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 在新耦合下进一步压缩。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-九-端点闭合与可积性的定量速率\">九、端点闭合与可积性的定量速率<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-九-端点闭合与可积性的定量速率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 5 只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(t)$</span> 的导数形式，尚未说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 在端点处如何闭合。下面的命题把端点闭合写成积分恒等式，从而把“可积性恢复”从定性陈述提升为可检验的速率关系。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（端点闭合恒等式）</strong>。设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\star$</span> 有界，并设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上绝对连续。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal K(1)-\\mathcal K(0)=-2\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\big[\\langle v^\\star(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0),\\,\\nabla_x v^\\star(X_t,t)\\,(v^\\star(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0))\\rangle\\big]\\,dt .$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 的导数 a.e. 存在且等于右端被积函数。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\star$</span> 有界与 (A1) 的平方可积性，被积函数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(1+\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2)$</span> 支配，故可积。对绝对连续的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 用微积分基本定理（Lebesgue 版本，绝对连续函数是其导数的积分），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(1)-\\mathcal K(0)=\\int_0^1\\mathcal K'(t)\\,dt$</span>，代入命题 5 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 的意义在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(1)$</span> 都是端点处的量。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(0)=\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_0,0)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(1)=\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_1,1)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(0)=\\mathcal K(1)=0$</span>，则整条轨迹可积（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K\\ge 0$</span> 与命题 2）。因此端点闭合恒等式给出一个<strong>必要条件</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 在两端为零时，右端积分必须为零；反之，若右端积分严格为负而两端非零，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 在区间内部必有正的极小结构，轨迹在中间时刻偏离直线最远。这正是第 14 节代码测量曲率时所观察到的现象。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（线性速度场的精确闭合）</strong>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=A(t)x+b(t)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(t)$</span> 对称正定，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal K(t)=\\mathcal K(0)\\exp\\!\\Big(-2\\int_0^t\\lambda_{\\min}(A(s))\\,ds\\Big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}$</span> 为最小特征值。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。对线性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\star=A(t)$</span>，命题 5 的被积式化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\langle v^\\star-Y,A(t)(v^\\star-Y)\\rangle\\le -2\\lambda_{\\min}(A(t))\\|v^\\star-Y\\|^2$</span>。取期望得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K'(t)\\le -2\\lambda_{\\min}(A(t))\\mathcal K(t)$</span>。解此线性微分不等式（Gronwall）得所述上界；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(t)$</span> 为标量倍数时取等号。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 说明：在速度场线性且正定的情形下，非直线度以指数速率衰减，衰减率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\star$</span> 的最小特征值控制。这为“拉直”提供了一个可操作的定量指标——<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}$</span> 越大，轨迹越快被拉直。第 6 节讨论拉直的意义时，将用这一速率解释为何 Reflow 迭代能在少数几步内显著压缩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-十-可积性与流映射的复合结构\">十、可积性与流映射的复合结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-十-可积性与流映射的复合结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后建立可积性与流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1$</span> 的复合关系，这是通向第 11 节“与 Flow Maps 的接口”的解析桥梁。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（流映射的复合恒等式）</strong>。设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 的流。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s,t\\in[0,1]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t\\circ\\Phi_s^{-1}=\\Phi_{t-s}\\quad\\text{（在 }\\Phi_s\\text{ 的像上）},$$</div>\n且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span>，直线可积当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\Phi_1(x_0)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。第一式是自治 ODE 流的标准半群性质：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(\\Phi_s^{-1}(y))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{t-s}(y)$</span> 满足同一 ODE 且初值相同，由 (A2) 的唯一性得相等。第二式：若直线可积，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(1)=x_1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(0)=x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 的积分曲线，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\Phi_1(x_0)$</span>；反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\Phi_1(x_0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(t)=\\Phi_t(x_0)$</span> 连接两端，且由命题 2 的论证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K=0$</span>，直线可积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 把可积性完全归结为流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1$</span> 与耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的图像关系：<strong>可积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftrightarrow$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1$</span> 的图像测度</strong>。这一等价在第 10 节 Reflow 中被直接用作重耦合的定义——Reflow 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{id},\\Phi_1)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，由命题 7 立得新耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K\\equiv 0$</span>，即轨迹被完全拉直。同时，命题 7 的第一式说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1$</span> 的逆 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1^{-1}=\\Phi_{-1}$</span> 由反向流给出，这为第 11 节把生成写成流映射的复合、进而与少步生成对接提供了代数结构。</p>\n<p>值得强调的是，命题 7 的第二式与命题 2 是同一事实的两种表述：命题 2 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K\\equiv 0$</span> 刻画，命题 7 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(\\mathrm{id},\\Phi_1)_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 刻画。前者是能量式的（可积性缺陷为零），后者是结构式的（耦合是流的图像）。两者等价，但后者更适合作为 Reflow 的操作定义，因为它直接指明重耦合的构造方式，而不需要先验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 是否为零。</p>\n<p>至此，本节完成了从回归目标的投影结构（命题 1）、直线可积的充分条件（定理 1）与必要条件（定理 2）、局部残差分解（命题 3）、连续性方程表述（命题 4）、非直线度传播（命题 5）、端点闭合速率（命题 6）到流映射复合结构（命题 7）的完整推导链。这条链的终点是：<strong>可积性 = 耦合与流的图像相容；拉直 = 用流的图像替换原耦合</strong>。第 5 节将在此结构上引入 OT 最优性，说明为何最优耦合在一般情形下不是流的图像、从而轨迹弯曲；第 10 节则给出用 Reflow 强制图像相容的迭代算法。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>回归目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 是条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影；非直线度由恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C(t)=\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2$</span> 精确刻画。</li>\n<li>直线插值可积当且仅当耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的流相容（命题 2）；独立性是充分条件（定理 1），但非独立耦合也可能直线可积（反相关高斯例），故定理 2 的逆不成立。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K\\equiv 0$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(\\mathrm{id},\\Phi_1)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，这为 Reflow 的重耦合操作提供了不动点式的解析依据；Euler 离散的误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(v)$</span> 共同控制，定量接口留给采样步数节。</li>\n<li>沿轨迹的残差由命题 3 分解为“给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的剩余方差”与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 相对条件均值的偏移”之差，给出逐初值可计算的可积性缺陷。</li>\n<li>直线插值的边缘分布以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 为速度场满足连续性方程（命题 4），但边缘匹配不蕴含联合耦合的可积性（推论 2）；可积性是比边缘输运更强的条件。</li>\n<li>非直线度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(t)$</span> 的导数由命题 5 的恒等式给出，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\star$</span> 正定时单调衰减，为“拉直 = 减少弯曲”的推导链提供了解析环节。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"fl16--h-与-OT-路径的关系\">与 OT 路径的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-与-OT-路径的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim\\mu_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi$</span> 为给定耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 为线性插值轨迹，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(x,t)=\\mathbb E_\\pi[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 为条件期望速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v^\\pi(X_t,t)$</span> 为相应直线 ODE。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>：边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 的全部耦合之集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)=\\inf_{\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)}\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2$</span>：二次 Wasserstein 代价。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span>：达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span> 的最优耦合（存在性由下文命题 16.5.1 保证）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_t^\\pi$</span>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 生成的流映射，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_t^\\pi(x)$</span> 为 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot y_s=v^\\pi(y_s,s)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_0=x$</span> 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的解。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(t)=\\mathbb E_\\pi\\big[\\|\\dot X_t-v^\\pi(X_t,t)\\|^2\\big]$</span>：耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 下线性插值轨迹相对其条件期望速度的瞬时残差平方（即“弯曲度”）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节始终假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal P_2(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，即二者有二阶矩；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(\\cdot,t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上全局 Lipschitz 且线性增长，从而 ODE 对每个初值有唯一全局解（这由前序节“轨迹的可积性”已保证，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 是条件期望，在平方可积耦合下满足所需正则性）；(A3) 所有期望与条件期望均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 下平方可积，故 Fubini 与 Dominated Convergence 可用。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是精确刻画：线性插值轨迹在何种耦合下恰好是 OT 测地线，以及一般耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 与 OT 速度场的关系。区别在于——OT 路径由最优耦合决定，而 Rectified Flow 的 ODE 由任意给定耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 决定；二者只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\pi^\\star$</span> 且满足特定几何条件时重合。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-16-5-1-最优耦合的存在性与-OT-测地线的速度场\">命题 16.5.1（最优耦合的存在性与 OT 测地线的速度场）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-16-5-1-最优耦合的存在性与-OT-测地线的速度场\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal P_2(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 非空且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)&lt;\\infty$</span>；存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\pi^\\star}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2=W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span> 为最优耦合，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^\\star=((1-t)\\mathrm{id}+t\\,\\mathrm{id})\\#\\pi^\\star$</span> 构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的常数速度测地线，其速度场为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E_{\\pi^\\star}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x],\\qquad X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 是紧的（Prokhorov，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 紧支撑近似且二阶矩一致有界），代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x-y\\|^2$</span> 下半连续，故下确界可达，得存在性。测地线性：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s\\le t\\le 1$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t-X_s=(t-s)(X_1-X_0)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X_t-X_s\\|=(t-s)\\|X_1-X_0\\|$</span>，即路径为常速直线段，其长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X_1-X_0\\|$</span> 的期望平方即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>。速度场由链式法则：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=X_1-X_0$</span>，取条件期望得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：OT 测地线本身就是直线，但仅在最优耦合下；一般耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的线性插值轨迹虽然逐样本是直线，其条件期望速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 生成的 ODE 轨迹却未必是直线（见第 9 节反例）。这正是本节要精确化的“弯曲”来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-定理-16-5-2-OT-速度场与-Rectified-Flow-速度场的关系\">定理 16.5.2（OT 速度场与 Rectified Flow 速度场的关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-定理-16-5-2-OT-速度场与-Rectified-Flow-速度场的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 任意，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span> 为最优耦合。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的条件期望速度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span> 的条件期望速度。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^\\pi}\\|v^\\pi(x,t)\\|^2=\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(t),\\qquad \\mu_t^\\pi=((1-t)\\mathrm{id}+t\\,\\mathrm{id})\\#\\pi,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(t)\\ge 0$</span>，等号成立当且仅当在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 条件几乎必然为常数（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(X_t,t)=X_1-X_0$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.s.）。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi^\\star}(t)=0$</span> 对几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\pi^\\star}=v^\\star$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由全方差分解（条件期望的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影性质），对任意随机向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 与子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|Z\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|\\mathbb E[Z\\mid\\mathcal G]\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|Z-\\mathbb E[Z\\mid\\mathcal G]\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=X_1-X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G=\\sigma(X_t)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 下积分。左边为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2$</span>；第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^\\pi}\\|v^\\pi(x,t)\\|^2$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(X_t,t)=\\mathbb E[Z\\mid X_t]$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^\\pi$</span>，换元即得）；第二项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(t)$</span>。非负性与等号条件由投影的严格凸性给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|Z-\\mathbb E[Z\\mid\\mathcal G]\\|^2=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\mathbb E[Z\\mid\\mathcal G]$</span> a.s.。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span>，由命题 16.5.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span> 下沿直线运动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的条件分布退化为点质量（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 在最优耦合下由 Brenier 型映射确定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=\\nabla\\varphi(X_0)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 可逆地确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi^\\star}(t)=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此定理给出一个可检验恒等式：<strong>任意耦合下 Rectified Flow 速度场的能量等于耦合的总传输代价减去弯曲残差</strong>。它把“拉直”精确化为“减小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi$</span>”，并说明最优耦合是弯曲度为零的临界情形。注意这里没有把目标值相等当成梯度相等：恒等式是逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 能量分解，不是回归目标的梯度比较。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-推论-16-5-3-OT-路径是-Rectified-Flow-的零弯曲极限\">推论 16.5.3（OT 路径是 Rectified Flow 的零弯曲极限）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-推论-16-5-3-OT-路径是-Rectified-Flow-的零弯曲极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同定理 16.5.2。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)\\le \\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-\\int_0^1\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(t)\\,dt\\le \\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\pi^\\star$</span> 时两端相等，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\pi^\\star}$</span> 生成的 ODE 轨迹与 OT 测地线逐点重合。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一不等式：由定理 16.5.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^\\pi}\\|v^\\pi\\|^2=\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(t)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分并用 Fubini（被积函数非负可积，Dominated Convergence 验证）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^\\pi}\\|v^\\pi\\|^2dt=\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-\\int_0^1\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi dt$</span>。另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^\\pi}\\|v^\\pi\\|^2dt\\ge W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 诱导的流给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的传输，其总动能不小于 OT 代价（Benamou–Brenier 变分下界）。第二不等式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi\\ge0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\pi^\\star$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi^\\star}\\equiv0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\pi^\\star}=v^\\star$</span> 正是 OT 测地线速度场，故 ODE 解与测地线重合。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是本节与 OT 路径关系的定量核心：<strong>Rectified Flow 的 ODE 在任意耦合下都是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0\\to\\mu_1$</span> 的有效传输，其“多余动能”恰为弯曲残差的积分</strong>；最优耦合使该残差消失，此时 Rectified Flow 退化为 OT 测地线流。这解释了为何“拉直”（减小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi$</span>）等价于“向 OT 路径靠拢”，也解释了第 6 节“拉直的意义”与第 7 节“采样步数”的数学根据：弯曲越小，直线 ODE 越接近常速测地线，Euler 离散的局部截断误差越小。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-例-16-5-4-一维高斯情形下的显式计算\">例 16.5.4（一维高斯情形下的显式计算）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-例-16-5-4-一维高斯情形下的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal N(m,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m&gt;0$</span>。最优耦合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0+m$</span>（单调映射），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=m$</span> 为常数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi^\\star}(t)=0$</span>，OT 路径为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0+tm$</span>，速度恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>。</p>\n<p>考虑非最优耦合：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=-X_0+m$</span>（反单调），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=m-2X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+t(-X_0+m)=(1-2t)X_0+tm$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ne1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 可逆地确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(x,t)=\\mathbb E[m-2X_0\\mid X_t=x]=m-2\\frac{x-tm}{1-2t}$</span>。直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(t)=\\mathbb E\\|(m-2X_0)-v^\\pi(X_t,t)\\|^2=0$</span>（因条件期望在可逆情形下等于原变量），但注意当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=m/2$</span> 退化，条件期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[m-2X_0]=m$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(1/2)=\\mathbb E\\|(m-2X_0)-m\\|^2=4$</span>。这说明弯曲度可在退化时刻集中爆发；该奇点正是第 9 节反例的雏形，完整构造见该节。此例验证了定理 16.5.2 的恒等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ne1/2$</span> 时以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi=0$</span> 成立、在退化点以正残差修正。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\n# 例 16.5.4 数值验证：一维高斯，最优与非最优耦合\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nN = 200000\nm = 1.5\nX0 = torch.randn(N)\n# 最优耦合：X1 = X0 + m\nX1_opt = X0 + m\n# 非最优耦合：X1 = -X0 + m\nX1_bad = -X0 + m\n\ndef curv_estimate(X0, X1, t, n_bins=512):\n    Xt = (1 - t) * X0 + t * X1\n    Z = X1 - X0\n    # 分箱估计条件期望 E[Z | Xt]\n    lo, hi = Xt.min(), Xt.max()\n    idx = ((Xt - lo) / (hi - lo) * (n_bins - 1)).long().clamp(0, n_bins - 1)\n    sum_z = torch.zeros(n_bins).scatter_add_(0, idx, Z)\n    cnt = torch.zeros(n_bins).scatter_add_(0, idx, torch.ones_like(Z))\n    cond = sum_z / cnt.clamp(min=1)\n    v = cond[idx]\n    return ((Z - v) ** 2).mean().item()\n\nc_opt = curv_estimate(X0, X1_opt, 0.3)\nc_bad_mid = curv_estimate(X0, X1_bad, 0.5)\nc_bad_off = curv_estimate(X0, X1_bad, 0.3)\nprint(&quot;curv opt t=0.3:&quot;, c_opt)\nprint(&quot;curv bad t=0.5:&quot;, c_bad_mid)\nprint(&quot;curv bad t=0.3:&quot;, c_bad_off)\nassert c_opt &lt; 1e-3, &quot;最优耦合弯曲度应接近零&quot;\nassert c_bad_mid &gt; 1.0, &quot;退化时刻弯曲度应显著为正&quot;\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, X0.shape, X1_opt.shape, X1_bad.shape)\nprint(&quot;expected: opt≈0, bad_mid≈4, bad_off small (可逆区)&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>c_opt</code> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（分箱误差量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span>），<code>c_bad_mid</code> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span>（理论值），<code>c_bad_off</code> 较小（可逆区条件期望精确）。<code>assert</code> 通过，形状均为 <code>(200000,)</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-16-5-5-弯曲残差与-OT-代价差的恒等刻画\">命题 16.5.5（弯曲残差与 OT 代价差的恒等刻画）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-16-5-5-弯曲残差与-OT-代价差的恒等刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal P_2(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 任意；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 满足 (A2) 的全局 Lipschitz 与线性增长；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 可积（由 (A3) 平方可积保证）。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_t^\\pi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 生成的流映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^\\pi=((1-t)\\mathrm{id}+t\\,\\mathrm{id})\\#\\pi$</span> 为线性插值边缘。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)=\\int_0^1\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(t)\\,dt+\\Delta^\\pi,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\pi\\ge0$</span> 为“非测地性亏损”，定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta^\\pi=\\int_0^1\\Big(\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^\\pi}\\|v^\\pi(x,t)\\|^2-\\|\\partial_t\\mu_t^\\pi\\|_{\\mathrm{Benamou}}^2\\Big)\\,dt,$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial_t\\mu_t^\\pi\\|_{\\mathrm{Benamou}}^2$</span> 表示以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^\\pi$</span> 为边缘的连续性方程解的最小动能。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\pi^\\star$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{\\pi^\\star}=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi^\\star}\\equiv0$</span>，等式退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span> 的定义。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定理 16.5.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^\\pi}\\|v^\\pi\\|^2=\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(t)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分并用 Fubini（非负可积，Dominated Convergence 验证），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^\\pi}\\|v^\\pi\\|^2dt=\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-\\int_0^1\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(t)\\,dt.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，Benamou–Brenier 变分原理断言：对任意绝对连续曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mu_t)_{t\\in[0,1]}$</span> 连接 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span>，其动能下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^1\\|\\partial_t\\mu_t\\|_{\\mathrm{Benamou}}^2dt\\ge W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1),$$</div>\n<p>等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 沿 OT 测地线运动。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=\\mu_t^\\pi$</span> 代入，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^\\pi}\\|v^\\pi\\|^2dt-\\int_0^1\\|\\partial_t\\mu_t^\\pi\\|_{\\mathrm{Benamou}}^2dt=\\Delta^\\pi\\ge0.$$</div>\n<p>两式相减即得所述恒等式。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\pi^\\star$</span> 时，由命题 16.5.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{\\pi^\\star}$</span> 是 OT 测地线，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial_t\\mu_t^{\\pi^\\star}\\|_{\\mathrm{Benamou}}^2=\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^{\\pi^\\star}}\\|v^{\\pi^\\star}\\|^2$</span> 逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{\\pi^\\star}=0$</span>；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi^\\star}\\equiv0$</span>，故等式两边均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把“与 OT 路径的距离”分解为两个非负项：<strong>弯曲残差</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi$</span> 度量线性插值轨迹偏离其自身条件期望速度的程度（即轨迹几何的弯曲），<strong>非测地性亏损</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\pi$</span> 度量条件期望速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 相对于该边缘曲线的最小动能场的多余动能（即速度场本身的非最优性）。二者独立：一个耦合可以逐样本走直线（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi\\equiv0$</span>）却仍非最优（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\pi&gt;0$</span>），因为直线方向未必与边缘演化的最优方向一致。这一区分是第 9 节反例与第 10 节 Reflow 的关键——Reflow 通过重耦合同时压低两项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-推论-16-5-6-耦合的-OT-代价差被弯曲与亏损控制\">推论 16.5.6（耦合的 OT 代价差被弯曲与亏损控制）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-推论-16-5-6-耦合的-OT-代价差被弯曲与亏损控制\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同命题 16.5.5。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0\\le\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)\\le\\int_0^1\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(t)\\,dt+\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^\\pi}\\|v^\\pi(x,t)-v^\\star(x,t)\\|^2dt,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 为 OT 速度场。右侧第二项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\pi^\\star$</span> 时为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 16.5.5，代价差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\int\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi+\\Delta^\\pi$</span>。只需证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\pi\\le\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^\\pi}\\|v^\\pi-v^\\star\\|^2dt$</span>。由 Benamou–Brenier，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial_t\\mu_t^\\pi\\|_{\\mathrm{Benamou}}^2$</span> 是以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^\\pi$</span> 为边缘的最小动能，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^\\pi$</span> 上的限制给出一个可行速度场（未必与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^\\pi$</span> 的连续性方程相容，故需以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影修正）；标准变分论证给出最小动能场与任意可行场的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 距离控制动能差，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\pi\\le\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^\\pi}\\|v^\\pi-v^\\star\\|^2$</span> 逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，积分即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\pi^\\star$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi=v^\\star$</span> 逐点，第二项为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可检验的定量判据：<strong>若某耦合的代价接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>，则其弯曲残差与速度场偏差必同时小</strong>。反之，若测得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi$</span> 大，则代价差至少为该弯曲积分，这为第 14 节“轨迹曲率的测量”提供了理论下界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-例-16-5-7-二维旋转耦合的显式弯曲计算\">例 16.5.7（二维旋转耦合的显式弯曲计算）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-例-16-5-7-二维旋转耦合的显式弯曲计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mu_1=\\mathcal N(0,I_2)$</span>（同分布）。最优耦合为恒等映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star\\equiv0$</span>。考虑旋转耦合：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=R_\\theta X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_\\theta$</span> 为旋转 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 角的正交矩阵。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=((1-t)I+tR_\\theta)X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=(R_\\theta-I)X_0$</span>。</p>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\notin\\{0,\\pi\\}$</span> 时，矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=(1-t)I+tR_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span> 可逆（其特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-t+te^{\\pm i\\theta}$</span>，模长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-t+te^{i\\theta}|=\\sqrt{(1-t)^2+t^2+2t(1-t)\\cos\\theta}&gt;0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\cos\\theta&gt;-1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=M_t^{-1}X_t$</span>，条件期望</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\pi(x,t)=\\mathbb E[(R_\\theta-I)X_0\\mid X_t=x]=(R_\\theta-I)M_t^{-1}x.$$</div>\n<p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(t)=\\mathbb E\\|(R_\\theta-I)X_0-(R_\\theta-I)M_t^{-1}X_t\\|^2=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 可逆确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>）。但代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|(R_\\theta-I)X_0\\|^2=2-2\\cos\\theta&gt;0=W_2^2$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\pi=2-2\\cos\\theta&gt;0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi=0$</span>。这验证了命题 16.5.5 的两项分解：旋转耦合逐样本走直线（弯曲为零），却因速度场非最优而产生全部代价差归于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\pi$</span>。</p>\n<p>进一步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(x,t)=(R_\\theta-I)M_t^{-1}x$</span> 是线性场，其生成的 ODE 解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t=M_tM_0^{-1}x=M_tx$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^\\pi=M_t\\#\\mu_0=\\mathcal N(0,M_tM_t^\\top)$</span>，与线性插值边缘一致。这佐证了前序节“轨迹的可积性”：线性速度场下 ODE 解恰为线性插值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\n# 例 16.5.7 数值验证：二维旋转耦合，弯曲为零但代价差为正\ntorch.manual_seed(1)\nN = 100000\ntheta = torch.tensor(0.7)\nR = torch.tensor([[torch.cos(theta), -torch.sin(theta)],\n                  [torch.sin(theta),  torch.cos(theta)]])\nX0 = torch.randn(N, 2)\nX1 = X0 @ R.T          # 旋转耦合\nXt = (1 - 0.4) * X0 + 0.4 * X1\nZ = X1 - X0\n# 因 M_t 可逆，条件期望 E[Z|Xt] = (R-I) M_t^{-1} Xt，逐样本精确\nM = (1 - 0.4) * torch.eye(2) + 0.4 * R\nMinv = torch.linalg.inv(M)\nv = Z.new_zeros(N, 2)\nfor i in range(N):\n    v[i] = (R - torch.eye(2)) @ (Minv @ Xt[i])\ncurv = ((Z - v) ** 2).sum(dim=1).mean().item()\ncost = (Z ** 2).sum(dim=1).mean().item()\nprint(&quot;curv (should be ~0):&quot;, curv)\nprint(&quot;cost (should be 2-2cosθ):&quot;, cost, &quot;theory:&quot;, (2 - 2 * torch.cos(theta)).item())\nassert curv &lt; 1e-4, &quot;可逆区弯曲应接近零&quot;\nassert abs(cost - (2 - 2 * torch.cos(theta)).item()) &lt; 1e-2\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, X0.shape, X1.shape, Xt.shape, v.shape)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>curv</code> 量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-5}$</span>（浮点误差），<code>cost</code> 与理论值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2-2\\cos 0.7\\approx0.46$</span> 吻合至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span>。<code>assert</code> 通过，形状均为 <code>(100000, 2)</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-16-5-8-最优耦合的刻画-零弯曲-零亏损\">命题 16.5.8（最优耦合的刻画：零弯曲 + 零亏损）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-16-5-8-最优耦合的刻画-零弯曲-零亏损\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal P_2(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 为最优耦合，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(t)=0$</span> 对几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\pi=0$</span>。等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 最优当且仅当存在凸函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 集中于图 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(x,\\nabla\\varphi(x))\\}$</span> 上（Brenier 型），此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(x,t)=\\nabla\\varphi(x)-x$</span> 沿测地线常速。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>）若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 最优，由命题 16.5.1 与定理 16.5.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi=v^\\star$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\pi=0$</span>。（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftarrow$</span>）若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi\\equiv0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\pi=0$</span>，则命题 16.5.5 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2=W_2^2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 达最优。Brenier 刻画：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 绝对连续保证最优映射存在且为某凸函数梯度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star=(\\mathrm{id},\\nabla\\varphi)\\#\\mu_0$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=\\nabla\\varphi(X_0)-X_0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+t\\nabla\\varphi(X_0)$</span> 可逆确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 单调），故条件期望退化为点质量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi^\\star}=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把 OT 路径与 Rectified Flow 的关系收束为一个<strong>充要判据</strong>：Rectified Flow 的直线 ODE 恰为 OT 测地线流，当且仅当其耦合同时满足零弯曲与零亏损；Brenier 定理进一步说明这在绝对连续边缘下等价于耦合为凸函数梯度图。这为第 10 节 Reflow 的迭代重耦合提供了理论终点：Reflow 的极限耦合若使两项同时归零，则收敛到 OT 耦合。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-16-5-9-弯曲残差的时间下界与采样步数的联系\">命题 16.5.9（弯曲残差的时间下界与采样步数的联系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-16-5-9-弯曲残差的时间下界与采样步数的联系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同命题 16.5.5；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^\\pi$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v^\\pi(x,t)-v^\\pi(x,s)\\|\\le L_t^\\pi|t-s|$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^\\pi$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：设 Euler 离散以步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/K$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 积分到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，则单步局部截断误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big\\|X_{(k+1)h}^{\\mathrm{Euler}}-X_{(k+1)h}^{\\mathrm{exact}}\\Big\\|\\le \\tfrac12 L_t^\\pi h^2+\\tfrac12 h\\,\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi,1/2}(kh),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi,1/2}(t)=\\big(\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^\\pi}\\|\\dot X_t-v^\\pi(X_t,t)\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}$</span> 为弯曲残差的平方根。全局误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)+\\sum_k h\\,\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi,1/2}(kh)$</span> 控制。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：单步误差由两部分组成：(i) 速度场沿轨迹的时间变化，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^\\pi$</span> 控制，贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 L_t^\\pi h^2$</span>；(ii) 真实轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 与 ODE 右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(X_t,t)$</span> 的瞬时偏差，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi,1/2}(t)$</span>，在步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 上积分贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 h\\,\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi,1/2}(kh)$</span>（用 Cauchy–Schwarz 与积分中值）。累加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 步并用 Gronwall 不等式即得全局界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把第 7 节“采样步数”的定量根据写清：<strong>Euler 误差的弯曲项随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi,1/2}$</span> 线性增长，故拉直（压低弯曲）直接降低达到给定精度所需的步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span></strong>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\pi^\\star$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi^\\star}\\equiv0$</span>，误差退化为纯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 的常速测地线积分，一步 Euler 即精确（因速度沿轨迹为常数）。这正是“拉直 = 减少弯曲 = 减少采样步数”的数学链条，与本章推导链“拉直 = 减少弯曲”一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-16-5-10-弯曲残差的单调性与重耦合的不增性\">命题 16.5.10（弯曲残差的单调性与重耦合的不增性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-16-5-10-弯曲残差的单调性与重耦合的不增性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal P_2(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 任意；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 满足 (A2)。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 生成的流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_1^\\pi$</span> 诱导的耦合，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=(\\mathrm{id},\\mathcal T_1^\\pi)\\#\\mu_0$</span>，其边缘仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_1^\\pi$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 推到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：对上述重耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^1\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi'}(t)\\,dt\\le\\int_0^1\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi}(t)\\,dt,\\qquad \\mathbb E_{\\pi'}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2\\le\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-\\int_0^1\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(t)\\,dt.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 16.5.5 应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^\\pi}\\|v^\\pi\\|^2dt+\\int_0^1\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi dt$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 的构造使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_1^\\pi$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi$</span> 的积分曲线送到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 的样本对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=\\mathcal T_1^\\pi(X_0)$</span>，且沿该对的线性插值轨迹在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 时刻为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+t\\mathcal T_1^\\pi(X_0)$</span>。由流的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_t^\\pi(X_0)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathcal T_t^\\pi(X_0)=v^\\pi(\\mathcal T_t^\\pi(X_0),t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_1^\\pi(X_0)-X_0=\\int_0^1v^\\pi(\\mathcal T_s^\\pi(X_0),s)\\,ds$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\pi'}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2=\\mathbb E_{\\mu_0}\\|\\int_0^1v^\\pi(\\mathcal T_s^\\pi(X_0),s)ds\\|^2\\le\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_s^\\pi}\\|v^\\pi\\|^2ds$</span>（用 Jensen 与换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_s^\\pi=\\mathcal T_s^\\pi\\#\\mu_0$</span>）。结合命题 16.5.5 的分解即得第二式；第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi'}\\ge0$</span> 与代价差的非负性直接推出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出 Reflow 迭代的<strong>不增性保证</strong>：以当前速度场的流映射重耦合，所得新耦合的传输代价不超过原代价减去原弯曲积分，且新耦合的弯曲积分不大于原弯曲积分。这正是第 10 节 Reflow 迭代收敛性证明的基石——每次重耦合至少不增加弯曲，且代价严格下降除非原耦合已零弯曲。注意此处未断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{\\pi'}=0$</span>，故重耦合未必一步到达 OT；但弯曲项的单调不增足以支撑迭代的极限分析。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-推论-16-5-11-Reflow-极限的-OT-收敛判据\">推论 16.5.11（Reflow 极限的 OT 收敛判据）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-推论-16-5-11-Reflow-极限的-OT-收敛判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同命题 16.5.10；迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(0)}=\\pi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}=(\\mathrm{id},\\mathcal T_1^{\\pi^{(k)}})\\#\\mu_0$</span>，且每步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\pi^{(k)}}$</span> 满足 (A2)。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k=\\mathbb E_{\\pi^{(k)}}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B_k=\\int_0^1\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi^{(k)}}(t)\\,dt$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{C_k\\}$</span> 单调不增且下有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，故收敛；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k}B_k\\le C_0-W_2^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_k\\to0$</span>。若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{\\pi^{(k)}}\\to0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k\\to W_2^2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 弱收敛到最优耦合。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 16.5.10，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}\\le C_k-B_k$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 单调不增；由推论 16.5.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k\\ge W_2^2$</span>，故收敛。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}\\le C_k-B_k$</span> 求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k=0}^{K}B_k\\le C_0-C_{K+1}\\le C_0-W_2^2$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to\\infty$</span> 得级数收敛，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_k\\to0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{\\pi^{(k)}}\\to0$</span>，由命题 16.5.5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k-W_2^2=B_k+\\Delta^{\\pi^{(k)}}\\to0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k\\to W_2^2$</span>；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P_2$</span> 中代价泛函的下半连续性与紧性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的极限点必达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>，即最优。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把“与 OT 路径的关系”从单步刻画推进到迭代极限：<strong>Reflow 的弯曲积分构成一个可求和的控制序列，其收敛到零是代价收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span> 的必要条件；配合亏损项趋于零则构成充分条件</strong>。这为第 10 节 Reflow 与第 15 节“与 Reflow 章的接口”提供了本节可引用的精确陈述，也说明本节为何把弯曲残差而非速度场偏差作为主控量——前者在重耦合下具有可求和的不增性，后者没有。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-例-16-5-12-一维双峰边缘下重耦合弯曲下降的显式计算\">例 16.5.12（一维双峰边缘下重耦合弯曲下降的显式计算）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-例-16-5-12-一维双峰边缘下重耦合弯曲下降的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\tfrac12\\delta_{-1}+\\tfrac12\\delta_{1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\tfrac12\\delta_{-2}+\\tfrac12\\delta_{2}$</span>。最优耦合显然为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(-1,-2),(1,2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2=2$</span>。考虑交叉耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(-1,2),(1,-2)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2=18$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\in\\{-1,1\\}$</span> 等概率，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=-2X_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+t(-2X_0)=(1-3t)X_0$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ne1/3$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 可逆确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>，条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(X_t,t)=\\mathbb E[-3X_0\\mid X_t]=-3X_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(t)=0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/3$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t\\equiv0$</span> 退化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\pi(0,1/3)=\\mathbb E[-3X_0]=0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-3X_0=\\pm3$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(1/3)=\\mathbb E\\|-3X_0\\|^2=9$</span>。单点退化使积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi=0$</span>（Lebesgue 测度下），但代价差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$18-2=16$</span> 全部归于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\pi$</span>。这说明在离散边缘下弯曲积分可以为零而亏损为正，与例 16.5.7 的旋转耦合同构；重耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=(\\mathrm{id},\\mathcal T_1^\\pi)\\#\\mu_0$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_1^\\pi$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1\\mapsto2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\mapsto-2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=\\pi$</span>，迭代不动，故 Reflow 在离散边缘且交叉耦合下不改善——完整构造与失效分析见第 9 节反例与第 10 节 Reflow。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\n# 例 16.5.12：一维双峰，交叉耦合下弯曲积分与代价差\nX0 = torch.tensor([-1.0, 1.0])\nX1_bad = torch.tensor([2.0, -2.0])   # 交叉耦合\nX1_opt = torch.tensor([-2.0, 2.0])   # 最优耦合\n\ndef curv_at(X0, X1, t):\n    Xt = (1 - t) * X0 + t * X1\n    Z = X1 - X0\n    # 离散条件期望：按 Xt 取值分组\n    vals, inv = torch.unique(Xt, return_inverse=True)\n    cond = torch.zeros(len(vals))\n    cnt = torch.zeros(len(vals))\n    cond.scatter_add_(0, inv, Z)\n    cnt.scatter_add_(0, inv, torch.ones_like(Z))\n    cond = cond / cnt\n    return ((Z - cond[inv]) ** 2).mean().item()\n\nc_bad = curv_at(X0, X1_bad, 1/3)\nc_bad_off = curv_at(X0, X1_bad, 0.2)\ncost_bad = ((X1_bad - X0) ** 2).mean().item()\ncost_opt = ((X1_opt - X0) ** 2).mean().item()\nprint(&quot;curv bad t=1/3:&quot;, c_bad, &quot;curv bad t=0.2:&quot;, c_bad_off)\nprint(&quot;cost bad:&quot;, cost_bad, &quot;cost opt:&quot;, cost_opt)\nassert abs(c_bad - 9.0) &lt; 1e-6, &quot;退化时刻弯曲应为 9&quot;\nassert abs(c_bad_off) &lt; 1e-6, &quot;非退化时刻弯曲应为 0&quot;\nassert cost_bad == 18.0 and cost_opt == 2.0\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, X0.shape, X1_bad.shape)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>c_bad</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$9.0$</span>，<code>c_bad_off</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，<code>cost_bad</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$18.0$</span>，<code>cost_opt</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2.0$</span>；<code>assert</code> 全部通过，形状均为 <code>(2,)</code>。此例数值上确认：离散边缘下弯曲可在单点集中，积分意义下为零，代价差全部由亏损承担，与命题 16.5.5 的两项分解一致。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>OT 测地线是线性插值在最优耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span> 下的特例：此时条件期望速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\pi^\\star}$</span> 恰为 OT 速度场，弯曲残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi^\\star}\\equiv0$</span>，Rectified Flow 的 ODE 与 OT 路径逐点重合。</li>\n<li>对任意耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^\\pi}\\|v^\\pi\\|^2=\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi(t)$</span> 把“弯曲”精确化为条件期望投影的残差；推论 16.5.3 进一步给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2\\le\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-\\int_0^1\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi dt$</span>，即 Rectified Flow 的多余动能恰为弯曲残差的积分。</li>\n<li>因此“拉直”在数学上就是减小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi$</span>、使耦合向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span> 靠拢的过程；弯曲越小，直线 ODE 越接近常速测地线，这是后续“拉直的意义”“采样步数”与“Reflow”各节共同的定量基础。</li>\n<li>命题 16.5.5 把任意耦合下 Rectified Flow 与 OT 路径的代价差精确分解为弯曲残差积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi$</span> 与非测地性亏损 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\pi$</span> 两个非负项；推论 16.5.6 给出代价差被弯曲与速度场偏差联合控制的可检验下界。</li>\n<li>例 16.5.7 的旋转耦合表明两项可以独立：逐样本直线（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Curv}^\\pi\\equiv0$</span>）仍可因速度场非最优而产生全部代价差归于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^\\pi$</span>；命题 16.5.8 则给出充要判据——耦合最优当且仅当零弯曲与零亏损同时成立，且在绝对连续边缘下等价于 Brenier 凸梯度图。</li>\n<li>命题 16.5.9 将弯曲残差与 Euler 离散误差挂钩：局部截断误差含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\,\\mathrm{Curv}^{\\pi,1/2}$</span> 项，故压低弯曲直接减少达到给定精度所需步数；当耦合最优时弯曲为零，常速测地线一步精确积分，这为第 7 节“采样步数”与第 10 节 Reflow 的迭代重耦合提供了完整的定量依据。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"fl16--h-拉直的意义\">拉直的意义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-拉直的意义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span> 为源分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim\\mu_1$</span> 为目标分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 为耦合（联合分布）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>；线性插值路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>；速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v=\\arg\\min_{v}\\ \\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2,$$</div>\n其中期望遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 下的条件期望速度\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E_{\\pi}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x],$$</div>\n它是上述回归问题的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_t)$</span>-最优解（前序“回归目标”节已证）。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)$</span>：路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的瞬时曲率测度，定义为加速度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(t):=\\big(\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\|\\dot X_t-\\mathbb E[\\dot X_t\\mid X_t]\\|^2\\big)^{1/2},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=X_1-X_0$</span> 沿插值路径为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\dot X_t\\mid X_t]=v^\\star(X_t,t)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{straight}}$</span>：直线性缺陷泛函\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{straight}}(\\pi):=\\int_0^1\\kappa(t)^2\\,\\mathrm dt.$$</div></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$N(\\varepsilon)$</span>：达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 所需的 Euler 离散步数（在“采样步数”节精确化，本节只作定性下界引用）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>假设（本节全部命题共用，逐条在命题处复核）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 二阶矩有限</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\|X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\|X_1\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。这保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=X_1-X_0\\in L^2(\\pi)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 作为条件期望良定义且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2\\le\\mathbb E\\|\\dot X_t\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 可测性与正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 联合 Borel 可测；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto v^\\star(x,t)$</span> 局部 Lipschitz，以保证 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=v^\\star(x,t)$</span> 的强解存在唯一（Cauchy–Lipschitz）。在本节情境下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 具有密度且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 由卷积光滑化得到，此条成立；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为经验测度，则需在“反例”节讨论失效。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 边界通量消失</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上具有紧支撑或满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\|x\\|\\to\\infty}\\pi_t(x)\\|v^\\star(x,t)\\|=0$</span>（在密度意义下），以保证分部积分时边界项为零。本节凡涉及对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 求导的恒等式均需此条。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把“拉直”从几何直觉提升为一个可计算的泛函恒等式，并证明该泛函恰好控制 Euler 离散的局部截断误差，从而给出“拉直 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 少步采样”的定量链条。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-1-拉直的定义-直线性缺陷泛函\">1. 拉直的定义：直线性缺陷泛函<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-1-拉直的定义-直线性缺陷泛函\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义（拉直）</strong>：称耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 是<strong>拉直的</strong>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)=0$</span>；称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> <strong>整体拉直</strong>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{straight}}(\\pi)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>由定义立即得到与本章 canonical claim 的接口：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 独立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]$</span> 一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 同时携带 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 的信息；只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 的条件分布退化时曲率才为零。反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 几乎必然等于某个确定性函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为点质量耦合），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)=0$</span> 平凡成立。这说明拉直不是“路径是直线”的同义反复，而是“条件期望速度等于实际速度”的统计性质。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（拉直等价于条件速度无偏）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)。<strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)$</span> 定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(t)^2=\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\|\\dot X_t-v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2=\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\big[\\|\\dot X_t\\|^2-\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2\\big],$$</div>\n最后一步用了条件期望的正交分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\dot X_t\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|\\dot X_t-v^\\star\\|^2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t)$</span>-可测）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)=0\\iff\\dot X_t=v^\\star(X_t,t)$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.s.。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把“拉直”与“回归目标的最优解恰为真实速度”等同起来，是本节一切推导的起点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-2-主定理-拉直泛函控制-Euler-局部误差\">2. 主定理：拉直泛函控制 Euler 局部误差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-2-主定理-拉直泛函控制-Euler-局部误差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 1（局部截断误差的曲率上界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)；设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的一阶偏导存在且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\partial_t v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。取步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&gt;0$</span>，Euler 格式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{k+1}=x_k+h\\,v^\\star(x_k,t_k)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=kh$</span>。则单步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_{t_k})$</span> 误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{\\pi_{t_k}}\\|X_{t_k+h}-x_{k+1}\\|^2\\le h^2\\,\\mathbb E_{\\pi_{t_k}}\\|\\partial_t v^\\star(X_{t_k},t_k)\\|^2+o(h^2),$$</div>\n且右端首项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_k,t_k+h]$</span> 上的积分控制：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{\\pi_{t_k}}\\|\\partial_t v^\\star\\|^2\\le \\frac{1}{h}\\int_{t_k}^{t_k+h}\\big(\\kappa(t)^2+\\mathbb E\\|\\partial_t v^\\star\\|^2\\big)\\,\\mathrm dt.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记真实解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_k+h}=X_{t_k}+\\int_{t_k}^{t_k+h}v^\\star(X_s,s)\\,\\mathrm ds$</span>（沿 ODE 流，由 (A2) 强解存在）。Euler 一步为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{k+1}=X_{t_k}+h\\,v^\\star(X_{t_k},t_k)$</span>。相减：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{t_k+h}-x_{k+1}=\\int_{t_k}^{t_k+h}\\big[v^\\star(X_s,s)-v^\\star(X_{t_k},t_k)\\big]\\,\\mathrm ds.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(X_s,s)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_{t_k},t_k)$</span> 处作一阶 Taylor 展开（(A2) 保证可微性）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star(X_s,s)=v^\\star(X_{t_k},t_k)+\\partial_x v^\\star\\cdot(X_s-X_{t_k})+\\partial_t v^\\star\\cdot(s-t_k)+R,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|R\\|=O(\\|X_s-X_{t_k}\\|^2+|s-t_k|^2)$</span>。代入并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 积分，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_k}^{t_k+h}(s-t_k)\\,\\mathrm ds=h^2/2$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{t_k+h}-x_{k+1}=\\tfrac{h^2}{2}\\partial_t v^\\star(X_{t_k},t_k)+\\int_{t_k}^{t_k+h}\\partial_x v^\\star\\cdot(X_s-X_{t_k})\\,\\mathrm ds+O(h^3).$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_{t_k})$</span> 范数，交叉项由 Cauchy–Schwarz 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^3)$</span> 控制（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x v^\\star$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X_s-X_{t_k}\\|=O(h)$</span>）。主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{h^2}{2}\\partial_t v^\\star$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|X_{t_k+h}-x_{k+1}\\|^2=\\tfrac{h^4}{4}\\mathbb E\\|\\partial_t v^\\star\\|^2+O(h^5).$$</div>\n这里出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^4$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^2$</span>，是因为 Euler 局部误差本身是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 阶、其平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^4$</span>；若按“每步误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le Ch^2$</span>”的标准陈述，应写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_{t_k+h}-x_{k+1}\\|^2\\le C h^4$</span>。为与采样步数节的累计误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 衔接，将单步误差的<strong>均方根</strong>记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>，累计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1/h$</span> 步得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>。定理陈述中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^2$</span> 界应理解为均方根界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\mathbb E\\|X_{t_k+h}-x_{k+1}\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}\\le h\\,\\|\\partial_t v^\\star\\|_{L^2}+o(h)$</span>。</p>\n<p>现证第二式。由 (A3) 与 ODE 的连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\pi_t+\\nabla\\cdot(\\pi_t v^\\star)=0$</span>（前序“轨迹的可积性”节已证），对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 求导得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E_{\\pi}[\\dot X_t\\mid X_t=x]\\text{ 的 }t\\text{-导数}=\\mathbb E[\\dot X_t\\,(\\partial_t\\log\\pi_t(X_t))\\mid X_t=x],$$</div>\n在密度意义下。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 积分并用分部积分（(A3) 保证边界项消失），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{t_k}^{t_k+h}\\mathbb E_{\\pi_t}\\|\\partial_t v^\\star\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt=\\int_{t_k}^{t_k+h}\\kappa(t)^2\\,\\mathrm dt+\\text{交叉项},$$</div>\n交叉项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t-v^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\log\\pi_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 正交性（条件期望投影）为零。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{t_k}^{t_k+h}\\mathbb E\\|\\partial_t v^\\star\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt=\\int_{t_k}^{t_k+h}\\kappa(t)^2\\,\\mathrm dt.$$</div>\n除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 即得第二式（右端多出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\partial_t v^\\star\\|^2$</span> 项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span> 时与左端同阶，故不等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 充分小时成立）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（拉直 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 零局部误差）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：定理 1 全部假设，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{straight}}(\\pi)=0$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，Euler 单步均方根误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(h)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_k+h}=x_{k+1}+o(h)$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.s.。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\equiv0$</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v^\\star=0$</span>（由定理 1 第二式，非负被积函数积分为零），故主项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{h^2}{2}\\partial_t v^\\star$</span> 消失，余项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^3)$</span> 给出均方根 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{3/2})=o(h)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是“拉直的意义”的数学内核：曲率泛函为零时，Euler 离散不产生一阶截断误差，采样步数可任意减少而不损失精度（在 (A2) 的 Lipschitz 常数意义下）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-3-可检验恒等式-曲率与耦合的互信息\">3. 可检验恒等式：曲率与耦合的互信息<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-3-可检验恒等式-曲率与耦合的互信息\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（曲率的协方差表示）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(t)^2=\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Cov}_{\\pi}\\big(\\dot X_t\\mid X_t\\big)=\\mathbb E\\|\\dot X_t\\|^2-\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1 的正交分解直接得到；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(\\dot X_t\\mid X_t)$</span> 是条件协方差矩阵，其迹等于条件方差之和，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\dot X_t-v^\\star\\|^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式可检验：给定有限样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(x_0^{(i)},x_1^{(i)})\\}_{i=1}^n$</span>，用核回归估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\kappa(t)^2=\\frac1n\\sum_i\\|\\dot x^{(i)}-\\hat v^\\star(x_t^{(i)},t)\\|^2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)^2$</span> 的相合估计（核带宽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span>）。代码节将实现此估计。</p>\n<p><strong>具体例子（一维高斯耦合）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0+\\sigma Z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 独立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1=X_0+t\\sigma Z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=\\sigma Z$</span>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 的条件分布由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,Z)$</span> 在约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0+t\\sigma Z=x$</span> 下的高斯条件给出：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\dot X_t\\mid X_t=x]=\\sigma\\,\\mathbb E[Z\\mid X_0+t\\sigma Z=x]=\\frac{t\\sigma^2}{1+t^2\\sigma^2}\\,x.$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=\\frac{t\\sigma^2}{1+t^2\\sigma^2}x$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=\\sigma Z$</span>。条件方差\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(t)^2=\\mathbb E\\big[\\sigma^2 Z^2\\big]-\\mathbb E\\Big[\\Big(\\frac{t\\sigma^2}{1+t^2\\sigma^2}X_t\\Big)^2\\Big]=\\sigma^2-\\frac{t^2\\sigma^4}{1+t^2\\sigma^2}=\\frac{\\sigma^2}{1+t^2\\sigma^2}.$$</div>\n验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(0)^2=\\sigma^2$</span>（源端完全不知道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 的去向）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(1)^2=\\sigma^2/(1+\\sigma^2)$</span>（目标端仍残留噪声）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\to0$</span>（恒等耦合，拉直）。此例同时说明：<strong>独立耦合不拉直</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa&gt;0$</span>），与本章 canonical claim “若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 独立，轨迹弯曲”一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-4-拉直与-OT-路径的关系\">4. 拉直与 OT 路径的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-4-拉直与-OT-路径的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序“与 OT 路径的关系”节已证：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 的最优传输计划（Brenier 意义下），则插值路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 构成测地线，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 为 OT 速度场。本节补充一个定量关系。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（OT 耦合的曲率下界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 具有密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为二次代价最优传输计划。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{straight}}(\\pi)\\ge \\mathrm{Var}_{\\pi}(\\dot X_t)-\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star_{\\mathrm{OT}}\\|^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star_{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span> 为 OT 速度场。等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 条件独立退化。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)^2=\\mathbb E\\|\\dot X_t\\|^2-\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star\\|^2$</span>。OT 耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=v^\\star_{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span>-a.s. 唯一的梯度场（Brenier 定理），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star_{\\mathrm{OT}}\\|^2$</span> 为常数。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分即得。等号条件由命题 1 给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义：OT 耦合<strong>不保证</strong>拉直。即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 最优，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 非退化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)&gt;0$</span> 一般成立（如上述高斯例中 OT 耦合即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=0$</span> 的恒等耦合才拉直，而独立耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 非 OT）。这纠正了一个常见误解：拉直不是 OT 的自动推论，而是需要 Reflow 显式构造的性质（后续“Reflow”节展开）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-5-拉直-Rightarrow-少步采样的定量链条\">5. 拉直 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 少步采样的定量链条<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-5-拉直-Rightarrow-少步采样的定量链条\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合定理 1 与推论 1，得到本节的核心推导链：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{straight}}(\\pi)\\downarrow\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\sup_t\\kappa(t)\\downarrow\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\sup_t\\|\\partial_t v^\\star\\|_{L^2}\\downarrow\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\text{Euler 局部误差}\\downarrow\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ N(\\varepsilon)\\downarrow.$$</div>\n<p>具体地，设全局截断误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步累计为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\kappa_{\\max}/N)$</span>（标准 Euler 收敛率，见“采样步数”节），则达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 所需步数\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N(\\varepsilon)=O\\!\\left(\\frac{\\sup_t\\kappa(t)}{\\varepsilon}\\right).$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{straight}}\\to0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(\\varepsilon)$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\varepsilon$</span> 的速率下降，而非拉直情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(\\varepsilon)$</span> 可能以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\varepsilon^{1/2}$</span> 或更慢速率增长（曲率有界时）。这就是“拉直 = 减少弯曲 = 减少采样步数”的严格含义：它不是经验观察，而是由定理 1 的局部误差上界与 Euler 收敛率复合得到的推论。</p>\n<p><strong>边界情形说明</strong>：若 (A2) 失效（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 不 Lipschitz），则定理 1 的 Taylor 展开不合法，上述链条断裂；此时拉直仍可定义（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影），但“少步采样”的保证需改用随机 Euler 或指数积分器分析。完整反例见本章反例节。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>拉直被定义为曲率泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{straight}}(\\pi)=\\int_0^1\\kappa(t)^2\\,\\mathrm dt$</span> 为零，等价于条件期望速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 沿插值路径无偏（命题 1）；它与“路径几何上是直线”不同，是耦合的统计性质。</li>\n<li>主定理 1 证明 Euler 局部截断误差的主项正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v^\\star$</span>，而后者被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的积分控制；推论 1 给出拉直 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 零一阶误差，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(\\varepsilon)=O(\\sup_t\\kappa(t)/\\varepsilon)$</span>，这是“拉直减少采样步数”的严格数学链条。</li>\n<li>OT 耦合不自动拉直（命题 3），独立耦合一般不拉直（高斯例 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)^2=\\sigma^2/(1+t^2\\sigma^2)&gt;0$</span>）；拉直需通过 Reflow 显式构造，其与少步生成的接口在后续节展开。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-7-拉直的稳定性-曲率在耦合扰动下的-Lipschitz-界\">7. 拉直的稳定性：曲率在耦合扰动下的 Lipschitz 界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-7-拉直的稳定性-曲率在耦合扰动下的-Lipschitz-界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文把拉直定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{straight}}(\\pi)=0$</span> 的精确性质。实际构造中耦合只能被近似实现，因此必须回答：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\pi$</span> 扰动时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 如何变化？若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 不连续，则“近似拉直”没有意义，Reflow 的迭代收敛也无从谈起。本小节给出一个显式的稳定性估计。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（曲率对耦合的 Lipschitz 依赖）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\pi$</span> 均成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\|X_0\\|^2,\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\|X_1\\|^2,\\mathbb E_{\\tilde\\pi}\\|X_0\\|^2,\\mathbb E_{\\tilde\\pi}\\|X_1\\|^2$</span> 均有限；(A2) 对两个耦合诱导的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star,\\tilde v^\\star$</span> 均成立。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\pi,\\tilde\\pi)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\times\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上以欧氏距离为代价的 2-Wasserstein 距离。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\kappa_\\pi(t)-\\kappa_{\\tilde\\pi}(t)\\big|\\le 2\\,W_2(\\pi,\\tilde\\pi).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\pi$</span> 的最优耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\Pi(\\pi,\\tilde\\pi)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\int\\|(x_0,x_1)-(\\tilde x_0,\\tilde x_1)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm d\\gamma\\big)^{1/2}=W_2(\\pi,\\tilde\\pi)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 下构造配对样本，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_0=\\tilde X_0-X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_1=\\tilde X_1-X_1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_\\gamma\\|\\Delta_0\\|^2+\\mathbb E_\\gamma\\|\\Delta_1\\|^2=W_2^2$</span>（逐分量求和）。两耦合的插值路径与速度分别为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1,\\quad \\dot X_t=X_1-X_0;\\qquad \\tilde X_t=(1-t)\\tilde X_0+t\\tilde X_1,\\quad \\dot{\\tilde X}_t=\\tilde X_1-\\tilde X_0.$$</div>\n于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X_t-X_t=(1-t)\\Delta_0+t\\Delta_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\tilde X}_t-\\dot X_t=\\Delta_1-\\Delta_0$</span>。由三角不等式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\dot{\\tilde X}_t-\\dot X_t\\|\\le\\|\\Delta_0\\|+\\|\\Delta_1\\|.$$</div>\n另一方面，条件期望算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t:f\\mapsto\\mathbb E[f\\mid X_t]$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 上的正交投影，其算子范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde v^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 分别在各自测度下取条件期望，需先将二者嵌入同一概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\gamma)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tilde v^\\star(\\tilde X_t,t)-v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|\\le\\mathbb E_\\gamma\\big[\\|\\dot{\\tilde X}_t-\\dot X_t\\|\\,\\big|\\,\\sigma(X_t,\\tilde X_t)\\big]\\le\\mathbb E_\\gamma\\big[\\|\\Delta_0\\|+\\|\\Delta_1\\|\\,\\big|\\,\\sigma(X_t,\\tilde X_t)\\big].$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\gamma)$</span> 范数并用 Jensen 不等式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\tilde v^\\star(\\tilde X_t,t)-v^\\star(X_t,t)\\big\\|_{L^2(\\gamma)}\\le\\big\\|\\|\\Delta_0\\|+\\|\\Delta_1\\|\\big\\|_{L^2(\\gamma)}\\le\\sqrt2\\,W_2(\\pi,\\tilde\\pi).$$</div>\n现估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 之差。由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\pi(t)=\\|\\dot X_t-v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|_{L^2(\\pi)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_{\\tilde\\pi}(t)=\\|\\dot{\\tilde X}_t-\\tilde v^\\star(\\tilde X_t,t)\\|_{L^2(\\tilde\\pi)}$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 下二者均为同一空间中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\kappa_\\pi(t)-\\kappa_{\\tilde\\pi}(t)\\big|\\le\\big\\|(\\dot{\\tilde X}_t-\\dot X_t)-(\\tilde v^\\star(\\tilde X_t,t)-v^\\star(X_t,t))\\big\\|_{L^2(\\gamma)}\\le\\|\\dot{\\tilde X}_t-\\dot X_t\\|_{L^2(\\gamma)}+\\|\\tilde v^\\star-v^\\star\\|_{L^2(\\gamma)}.$$</div>\n第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\sqrt2\\,W_2$</span>，第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\sqrt2\\,W_2$</span>，合计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 2\\sqrt2\\,W_2$</span>。将常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\sqrt2$</span> 收紧为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 需要更细的逐项配对估计：注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\tilde X}_t-\\dot X_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde v^\\star-v^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 下同向（二者都是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的线性组合且条件期望不增加范数），由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影的单调性可得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\dot{\\tilde X}_t-\\tilde v^\\star\\|_{L^2(\\gamma)}\\le\\|\\dot X_t-v^\\star\\|_{L^2(\\pi)}+W_2$</span> 型的单向界；对称地交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi,\\tilde\\pi$</span> 得反向界，合并即得系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的用途：它把“拉直”从一个精确等式放宽为一个<strong>关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 连续的量</strong>。因此若 Reflow 迭代产生耦合序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\pi^{(k)},\\pi^{(k+1)})\\to0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^{(k)}(t)$</span> 一致收敛，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{straight}}(\\pi^{(k)})\\to0$</span> 是可证的而非猜想的。这正是后续“Reflow”节收敛性分析的入口；本节只负责提供该分析所需的稳定性引理。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（近似拉直的误差预算）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：命题 4 全部假设，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{straight}}(\\tilde\\pi)\\le\\delta^2$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_t\\kappa_\\pi(t)\\le\\delta+2\\,W_2(\\pi,\\tilde\\pi).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{straight}}(\\tilde\\pi)=\\int_0^1\\kappa_{\\tilde\\pi}(t)^2\\,\\mathrm dt\\le\\delta^2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_{\\tilde\\pi}(t)\\le\\delta$</span> 对几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（非负被积函数）。代入命题 4 逐点估计即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出工程上可操作的误差预算：若希望采样步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(\\varepsilon)=O(\\sup_t\\kappa_\\pi/\\varepsilon)$</span> 达到目标，则需同时控制耦合近似误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 与残余曲率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>，二者以加法方式进入步数上界。这解释了为什么 Reflow 的每一轮迭代都必须同时（i）用当前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 生成新配对以缩小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span>，（ii）重新回归以缩小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>；缺一不可。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-8-拉直与插值路径几何的区分-一个恒等式\">8. 拉直与插值路径几何的区分：一个恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-8-拉直与插值路径几何的区分-一个恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节反复强调“拉直”是统计性质而非几何性质。为使这一区分可检验，本小节给出一个把二者联系起来的恒等式，并说明它们一般不等价。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（几何直线性）</strong>：称耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的插值路径<strong>几何拉直</strong>，若存在确定性仿射映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=A X_0+b$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.s.。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+t(AX_0+b)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的仿射函数，路径在样本意义下为直线段。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（几何拉直 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 统计拉直，反之不然）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 几何拉直，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。反之，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\equiv0$</span> 但非几何拉直的耦合。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：前半。几何拉直下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=X_1-X_0=(A-I)X_0+b$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(I+t(A-I))X_0+tb$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I+t(A-I)$</span> 可逆（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 除有限个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 外成立；在退化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处由连续性延拓），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的确定性仿射函数，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 也是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的确定性仿射函数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=\\mathbb E[\\dot X_t\\mid X_t]$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.s.，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>后半。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}\\{0,1\\}$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0$</span>（恒等耦合）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\equiv0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0$</span> 本身即几何拉直（<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=I,b=0$</span>），故此例不构成反例。改取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=1-X_0$</span>（反射耦合）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=1-2X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+t(1-X_0)=(1-2t)X_0+t$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ne1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=(X_t-t)/(1-2t)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的确定性函数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=1-2X_0$</span> 也是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的确定性函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)=0$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=1-X_0$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的仿射映射（它是仿射的！<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=-1,b=1$</span>），故此例仍几何拉直。再改：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}\\{0,1,2\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=\\phi(X_0)$</span> 其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(0)=0,\\phi(1)=2,\\phi(2)=1$</span>（一个非线性置换）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+t\\phi(X_0)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto(1-t)x+t\\phi(x)$</span> 在三点上取值互异（可直接验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 时取值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0,1.5,1.5$</span>——退化！），故需选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 使三点像互异，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/3$</span>：像为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0,4/3,5/3$</span>，互异，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 唯一确定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=\\phi(X_0)-X_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的确定性函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(1/3)=0$</span>。对几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>（除使像碰撞的有限个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>），同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)=0$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=\\phi(X_0)$</span> 非线性，非几何拉直。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题澄清了本节的核心区分：几何拉直是<strong>样本路径</strong>的性质（每条轨迹是直线段），统计拉直是<strong>条件期望</strong>的性质（平均速度沿边际无偏）。后者严格更弱，因而 Reflow 能达到的“拉直”不必以牺牲耦合的灵活性为代价——它只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 与真实速度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下一致，而不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的仿射函数。这一区分对后续“与 Flow Maps 的接口”节至关重要：Flow Maps 追求的是几何拉直（单步精确映射），而 Rectified Flow 的拉直是统计意义下的，二者不等价。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-9-拉直泛函的下界-不可约曲率\">9. 拉直泛函的下界：不可约曲率<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-9-拉直泛函的下界-不可约曲率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一个自然的问题是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{straight}}$</span> 能否被压到任意小？本小节证明存在一个由边际分布决定的下界，它不依赖于耦合的选择。这刻画了“拉直”的极限。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（不可约曲率下界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 具有密度，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0\\ne\\mu_1$</span>。则对任意耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{straight}}(\\pi)\\ge \\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{irr}}(\\mu_0,\\mu_1):=\\inf_{\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)}\\int_0^1\\kappa_\\pi(t)^2\\,\\mathrm dt,$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{irr}}&gt;0$</span> 当且仅当不存在使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 的仿射像的耦合。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：下界由定义平凡。正性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{irr}}=0$</span>，则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\pi\\equiv0$</span>，由命题 5 的论证，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的确定性函数对几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_0=X_1-X_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的确定性函数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0+g(X_0)$</span> 对某 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_1=X_1-X_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 的确定性函数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=X_1-h(X_1)$</span>。合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0+g(X_0)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=X_1-h(X_1)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 互为确定性函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为图耦合。进一步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\equiv0$</span> 要求对<strong>所有</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的确定性函数；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 沿路径为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span>，这迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的函数对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t'$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t-X_{t'}=(t-t')(X_1-X_0)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t'}$</span> 互为确定性函数，路径族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{X_t\\}$</span> 是单参数确定性变换群。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 的线性性，该变换群必为仿射：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=a(t)X_0+b(t)$</span>，比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0,1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=AX_0+b$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 的仿射像。反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 的仿射像，取对应的仿射耦合即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{straight}}=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的实践含义：对一般的目标分布（如图像、文本），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 的仿射像，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{irr}}&gt;0$</span>，<strong>拉直不可能精确达到零</strong>。Reflow 的目标只能是使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{straight}}(\\pi^{(k)})$</span> 单调下降并收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{irr}}$</span>，而非收敛到零。这纠正了“Reflow 最终给出完全直线轨迹”的过度承诺；后续“Reflow”节将证明单调下降性，本节只确立下界的存在性。同时，此命题给出一个可检验的判据：若某数据集上 Reflow 迭代后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{straight}}$</span> 停在显著大于零的值，应首先检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 是否近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 的仿射像，而非归咎于优化不足。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-10-从拉直到采样步数的显式常数\">10. 从拉直到采样步数的显式常数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-10-从拉直到采样步数的显式常数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后补足第 5 小节定性链条中的常数，使其成为可代入数值的公式。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L:=\\sup_t\\mathrm{Lip}(v^\\star(\\cdot,t))$</span> 为速度场关于空间的 Lipschitz 常数（(A2) 保证有限）。标准 Euler 全局误差分析给出：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的导数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M:=\\sup_t\\|\\partial_t v^\\star\\|_{L^2(\\pi_t)}$</span> 控制，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步 Euler 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 全局误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\text{err}(N)\\le\\frac{e^{L}-1}{L}\\cdot\\frac{M}{N}.$$</div>\n由定理 1 第二式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M^2\\le\\sup_t\\kappa(t)^2+\\sup_t\\mathbb E\\|\\partial_t v^\\star\\|^2$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span> 极限下二者同阶，故可写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\lesssim\\sup_t\\kappa(t)$</span>。代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N(\\varepsilon)\\le\\frac{e^{L}-1}{L}\\cdot\\frac{\\sup_t\\kappa(t)}{\\varepsilon}.$$</div>\n此式即第 5 小节定性链条的定量版本：步数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\kappa$</span> 成正比、与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 成反比，比例常数由速度场的 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 决定。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^L$</span> 因子：即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 很小，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 很大（速度场陡峭），步数仍可能不小；这解释了为什么拉直必须与速度场的正则性联合优化，而不能只看曲率。后续“采样步数”节将在此基础上讨论自适应步长与高阶积分器如何改进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^L$</span> 因子。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fl16--h-采样步数\">采样步数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-采样步数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim\\mu_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi$</span> 为给定耦合；线性插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>；速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)$</span> 满足本章 canonical 回归目标</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v=\\arg\\min_{u}\\ \\mathbb E\\,\\|u(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2 ,$$</div>\n<p>其中期望对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]$</span> 联合取。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t^{v}$</span> 为 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v(X_t,t)$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 出发的流映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{v}:=(\\phi_t^{v})_\\#\\mu_0$</span>。本节只使用这些对象，不重新定义它们。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>离散采样格式</strong>：给定步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/N$</span>，节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=kh$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,\\dots,N$</span>。显式 Euler 格式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat X_{k+1}=\\hat X_k+h\\,v(\\hat X_k,t_k),\\qquad \\hat X_0\\sim\\mu_0,$$</div>\n记其终端分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_N:=(\\hat X_N)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>单步局部截断误差</strong>：对精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X(t)$</span> 与 Euler 一步，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau(t,h;x):=\\frac{1}{h}\\big\\|\\phi_{t+h}^{v}(x)-\\big(x+h\\,v(x,t)\\big)\\big\\| .$$</div></li>\n<li><strong>轨迹曲率泛函</strong>：对速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in C^1(\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1];\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(v):=\\sup_{x,t}\\ \\big\\|(\\partial_t v+(\\nabla_x v)\\,v)(x,t)\\big\\| ,$$</div>\n即沿流线的物质导数之上确界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> Jacobian，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\nabla_x v)v$</span> 为矩阵—向量积）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 为直线场（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)\\equiv v(x)$</span> 且沿流线常值）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)=0$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的正则性假设统一列于此，后续命题逐条引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(H1)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in C^1(\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1];\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v&lt;\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x,t}\\|\\nabla_x v(x,t)\\|\\le L_v$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x,t}\\|\\partial_t v(x,t)\\|\\le M_v$</span>。由此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，ODE 解存在唯一且流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t^v$</span> 全局定义。</p>\n<p><strong>(H2)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，回归目标有限。</p>\n<p><strong>(H3)</strong> 当需要比较分布时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 具有有限二阶矩，且所用 Wasserstein 距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 在该矩条件下良定义。</p>\n<p>在 (H1) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t^v$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{L_v t}$</span>-Lipschitz 的（Grönwall），这一事实将在误差传播中反复使用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-离散格式的全局误差界\">离散格式的全局误差界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-离散格式的全局误差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7.1（Euler 全局误差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)&lt;\\infty$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，Euler 格式的终端误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\hat X_N(x)-\\phi_1^{v}(x)\\big\\|\\ \\le\\ \\frac{h}{2}\\,\\kappa(v)\\,\\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_N(x)$</span> 表示以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_0=x$</span> 启动的 Euler 迭代。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X(t)=\\phi_t^v(x)$</span>。由 ODE 与 Taylor 展开（在 (H1) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 沿解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>，故可微），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X(t+h)=X(t)+h\\,v(X(t),t)+\\frac{h^2}{2}\\big(\\partial_t v+(\\nabla_x v)v\\big)(X(t),t)+o(h^2),$$</div>\n<p>其中余项由 (H1) 的二阶可微性缺失不能直接写出，但我们只用中值形式：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in[0,h]$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X(t+h)-X(t)-h\\,v(X(t),t)=\\frac{h^2}{2}\\,\\frac{d}{dt}\\big[v(X(t),t)\\big]\\Big|_{t+\\theta}.$$</div>\n<p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}v(X(t),t)=\\partial_t v+(\\nabla_x v)v$</span>，其范数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span> 控制，故单步局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le \\frac{h^2}{2}\\kappa(v)$</span>。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_k:=\\hat X_k-X(t_k)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_{k+1}=e_k+h\\big[v(\\hat X_k,t_k)-v(X(t_k),t_k)\\big]+\\delta_k,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta_k\\|\\le \\frac{h^2}{2}\\kappa(v)$</span>。取范数并用 Lipschitz 性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|e_{k+1}\\|\\le (1+hL_v)\\|e_k\\|+\\frac{h^2}{2}\\kappa(v).$$</div>\n<p>由离散 Grönwall（归纳：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_k\\|\\le \\sum_{j=0}^{k-1}(1+hL_v)^{k-1-j}\\frac{h^2}{2}\\kappa(v)$</span>），并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+hL_v)^{N}\\le e^{L_v}$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|e_N\\|\\le \\frac{h^2}{2}\\kappa(v)\\sum_{j=0}^{N-1}(1+hL_v)^{j}\\le \\frac{h}{2}\\kappa(v)\\,\\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v}. \\qquad\\blacksquare$$</div>\n<p>此命题说明：<strong>终端误差关于步长是一阶的，其常数正比于曲率泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span></strong>。这正是“拉直减少步数”的定量入口：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span> 越小，同样误差容限下所需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 越小。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-分布层面的采样误差\">分布层面的采样误差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-分布层面的采样误差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 采样误差界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 同分布（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_0=\\mu_0$</span>）。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\hat\\mu_N,\\mu_1^{v})\\ \\le\\ \\frac{h}{2}\\,\\kappa(v)\\,\\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1^{v}=(\\phi_1^v)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与自身的恒等耦合作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的可行耦合（对角耦合），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\hat\\mu_N,\\mu_1^v)^2\\ \\le\\ \\mathbb E\\big\\|\\hat X_N(X_0)-\\phi_1^v(X_0)\\big\\|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>由命题 16.7.1 逐点界，右边 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le \\big(\\frac{h}{2}\\kappa(v)\\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v}\\big)^2$</span>，开方即得。这里用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的定义下确界不超过任一可行耦合的代价，属定义直接推论，无需额外测度论工具。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\blacksquare$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.7.3（步数—曲率—精度三角关系）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 16.7.2，并给定误差容限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：若</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N\\ \\ge\\ \\frac{\\kappa(v)}{2\\varepsilon}\\,\\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v},$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\hat\\mu_N,\\mu_1^v)\\le\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/N$</span> 代入命题 16.7.2 的界，令其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\varepsilon$</span> 解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\blacksquare$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是本节的核心可检验恒等式：<strong>所需步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span> 成正比</strong>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)=0$</span>（直线场）时，Euler 格式对线性 ODE 精确，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 即达零误差（在 (H1) 下线性场满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v+(\\nabla_x v)v=0$</span> 沿流线，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=0$</span>，且 Euler 一步精确复现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1^v$</span>）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-具体例子-线性插值场的曲率与步数\">具体例子：线性插值场的曲率与步数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-具体例子-线性插值场的曲率与步数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 16.7.4</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H2) 成立，且耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 使条件速度场可积。取本章 canonical 的线性插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> <strong>独立</strong>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\mu_0\\otimes\\mu_1$</span>），则条件期望速度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$$</div>\n<p>一般<strong>不</strong>为零曲率；但若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 条件常值（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0+c$</span> 确定性平移，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 固定），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)\\equiv c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)=0$</span>，Euler 一步精确。<strong>验证</strong>：此时 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=c$</span> 的解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0+tc$</span>，与线性插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+t(X_0+c)=X_0+tc$</span> 逐点相等；Euler 一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_1=X_0+c$</span> 与精确终端一致，误差为零，与推论 16.7.3 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 的结论吻合。</p>\n<p>反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 不独立，条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)$</span> 一般依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v\\neq 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)&gt;0$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 必须随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 增大。完整反例构造见本章反例节（第 9 节），本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-采样步数的操作性定义\">采样步数的操作性定义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-采样步数的操作性定义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 16.7.2 与推论 16.7.3，本节将“采样步数”定义为满足给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的最小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N_{\\mathrm{sample}}(\\varepsilon;v):=\\min\\Big\\{N\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}:\\ W_2(\\hat\\mu_N,\\mu_1^v)\\le\\varepsilon\\Big\\}.$$</div>\n<p>由推论 16.7.3，其一个可计算上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lceil \\kappa(v)(e^{L_v}-1)/(2\\varepsilon L_v)\\rceil$</span>。该上界只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的曲率与 Lipschitz 常数，不依赖具体数据分布，因而可在训练后离线估计：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在样本点上数值估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v$</span>，代入即得步数预算。这正是“拉直”在工程上的可操作含义——<strong>拉直降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span>，从而降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathrm{sample}}$</span></strong>，而非仅仅改善轨迹美观。</p>\n<p>数值验证如下（可运行）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nd = 4\nN = 200\n\n# 构造一个曲率非零的速度场：v(x,t) = A x + b t，A 为小范数矩阵\nA = 0.3 * torch.randn(d, d)\nb = 0.5 * torch.randn(d)\n\ndef v(x, t):\n    return x @ A.T + b * t\n\ndef kappa_estimate(A, b, n_grid=50):\n    # sup over grid of ||partial_t v + (grad_x v) v||\n    # partial_t v = b ; grad_x v = A ; (grad_x v) v = A @ v(x,t)\n    worst = 0.0\n    for i in range(n_grid):\n        for j in range(n_grid):\n            t = i / (n_grid - 1)\n            x = torch.randn(d)\n            vt = v(x, t)\n            mat_deriv = b + A @ vt\n            worst = max(worst, mat_deriv.norm().item())\n    return worst\n\nkap = kappa_estimate(A, b)\nLv = torch.linalg.matrix_norm(A, ord=2).item()\nprint(&quot;kappa estimate:&quot;, kap, &quot;L_v:&quot;, Lv)\nassert kap &gt; 0 and Lv &gt; 0\n\n# Euler 采样与精确流（此处精确流用细步长 RK4 近似）\ndef euler_terminal(x0, N):\n    x = x0.clone()\n    h = 1.0 / N\n    for k in range(N):\n        x = x + h * v(x, k * h)\n    return x\n\ndef rk4_terminal(x0, N):\n    x = x0.clone()\n    h = 1.0 / N\n    for k in range(N):\n        t = k * h\n        k1 = v(x, t)\n        k2 = v(x + 0.5 * h * k1, t + 0.5 * h)\n        k3 = v(x + 0.5 * h * k2, t + 0.5 * h)\n        k4 = v(x + h * k3, t + h)\n        x = x + h / 6.0 * (k1 + 2 * k2 + 2 * k3 + k4)\n    return x\n\nx0 = torch.randn(d)\nerr_euler = (euler_terminal(x0, N) - rk4_terminal(x0, 4000)).norm().item()\nprint(&quot;euler terminal error at N=200:&quot;, err_euler)\nassert err_euler &lt; 0.05  # 一阶收敛，N=200 时误差应较小\n\n# 步数上界：eps=0.01\neps = 0.01\nN_bound = int(torch.ceil(torch.tensor(kap * (torch.exp(torch.tensor(Lv)) - 1) / (2 * eps * Lv))).item())\nprint(&quot;N bound for eps=0.01:&quot;, N_bound)\nassert N_bound &gt; 0\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>kappa estimate</code> 为正数，<code>euler terminal error</code> 小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05$</span>，<code>N bound</code> 为正整数。该代码验证了命题 16.7.1 的一阶收敛与推论 16.7.3 的上界公式可计算。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 (H1)–(H3) 下，Euler 采样的终端误差逐点被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{h}{2}\\kappa(v)\\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v}$</span> 控制（命题 16.7.1），分布层面被同一常数控制（命题 16.7.2），从而所需步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 与曲率泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span> 成正比（推论 16.7.3）。</li>\n<li>直线场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)=0$</span> 时 Euler 一步精确，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathrm{sample}}=1$</span>；曲率非零时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathrm{sample}}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span> 线性增长，这给出了“拉直减少采样步数”的严格定量表述。</li>\n<li>采样步数被定义为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的最小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，其可计算上界仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v$</span>，可在训练后离线估计，不依赖数据分布的具体形式。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>上界（推论 16.7.3）说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span> 大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 必须大；但“拉直”能否把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 压到任意小，取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span> 是否可以被任意压低。本节给出一个下界，说明在给定端点分布与耦合下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathrm{sample}}$</span> 存在不可约的下限，且该下限由轨迹的几何弯曲程度决定，不能仅靠改进数值格式消除。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7.5（曲率—步数下界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 具有有限二阶矩且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0\\neq\\mu_1$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 为任一满足本章回归目标的速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t^v$</span> 为其流映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^v=(\\phi_t^v)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>。若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_*\\in(0,1)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{t_*}^v$</span> 与线性插值分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{t_*}^{\\mathrm{lin}}:=((1-t_*)X_0+t_*X_1)_\\#\\pi$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 距离为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\hat\\mu_N,\\mu_1^v)\\ \\ge\\ \\delta - \\frac{1}{2N}\\kappa(v)\\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由三角不等式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\mu_{t_*}^v,\\mu_{t_*}^{\\mathrm{lin}})\\ \\le\\ W_2(\\mu_{t_*}^v,\\hat\\mu_{\\lfloor t_*N\\rfloor})+W_2(\\hat\\mu_{\\lfloor t_*N\\rfloor},\\mu_{t_*}^{\\mathrm{lin}}).$$</div>\n<p>第一项由命题 16.7.2 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_*$</span> 的版本控制（把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,t_*]$</span> 上的 Euler 误差界按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_*$</span> 缩放，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le \\frac{t_*}{2N}\\kappa(v)\\frac{e^{L_v t_*}-1}{L_v}\\le \\frac{1}{2N}\\kappa(v)\\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v}$</span>）。第二项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_{\\lfloor t_*N\\rfloor}$</span> 是 Euler 迭代在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_*$</span> 处的分布，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{t_*}^{\\mathrm{lin}}$</span> 是线性插值分布；两者之差正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 与线性插值场之间的偏差，由假设为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge\\delta$</span> 减去第一项。整理得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\hat\\mu_{\\lfloor t_*N\\rfloor},\\mu_{t_*}^{\\mathrm{lin}})\\ \\ge\\ \\delta - \\frac{1}{2N}\\kappa(v)\\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v}.$$</div>\n<p>再用一次三角不等式把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_{\\lfloor t_*N\\rfloor}$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_N$</span>（Euler 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_*$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的误差同样被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2N}\\kappa(v)\\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v}$</span> 控制），即得所述下界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\blacksquare$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的含义是：<strong>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的轨迹在中间时刻偏离线性插值达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>，则任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 都无法把终端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 误差压到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 以下减去一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 项</strong>。换言之，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 是曲率的几何表现，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 只能消除数值离散误差，不能消除轨迹本身的弯曲。这与上界互补：上界说 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 大则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 大，下界说 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 大则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 再大也压不到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 以下。二者共同刻画了“拉直”的必要性——要真正减少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，必须改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\to 0$</span>，即让轨迹逼近直线，这正是 Reflow 的动机（见本章第 10 节，本节不展开）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-直线场的最优性-N-1-的充要条件\">直线场的最优性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 的充要条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-直线场的最优性-N-1-的充要条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 16.7.3 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)=0$</span> 时给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)=0$</span> 只是充分条件。本节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 精确的充要条件，以厘清“直线”与“一步可采样”的关系。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7.6（一步精确的充要条件）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 任意。<strong>结论</strong>：Euler 格式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 精确（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_1(x)=\\phi_1^v(x)$</span>）当且仅当对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v(x,0)\\ =\\ \\int_0^1 v\\big(\\phi_s^v(x),s\\big)\\,ds .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：Euler 一步给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_1=x+v(x,0)$</span>。精确解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1^v(x)=x+\\int_0^1 v(\\phi_s^v(x),s)\\,ds$</span>。两者相等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,0)=\\int_0^1 v(\\phi_s^v(x),s)\\,ds$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\blacksquare$</span></p>\n<p>此条件比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)=0$</span> 弱：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)=0$</span> 意味着沿流线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 常值，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,0)=v(\\phi_s^v(x),s)$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 成立，积分等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,0)$</span>，条件自动满足；但反过来，条件只要求在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 支撑上积分平均等于初值，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 沿流线有涨落但均值为初值。因此<strong>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)&gt;0$</span> 却仍可 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 精确采样的场</strong>，这提醒我们 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span> 是上界的常数，不是精确的步数判据。</p>\n<p><strong>例 16.7.7</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\delta_0$</span>（单点）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=1+\\sin(2\\pi t)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)=\\sup_t|\\partial_t v+(\\nabla_x v)v|=\\sup_t|2\\pi\\cos(2\\pi t)|=2\\pi&gt;0$</span>。但沿流线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(t)=t-\\frac{1}{2\\pi}\\cos(2\\pi t)+\\frac{1}{2\\pi}$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 v(x(s),s)\\,ds=1=v(x(0),0)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 精确。<strong>验证</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_1=0+v(0,0)=1$</span>；精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1^v(0)=1$</span>。两者相等。此例说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa&gt;0$</span> 不蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N&gt;1$</span>，命题 16.7.6 的条件才是精确判据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-步数与曲率的联合优化-一个变分表述\">步数与曲率的联合优化：一个变分表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-步数与曲率的联合优化-一个变分表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>工程上“拉直”不是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span> 压到零，而是在保持端点分布匹配的约束下最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span>。本节把这一目标写成变分问题，并说明其与回归目标的关系。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.7.8（拉直变分问题）</strong>—给定耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 与端点分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J(v):=\\mathbb E\\,\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2+\\lambda\\,\\kappa(v)^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\ge 0$</span> 为拉直权重，期望对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]$</span> 取。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的第一项即本章回归目标，第二项惩罚曲率。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7.9（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H2) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 使条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^*(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 满足 (H1)。<strong>结论</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\to\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的极小元收敛到满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)=0$</span> 且第一项最小的场；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 条件常值，则该极限场就是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^*$</span> 本身，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v^*)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 是凸的（第一项为平方损失，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的平方，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的线性算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t+(\\nabla_x)v$</span> 的 sup 范数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^2$</span> 凸）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\to\\infty$</span> 时第二项主导，极小元落入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:\\kappa(v)=0\\}$</span> 的闭凸集；在该集上最小化第一项即得所述极限。条件常值情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^*$</span> 沿流线常值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v^*)=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^*$</span> 已使第一项为零，故为极限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\blacksquare$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把“拉直”与“回归”统一为一个变分问题：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 控制二者权衡。实际训练中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 不取无穷，而是在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 下得到近似直线场，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathrm{sample}}$</span> 由推论 16.7.3 给出有限上界。这解释了为何 Reflow 迭代（第 10 节）能逐步降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>：每一轮都在增大有效 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-数值格式的阶数与步数的关系\">数值格式的阶数与步数的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-数值格式的阶数与步数的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 16.7.1 只处理一阶 Euler。若改用高阶格式，误差界变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^p)$</span>，步数上界相应变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/p$</span> 次幂量级。本节给出这一推广，以说明“减少步数”有两条独立途径：降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span>（拉直）或提高格式阶数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7.10（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阶格式的步数界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in C^p$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_p(v):=\\sup\\|\\frac{d^p}{dt^p}v(\\phi_t^v(x),t)\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阶 Runge–Kutta 格式的终端误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat X_N-\\phi_1^v\\|\\ \\le\\ C_p\\,h^p\\,\\kappa_p(v)\\,\\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_p$</span> 为格式的阶常数。从而满足精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的步数上界为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N\\ \\ge\\ \\Big(\\frac{C_p\\,\\kappa_p(v)}{\\varepsilon}\\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v}\\Big)^{1/p}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong>：与命题 16.7.1 同构，只是单步局部误差从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{h^2}{2}\\kappa(v)$</span> 换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_p h^{p+1}\\kappa_p(v)$</span>；离散 Grönwall 求和后得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^p$</span> 全局界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\blacksquare$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：<strong>拉直（降 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>）与升阶（升 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>）对步数的作用是乘性的</strong>——<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\propto\\kappa_p^{1/p}$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 很大时，升阶只能把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^{1/p}$</span>，而拉直能把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 本身压到接近零，效果更根本。这正是本章主旨“拉直减少采样步数”优于单纯换高阶求解器的数学依据。</p>\n<p><strong>例 16.7.11（二阶格式的步数对比）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 16.7.10，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2=1/6$</span>（中点格式），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_2(v)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.01$</span>。一阶 Euler 的步数上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)(e-1)/(2\\varepsilon)\\approx 86$</span>；二阶格式的步数上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\frac{1}{6}\\cdot\\frac{e-1}{0.01}\\big)^{1/2}\\approx 5.3$</span>，取整为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$6$</span>。<strong>验证</strong>：代入命题 16.7.10 的公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge(0.1667\\times 171.8)^{1/2}\\approx 5.35$</span>。此例说明升阶能把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$86$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$6$</span>，但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 本身可被拉直到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.01$</span>，则一阶 Euler 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 上界降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 0.86$</span>，取整为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，优于升阶。两条途径的对比在此数值上清晰可见。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-采样步数与生成质量的权衡-一个可检验恒等式\">采样步数与生成质量的权衡：一个可检验恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-采样步数与生成质量的权衡-一个可检验恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后，本节给出一个把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathrm{sample}}$</span> 与生成分布误差联系起来的恒等式，供工程上直接测量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7.12（步数—误差恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_0=\\mu_0$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\hat\\mu_N,\\mu_1^v)\\ \\le\\ \\frac{\\kappa(v)}{2N}\\cdot\\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v}\\ =\\ \\frac{\\kappa(v)}{2}\\cdot\\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v}\\cdot h .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：即命题 16.7.2 的改写，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/N$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\blacksquare$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式可直接用于工程诊断：给定训练好的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，测量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v$</span>，代入即得任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 上界；反之给定目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>。它不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 的具体形式，只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的微分性质，因而是一个<strong>与数据无关的步数预算公式</strong>。这正是本节标题“采样步数”所要交付的可操作结论：步数不是拍脑袋定的超参数，而是由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v$</span> 通过一个显式恒等式决定的量；拉直降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span>，从而在恒等式意义上直接降低所需步数。</p>\n<p>数值上，该恒等式可用如下代码在训练后验证（接前文代码，不重复已有部分）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\"># 验证命题 16.7.12 的恒等式：对多个 N 检查 W2 上界与实际误差\nimport torch\n\ndef w2_upper_bound(kappa, Lv, N):\n    return kappa / (2 * N) * (torch.exp(torch.tensor(Lv)) - 1) / Lv\n\nfor N_test in [10, 50, 200]:\n    bound = w2_upper_bound(kap, Lv, N_test).item()\n    # 实际误差用单点 Euler 与 RK4 的差近似（分布层面需多样本，这里示意单点）\n    errs = []\n    for _ in range(20):\n        x0 = torch.randn(d)\n        errs.append((euler_terminal(x0, N_test) - rk4_terminal(x0, 4000)).norm().item())\n    actual = max(errs)\n    print(f&quot;N={N_test}: bound={bound:.4f}, max pointwise err={actual:.4f}&quot;)\n    assert actual &lt;= bound + 1e-3  # 单点误差应被上界控制\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：三个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下 <code>max pointwise err</code> 均不超过 <code>bound</code>（加小容差），验证恒等式在单点层面的正确性；分布层面的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 上界由命题 16.7.2 保证，此处用单点最大误差作为其必要条件的数值检查。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-步数预算的紧性-为何上界不能直接当步数用\">步数预算的紧性：为何上界不能直接当步数用<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-步数预算的紧性-为何上界不能直接当步数用\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 16.7.12 给出的是上界，工程上若直接取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=\\lceil \\kappa(v)(e^{L_v}-1)/(2\\varepsilon L_v)\\rceil$</span>，往往远大于实际所需步数。本节说明这一上界在何种情形下是紧的，在何种情形下是松的，并给出一个可检验的紧性判据，以免读者把上界误当精确步数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7.13（上界的紧性条件）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)&lt;\\infty$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_*\\in\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_*\\in[0,1]$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\big(\\partial_t v+(\\nabla_x v)v\\big)(\\phi_{t_*}^v(x_*),t_*)\\big\\|\\ =\\ \\kappa(v),$$</div>\n<p>即曲率泛函在流线上某点取到。<strong>结论</strong>：存在仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_*$</span> 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>，使对充分大的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\hat X_N(x_*)-\\phi_1^v(x_*)\\big\\|\\ \\ge\\ c\\,h\\,\\kappa(v).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 16.7.1 的展开，单步误差的主导项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{h^2}{2}\\frac{d}{dt}v(\\phi_t^v(x_*),t)$</span>。在曲率取到点附近，该导数范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge \\kappa(v)-\\eta$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 为连续性给出的任意小量）。各步误差的主导项沿流线同号累积（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_*$</span> 邻域内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且曲率连续），故总误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge \\frac{h}{2}(\\kappa(v)-\\eta)\\cdot(\\text{有效步数占比})$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=\\kappa(v)/2$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=1/4$</span> 量级的常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\blacksquare$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：当曲率在流线上取到且符号一致时，上界是紧的，此时按上界取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 不多余。反之，若曲率沿流线正负抵消（如例 16.7.7 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sin(2\\pi t)$</span>），则误差累积被抵消，实际上界远松于真实误差。<strong>工程含义</strong>：直接按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 是保守策略，保证精度但可能过采样；要取更紧的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，需测量沿流线的曲率符号一致性，而非仅测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-自适应步数-局部曲率的逐步预算\">自适应步数：局部曲率的逐步预算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-自适应步数-局部曲率的逐步预算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>固定步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/N$</span> 假定曲率在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上均匀。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化剧烈，固定步长在低曲率段浪费、在高曲率段不足。本节给出自适应步数的局部预算，把命题 16.7.1 的单步误差界逐段使用。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.7.14（局部曲率剖面）</strong>—对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 与给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa_{\\mathrm{loc}}(t;x):=\\big\\|\\big(\\partial_t v+(\\nabla_x v)v\\big)(\\phi_t^v(x),t)\\big\\| .$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7.15（自适应步数的误差界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\cdot;x)$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 连续。给定节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\dots&lt;t_N=1$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_k=t_{k+1}-t_k$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：以变步长 Euler 迭代，终端误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\hat X_N(x)-\\phi_1^v(x)\\big\\|\\ \\le\\ \\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\frac{h_k^2}{2}\\,\\kappa_{\\mathrm{loc}}(t_k;x)\\,e^{L_v(1-t_k)} .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：与命题 16.7.1 同构，只是每步局部误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{h_k^2}{2}\\kappa_{\\mathrm{loc}}(t_k;x)$</span>，且后续步的 Lipschitz 放大因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{L_v(1-t_k)}$</span>（从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 到终点的累积）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 求和即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\blacksquare$</span></p>\n<p>由此，给定总误差预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，可逐段分配：令每段贡献相等，解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_k\\propto \\kappa_{\\mathrm{loc}}(t_k;x)^{-1/2}e^{-L_v(1-t_k)/2}$</span>。这给出一个<strong>曲率自适应步长表</strong>，其总步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 \\kappa_{\\mathrm{loc}}(t;x)^{1/2}e^{L_v(1-t)/2}\\,dt$</span> 决定，而非由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\kappa_{\\mathrm{loc}}$</span> 决定。当曲率集中在短时间段时，自适应步数可比固定步长少一个量级。这与拉直互补：拉直压低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_{\\mathrm{loc}}$</span> 的整体水平，自适应则利用其沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的不均匀性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-与少步生成的接口-N_-mathrm-sample-的可达下界\">与少步生成的接口：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathrm{sample}}$</span> 的可达下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-与少步生成的接口-N_-mathrm-sample-的可达下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathrm{sample}}$</span> 的一个不可约下界，说明即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)\\to 0$</span>，步数也不能低于端点分布差异所决定的值。这为后续“与少步生成的接口”节（第 12 节）提供数学接口，本节只陈述与采样步数直接相关的部分。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7.16（步数的分布下界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0\\neq\\mu_1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 满足本章回归目标。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\hat\\mu_N,\\mu_1^v)\\ \\ge\\ W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1^v)\\ -\\ \\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\frac{h^2}{2}\\kappa(v)\\,e^{L_v(1-t_k)}\\cdot(\\text{支撑直径}) .$$</div>\n<p>特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)=0$</span>（直线场），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\hat\\mu_N,\\mu_1^v)=W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1^v)$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 成立，步数下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 已精确）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由三角不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1^v)\\le W_2(\\mu_0,\\hat\\mu_N)+W_2(\\hat\\mu_N,\\mu_1^v)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mu_0,\\hat\\mu_N)$</span> 被 Euler 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 出发的位移误差控制，即命题 16.7.1 的分布版本乘以支撑直径。整理即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=0$</span> 时误差项为零，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_1=\\mu_1^v$</span>，故等号成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\blacksquare$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的含义是：<strong>步数的下界由端点分布本身的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 距离决定，与曲率无关</strong>。曲率只影响达到该下界所需的额外步数；当曲率被拉直到零，步数降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\hat\\mu_1,\\mu_1^v)=0$</span>，下界被精确达到。这解释了为何“拉直”能把少步生成推到极限：它不是绕过端点分布差异，而是让 ODE 一步走完整个传输，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 即达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 下界。若端点分布差异大而曲率非零，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 必须同时覆盖离散误差与传输距离，二者不可互相替代。</p>\n<p>数值上，命题 16.7.16 的下界可用如下代码在训练后检查（接前文，不重复已有定义）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\"># 检查命题 16.7.16：直线场 N=1 精确，非直线场 N=1 有残差\n# 构造直线场：v(x,t) = c 常值\nc = torch.randn(d)\ndef v_linear(x, t):\n    return c.expand_as(x)\n\ndef euler_linear(x0, N):\n    x = x0.clone()\n    h = 1.0 / N\n    for k in range(N):\n        x = x + h * v_linear(x, k * h)\n    return x\n\nx0 = torch.randn(d)\nerr_N1 = (euler_linear(x0, 1) - (x0 + c)).norm().item()\nerr_N10 = (euler_linear(x0, 10) - (x0 + c)).norm().item()\nprint(&quot;linear field N=1 err:&quot;, err_N1, &quot;N=10 err:&quot;, err_N10)\nassert err_N1 &lt; 1e-6 and err_N10 &lt; 1e-6  # 直线场任意 N 精确\n\n# 非直线场 N=1 残差应正比于 kappa\nerr_nonlin_N1 = (euler_terminal(x0, 1) - rk4_terminal(x0, 4000)).norm().item()\nprint(&quot;nonlinear field N=1 err:&quot;, err_nonlin_N1)\nassert err_nonlin_N1 &gt; 1e-3  # 非直线场 N=1 不精确\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：直线场在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=10$</span> 下误差均小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>，验证命题 16.7.16 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=0$</span> 情形；非直线场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 误差为正，说明曲率非零时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 不能达下界。该代码把“拉直 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 少步”的结论落到可运行检查上：直线场一步到位，非直线场必须加步，加步数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(v)$</span> 通过命题 16.7.12 的恒等式给出。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fl16--h-与-CFM-的对照\">与 CFM 的对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-与-CFM-的对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim p_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim p_1$</span> 为两端分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 为给定耦合（联合分布）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}$</span>，线性插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>。记条件速度场（沿插值路径的瞬时速度）为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_t(x):=\\mathbb{E}\\!\\left[X_1-X_0\\,\\middle|\\,X_t=x\\right],$$</div>\n<p>它是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_t)$</span> 意义下对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 的最优回归，即本章第 3 节所建立的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\min$</span> 目标之解。记 RF 速度场为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\mathrm{RF}}_t$</span>（即上述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 在 RF 构造下的具体化），其流记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{\\mathrm{RF}}_t$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号仅一个：CFM 速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\mathrm{CFM}}_t$</span>，定义为在给定条件路径族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{X_t\\mid X_0=x_0,X_1=x_1\\}$</span> 下、以条件期望形式给出的回归解；其精确形式在下面定义 8.1 中给出。为避免与 RF 混淆，本节始终用上标区分二者。</p>\n<p>正则性假设（本节所有命题共用，逐条在命题处复核）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 二阶矩有限</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_0\\|^2+\\mathbb{E}\\|X_1\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，回归问题在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中良定。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 条件期望存在</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的律）为 Radon 测度且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t)$</span> 可分，条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_t)$</span> 元素存在唯一（几乎处处）。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 速度场正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}\\|u_t(X_t)\\|^2\\,dt&lt;\\infty$</span>，保证 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=u_t(X_t)$</span> 的流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 存在唯一（Cauchy–Lipschitz 定理）。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 边界通量消失</strong>：在需要分部积分时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\pi_t$</span> 的边界上通量为零，或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 紧支撑，以保证连续性方程无边界项。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把 CFM 的速度场与 RF 的速度场放在同一测度传输框架下逐项比对，证明二者在“条件路径族为线性插值”时<strong>逐点相等</strong>，并指出一般条件路径族下二者的差异仅来自路径族的选取，而非回归目标的结构。由此澄清一个常见混淆：CFM 与 RF 的差别不在回归目标（二者都是条件速度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 回归），而在<strong>条件路径族的选取</strong>与<strong>耦合的选取</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-8-1-CFM-速度场的定义及其与-RF-的逐点恒等\">8.1 CFM 速度场的定义及其与 RF 的逐点恒等<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-8-1-CFM-速度场的定义及其与-RF-的逐点恒等\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 8.1（CFM 速度场）</strong> 设给定条件路径族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{X_t\\}_{t\\in[0,1]}$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=x_1$</span> 几乎必然，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto X_t$</span> 绝对连续。定义 CFM 速度场为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^{\\mathrm{CFM}}_t(x):=\\mathbb{E}\\!\\left[\\dot X_t\\,\\middle|\\,X_t=x\\right],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 为条件路径的几乎处处时间导数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1（RF 是 CFM 在线性路径族下的特例）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若条件路径族取线性插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^{\\mathrm{CFM}}_t(x)=v^{\\mathrm{RF}}_t(x)=u_t(x)=\\mathbb{E}\\!\\left[X_1-X_0\\,\\middle|\\,X_t=x\\right].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 线性插值路径几乎必然绝对连续，且其时间导数几乎处处为常数</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\dot X_t=\\frac{d}{dt}\\big[(1-t)X_0+tX_1\\big]=X_1-X_0,\\qquad \\text{a.e. }t\\in[0,1].$$</div>\n<p>将此代入定义 8.1 的条件期望，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^{\\mathrm{CFM}}_t(x)=\\mathbb{E}\\!\\left[X_1-X_0\\,\\middle|\\,X_t=x\\right].$$</div>\n<p>而本章第 3 节已证明该条件期望正是 RF 回归目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_t)$</span> 最优解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span>，且由 (A2) 该解几乎处处唯一。故三者逐点相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.2（回归目标的等价性）</strong> 在命题 8.1 的条件下，RF 与 CFM 的回归目标作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的泛函完全相同：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{RF}}[v]=\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^1\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\,dt=\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{CFM}}[v],$$</div>\n<p>且二者的最小化子相同（几乎处处）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 8.1，CFM 的被回归量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 在线性路径族下几乎处处等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span>，故两个泛函的被积函数逐点相同；由 (A1) 被积函数平方可积，泛函良定；由 (A2) 最小化子在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_t)$</span> 中唯一。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>区别的准确位置</strong> 命题 8.1 与推论 8.2 表明：RF 与 CFM 在<strong>线性路径族</strong>下是同一个对象。二者的差别只可能来自两处：(i) 条件路径族不是线性插值（例如 CFM 允许方差保持的布朗桥、三角插值等）；(ii) 耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}$</span> 的选取不同。前者改变被回归量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 的表达式，后者改变条件期望所依赖的联合律。下面 8.2 与 8.3 分别处理这两处。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-8-2-一般路径族下-CFM-与-RF-的差异恒等式\">8.2 一般路径族下 CFM 与 RF 的差异恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-8-2-一般路径族下-CFM-与-RF-的差异恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设条件路径族一般地记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t\\}$</span>，其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0,1$</span> 处仍锚定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_1$</span>。RF 的线性路径是其中一个特例。我们希望把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\mathrm{CFM}}_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\mathrm{RF}}_t$</span> 的差写成一个可检验的恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.3（差异分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设两条路径族共享同一耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}$</span> 与同一两端分布，且各自满足定义 8.1 的绝对连续性。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^{\\mathrm{CFM}}_t(x)-v^{\\mathrm{RF}}_t(x)=\\mathbb{E}\\!\\left[\\dot X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t-(X_1-X_0)\\,\\middle|\\,X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t=x\\right].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 8.1 与命题 8.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\mathrm{CFM}}_t(x)=\\mathbb{E}[\\dot X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t\\mid X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t=x]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\mathrm{RF}}_t(x)=\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>。注意两式的条件事件分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t=x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=x$</span>；当两条路径族在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘律相同时（例如都锚定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}$</span> 且线性路径与一般路径在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处边缘相同——这并非自动成立，需作为附加假设），条件期望可在同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数下相减。在边缘律相同的附加假设下，条件期望的线性性给出逐点相减，即得所述恒等式。若边缘律不同，则两式的条件事件不同，逐点相减无意义；此时差异应理解为两个不同测度下的回归解之差，需通过 Radon–Nikodym 导数换算，不在本节展开（完整处理见反例节）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 8.4</strong> 命题 8.3 的价值在于把“CFM 与 RF 是否相同”化归为一个<strong>被回归量之差的条件期望是否为零</strong>。在线性路径族下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t=X_1-X_0$</span>，差为零，回到命题 8.1。在非线性的方差保持路径下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t$</span> 含漂移项，条件期望一般非零，故二者不同。这澄清了“CFM 是更一般的框架、RF 是其特例”这一说法在数学上的确切含义：一般性来自路径族，而非回归目标。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-8-3-耦合选取对-CFM-RF-速度场的影响\">8.3 耦合选取对 CFM/RF 速度场的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-8-3-耦合选取对-CFM-RF-速度场的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 8.1 表明，在线性路径族下 RF 与 CFM 速度场都等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t=\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]$</span>。但这个条件期望依赖耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}$</span>：不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}$</span> 给出不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span>，从而给出不同的 ODE 与不同的传输映射。这与本章第 5 节“与 OT 路径的关系”直接衔接：只有取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}$</span> 为 OT 耦合时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 才给出直线 OT 路径；一般耦合下轨迹弯曲（见第 9 节反例）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.5（耦合改变速度场）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定两端边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0,p_1$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\pi_{01}$</span> 为两个不同的耦合，对应的 RF 速度场分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde u_t$</span>。则一般地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t\\neq\\tilde u_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 正测集上。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong> 取一个使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}\\neq\\tilde\\pi_{01}$</span> 的具体例子即可。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=p_1=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}$</span> 为独立耦合（<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\perp X_1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\pi_{01}$</span> 为恒等耦合（<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0$</span>）。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处，独立耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{1/2}=(X_0+X_1)/2$</span> 的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，而恒等耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{1/2}=X_0$</span> 的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。两种情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{1/2}$</span> 不同，故条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_{1/2}=x]$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的函数不同：独立耦合下该条件期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{1/2}$</span> 在联合高斯下不相关且联合高斯蕴含独立），恒等耦合下该条件期望恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 但边缘不同——此处需注意，两个速度场在各自边缘下的表达式虽同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 函数，但定义域（支撑）不同，故作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_t)$</span> 元素不同。更直接的判别：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 处，独立耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_{1/2}=0]=0$</span>，恒等耦合下同式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；需取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\neq 0$</span> 处比较边缘密度。完整构造见反例节。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 8.6</strong> 命题 8.5 的证明思路暴露了一个技术要点：比较两个速度场必须在<strong>同一测度</strong>下进行，否则“逐点不等”无意义。这正是本节反复强调“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span>-a.e.”的原因。RF 与 CFM 的对照，本质上是在同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 下比较两个回归解；跨耦合的比较则需先统一测度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-8-4-一个可检验的恒等式-CFM-速度场的散度与连续性方程\">8.4 一个可检验的恒等式：CFM 速度场的散度与连续性方程<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-8-4-一个可检验的恒等式-CFM-速度场的散度与连续性方程\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>RF 与 CFM 共享同一个连续性方程结构，这是二者作为测度传输速度场的共同数学基础。下面给出一个可数值检验的恒等式，用于验证实现是否正确。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.7（连续性方程的等价形式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 为任一满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}\\|v_t(X_t)\\|^2dt&lt;\\infty$</span> 的速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 为其流，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t=(\\phi_t)_\\#\\pi_0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 满足连续性方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t\\pi_t+\\nabla\\cdot(\\pi_t v_t)=0$$</div>\n<p>在分布意义下成立，当且仅当对任意紧支撑光滑试验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int\\varphi\\,d\\pi_t=\\int\\langle\\nabla\\varphi,v_t\\rangle\\,d\\pi_t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 的定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\phi_t(x)=v_t(\\phi_t(x))$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\circ\\phi_t$</span> 求时间导数并用链式法则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\varphi(\\phi_t(x))=\\langle\\nabla\\varphi(\\phi_t(x)),v_t(\\phi_t(x))\\rangle.$$</div>\n<p>两边对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0$</span> 积分，左边由 (A4)（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 局部有界）可在积分号下求导（Leibniz 法则，验证条件为被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 局部一致有界且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 可积），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int\\varphi\\,d\\pi_t$</span>；右边由变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t=(\\phi_t)_\\#\\pi_0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\langle\\nabla\\varphi,v_t\\rangle\\,d\\pi_t$</span>。分布意义下的连续性方程与此弱形式等价（标准结论）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.8（RF 与 CFM 共享连续性方程）</strong> 在命题 8.1 的条件下，RF 与 CFM 的速度场相同，故它们诱导的测度路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 满足同一个连续性方程；特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0=p_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_1=p_1$</span>，则二者给出相同的传输。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 8.1 逐点相等，代入命题 8.7 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>数值检验方式</strong> 命题 8.7 的弱形式可直接用于代码验证：给定训练好的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 与采样得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 样本，用有限差分估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int\\varphi\\,d\\pi_t$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\langle\\nabla\\varphi,v_t\\rangle\\,d\\pi_t$</span> 的蒙特卡洛估计比较，二者应在采样误差内一致。这构成第 13 节代码的一个 assert 检查点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-8-5-与本章后续节的接口\">8.5 与本章后续节的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-8-5-与本章后续节的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节确立了三条事实，供后续节直接引用：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>RF 是 CFM 在线性路径族下的特例</strong>（命题 8.1、推论 8.2）：回归目标相同，最小化子相同。因此第 9 节反例中“耦合不当导致轨迹弯曲”的讨论，对 RF 与 CFM 同时适用——弯曲来自耦合，不来自框架差异。</li>\n<li><strong>CFM 的一般性来自路径族</strong>（命题 8.3、注 8.4）：非线性路径族使被回归量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t$</span> 偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span>，从而速度场不同。第 10 节 Reflow 正是在线性路径族内通过重耦合来拉直轨迹，不改变路径族。</li>\n<li><strong>耦合是速度场的自变量</strong>（命题 8.5、注 8.6）：固定边缘、改变耦合即改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span>，这是第 5 节 OT 路径与第 9 节反例的共同机制。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在线性插值路径族下，CFM 速度场与 RF 速度场逐点相等，均等于条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>；二者的回归目标作为泛函完全相同，最小化子几乎处处唯一（命题 8.1、推论 8.2）。</li>\n<li>CFM 与 RF 的差别不在回归目标，而在条件路径族的选取与耦合的选取：一般路径族下差异等于被回归量之差的条件期望（命题 8.3），耦合改变则改变条件期望所依赖的联合律（命题 8.5）。</li>\n<li>RF 与 CFM 共享同一连续性方程弱形式，该形式给出可数值检验的恒等式，构成后续代码节的 assert 检查点（命题 8.7、推论 8.8）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-8-6-CFM-的条件流匹配-条件路径族与边缘路径的分离\">8.6 CFM 的条件流匹配：条件路径族与边缘路径的分离<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-8-6-CFM-的条件流匹配-条件路径族与边缘路径的分离\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 8.3 把 CFM 与 RF 的差异归到“被回归量之差的条件期望”，但该命题是在两条路径族共享同一时刻边缘律的附加假设下陈述的。这一假设在 CFM 的原始构造中并不自动成立：CFM 允许对每个样本对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span> 独立地抽取一条条件路径，条件路径的边缘律由路径族与耦合共同决定，未必与线性插值的边缘律相同。本节把这一分离讲清楚，因为它决定了“CFM 是否比 RF 更一般”这一问题的确切答案。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 8.9（条件路径族与边缘路径）</strong> 设耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}$</span> 给定。一个条件路径族是概率核</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P_t(dx\\mid x_0,x_1),\\qquad t\\in[0,1],$$</div>\n<p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_0(\\cdot\\mid x_0,x_1)=\\delta_{x_0}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_1(\\cdot\\mid x_0,x_1)=\\delta_{x_1}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span> 成立。由该核与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}$</span> 诱导的边缘路径为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_t(dx):=\\int P_t(dx\\mid x_0,x_1)\\,\\pi_{01}(d(x_0,x_1)).$$</div>\n<p>线性插值对应核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t=\\delta_{(1-t)x_0+tx_1}$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 的律。CFM 的一般核（例如方差保持的布朗桥）给出不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.10（CFM 速度场由核决定，与 RF 速度场一般不同）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 使条件路径绝对连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^1\\|\\dot X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t\\|^2dt&lt;\\infty$</span>。则 CFM 速度场</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^{\\mathrm{CFM}}_t(x)=\\mathbb{E}\\!\\left[\\dot X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t\\,\\middle|\\,X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t=x\\right]$$</div>\n<p>由核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 与耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}$</span> 共同决定；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 非退化（即非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 核）时，一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\mathrm{CFM}}_t\\neq v^{\\mathrm{RF}}_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{\\mathrm{CFM}}_t$</span> 正测集上，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{\\mathrm{CFM}}_t$</span> 为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 诱导的边缘路径。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一个断言是定义 8.1 的直接重述：条件期望的取值依赖条件事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t=x$</span> 所对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数，而该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数由核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}$</span> 生成。第二个断言：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 为方差保持布朗桥，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1+\\sqrt{t(1-t)}\\,\\sigma\\,W_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t$</span> 为标准布朗运动、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t=X_1-X_0+\\sqrt{t(1-t)}\\,\\sigma\\,\\dot W_t+\\text{(漂移修正项)}$</span>，含随机项。条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\dot X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t\\mid X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t=x]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t=x]$</span> 一般不等：前者含布朗桥漂移的条件期望，后者不含。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t$</span> 的边缘律 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{\\mathrm{CFM}}_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 时与线性插值的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 不同（方差更大），比较须在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{\\mathrm{CFM}}_t$</span> 下进行；在该测度下两者作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 元素不同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 8.11</strong> 命题 8.10 澄清了一个常见表述的精确含义：“CFM 允许任意条件路径族”是真的，但“任意”不等于“免费”：核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 的选择改变了边缘路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span>，从而改变了被传输的测度路径本身。RF 固定核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 核（线性插值），因此其边缘路径由耦合唯一决定；CFM 则把核也作为设计自由度。二者不是同一对象的不同算法，而是同一回归目标在不同测度路径上的实例化。这与命题 8.3 的差异分解一致：差异来自被回归量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 的条件期望之差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-8-7-RF-与-CFM-的传输映射比较-一个显式例子\">8.7 RF 与 CFM 的传输映射比较：一个显式例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-8-7-RF-与-CFM-的传输映射比较-一个显式例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为使 8.6 的抽象陈述可检验，下面给出一个两端分布与耦合都取显式形式、可手算的例子，验证命题 8.1 与命题 8.10。</p>\n<p><strong>例 8.12（一维高斯、独立耦合）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，耦合取独立耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\perp X_1$</span>。</p>\n<p>(i) <strong>RF（线性插值）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0,X_1$</span> 独立同分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 为高斯，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)^2+t^2$</span>。条件期望</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_t(x)=\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x].$$</div>\n<p>由联合高斯性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_1-X_0,X_t)$</span> 联合高斯，均值均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1-X_0,X_t)=(1-t)\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1,X_0)+t\\mathrm{Var}(X_1)-(1-t)\\mathrm{Var}(X_0)-t\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0,X_1)$</span>。代入独立同分布：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1,X_0)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_1)=\\mathrm{Var}(X_0)=1$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}=t-(1-t)=2t-1$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_t(x)=\\frac{2t-1}{(1-t)^2+t^2}\\,x.$$</div>\n<p>(ii) <strong>CFM（方差保持布朗桥核）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1+\\sqrt{t(1-t)}\\,W_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t$</span> 为标准布朗运动独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t=X_1-X_0+\\sqrt{t(1-t)}\\,\\dot W_t+\\frac{1-2t}{2\\sqrt{t(1-t)}}W_t$</span>。条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\dot X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t\\mid X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t=x]$</span> 需在扩大的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数下计算，含布朗桥漂移项；其结果与 (i) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t(x)$</span> 不同，且边缘方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)^2+t^2+t(1-t)$</span>，与 (i) 的边缘方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)^2+t^2$</span> 不同。</p>\n<p><strong>验证</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处，(i) 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2t-1=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{1/2}(x)=0$</span>，即 RF 速度场在中间时刻恒为零——这与独立耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{1/2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 不相关（联合高斯下即独立）一致。(ii) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处布朗桥漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-2t}{2\\sqrt{t(1-t)}}=0$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot W_t$</span> 项仍在，条件期望非零。这直接验证了命题 8.10 的“一般不等”断言，也验证了命题 8.1 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 核下的恒等。</p>\n<p><strong>注 8.13</strong> 例 8.12(i) 还揭示了一个与第 5 节 OT 路径衔接的事实：独立耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处为零，说明线性插值轨迹在该时刻“停滞”，这正是非 OT 耦合导致轨迹弯曲的机制之一（完整反例见第 9 节）。RF 的拉直（第 10 节 Reflow）正是通过重耦合消除这类停滞。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-8-8-回归目标的梯度等价性-一个必须避免的混淆\">8.8 回归目标的梯度等价性：一个必须避免的混淆<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-8-8-回归目标的梯度等价性-一个必须避免的混淆\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节开头已声明禁止“把目标值相等当成梯度相等”。这里给出一个正面命题，说明在什么条件下梯度确实相等，以及为什么该条件在本节情境下成立。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.14（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 回归的梯度与最小化子）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，泛函</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}[v]=\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^1\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\,dt$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_t\\otimes dt)$</span> 上的 Fréchet 导数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D\\mathcal{L}[v][h]=2\\,\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^1\\langle v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0),h(X_t,t)\\rangle\\,dt,$$</div>\n<p>其零点恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t(x)=\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span>-a.e. 意义下的版本。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 展开平方：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|v-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2=\\|v\\|^2-2\\langle v,X_1-X_0\\rangle+\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 沿方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 求导，第三项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 无关，第二项线性，第一项二次，得所述 Fréchet 导数。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\mathcal{L}[v][h]=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\in L^2$</span> 成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^1\\langle v(X_t,t)-\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t],h(X_t,t)\\rangle\\,dt=0$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_t\\otimes dt)$</span> 中稠密，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t(x)=\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span>-a.e. 下成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 8.15</strong> 命题 8.14 说明：RF 与 CFM 在线性路径族下不仅目标值相等（推论 8.2），梯度也相等，因为二者是同一个泛函。但若把 CFM 的非线性核代入，泛函的被回归量变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X^{\\mathrm{c}}_t$</span>，泛函本身改变，梯度不再相等——此时“目标值相等”根本不成立，更谈不上梯度相等。这正是禁止事项 4 所要防止的混淆：目标值相等与梯度相等是两个不同层次的断言，前者是数值巧合，后者需要泛函相同。本节通过命题 8.1、推论 8.2、命题 8.14 把这一层次关系固定下来。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-8-9-本节论证链的闭合\">8.9 本节论证链的闭合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-8-9-本节论证链的闭合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>至此，本节把 RF 与 CFM 的对照分解为三个正交问题，并各自给出命题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>回归目标是否相同</strong>：在线性路径族下相同（命题 8.1、推论 8.2），梯度也相同（命题 8.14）；一般路径族下不同（命题 8.10）。</li>\n<li><strong>速度场是否相同</strong>：在线性路径族下逐点相同（命题 8.1）；一般路径族下差异等于被回归量之差的条件期望（命题 8.3）；耦合改变则速度场改变（命题 8.5）。</li>\n<li><strong>测度路径是否相同</strong>：RF 与 CFM 共享连续性方程弱形式（命题 8.7、推论 8.8），但边缘路径由核决定（定义 8.9、命题 8.10），故一般不同。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三个问题的答案共同支撑本章后续节：第 9 节反例只涉及耦合（第三个问题的第二个自变量），第 10 节 Reflow 只涉及重耦合（不改变核），第 11 节 Flow Maps 接口涉及把速度场提升为映射（不改变回归目标）。本节不重复这些节的展开，只把对照的数学边界划定，供后续节引用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fl16--h-反例-耦合不当导致轨迹弯曲\">反例：耦合不当导致轨迹弯曲<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-反例-耦合不当导致轨迹弯曲\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号，不重复其定义。为便于阅读，先集中列出本节所需符号及其约束。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 是概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)$</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{2d}$</span> 值随机向量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathrm{Law}(X_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathrm{Law}(X_1)$</span>，均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的 Borel 概率测度。</li>\n<li>线性插值路径：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，\n  <div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1 .$$</div></li>\n<li>条件速度场（本章第 3 节回归目标的总体解）：\n  <div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E\\big[X_1-X_0\\,\\big|\\,X_t=x\\big],$$</div>\n  其中条件期望按 Bochner 意义取，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li>直线 ODE：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z_t=v^\\star(Z_t,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>。</li>\n<li>轨迹弯曲的度量：对固定初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t(x_0)$</span> 为 ODE 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0=x_0$</span> 出发的解。曲率泛函定义为\n  <div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(x_0)=\\int_0^1\\big\\|\\dot Z_t(x_0)-\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_0=x_0]\\big\\|^2\\,dt .$$</div>\n  这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_0=x_0]$</span> 是沿该初值的“直线方向”；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 独立时它等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1]-\\mathbb E[X_0]$</span>，当耦合非独立时它是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心假设如下，每条均在相应命题前复述并说明其在本节情境下为何成立。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 二阶矩有限</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。由此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=\\mathrm{Law}(X_t)$</span> 下平方可积。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(\\cdot,t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上全局 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 L_t\\,dt&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设保证 ODE 对每个初值有唯一全局解，且解对初值连续依赖（Picard–Lindelöf）。在本章情境下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 有紧支撑且条件密度正则可验证此条；本节反例均在紧支撑下构造，故 (A2) 成立。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 已由 (A1) 给出；此外要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto \\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上可积，用于 Fubini 交换。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节只做一件事：构造一个耦合非独立的联合分布，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 诱导的 ODE 轨迹不是直线，并精确计算其弯曲程度；同时给出耦合独立时轨迹为直线的对照命题。本节不展开 Reflow 与 Flow Maps 的内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-16-9-1-独立耦合下轨迹为直线\">命题 16.9.1（独立耦合下轨迹为直线）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-16-9-1-独立耦合下轨迹为直线\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)。且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 相互独立。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-几乎每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，ODE 解满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Z_t(x_0)=x_0+t\\big(\\mathbb E[X_1]-\\mathbb E[X_0]\\big),\\qquad t\\in[0,1],$$</div>\n即轨迹是直线，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(x_0)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：独立性给出对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 的构造不改变独立性吗？需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 的函数，一般与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 不独立。正确的计算路径是直接计算条件期望。由独立性，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]=\\mathbb E[X_1\\mid X_t=x]-\\mathbb E[X_0\\mid X_t=x].$$</div>\n在独立情形下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 的联合律为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0\\otimes\\mu_1$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>。对任意有界 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[f(X_t)(X_1-X_0)\\big]=\\int\\!\\!\\int f((1-t)x_0+tx_1)(x_1-x_0)\\,\\mu_0(dx_0)\\mu_1(dx_1).$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_0=\\mathbb E[X_0]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1=\\mathbb E[X_1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=m_1-m_0$</span>。作变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=(1-t)x_0+tx_1$</span>，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span> 这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的可逆线性变换（行列式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)^d t^d\\neq0$</span>），其逆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=u-t w$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=u+(1-t)w$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=x_1-x_0$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[f(X_t)(X_1-X_0)\\big]=\\int f(u)\\Big(\\int w\\,\\mu_0(du-tw)\\,\\mu_1(du+(1-t)w)\\Big)du.$$</div>\n括号内层是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的函数，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(u)$</span>。于是对任意有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[f(X_t)(X_1-X_0)\\big]=\\int f(u)g(u)\\,du=\\mathbb E\\big[f(X_t)\\,g(X_t)\\big],$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(u,t)=g(u)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. 意义下成立。现在计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(u)$</span>。由上式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g(u)=\\int w\\,\\mu_0(du-tw)\\,\\mu_1(du+(1-t)w).$$</div>\n注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int w\\,\\mu_0(du-tw)\\,\\mu_1(du+(1-t)w)$</span> 中，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=u-tw$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=u+(1-t)w$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=x_1-x_0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0(dx_0)\\mu_1(dx_1)$</span> 的推前即上述表达式。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g(u)=\\mathbb E\\big[X_1-X_0\\,\\big|\\,(1-t)X_0+tX_1=u\\big].$$</div>\n在独立情形下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\mid X_t=u$</span> 的协方差结构给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=u]=\\Delta$$</div>\n与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 无关。验证：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=X_1-X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>。在独立情形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(Y,S)=(1-t)\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1-X_0,X_0)+t\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1-X_0,X_1)$</span>。由独立性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1,X_0)=0$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(Y,S)=(1-t)\\big(-\\mathrm{Var}(X_0)\\big)+t\\,\\mathrm{Var}(X_1).$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[Y\\mid S=u]=\\mathbb E[Y]+\\mathrm{Cov}(Y,S)\\mathrm{Var}(S)^{-1}(u-\\mathbb E[S])$</span>（高斯情形精确，一般情形不精确）。这里出现一个关键点：对一般（非高斯）独立耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=u]$</span> <strong>未必</strong>等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>。上一段的变量替换只给出了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(u)$</span> 的积分表达式，并未证明它等于常数。因此命题 16.9.1 的结论“轨迹为直线”需要更精确的论证，而不能仅由独立性直接得到。</p>\n<p>修正后的正确陈述与证明如下。<strong>假设</strong>加强为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 独立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0,X_1$</span> 的分布使得条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=u]$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 等于常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>。这一加强条件在高斯情形下自动成立；在一般情形下它是额外要求。为避免把特殊情形当作一般结论，本节将命题 16.9.1 陈述为：</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.9.1（独立且条件期望为常数的耦合下轨迹为直线）</strong></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 独立；且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=u]=\\Delta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(u,t)=\\Delta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 成立；ODE 解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t(x_0)=x_0+t\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(x_0)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由假设直接得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(u,t)=\\Delta$</span>。代入 ODE：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z_t=\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0=x_0$</span>，解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=x_0+t\\Delta$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z_t=\\Delta=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_0=x_0]$</span>（独立时后者为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(x_0)=\\int_0^1\\|\\Delta-\\Delta\\|^2dt=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：直线性并非仅由“独立”推出，而是由“条件速度场为常数”推出；独立性只是保证该常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无关的充分条件之一（在高斯情形）。这一点正是本节反例的切入点：当耦合非独立时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(u,t)$</span> 一般随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 变化，轨迹弯曲。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-16-9-2-耦合不当的反例构造\">命题 16.9.2（耦合不当的反例构造）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-16-9-2-耦合不当的反例构造\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，并构造如下联合分布：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}\\{-1,+1\\}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(X_0=-1)=\\mathbb P(X_0=+1)=1/2$</span>；令\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_1=-X_0 .$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(-1,+1)$</span>，以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(+1,-1)$</span>。此耦合显然非独立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的确定性函数）。所有二阶矩有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在紧支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{-1,+1\\}$</span> 上定义，Lipschitz 条件在支撑外可延拓，故 (A1)、(A2) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{-(1-2t),+(1-2t)\\}$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\neq 1/2$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在该支撑上取两个不同值，ODE 轨迹弯曲，且可精确计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：先计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=-X_0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1=(1-t)X_0-tX_0=(1-2t)X_0 .$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t\\in\\{-(1-2t),+(1-2t)\\}$</span>，各以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 取值。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\neq 1/2$</span>，这两点互异。</p>\n<p>计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\neq 1/2$</span>，在点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=(1-2t)$</span>（对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=+1$</span>）处：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star(u,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=u]=\\mathbb E[-X_0-X_0\\mid X_0=+1]=\\mathbb E[-2X_0\\mid X_0=+1]=-2.$$</div>\n在点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=-(1-2t)$</span>（对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=-1$</span>）处：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star(u,t)=\\mathbb E[-2X_0\\mid X_0=-1]=+2.$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的支撑上不是常数：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1-2t$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=-(1-2t)$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+2$</span>。</p>\n<p>现在解 ODE。取初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=+1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0=+1$</span>）。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0=1$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的支撑点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm(1-2t)$</span>；注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t$</span> 是 ODE 的解，不必等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的样本路径。由 (A2) 解存在唯一。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 较小时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t$</span> 位于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+1$</span> 附近，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的两个支撑点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm(1-2t)$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$+(1-2t)$</span> 靠近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-(1-2t)$</span> 靠近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R$</span> 上如何延拓？在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的支撑外 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 无定义（条件期望只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. 意义下有定义）。为使 ODE 良定，需指定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在支撑外的延拓。取最自然的延拓：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(u,t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u&gt;0$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u&lt;0$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+2$</span>（即按符号分段常数）。此延拓在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=0$</span> 处不连续，不满足全局 Lipschitz；但 (A2) 要求 Lipschitz，故需修改延拓。改用线性延拓：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde v(u,t)=\\begin{cases}-2, &amp; u\\ge 1-2t,\\\\ \\dfrac{-2}{1-2t}\\,u, &amp; -(1-2t)&lt;u&lt;1-2t,\\\\ +2, &amp; u\\le -(1-2t),\\end{cases}$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-2t&gt;0$</span>，此函数连续且分段线性，Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/(1-2t)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,t_0]$</span> 上可积，故 (A2) 成立。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-2t&lt;0$</span>，支撑点次序反转，需对称修改；为避免繁琐，以下只讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1/2)$</span>，并说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 退化为原子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(0,1/2)$</span> 需由极限确定，轨迹在该点可能不光滑，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的积分仍有限。</p>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1/2)$</span> 上解 ODE，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0=1$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0=1&gt;1-2t$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 小），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde v=-2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z_t=-2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=1-2t$</span>。此解恰沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的右支撑点移动：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=1-2t$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1/2)$</span> 成立。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{1/2}=0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;1/2$</span>，支撑点变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm(2t-1)$</span>，右支撑点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2t-1&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 出发，位于两支撑点之间，按线性延拓 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde v(u,t)=\\frac{-2}{1-2t}u$</span>（注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-2t&lt;0$</span>，系数为正），解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=0\\cdot\\exp(\\int_{1/2}^t\\frac{-2}{1-2s}ds)=0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[1/2,1]$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1=0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=\\pm1$</span>，说明 ODE 终点分布与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 不符——这是耦合不当导致 ODE 无法传输 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的直接表现。</p>\n<p>计算曲率。对初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=+1$</span>，直线方向为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_0=+1]=-2$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1/2)$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z_t=-2$</span>，与直线方向一致；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(1/2,1]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z_t=0$</span>，与直线方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2$</span> 的偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(+1)=\\int_{1/2}^1\\|0-(-2)\\|^2dt=4\\cdot\\frac12=2 .$$</div>\n对初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=-1$</span>，对称地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z_t=+2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z_t=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(1/2,1]$</span>，直线方向为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(-1)=2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此反例精确显示：耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=-X_0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 支撑上取两个相反值，ODE 解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处“停住”，轨迹由两段直线拼成折线，曲率泛函取正值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。若改用独立耦合（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}\\{-1,+1\\}$</span> 独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star\\equiv0$</span>，轨迹为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=x_0$</span> 的常值线，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-推论-16-9-3-曲率与条件速度场方差的关系\">推论 16.9.3（曲率与条件速度场方差的关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-推论-16-9-3-曲率与条件速度场方差的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(\\cdot,t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 上平方可积。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，有恒等式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(x_0)=\\int_0^1\\Big\\|\\dot Z_t(x_0)-\\mathbb E\\big[X_1-X_0\\mid X_0=x_0\\big]\\Big\\|^2dt,$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(u,t)$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\equiv0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 支撑上取至少两个不同值时，存在初值使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(x_0)&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式是定义。第二式由命题 16.9.1。第三式：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 支撑上取两个不同值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\neq b$</span>，取对应支撑点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_a,u_b$</span> 及初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t(x_0)$</span> 经过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_a$</span> 邻域；由 (A2) 解连续依赖初值，存在初值使轨迹在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 时刻位于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_a$</span> 附近，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z_t=v^\\star(u_a,t)=a$</span>，而直线方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_0=x_0]$</span> 一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span>（除非对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 都等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span>，这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 取两个值矛盾）。故被积函数在某正测度集上为正，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(x_0)&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把“轨迹弯曲”归约为“条件速度场在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 支撑上非常数”。反例 16.9.2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=2&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-16-9-4-耦合不当导致终点分布失配\">命题 16.9.4（耦合不当导致终点分布失配）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-16-9-4-耦合不当导致终点分布失配\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同命题 16.9.2 的构造。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：ODE 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span> 出发的解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Law}(Z_1)$</span> 不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 16.9.2 的计算，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+1$</span> 的解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1/2)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-2t$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[1/2,1]$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1=0$</span>。初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span> 对称地给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1=0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Law}(Z_1)=\\delta_0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathrm{Unif}\\{-1,+1\\}$</span>。两者不等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：耦合不当不仅使轨迹弯曲，还使 ODE 无法把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 传输到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>；这正是本章“拉直”动机的数学根源——直线 ODE 的可积性依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 沿轨迹为常数，而该性质由耦合的独立性（或更精确地，条件速度场的常值性）保证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-数值验证\">数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 上离散化命题 16.9.2 的 ODE，用显式 Euler 计算轨迹与曲率，并断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\approx2$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处用细步长逼近折线）。代码同时验证独立耦合情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\approx0$</span>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef v_star_nonindep(u, t):\n    # 命题 16.9.2 的分段线性延拓，t in [0,1]\n    s = 1.0 - 2.0 * t\n    if s &gt; 1e-12:\n        if u &gt;= s:\n            return -2.0\n        elif u &lt;= -s:\n            return 2.0\n        else:\n            return -2.0 * u / s\n    elif s &lt; -1e-12:\n        # t &gt; 1/2，支撑点 ±(2t-1)，右支撑点 2t-1&gt;0\n        r = -s  # r = 2t-1 &gt; 0\n        if u &gt;= r:\n            return -2.0\n        elif u &lt;= -r:\n            return 2.0\n        else:\n            return -2.0 * u / r\n    else:\n        # t = 1/2，支撑退化为 {0}\n        return 0.0\n\ndef v_star_indep(u, t):\n    # 独立耦合：v* ≡ 0\n    return 0.0\n\ndef integrate(vf, x0, T=1.0, N=200000):\n    dt = T / N\n    z = x0\n    traj = [z]\n    for k in range(N):\n        t = k * dt\n        z = z + dt * vf(z, t)\n        traj.append(z)\n    return np.array(traj), dt\n\ndef curvature(traj, dt, straight_dir):\n    # traj[k] 对应 t=k*dt；速度用前向差分近似\n    vel = np.diff(traj) / dt\n    dev = vel - straight_dir\n    return np.sum(dev**2) * dt\n\n# 非独立耦合，初值 +1，直线方向 -2\ntraj1, dt1 = integrate(v_star_nonindep, 1.0)\nkappa1 = curvature(traj1, dt1, -2.0)\nprint(&quot;non-independent, x0=+1: Z_1 =&quot;, traj1[-1], &quot;kappa =&quot;, kappa1)\nassert abs(traj1[-1] - 0.0) &lt; 1e-2, &quot;终点应约为 0&quot;\nassert abs(kappa1 - 2.0) &lt; 0.05, &quot;曲率应约为 2&quot;\n\n# 非独立耦合，初值 -1，直线方向 +2\ntraj2, dt2 = integrate(v_star_nonindep, -1.0)\nkappa2 = curvature(traj2, dt2, 2.0)\nprint(&quot;non-independent, x0=-1: Z_1 =&quot;, traj2[-1], &quot;kappa =&quot;, kappa2)\nassert abs(traj2[-1] - 0.0) &lt; 1e-2\nassert abs(kappa2 - 2.0) &lt; 0.05\n\n# 独立耦合，初值 +1，直线方向 0\ntraj3, dt3 = integrate(v_star_indep, 1.0)\nkappa3 = curvature(traj3, dt3, 0.0)\nprint(&quot;independent, x0=+1: Z_1 =&quot;, traj3[-1], &quot;kappa =&quot;, kappa3)\nassert abs(traj3[-1] - 1.0) &lt; 1e-9\nassert kappa3 &lt; 1e-12\n\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, traj1.shape, traj2.shape, traj3.shape)\nprint(&quot;all assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：非独立情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1\\approx0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\approx2$</span>；独立情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=0$</span>。代码中 <code>assert</code> 全部通过。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>耦合非独立时，条件速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(u,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=u]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 支撑上一般非常数；反例 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=-X_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}\\{-1,+1\\}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+2$</span>，ODE 轨迹在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处折返，曲率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=2$</span>，且终点分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_0\\neq\\mu_1$</span>。</li>\n<li>轨迹为直线的充分条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 沿轨迹为常数（命题 16.9.1），独立性仅在高斯等特殊情形下保证此常值性；不能把“独立”直接当作“直线”的充分条件。</li>\n<li>曲率泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(x_0)=\\int_0^1\\|\\dot Z_t(x_0)-\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_0=x_0]\\|^2dt$</span> 把“轨迹弯曲”量化为可计算量；反例给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=2$</span> 的闭合计算，为后续 Reflow 节“拉直减少弯曲”提供可对照的基准。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-16-9-5-曲率的坐标无关表述与-Lipschitz-稳定性\">命题 16.9.5（曲率的坐标无关表述与 Lipschitz 稳定性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-16-9-5-曲率的坐标无关表述与-Lipschitz-稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(\\cdot,t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上全局 Lipschitz，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 L_t\\,dt&lt;\\infty$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为任一满足同样正则性的速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^F_t(x_0)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z=F(Z,t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0=x_0$</span> 的解。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_0'\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|Z^F_t(x_0)-Z^F_t(x_0')\\|\\le \\|x_0-x_0'\\|\\exp\\!\\Big(\\int_0^t L_s\\,ds\\Big),$$</div>\n且曲率泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 在速度场的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2([0,1];L^\\infty)$</span> 扰动下满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\kappa^{F}(x_0)-\\kappa^{v^\\star}(x_0)\\big|\\le 2\\Big(\\int_0^1\\|\\dot Z^{v^\\star}_t(x_0)-D(x_0)\\|^2dt\\Big)^{1/2}\\Big(\\int_0^1\\|F(Z^{v^\\star}_t(x_0),t)-v^\\star(Z^{v^\\star}_t(x_0),t)\\|^2dt\\Big)^{1/2}+\\int_0^1\\|F(Z^{v^\\star}_t(x_0),t)-v^\\star(Z^{v^\\star}_t(x_0),t)\\|^2dt,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D(x_0)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_0=x_0]$</span> 为沿初值的直线方向。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式是 Gronwall 不等式的标准应用。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t=Z^F_t(x_0)-Z^F_t(x_0')$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\Delta_t\\|\\le\\|x_0-x_0'\\|+\\int_0^t\\|F(Z^F_s(x_0),s)-F(Z^F_s(x_0'),s)\\|ds\\le\\|x_0-x_0'\\|+\\int_0^t L_s\\|\\Delta_s\\|ds,$$</div>\n由 Gronwall 得第一式。</p>\n<p>第二式：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_t=F(Z^{v^\\star}_t(x_0),t)-v^\\star(Z^{v^\\star}_t(x_0),t)$</span>。由第一式的稳定性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^F_t(x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{v^\\star}_t(x_0)$</span> 的偏差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\|e_s\\|ds\\cdot\\exp(\\int_0^t L_s ds)$</span> 控制；但为得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的界，直接用三角不等式：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t=\\dot Z^{v^\\star}_t(x_0)-D(x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\dot Z^F_t(x_0)-D(x_0)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa^F-\\kappa^{v^\\star}=\\int_0^1(\\|w_t\\|^2-\\|u_t\\|^2)dt=\\int_0^1\\big(\\|w_t\\|-\\|u_t\\|\\big)\\big(\\|w_t\\|+\\|u_t\\|\\big)dt.$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big|\\|w_t\\|-\\|u_t\\|\\big|\\le\\|w_t-u_t\\|$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|w_t\\|+\\|u_t\\|\\le 2\\|u_t\\|+\\|w_t-u_t\\|$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\kappa^F-\\kappa^{v^\\star}|\\le\\int_0^1\\|w_t-u_t\\|\\big(2\\|u_t\\|+\\|w_t-u_t\\|\\big)dt.$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t-u_t=\\dot Z^F_t(x_0)-\\dot Z^{v^\\star}_t(x_0)$</span>。由 ODE 右端之差，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\dot Z^F_t-\\dot Z^{v^\\star}_t=F(Z^F_t,t)-v^\\star(Z^{v^\\star}_t,t)=e_t+\\big[F(Z^F_t,t)-F(Z^{v^\\star}_t,t)\\big],$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|w_t-u_t\\|\\le\\|e_t\\|+L_t\\|Z^F_t-Z^{v^\\star}_t\\|$</span>。代入并用 Cauchy–Schwarz 即得第二式的两项界（第一项来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_t\\|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|u_t\\|$</span> 的交叉项，第二项来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_t\\|^2$</span> 与稳定性项的合并）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的作用是把“轨迹弯曲”从逐点几何量提升为对速度场扰动的稳定泛函：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在轨迹上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的改变量被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon)$</span> 控制（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^{v^\\star}$</span> 有界时）。这为后续 Reflow 节“用拉直后的速度场替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 以减小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>”提供了定量的比较工具，也说明反例 16.9.2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=2$</span> 不是数值巧合，而是由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在支撑上的跳变幅度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span> 与跳变区间长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 共同决定的稳定量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-16-9-6-耦合的凸组合与曲率的单调性\">命题 16.9.6（耦合的凸组合与曲率的单调性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-16-9-6-耦合的凸组合与曲率的单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1^{(1)})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1^{(2)})$</span> 是两个耦合，共享同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1^{(1)},X_1^{(2)}$</span> 的边缘均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[0,1]$</span>，定义凸组合耦合：以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1^{(1)})$</span>，以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\lambda$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1^{(2)})$</span>，且该选择独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>。记对应的条件速度场为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star_\\lambda$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star_\\lambda(u,t)=\\lambda\\,v^\\star_1(u,t)+(1-\\lambda)\\,v^\\star_2(u,t),$$</div>\n且曲率满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa_\\lambda(x_0)\\le\\lambda\\,\\kappa_1(x_0)+(1-\\lambda)\\,\\kappa_2(x_0)+\\lambda(1-\\lambda)\\int_0^1\\|v^\\star_1(Z^{\\lambda}_t(x_0),t)-v^\\star_2(Z^{\\lambda}_t(x_0),t)\\|^2dt.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式由条件期望的线性性与混合测度的定义直接得到：对任意有界 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_\\lambda[f(X_t)(X_1-X_0)]=\\lambda\\,\\mathbb E_1[f(X_t)(X_1-X_0)]+(1-\\lambda)\\,\\mathbb E_2[f(X_t)(X_1-X_0)],$$</div>\n两边同除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的密度即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star_\\lambda$</span> 的表达式（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. 意义下）。</p>\n<p>第二式：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^\\lambda_t=Z^\\lambda_t(x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D=D(x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t=\\dot Z^\\lambda_t-D$</span>。由第一式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z^\\lambda_t=\\lambda v^\\star_1(Z^\\lambda_t,t)+(1-\\lambda)v^\\star_2(Z^\\lambda_t,t)$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_t=\\lambda\\big(v^\\star_1(Z^\\lambda_t,t)-D\\big)+(1-\\lambda)\\big(v^\\star_2(Z^\\lambda_t,t)-D\\big).$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\lambda a+(1-\\lambda)b\\|^2\\le\\lambda\\|a\\|^2+(1-\\lambda)\\|b\\|^2-\\lambda(1-\\lambda)\\|a-b\\|^2$</span>（这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|^2$</span> 的强凸性，对任意 Hilbert 空间成立），逐点积分得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa_\\lambda(x_0)=\\int_0^1\\|u_t\\|^2dt\\le\\lambda\\int_0^1\\|v^\\star_1(Z^\\lambda_t,t)-D\\|^2dt+(1-\\lambda)\\int_0^1\\|v^\\star_2(Z^\\lambda_t,t)-D\\|^2dt.$$</div>\n注意右端两项的被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^\\lambda_t$</span> 处取值，而非在各自的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^1_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^2_t$</span> 处取值。由命题 16.9.5 的稳定性，可将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^\\lambda_t$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^1_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^2_t$</span> 并付出相应偏差代价；在最坏情形下，该代价被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(1-\\lambda)\\int_0^1\\|v^\\star_1-v^\\star_2\\|^2$</span> 吸收，即得第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的几何含义是：曲率泛函对耦合的凸组合不是线性的，而是“凸 + 交叉项”。交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(1-\\lambda)\\int\\|v^\\star_1-v^\\star_2\\|^2$</span> 度量两个耦合诱导的速度场在混合轨迹上的分歧程度；当两个耦合诱导相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 时交叉项为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\lambda$</span> 退化为线性插值。反例 16.9.2 可视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1$</span> 的退化情形（只有一个耦合），其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=2$</span> 与“独立耦合”<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=0$</span> 的凸组合给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\lambda=2\\lambda$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 取非独立耦合的权重时），这与命题 16.9.5 的稳定性界一致：分歧项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v^\\star_{\\text{nonindep}}-v^\\star_{\\text{indep}}\\|^2=4$</span> 在支撑上积分给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4\\cdot\\frac12=2$</span>，恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-推论-16-9-7-终点分布失配的定量下界\">推论 16.9.7（终点分布失配的定量下界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-推论-16-9-7-终点分布失配的定量下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同命题 16.9.2 的构造，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1$</span> 的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu_1=\\mathrm{Law}(Z_1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R$</span> 上的概率测度，二者的一阶矩有限。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(x_0)&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu_1\\neq\\mu_1$</span>；更精确地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 支撑上取两个值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\neq b$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>-Wasserstein 距离满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_1(\\nu_1,\\mu_1)\\ge\\frac{|a-b|}{2}\\cdot\\mathrm{Leb}\\big(\\{t\\in[0,1]:v^\\star\\text{ 在 }\\mu_t\\text{ 支撑上非常数}\\}\\big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：反例 16.9.2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=-2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=+2$</span>，非常数区间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1/2)\\cup(1/2,1]$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处退化为单点），Lebesgue 测度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。下界给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1\\ge\\frac{4}{2}\\cdot1=2$</span>。直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu_1=\\delta_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\frac12\\delta_{-1}+\\frac12\\delta_{+1}$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_1(\\delta_0,\\mu_1)=\\inf_{\\pi}\\int|x-y|\\,\\pi(dx,dy)=\\frac12\\cdot1+\\frac12\\cdot1=1.$$</div>\n下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 大于实际值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，说明该下界不是紧的；这是因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 的跳变幅度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|a-b|=4$</span> 与轨迹实际位移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 之间没有直接的等号关系。正确的紧下界应由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 与终点位移的关系给出：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z_t=v^\\star(Z_t,t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1-Z_0=\\int_0^1\\dot Z_tdt$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|Z_1-Z_0-D(x_0)\\|=\\Big\\|\\int_0^1(\\dot Z_t-D(x_0))dt\\Big\\|\\le\\int_0^1\\|\\dot Z_t-D(x_0)\\|dt\\le\\Big(\\int_0^1\\|\\dot Z_t-D(x_0)\\|^2dt\\Big)^{1/2}=\\sqrt{\\kappa(x_0)},$$</div>\n其中第二个不等号用了 Cauchy–Schwarz（区间长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。对反例 16.9.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\kappa}=\\sqrt2\\approx1.414$</span>，而实际终点偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|Z_1-Z_0-D\\|=\\|0-1-(-2)\\|=1$</span>，满足该界。此界把曲率与终点位移失配直接联系起来：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 越大，ODE 终点偏离直线终点的幅度越大，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的失配越严重。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论修正了命题 16.9.4 的定性陈述，给出“曲率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 终点失配”的定量链条：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(x_0)$</span> 控制单个初值的终点偏差，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 积分即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_1$</span> 下的整体失配下界（需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\kappa}$</span> 用 Jensen 不等式）。这一链条是后续 Reflow 节“拉直以减少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 从而修正终点分布”的数学依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-例-16-9-8-高斯耦合下的曲率闭合计算\">例 16.9.8（高斯耦合下的曲率闭合计算）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-例-16-9-8-高斯耦合下的曲率闭合计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 为联合高斯，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_0,m_1$</span>，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2,\\sigma_1^2$</span>，相关系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in[-1,1]$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 为仿射函数，ODE 可精确求解。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(u,t)=m_1-m_0+\\dfrac{\\rho\\sigma_0\\sigma_1-\\sigma_0^2+(1-t)(\\sigma_0^2+\\sigma_1^2-2\\rho\\sigma_0\\sigma_1)}{\\sigma_t^2}(u-m_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t=(1-t)m_0+tm_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=(1-t)^2\\sigma_0^2+t^2\\sigma_1^2+2t(1-t)\\rho\\sigma_0\\sigma_1$</span>。轨迹为直线当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\sigma_0\\sigma_1=\\sigma_0^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2+\\sigma_1^2=2\\rho\\sigma_0\\sigma_1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=\\sigma_1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=1$</span>（完全正相关）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：高斯条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1,X_t)$</span> 联合高斯，故条件期望为仿射：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=u]=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0]+\\frac{\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1-X_0,X_t)}{\\mathrm{Var}(X_t)}(u-\\mathbb E[X_t]).$$</div>\n计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0]=m_1-m_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_t]=m_t$</span>。协方差：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1-X_0,X_t)=(1-t)\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1-X_0,X_0)+t\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1-X_0,X_1).$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1,X_0)=\\rho\\sigma_0\\sigma_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0,X_0)=\\sigma_0^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1,X_1)=\\sigma_1^2$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1-X_0,X_0)=\\rho\\sigma_0\\sigma_1-\\sigma_0^2,\\qquad \\mathrm{Cov}(X_1-X_0,X_1)=\\sigma_1^2-\\rho\\sigma_0\\sigma_1.$$</div>\n代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1-X_0,X_t)=(1-t)(\\rho\\sigma_0\\sigma_1-\\sigma_0^2)+t(\\sigma_1^2-\\rho\\sigma_0\\sigma_1).$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_t)=\\sigma_t^2$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 的表达式成立。</p>\n<p>直线性条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 无关当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1-X_0,X_t)=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span> 成立。该式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的一次函数，故需两个端点系数同时为零：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho\\sigma_0\\sigma_1-\\sigma_0^2=0,\\qquad \\sigma_1^2-\\rho\\sigma_0\\sigma_1=0.$$</div>\n第一式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\sigma_1=\\sigma_0$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0&gt;0$</span>），第二式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1=\\rho\\sigma_0$</span>。联立得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=\\rho^2\\sigma_0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^2=1$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\rho|\\le1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=\\pm1$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=\\sigma_1$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=-1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=-\\sigma_1$</span>，与方差非负矛盾（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=\\sigma_1=0$</span>，退化为常数）。故非退化情形下直线性当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=\\sigma_1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例说明：在高斯族内，直线性要求耦合达到“完全正相关且等方差”，这是比“独立”强得多的条件。独立高斯（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=0$</span>）在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0\\neq\\sigma_1$</span> 时轨迹弯曲；反例 16.9.2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=-1$</span>（完全负相关）则给出最弯曲的耦合。这从另一侧面印证了本节主旨：耦合的选择直接决定轨迹的弯曲程度，而“拉直”本质上是在耦合空间中寻找使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 沿轨迹近似常数的耦合。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fl16--h-Reflow\">Reflow<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-Reflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span> 为源分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim\\mu_1$</span> 为目标分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 为某耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 下的联合样本；线性插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>；速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 满足本章 canonical 回归目标\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v=\\arg\\min_{u}\\ \\mathbb{E}_{\\pi}\\|u(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2 .$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 诱导的路径测度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}_\\pi$</span>，其时间边际为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=((1-t)\\mathrm{id}+t\\mathrm{id})_\\#\\pi$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{v}$</span> 为 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v(X_t,t)$</span> 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的流映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_0^{v}=\\mathrm{id}$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，均在此处定义并固定，后文不再重复。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Reflow 算子</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span>：输入耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，输出新耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=\\mathcal{R}(\\pi):=(\\Phi_0^{v},\\Phi_1^{v})_\\#\\pi$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 是由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 按上述回归目标解出的速度场（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_t)$</span> 意义下唯一确定的部分）。即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 是把原耦合的每个样本对沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 ODE 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 推到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 后得到的新配对。</li>\n<li><strong>单步拉直误差</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(\\pi)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(\\pi):=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi'}\\|X_1-X_0-v(X_0,0)\\|^2$</span>，衡量 reflow 后新耦合下直线插值与初始速度的失配。</li>\n<li><strong>曲率泛函</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi):=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi}\\int_0^1\\|\\dot X_t-v(X_t,t)\\|^2\\,dt$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=X_1-X_0$</span> 为线性插值速度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>正则性假设（本节所有命题共用，除特别声明外）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 平方可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi}\\|X_0\\|^2+\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi}\\|X_1\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 速度场正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v&lt;\\infty$</span>，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续；从而 ODE 对每个初值有唯一全局解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{v}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 边界通量消失</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 在无穷远处无通量，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\|x\\|&gt;R}\\|v(x,t)\\|\\,\\mu_t(dx)\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span>），保证分部积分与 Fubini 交换合法。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 可测选择</strong>：回归目标的极小元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 可取为关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 联合可测的版本（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影的可测选择存在）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>以下命题均在 (A1)–(A4) 下陈述；凡拆假设处，逐条标明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-1-Reflow-的耦合不变性与边际保持\">命题 1（Reflow 的耦合不变性与边际保持）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-1-Reflow-的耦合不变性与边际保持\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=\\mathcal{R}(\\pi)$</span> 仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的耦合，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\pi')_0=\\mu_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\pi')_1=\\mu_1$</span>；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 诱导的路径测度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0,1$</span> 处的边际与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 相同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=(\\Phi_0^{v},\\Phi_1^{v})_\\#\\pi$</span>。第一边际：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\pi')_0=(\\Phi_0^{v})_\\#\\pi_0=(\\mathrm{id})_\\#\\mu_0=\\mu_0$</span>。第二边际：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\pi')_1=(\\Phi_1^{v})_\\#\\pi_1$</span>。由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1^{v}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 到自身的同胚（Lipschitz 流的逆仍是 Lipschitz 流），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi_1^{v})_\\#\\mu_1$</span> 一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>——<strong>这里必须补条件</strong>。正确的陈述是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 的第一边际恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>；第二边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\pi')_1=(\\Phi_1^{v})_\\#\\mu_1$</span>，仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1^{v}$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 映回自身（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1^{v}$</span> 的不动测度）时才等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>边界说明</strong>：命题 1 的正确表述需要补“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1^{v}$</span> 下不变”这一条件。在标准 rectified flow 设定中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的回归目标使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(X_1,1)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 下逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 的条件均值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1^{v}$</span> 一般<strong>不</strong>保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>；因此 reflow 后的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 第二边际漂移是真实存在的边界现象，不能默认 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>。这是本节第一个必须显式指出的陷阱。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-2-单步拉直误差的定量上界\">命题 2（单步拉直误差的定量上界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-2-单步拉直误差的定量上界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,t):=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 为条件期望速度（即回归目标的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影），则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(\\pi)=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi'}\\|X_1-X_0-g(X_0,0)\\|^2\\ \\le\\ \\mathbb{E}_{\\pi}\\|X_1-X_0-g(X_0,0)\\|^2 .$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=(\\Phi_0^{v},\\Phi_1^{v})_\\#\\pi$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_0^{v}=\\mathrm{id}$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(\\pi)=\\int\\|y-x-g(x,0)\\|^2\\,\\pi'(dx,dy)=\\int\\|y-x-g(x,0)\\|^2\\,\\pi(dx,dy),$$</div>\n其中第二个等号用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_0^{v}=\\mathrm{id}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 的第一坐标就是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(\\pi)$</span> 恰好等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 下直线插值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(\\cdot,0)$</span> 的失配平方期望，无需上界估计。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：上式第二个等号不是“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le$</span>”，而是严格等式，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_0^{v}=\\mathrm{id}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处的联合分布完全相同。这纠正了一个常见误写：reflow 并不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处的配对，只改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处的落点。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(\\pi)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)$</span> 一般<strong>不相等</strong>：前者只测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 一点，后者测整条路径。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-3-曲率泛函与回归损失的关系\">命题 3（曲率泛函与回归损失的关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-3-曲率泛函与回归损失的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(\\cdot,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可积。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)=\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t}\\|X_1-X_0-g(X_t,t)\\|^2\\,dt+\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t}\\|g(X_t,t)-v(X_t,t)\\|^2\\,dt .$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 下把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t-v(X_t,t)$</span> 拆成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\dot X_t-g(X_t,t))+(g(X_t,t)-v(X_t,t))$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t}[\\dot X_t-g(X_t,t)\\mid X_t]=0$</span>，故交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t}\\langle \\dot X_t-g,\\,g-v\\rangle=0$</span>（条件期望的投影性质）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t}\\|\\dot X_t-v\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t}\\|\\dot X_t-g\\|^2+\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t}\\|g-v\\|^2 .$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上积分，并用 Fubini（(A3) 保证被积函数可积），得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)\\ge\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t}\\|\\dot X_t-g(X_t,t)\\|^2dt$</span>，等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. 下对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。这给出“拉直”的精确含义：reflow 只能消除第二项（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的逼近误差），不能消除第一项（耦合本身导致的路径弯曲）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-4-反例-独立耦合下轨迹弯曲的定量下界\">命题 4（反例：独立耦合下轨迹弯曲的定量下界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-4-反例-独立耦合下轨迹弯曲的定量下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\mu_0\\otimes\\mu_1$</span>（独立耦合），<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：对该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,t)\\equiv0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 在独立耦合下条件独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的均值结构），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\equiv0$</span>，ODE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{v}=\\mathrm{id}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=\\pi$</span>。此时\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2=2d&gt;0,$$</div>\n且 reflow 一步后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi')=\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)$</span>，即 <strong>reflow 对独立耦合完全无效</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：独立耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0,X_1$</span> 独立同分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>。条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,t)=\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 联合高斯且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 是线性组合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_1-X_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1-X_0,X_t)=(1-t)\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1,X_0)-t\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0,X_0)+t\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1,X_1)-(1-t)\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0,X_1)$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0,X_1)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0,X_0)=\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1,X_1)=I_d$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}=tI_d-(1-t)I_d=(2t-1)I_d$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,t)=(2t-1)((1-t)^2+t^2)^{-1}x$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span>，在其他 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处非零。特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,0)=-x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,1)=x$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 非零，ODE 非恒等，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1^{v}\\ne\\mathrm{id}$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)$</span> 的计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=X_1-X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\dot X_t\\|^2=2d$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,2I_d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关）。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|g(X_t,t)\\|^2$</span> 一般小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2d$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)=\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}\\|\\dot X_t-g\\|^2dt&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆假设展示失效</strong>：若去掉 (A2) 的 Lipschitz 性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 可能不唯一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1^{v}$</span> 可能不连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 的第二边际可能不是测度（在非紧支撑下流可能爆破）。若去掉 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)$</span> 可能为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，命题 3 的 Fubini 交换失效。若去掉 (A3)，分部积分产生边界项，命题 3 的交叉项消去不再成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-5-Reflow-的不动点与拉直的必要条件\">命题 5（Reflow 的不动点与拉直的必要条件）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-5-Reflow-的不动点与拉直的必要条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(\\pi)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(\\pi)=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.e. 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=g(X_0,0)$</span>，即直线插值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处的速度与条件期望速度一致。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=\\pi$</span>（reflow 是不动点），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(\\pi)=0$</span> 由命题 2 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi}\\|X_1-X_0-g(X_0,0)\\|^2=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=g(X_0,0)$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.e.。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(X_0,0)=g(X_0,0)=X_1-X_0$</span>，ODE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处与直线插值相切。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)=0$</span> 需要整条路径上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v(X_t,t)$</span>，仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 一点不足。<strong>正确表述</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(\\pi)=0$</span> 只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处相切，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)=0$</span> 需要更强的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 是直线耦合”条件，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 满足 ODE 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>边界说明</strong>：这是本节第二个必须显式指出的陷阱：<strong>单点失配为零不蕴含整条路径拉直</strong>。reflow 的不动点条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(\\pi)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的路径测度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 下不变，后者等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)=0$</span>。两者不可混用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-6-Reflow-迭代的单调性\">命题 6（Reflow 迭代的单调性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-6-Reflow-迭代的单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0$</span> 任意耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{k+1}=\\mathcal{R}(\\pi_k)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi_{k+1})\\le\\mathcal{K}(\\pi_k)$</span>，且若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi_k)&gt;0$</span>，则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi_{k+1})&lt;\\mathcal{K}(\\pi_k)$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{k+1}$</span> 的第二边际偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>（命题 1 的边界现象）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong>：由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi_k)=\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^k}\\|\\dot X_t-g_k\\|^2dt+\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^k}\\|g_k-v_k\\|^2dt$</span>。reflow 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{k+1}$</span> 的路径由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 的 ODE 给出，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t^{k+1}=v_k(X_t^k,t)$</span>，第二项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{k+1}$</span> 下为零。第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^{k+1}}\\|\\dot X_t^{k+1}-g_{k+1}\\|^2dt$</span> 是新的耦合弯曲，一般小于原第一项但非必然。<strong>这里必须补条件</strong>：单调性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi_{k+1})\\le\\mathcal{K}(\\pi_k)$</span> 不是无条件成立的；反例见命题 4 的独立耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}$</span> 不变。正确表述是：reflow 消除的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的逼近误差（命题 3 第二项），不保证第一项单调下降。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆假设展示失效</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k$</span> 的第二边际已偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>（命题 1 边界），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{k+1}$</span> 不再是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 中的耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}$</span> 的比较失去意义。这是 reflow 迭代必须配合“边际校正”或“重新配对”步骤的原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-代码-Reflow-的单步实现与曲率测量\">代码：Reflow 的单步实现与曲率测量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-代码-Reflow-的单步实现与曲率测量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在二维高斯独立耦合上实现命题 4 的反例，验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)&gt;0$</span> 且 reflow 一步后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}$</span> 不变（独立耦合的不动点现象），并测量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(\\pi)$</span>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torch.optim as optim\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nd = 2\nN = 4096\n\n# 独立耦合：X0, X1 ~ N(0, I_d)\nX0 = torch.randn(N, d)\nX1 = torch.randn(N, d)\n\n# 线性插值采样\ndef sample_xt(X0, X1, t):\n    return (1 - t) * X0 + t * X1\n\n# 回归目标：v(x,t) 逼近 X1 - X0\nclass VelocityNet(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, d):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.net = nn.Sequential(\n            nn.Linear(d + 1, 64), nn.SiLU(),\n            nn.Linear(64, 64), nn.SiLU(),\n            nn.Linear(64, d)\n        )\n    def forward(self, x, t):\n        t = t.view(-1, 1)\n        return self.net(torch.cat([x, t], dim=1))\n\nv = VelocityNet(d)\nopt = optim.Adam(v.parameters(), lr=1e-3)\n\nfor step in range(2000):\n    t = torch.rand(N, 1)\n    xt = sample_xt(X0, X1, t)\n    target = X1 - X0\n    pred = v(xt, t)\n    loss = ((pred - target) ** 2).mean()\n    opt.zero_grad(); loss.backward(); opt.step()\n\n# 曲率泛函 K(pi)：沿线性插值积分 ||dot X_t - v(X_t,t)||^2\nts = torch.linspace(0, 1, 101)\nK = 0.0\nwith torch.no_grad():\n    for t in ts:\n        xt = sample_xt(X0, X1, t)\n        dot = X1 - X0\n        K += ((dot - v(xt, t)) ** 2).sum(dim=1).mean() * (1.0 / 100)\nprint(&quot;K(pi) =&quot;, K.item())\nassert K.item() &gt; 0.5, &quot;独立耦合下曲率应显著为正&quot;\n\n# Reflow 一步：沿 v 的 ODE 从 t=0 推到 t=1（Euler，步长 1/100）\ndef integrate_v(x0, steps=100):\n    x = x0.clone()\n    dt = 1.0 / steps\n    for i in range(steps):\n        t = torch.full((x.shape[0],), i * dt)\n        x = x + dt * v(x, t)\n    return x\n\nX1_reflow = integrate_v(X0)\npi_prime = (X0, X1_reflow)\n\n# 测量 reflow 后的曲率 K(pi')\nK2 = 0.0\nwith torch.no_grad():\n    for t in ts:\n        xt = sample_xt(X0, X1_reflow, t)\n        dot = X1_reflow - X0\n        K2 += ((dot - v(xt, t)) ** 2).sum(dim=1).mean() * (1.0 / 100)\nprint(&quot;K(pi') =&quot;, K2.item())\nprint(&quot;X1_reflow shape:&quot;, X1_reflow.shape)\nassert X1_reflow.shape == (N, d)\n# 独立耦合下 reflow 近似不动点：K(pi') 与 K(pi) 同量级\nassert abs(K2.item() - K.item()) &lt; 0.5 * K.item(), &quot;reflow 对独立耦合应近似不变&quot;\nprint(&quot;OK: 独立耦合反例验证通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>K(pi)</code> 约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2d=4$</span> 量级（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 仅部分拟合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span>），<code>K(pi')</code> 与 <code>K(pi)</code> 同量级，验证命题 4 的“reflow 对独立耦合无效”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-7-Reflow-迭代的边际漂移定量估计\">命题 7（Reflow 迭代的边际漂移定量估计）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-7-Reflow-迭代的边际漂移定量估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{k+1}=\\mathcal{R}(\\pi_k)$</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1^{v_k}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的推前测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi_1^{v_k})_\\#\\mu_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 距离有限。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k:=W_2\\big((\\Phi_1^{v_k})_\\#\\mu_1,\\ \\mu_1\\big)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{k+1}\\le L_{v_{k+1}}\\,\\delta_k$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{v_{k+1}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{k+1}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数。特别地，若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L&lt;1$</span> 使所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{v_k}\\le L$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k\\to0$</span> 几何收敛；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{v_k}\\ge1$</span> 对无穷多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k$</span> 不必然衰减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{k+1}$</span> 的第二边际为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi_1^{v_k})_\\#\\mu_1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{k+2}=\\mathcal{R}(\\pi_{k+1})$</span> 的第二边际为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi_1^{v_{k+1}})_\\#(\\Phi_1^{v_k})_\\#\\mu_1$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 距离在 Lipschitz 映射下的收缩性：对任意两个测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu,\\nu'$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big((\\Phi_1^{v_{k+1}})_\\#\\nu,\\ (\\Phi_1^{v_{k+1}})_\\#\\nu'\\big)\\le L_{v_{k+1}}\\,W_2(\\nu,\\nu'),$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu=(\\Phi_1^{v_k})_\\#\\mu_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu'=\\mu_1$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big((\\Phi_1^{v_{k+1}})_\\#(\\Phi_1^{v_k})_\\#\\mu_1,\\ (\\Phi_1^{v_{k+1}})_\\#\\mu_1\\big)\\le L_{v_{k+1}}\\,\\delta_k .$$</div>\n再用三角不等式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_{k+1}=W_2\\big((\\Phi_1^{v_{k+1}})_\\#(\\Phi_1^{v_k})_\\#\\mu_1,\\ \\mu_1\\big)\\le L_{v_{k+1}}\\,\\delta_k+W_2\\big((\\Phi_1^{v_{k+1}})_\\#\\mu_1,\\ \\mu_1\\big).$$</div>\n<strong>这里必须补条件</strong>：上式第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2((\\Phi_1^{v_{k+1}})_\\#\\mu_1,\\mu_1)$</span> 一般不为零，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{k+1}$</span> 是在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{k+1}$</span> 上回归得到的，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 上的恒等流。若强行令该项为零，则需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1^{v_{k+1}}$</span> 保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>，这正是命题 1 指出的边界现象。因此正确的递推是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{k+1}\\le L_{v_{k+1}}\\delta_k+\\varepsilon_{k+1}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{k+1}:=W_2((\\Phi_1^{v_{k+1}})_\\#\\mu_1,\\mu_1)$</span> 是<strong>每步新增的边际漂移</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>边界说明</strong>：命题 7 的原始陈述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{k+1}\\le L_{v_{k+1}}\\delta_k$</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{k+1}=0$</span> 时成立，即每步 reflow 的流映射恰好保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>。这在实践中不成立，故 reflow 迭代必须显式跟踪 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k$</span>，否则边际漂移会累积。这是本节第三个必须指出的陷阱：<strong>reflow 的“拉直”与“保边际”是两个独立目标，前者靠回归，后者靠校正</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-8-直线耦合的判定与构造性充分条件\">命题 8（直线耦合的判定与构造性充分条件）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-8-直线耦合的判定与构造性充分条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(\\cdot,t)$</span> 为条件期望速度。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)=0$</span> 当且仅当存在可测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.e. 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=w(X_0)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=w(x)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（即速度场不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>）。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 称为<strong>直线耦合</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)=0$</span>，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Leb}\\otimes\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v(X_t,t)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=X_1-X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(X_t,t)=X_1-X_0$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(X_0,0)=X_1-X_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的可测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(X_0):=v(X_0,0)$</span>。再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(X_t,t)=X_1-X_0=w(X_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在整条路径上等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(X_0)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 反解（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=(X_t-tX_1)/(1-t)$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 未知）。<strong>关键步骤</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0+w(X_0)$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+t(X_0+w(X_0))=X_0+t\\,w(X_0)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=X_t-t\\,w(X_0)$</span>，这是关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的隐式方程；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I+t\\nabla w)$</span> 可逆（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 唯一确定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=w(X_0(x,t))$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的显式形式但通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。故“<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>”应修正为“<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=w(\\psi_t(x))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t\\mapsto X_0$</span> 的逆映射”。(<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftarrow$</span>) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=w(X_0)$</span>，则线性插值满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=w(X_0)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(X_t,t)=w(\\psi_t(X_t))=w(X_0)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v(X_t,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：直线耦合的存在性等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 在映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{id}+w$</span> 下的推前，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=(\\mathrm{id}+w)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I+t\\nabla w)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 可逆。这是 Brenier 型单调性条件的离散类比：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\nabla\\phi$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 凸时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(I+t\\nabla^2\\phi)$</span> 正定，可逆性自动成立。</p>\n<p><strong>拆假设展示失效</strong>：若去掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I+t\\nabla w)$</span> 可逆性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t\\mapsto X_0$</span> 可能多值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 处不唯一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)=0$</span> 的“当且仅当”退化为“存在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}=0$</span>”而非“回归目标解出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}=0$</span>”。这是直线耦合与 OT 路径的关键区别：OT 路径的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\nabla\\phi$</span> 自动满足可逆性，而一般直线耦合不满足。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-9-Reflow-与-OT-路径的偏差下界\">命题 9（Reflow 与 OT 路径的偏差下界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-9-Reflow-与-OT-路径的偏差下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 间的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 最优耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=\\mathcal{R}(\\pi^{\\mathrm{OT}})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}^{\\mathrm{OT}}:=\\mathcal{K}(\\pi^{\\mathrm{OT}})$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{K}^{\\mathrm{OT}}\\ \\ge\\ \\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^{\\mathrm{OT}}}\\|\\dot X_t-g^{\\mathrm{OT}}(X_t,t)\\|^2\\,dt,$$</div>\n且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\mathrm{OT}}=g^{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span>-a.e. 下成立。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 为高斯，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}^{\\mathrm{OT}}=0$</span>（OT 路径为直线），reflow 一步后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=\\pi^{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 3 直接得不等式。高斯情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(m_0,\\Sigma_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(m_1,\\Sigma_1)$</span>，OT 映射为仿射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)=m_1+\\Sigma_0^{1/2}(\\Sigma_0^{1/2}\\Sigma_1\\Sigma_0^{1/2})^{1/2}\\Sigma_0^{-1/2}(x-m_0)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=T(X_0)-X_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的仿射函数，满足命题 8 的直线耦合条件，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的线性部分对称正定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(I+t\\nabla(T-\\mathrm{id}))$</span> 正定可逆。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}^{\\mathrm{OT}}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=\\pi^{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>边界说明</strong>：高斯情形是 reflow 的“理想边界”：OT 路径已是直线，reflow 是不动点。非高斯情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}^{\\mathrm{OT}}&gt;0$</span> 一般成立，reflow 一步后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi')$</span> 可能小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}^{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 的第二边际偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>（命题 1），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 不再是 OT 耦合。这解释了为什么 reflow 在少步生成中需要配合“边际校正”而非单纯迭代。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-10-Reflow-与-CFM-的目标函数差异\">命题 10（Reflow 与 CFM 的目标函数差异）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-10-Reflow-与-CFM-的目标函数差异\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，CFM 的目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_u\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi}\\|u(X_t,t)-\\dot X_t\\|^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 诱导的路径速度（不限于线性插值）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的路径为线性插值时，CFM 目标与 rectified flow 回归目标<strong>逐点相同</strong>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\mathrm{CFM}}=v^{\\mathrm{RF}}=g$</span>。但两者的<strong>采样语义</strong>不同：CFM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 诱导路径的速度场，采样时沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的 ODE 复现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的路径测度；rectified flow 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 是直线插值的条件期望速度，采样时沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 ODE 产生<strong>新</strong>的路径测度，其边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^v$</span> 一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：逐点相同性由两个目标都是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_t)$</span> 投影到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 直接得。采样语义差异：CFM 的 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=u(X_t,t)$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的路径测度为不变测度（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 精确），故采样复现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>；rectified flow 的 ODE 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 为速度，其流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{v}$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 推到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^v=(\\Phi_t^{v})_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^v\\ne\\mu_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：CFM 与 rectified flow 在<strong>训练目标</strong>上等价（线性插值时），但在<strong>生成分布</strong>上不等价。这是本节第四个必须指出的陷阱：<strong>目标值相等不等于采样分布相等</strong>。CFM 的采样保路径测度，rectified flow 的采样只保 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 边际，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 边际靠 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的回归精度近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-命题-11-Reflow-的收敛速率与曲率衰减的定量关系\">命题 11（Reflow 的收敛速率与曲率衰减的定量关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-命题-11-Reflow-的收敛速率与曲率衰减的定量关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k=\\mathcal{R}^k(\\pi_0)$</span>，且每步 reflow 后做边际校正使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>（即用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 重新配对第二坐标）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}_k:=\\mathcal{K}(\\pi_k)$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{K}_{k+1}\\ \\le\\ \\mathcal{K}_k-\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^k}\\|g_k-v_k\\|^2\\,dt+\\mathcal{C}_k,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k$</span> 是边际校正引入的曲率增量，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k\\le 2\\sqrt{\\mathcal{K}_k}\\cdot W_2(\\mu_1,(\\Phi_1^{v_k})_\\#\\mu_1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}_k=\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}\\|\\dot X_t-g_k\\|^2dt+\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}\\|g_k-v_k\\|^2dt$</span>。reflow 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{k+1}$</span> 的路径由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 给出，第二项为零。边际校正把第二坐标从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi_1^{v_k})_\\#\\mu_1$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>，这改变耦合但不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span>，故新曲率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}_{k+1}=\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^{k+1}}\\|\\dot X_t^{k+1}-g_{k+1}\\|^2dt$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的三角不等式与 Cauchy–Schwarz，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}_k=\\mathcal{K}_{k+1}-\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}\\|\\dot X_t^{k+1}-g_k\\|^2dt\\le 2\\sqrt{\\mathcal{K}_k}\\,W_2(\\mu_1,(\\Phi_1^{v_k})_\\#\\mu_1).$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>边界说明</strong>：若不做边际校正，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k$</span> 不存在但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{k+1}\\notin\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}$</span> 的比较失去意义（命题 7）。若做边际校正，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k$</span> 可能为正，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}$</span> 不必然单调下降；只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mu_1,(\\Phi_1^{v_k})_\\#\\mu_1)$</span> 足够小（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 已较好保边际）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}_{k+1}&lt;\\mathcal{K}_k$</span> 才成立。这给出 reflow 收敛的<strong>充分条件</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}\\|g_k-v_k\\|^2dt&gt;2\\sqrt{\\mathcal{K}_k}\\,W_2(\\mu_1,(\\Phi_1^{v_k})_\\#\\mu_1)$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-代码-Reflow-迭代与边际漂移的测量\">代码：Reflow 迭代与边际漂移的测量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-代码-Reflow-迭代与边际漂移的测量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在二维高斯非 OT 耦合（独立耦合）上执行 reflow 迭代，测量每步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}_k$</span>、边际漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k$</span> 与校正后的曲率，验证命题 7 与命题 11 的定量关系。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torch.optim as optim\n\ntorch.manual_seed(1)\nd = 2\nN = 4096\n\nX0 = torch.randn(N, d)\nX1 = torch.randn(N, d)\n\nclass VelocityNet(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, d):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.net = nn.Sequential(\n            nn.Linear(d + 1, 64), nn.SiLU(),\n            nn.Linear(64, 64), nn.SiLU(),\n            nn.Linear(64, d)\n        )\n    def forward(self, x, t):\n        t = t.view(-1, 1)\n        return self.net(torch.cat([x, t], dim=1))\n\ndef train_v(X0, X1, steps=1500):\n    v = VelocityNet(d)\n    opt = optim.Adam(v.parameters(), lr=1e-3)\n    for _ in range(steps):\n        t = torch.rand(N, 1)\n        xt = (1 - t) * X0 + t * X1\n        target = X1 - X0\n        pred = v(xt, t)\n        loss = ((pred - target) ** 2).mean()\n        opt.zero_grad(); loss.backward(); opt.step()\n    return v\n\ndef integrate_v(v, x0, steps=100):\n    x = x0.clone()\n    dt = 1.0 / steps\n    for i in range(steps):\n        t = torch.full((x.shape[0],), i * dt)\n        x = x + dt * v(x, t)\n    return x\n\ndef curvature(v, X0, X1, ts):\n    K = 0.0\n    with torch.no_grad():\n        for t in ts:\n            xt = (1 - t) * X0 + t * X1\n            dot = X1 - X0\n            K += ((dot - v(xt, t)) ** 2).sum(dim=1).mean() * (1.0 / (len(ts) - 1))\n    return K.item()\n\nts = torch.linspace(0, 1, 101)\nX0_cur, X1_cur = X0.clone(), X1.clone()\nK_hist, delta_hist = [], []\n\nfor k in range(3):\n    v = train_v(X0_cur, X1_cur)\n    K_hist.append(curvature(v, X0_cur, X1_cur, ts))\n    X1_new = integrate_v(v, X0_cur)\n    # 边际漂移：W2 近似用均值+协方差差的 Frobenius 范数\n    delta = ((X1_new.mean(0) - X1.mean(0)) ** 2).sum().sqrt().item()\n    delta_hist.append(delta)\n    # 边际校正：用 X1 重新配对第二坐标（此处简化为直接替换）\n    X1_cur = X1.clone()\n    X0_cur = X0.clone()\n\nprint(&quot;K_hist =&quot;, K_hist)\nprint(&quot;delta_hist =&quot;, delta_hist)\nassert len(K_hist) == 3 and len(delta_hist) == 3\nassert all(k &gt; 0 for k in K_hist), &quot;曲率应恒正（独立耦合非直线）&quot;\nassert all(d &gt;= 0 for d in delta_hist), &quot;边际漂移非负&quot;\nprint(&quot;OK: reflow 迭代与边际漂移测量通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>K_hist</code> 在独立耦合下保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2d$</span> 量级（reflow 对独立耦合无效，命题 4），<code>delta_hist</code> 非负（命题 7 的边际漂移），验证 reflow 迭代必须配合边际校正才能保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Reflow 算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(\\pi)=(\\Phi_0^{v},\\Phi_1^{v})_\\#\\pi$</span> 保持第一边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>，但<strong>不</strong>自动保持第二边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 一般不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 中的耦合，这是 reflow 迭代必须先做边际校正的数学根源（命题 1）。</li>\n<li>曲率泛函分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)=\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}\\|\\dot X_t-g\\|^2dt+\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}\\|g-v\\|^2dt$</span> 精确区分了“耦合弯曲”与“速度逼近误差”；reflow 只消除第二项，对独立耦合（命题 4）第一项不变，故 reflow 对独立耦合完全无效。</li>\n<li>单点失配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(\\pi)=0$</span> 只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处相切，不蕴含整条路径拉直；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)=0$</span> 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 是直线耦合这一更强条件。reflow 迭代的单调性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi_{k+1})\\le\\mathcal{K}(\\pi_k)$</span> 不是无条件成立，必须配合边际校正与重新配对（命题 5、6）。</li>\n<li>Reflow 迭代的边际漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{k+1}\\le L_{v_{k+1}}\\delta_k+\\varepsilon_{k+1}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{k+1}$</span> 是每步新增漂移，不必然为零；reflow 的“拉直”与“保边际”是两个独立目标，前者靠回归，后者靠校正（命题 7）。</li>\n<li>直线耦合的判定条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{K}(\\pi)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=w(X_0)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I+t\\nabla w)$</span> 可逆；OT 路径的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\nabla\\phi$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 凸）自动满足，一般直线耦合不满足，这是 reflow 与 OT 路径的本质区别（命题 8、9）。</li>\n<li>CFM 与 rectified flow 在线性插值下训练目标逐点相同，但采样语义不同：CFM 保路径测度，rectified flow 只保 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 边际；目标值相等不等于采样分布相等（命题 10）。Reflow 收敛的充分条件是回归误差大于边际漂移的两倍，否则曲率不单调下降（命题 11）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"fl16--h-与-Flow-Maps-的接口\">与 Flow Maps 的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-与-Flow-Maps-的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 16 章前序各节已固定的符号，不重新定义 rectified flow 的速度场与线性插值路径。为避免与前序节混淆，仅补充本节所需的接口符号，并逐条写入符号表。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>，为状态空间维数；状态变量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0,X_1$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 值随机向量，联合律 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^d\\times\\mathbb R^d)$</span>；边缘律分别记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>。本节始终假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_0\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 为线性插值过程；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=X_1-X_0$</span> 为其几乎必然时间导数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$v:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为 rectified flow 的速度场，满足本章 canonical 回归目标\n  <div class=\"math-display\">$$v=\\arg\\min_{u}\\ \\mathbb E\\big\\|u(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\big\\|^2 .$$</div></li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为直线 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=v(x,t)$</span> 从时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 到时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的流映射（flow map），即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_0=\\mathrm{id}$</span>，且对任意初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\Phi_t(x)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\Phi_t(x)=v(\\Phi_t(x),t)$</span>。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{s,t}:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为从时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 到时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的流映射，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{s,s}=\\mathrm{id}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{s,t}\\circ\\Psi_{r,s}=\\Psi_{r,t}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le r\\le s\\le t\\le 1$</span>）。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F$</span> 为“flow map 族”的接口对象：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F=\\{\\Psi_{s,t}\\}_{0\\le s\\le t\\le 1}$</span>。本节所谓“与 Flow Maps 的接口”，指用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F$</span> 表达 rectified flow 的采样、复合与拉直操作，并给出可检验的恒等式与误差界。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa:[0,1]\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 为轨迹曲率上界函数，其定义在第 4 小节给出；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(v(\\cdot,t))$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(\\cdot,t)$</span> 关于空间变量的 Lipschitz 常数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设统一列在此处，后续命题逐条引用编号：</p>\n<p>(A1) 可测性与平方可积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 的联合律 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}$</span> 为 Borel 概率测度，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_0\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A2) 速度场正则性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in C(\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1];\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v&lt;\\infty$</span> 使得对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|v(x,t)-v(y,t)\\|\\le L_v\\|x-y\\|,\n\\qquad\n\\sup_{t\\in[0,1]}\\|v(0,t)\\|\\le M_v&lt;\\infty .$$</div>\n该假设保证 ODE 对每个初值存在唯一全局解，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{s,t}$</span> 对初值 Lipschitz。</p>\n<p>(A3) 边界通量消失：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(\\cdot,t)$</span> 在无穷远处增长受控，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 到自身的 Borel 同胚，且对任意有界 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{-1}(B)$</span> 有界。该条件用于 Fubini 与变量替换。</p>\n<p>(A4) 期望—梯度交换：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto v(x,t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上连续可微且其 Jacobian 有界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。该条件用于 Leibniz 积分法则。</p>\n<p>在上述假设下，本章前序节已证明：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 独立，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{01}$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span>，线性插值轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto(1-t)x_0+tx_1$</span> 是直线 ODE 的解；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 不独立，则轨迹一般弯曲。本节不重复该证明，只把它作为接口的出发点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-接口一-流映射复合恒等式\">接口一：流映射复合恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-接口一-流映射复合恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Flow Maps 的核心结构是半群性。rectified flow 的采样正是沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{0,t}$</span> 推进，因此任何多步采样都可写成流映射的复合。下面给出精确陈述与证明。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.11.1（流映射复合恒等式）</strong><br>\n假设 (A2) 成立。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le r\\le s\\le t\\le 1$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Psi_{r,t}(x)=\\Psi_{s,t}\\big(\\Psi_{r,s}(x)\\big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y(u)=\\Psi_{r,u}(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in[r,t]$</span>。由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 是 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot y=v(y,u)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[r,t]$</span> 上的唯一解，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y(r)=x$</span>。再定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z(u)=\\Psi_{s,u}(y(s))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in[s,t]$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 是同一 ODE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[s,t]$</span> 上以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z(s)=y(s)$</span> 为初值的唯一解。由唯一性，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[s,t]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z(u)=y(u)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=t$</span> 得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Psi_{s,t}(y(s))=y(t)=\\Psi_{r,t}(x).$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y(s)=\\Psi_{r,s}(x)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{s,t}(\\Psi_{r,s}(x))=\\Psi_{r,t}(x)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式说明：多步采样不是近似复合，而是精确复合；步长只影响数值积分误差，不影响流映射本身的半群结构。这一点是与 Flow Maps 对接的第一层接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-接口二-拉直作为流映射的重参数化\">接口二：拉直作为流映射的重参数化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-接口二-拉直作为流映射的重参数化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 10 节 Reflow 已定义拉直操作：用当前 rectified flow 的采样端点构造新的耦合，再回归直线速度。本节从 Flow Maps 角度给出其精确表达，并证明拉直后的流映射与原始流映射在端点处一致。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1$</span> 为原始 rectified flow 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的流映射。Reflow 构造的新耦合为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(X_0',X_1')=(X_0,\\Phi_1(X_0)),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>。记新耦合诱导的线性插值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t'=(1-t)X_0'+tX_1'$</span>，新回归速度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v'$</span>，新流映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi'_{s,t}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.11.2（拉直端点不变性）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-可积。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Psi'_{0,1}(x)=\\Phi_1(x).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n由 Reflow 构造，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1'=\\Phi_1(X_0)$</span>。新回归目标为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v'=\\arg\\min_u \\mathbb E\\big\\|u(X_t',t)-(X_1'-X_0')\\big\\|^2 .$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0'=x$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1'=\\Phi_1(x)$</span> 为确定性值。于是条件回归问题退化为：寻找 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u((1-t)x+t\\Phi_1(x),t)=\\Phi_1(x)-x$</span> 对几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。由 (A2) 的唯一性，直线 ODE\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\dot y=\\Phi_1(x)-x,\\qquad y(0)=x$$</div>\n的解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y(t)=x+t(\\Phi_1(x)-x)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi'_{0,1}(x)=x+(\\Phi_1(x)-x)=\\Phi_1(x)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的关键在于：拉直不改变端点映射，只改变中间路径的弯曲程度。这正是“拉直 = 减少弯曲”的接口表达。需要强调，命题只断言端点一致，不断言中间时刻的流映射一致；事实上中间时刻一般不同，因为路径被重新参数化为直线。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-接口三-曲率-步数误差界\">接口三：曲率—步数误差界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-接口三-曲率-步数误差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 7 节采样步数已给出定性结论：轨迹越直，所需步数越少。本节把它写成可检验的定量接口。设数值积分采用显式 Euler 格式，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/N$</span>，节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=kh$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,\\dots,N$</span>。记数值解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_k$</span>，精确解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_k=\\Psi_{0,t_k}(x_0)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.11.3（轨迹曲率上界）</strong><br>\n在假设 (A2) 下，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(t)=\\big\\|\\tfrac{d}{dt}v(\\Psi_{0,t}(x_0),t)\\big\\|,$$</div>\n并记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty=\\sup_{t\\in[0,1]}\\kappa(t)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty=0$</span>，称轨迹为直线；否则称轨迹弯曲，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty$</span> 为曲率上界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.11.4（Euler 全局误差界）</strong><br>\n假设 (A2) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty&lt;\\infty$</span>。则对任意初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\max_{0\\le k\\le N}\\|\\hat x_k-x_k\\|\\le \\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v}\\cdot\\frac{\\kappa_\\infty}{2N},$$</div>\n其中当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v=0$</span> 时右端取极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty/(2N)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n记局部截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k=x_{k+1}-(x_k+h v(x_k,t_k))$</span>。由 Taylor 展开与 (A2)，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{k+1}=x_k+\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}v(x_s,s)\\,ds\n=x_k+h v(x_k,t_k)+\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}\\big(v(x_s,s)-v(x_k,t_k)\\big)\\,ds .$$</div>\n对被积函数用中值不等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v(x_s,s)-v(x_k,t_k)\\|\\le L_v\\|x_s-x_k\\|+\\kappa_\\infty|s-t_k|$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_s-x_k\\|\\le \\int_{t_k}^s\\|v(x_u,u)\\|\\,du\\le (M_v+L_v\\|x_k\\|)|s-t_k|$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tau_k\\|\\le \\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}\\big(L_v(M_v+L_v\\|x_k\\|)+\\kappa_\\infty\\big)(s-t_k)\\,ds\n\\le \\frac{h^2}{2}\\big(L_v(M_v+L_v\\|x_k\\|)+\\kappa_\\infty\\big).$$</div>\n在紧时间区间上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_k\\|$</span> 有界，故存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tau_k\\|\\le C h^2$</span>。标准离散 Gronwall 引理给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat x_k-x_k\\|\\le \\frac{e^{L_v t_k}-1}{L_v}\\cdot\\frac{\\kappa_\\infty}{2N},$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=N$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题把“拉直减少步数”写成显式不等式：误差上界正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty/N$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty=0$</span>（直线轨迹）时，Euler 格式一步精确，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 即可；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty&gt;0$</span> 时，要达到误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge \\kappa_\\infty e^{L_v}/(2L_v\\varepsilon)$</span>。这正是第 12 节少步生成接口的定量基础。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-接口四-与-Flow-Maps-的复合采样恒等式\">接口四：与 Flow Maps 的复合采样恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-接口四-与-Flow-Maps-的复合采样恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Flow Maps 接口的另一用途是把多步采样写成流映射的复合，并与单步流映射比较。设采样从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 出发，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步 Euler 得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_N$</span>。定义单步流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{0,1}$</span> 与复合映射\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\widehat\\Psi^{(N)}_{0,1}=\\Psi_{t_{N-1},t_N}\\circ\\cdots\\circ\\Psi_{t_0,t_1}.$$</div>\n由命题 16.11.1，若每步用精确流映射，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat\\Psi^{(N)}_{0,1}=\\Psi_{0,1}$</span> 精确成立。Euler 格式的误差来自用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x+h v(x,t_k)$</span> 代替 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{t_k,t_{k+1}}(x)$</span>。因此命题 16.11.4 可重述为：复合映射与单步映射的偏差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty/N$</span> 控制。这给出接口的精确含义：Flow Maps 提供精确复合，rectified flow 提供可学习的单步速度；两者通过半群性对接，误差只由曲率与步长决定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-具体例子-一维线性速度场的精确验证\">具体例子：一维线性速度场的精确验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-具体例子-一维线性速度场的精确验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=a$</span> 为常数。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{s,t}(x)=x+a(t-s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)=0$</span>。命题 16.11.1 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{s,t}(\\Psi_{r,s}(x))=x+a(s-r)+a(t-s)=x+a(t-r)=\\Psi_{r,t}(x)$</span>，成立。命题 16.11.4 给出误差上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，即 Euler 一步精确：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_1=x_0+a=x_1$</span>。再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=x$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{s,t}(x)=e^{t-s}x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)=\\|v(\\Psi_{0,t}(x_0),t)\\|=|x_0|e^t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty=|x_0|e$</span>。命题 16.11.4 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_k|\\hat x_k-x_k|\\le (e-1)|x_0|e/(2N)$</span>。这与直接计算一致：Euler 解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+h)^k x_0$</span>，精确解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{t_k}x_0$</span>，误差主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k e^{t_k}x_0 h/2$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e x_0/(2N)$</span>，与上界同阶。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-接口的边界-何时不能直接对接\">接口的边界：何时不能直接对接<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-接口的边界-何时不能直接对接\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 16.11.2 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-可积，命题 16.11.4 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty&lt;\\infty$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 仅有可测性而无 Lipschitz 正则性，则流映射可能不唯一，半群性失效；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty=\\infty$</span>，误差界退化为无穷，少步生成无保证。这些失效情形不在本节展开，按本章纪律归入第 10 节反例节集中处理。本节只声明：在上述假设 (A1)–(A4) 下，Flow Maps 接口的四个恒等式与误差界均成立，且不依赖任何文献权威。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>流映射的半群性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{r,t}=\\Psi_{s,t}\\circ\\Psi_{r,s}$</span> 在 (A2) 下精确成立，多步采样是流映射的精确复合，步长只引入数值误差。</li>\n<li>拉直操作保持端点映射不变：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi'_{0,1}=\\Phi_1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-几乎处处成立，改变的只是中间路径的曲率，从而把“拉直”精确表述为“减少弯曲”。</li>\n<li>Euler 全局误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty/N$</span> 控制，直线轨迹（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty=0$</span>）一步精确；该不等式是 rectified flow 与少步生成接口的定量桥梁。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-接口五-流映射的-Jacobian-与测度传输恒等式\">接口五：流映射的 Jacobian 与测度传输恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-接口五-流映射的-Jacobian-与测度传输恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Flow Maps 接口不仅涉及轨迹的复合，还涉及密度沿流的演化。rectified flow 的生成语义是测度传输：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1$</span> 推前为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>。本节把这一事实写成 Jacobian 恒等式，作为与 Flow Maps 对接的第二层结构。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 在 (A2)–(A3) 下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚，记其 Jacobian 矩阵为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_t(x)=D\\Phi_t(x)\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d},\n\\qquad\n[J_t(x)]_{ij}=\\frac{\\partial(\\Phi_t(x))_i}{\\partial x_j},\\quad 1\\le i,j\\le d .$$</div>\n由流映射对初值的可微性（(A4) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微），<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 满足矩阵变分方程\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}J_t(x)=D v(\\Phi_t(x),t)\\,J_t(x),\n\\qquad J_0(x)=I_d ,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Dv$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(\\cdot,t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(x)$</span> 处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> Jacobian。该方程是链式法则的直接结果：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\Phi_t(x)=v(\\Phi_t(x),t)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求导并用链式法则即得。由 Liouville 公式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log|\\det J_t(x)|=\\operatorname{tr}\\big(Dv(\\Phi_t(x),t)\\big)=\\nabla\\cdot v(\\Phi_t(x),t),$$</div>\n故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\det J_t(x)|=\\exp\\!\\Big(\\int_0^t \\nabla\\cdot v(\\Phi_s(x),s)\\,ds\\Big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.11.5（推前密度恒等式）</strong><br>\n假设 (A2)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度有密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in L^1(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 为全局微分同胚。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=(\\Phi_t)_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 有密度\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(y)=p_0\\big(\\Phi_t^{-1}(y)\\big)\\,\\big|\\det J_t(\\Phi_t^{-1}(y))\\big|^{-1},\n\\qquad y\\in\\mathbb R^d .$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n对任意有界 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>，由推前测度定义与变量替换（(A3) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{-1}(B)$</span> 有界，Fubini 可用），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t(B)=\\mu_0(\\Phi_t^{-1}(B))=\\int_{\\Phi_t^{-1}(B)}p_0(x)\\,dx\n=\\int_B p_0(\\Phi_t^{-1}(y))\\,\\big|\\det D\\Phi_t^{-1}(y)\\big|\\,dy .$$</div>\n由逆映射定理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\Phi_t^{-1}(y)=(J_t(\\Phi_t^{-1}(y)))^{-1}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\det D\\Phi_t^{-1}(y)|=|\\det J_t(\\Phi_t^{-1}(y))|^{-1}$</span>。于是被积函数即命题右端，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 积分相等，故密度恒等式成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题把 Flow Maps 接口与第 5 节 OT 路径关系连接起来：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=(\\Phi_1)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1$</span> 是一个传输映射；rectified flow 的回归目标并不强制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1$</span> 为 OT 映射，但当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 独立且边缘固定时，直线插值的条件速度场给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1$</span> 与 OT 路径在端点处一致（第 5 节已证）。本节只强调接口层面：密度恒等式对任意满足 (A2)–(A4) 的速度场成立，不依赖最优性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-接口六-流映射的逆与反向采样\">接口六：流映射的逆与反向采样<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-接口六-流映射的逆与反向采样\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Flow Maps 接口的第三个结构是时间反演。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{s,t}$</span> 为正向流映射，定义反向流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\overleftarrow\\Psi_{t,s}=\\Psi_{s,t}^{-1}$</span>。由 (A2) 的 Lipschitz 性与 (A3) 的全局同胚性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{s,t}^{-1}$</span> 存在且对初值 Lipschitz。反向流映射满足 ODE\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{ds}\\overleftarrow\\Psi_{t,s}(y)=-v\\big(\\overleftarrow\\Psi_{t,s}(y),s\\big),\n\\qquad \\overleftarrow\\Psi_{t,t}(y)=y .$$</div>\n这是正向 ODE 的时间反演：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=t-s$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y(u)=\\Psi_{t-u,t}(y_0)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{du}y=-v(y,t-u)$</span>。该恒等式说明 rectified flow 的采样与逆采样共用同一速度场，只是时间方向相反。这与第 9 节反例中“耦合不当导致轨迹弯曲”形成对照：弯曲不影响可逆性，只影响数值积分步数；可逆性由 (A2) 保证。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.11.6（端点互逆恒等式）</strong><br>\n假设 (A2)–(A3) 成立。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Psi_{1,0}\\big(\\Psi_{0,1}(x)\\big)=x,\n\\qquad\n\\Psi_{0,1}\\big(\\Psi_{1,0}(y)\\big)=y .$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n由命题 16.11.1 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=0,s=1,t=0$</span> 不合法（要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\le s\\le t$</span>），故直接由逆映射定义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{1,0}=\\Psi_{0,1}^{-1}$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{1,0}(\\Psi_{0,1}(x))=\\Psi_{0,1}^{-1}(\\Psi_{0,1}(x))=x$</span>。第二式同理。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论是 Flow Maps 接口的闭合性：正向采样与反向采样在端点处精确互逆，不依赖步长。数值实现中，反向采样用负步长 Euler，其误差同样被命题 16.11.4 的曲率界控制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-接口七-流映射与-Reflow-的复合误差\">接口七：流映射与 Reflow 的复合误差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-接口七-流映射与-Reflow-的复合误差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 10 节 Reflow 已定义拉直操作，命题 16.11.2 给出端点不变性。本节补充一个可检验的复合误差恒等式：若用拉直后的流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi'_{0,1}$</span> 近似原始 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1$</span>，则端点误差为零，但中间时刻误差由两次曲率之差控制。设原始流映射在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span>，拉直后为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi'_t$</span>。定义中间偏差\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_t(x)=\\Psi'_t(x)-\\Phi_t(x),\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb R^d .$$</div>\n由命题 16.11.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_1(x)=0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-几乎处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t$</span> 一般非零。由两流映射均满足各自 ODE，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\Delta_t(x)=v'(\\Psi'_t(x),t)-v(\\Phi_t(x),t)\n=\\big[v'(\\Psi'_t(x),t)-v'(\\Phi_t(x),t)\\big]+\\big[v'(\\Phi_t(x),t)-v(\\Phi_t(x),t)\\big].$$</div>\n第一项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{v'}\\|\\Delta_t(x)\\|$</span> 控制，第二项为两速度场在原始轨迹上的差。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t(x)=v'(\\Phi_t(x),t)-v(\\Phi_t(x),t)$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\Delta_t(x)\\|\\le\\int_0^t e^{L_{v'}(t-s)}\\|\\delta_s(x)\\|\\,ds .$$</div>\n该不等式说明：拉直后的中间偏差由两速度场沿原始轨迹的差异累积决定，且被指数因子放大。端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_1=0$</span> 要求累积误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处恰好抵消，这正是命题 16.11.2 的结论。该恒等式是第 12 节少步生成接口的误差分析基础：拉直减少的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 衡量的是拉直前后速度场的局部差异。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-接口八-流映射的算子表述\">接口八：流映射的算子表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-接口八-流映射的算子表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为与 Flow Maps 的算子语言对接，把流映射写成作用于函数与测度的算子。对 Borel 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，定义前推算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P_t$</span> 与拉回算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal Q_t$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\mathcal P_t f)(x)=f(\\Phi_t(x)),\n\\qquad\n(\\mathcal Q_t f)(y)=f(\\Phi_t^{-1}(y)).$$</div>\n由命题 16.11.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P_t\\mathcal P_s=\\mathcal P_{t+s}$</span>（在复合合法时），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal Q_t\\mathcal Q_s=\\mathcal Q_{t+s}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P_t\\mathcal Q_t=\\mathrm{id}$</span>。对测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>，推前算子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_t\\mu=(\\Phi_t)_\\#\\mu$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_t\\mathcal T_s=\\mathcal T_{t+s}$</span>。rectified flow 的生成即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal T_1\\mu_0$</span>。Flow Maps 接口的算子表述把“采样”写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_1$</span> 的作用，把“训练”写成对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_1$</span> 的参数化逼近。该表述与第 8 节 CFM 对照一致：CFM 直接回归条件速度场，rectified flow 回归线性插值速度场，两者在算子层面均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_1$</span> 的逼近，区别只在条件化方式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-接口九-离散流映射与连续流映射的交换图\">接口九：离散流映射与连续流映射的交换图<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-接口九-离散流映射与连续流映射的交换图\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个交换图式的恒等式，把数值采样、精确流映射与 Reflow 三者关系写成可检验的等式。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat\\Psi^{(N)}_{0,1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步 Euler 复合映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{0,1}$</span> 为精确流映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi'_{0,1}$</span> 为拉直后精确流映射。由命题 16.11.1 与命题 16.11.4，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\widehat\\Psi^{(N)}_{0,1}(x)-\\Psi_{0,1}(x)\\big\\|\\le \\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v}\\cdot\\frac{\\kappa_\\infty}{2N},$$</div>\n而由命题 16.11.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi'_{0,1}(x)=\\Psi_{0,1}(x)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-几乎处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\widehat\\Psi^{(N)}_{0,1}(x)-\\Psi'_{0,1}(x)\\big\\|\\le \\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v}\\cdot\\frac{\\kappa_\\infty}{2N}.$$</div>\n该不等式把“拉直减少步数”写成交换图：数值复合映射到精确流映射的误差，等于到拉直流映射的误差，因为两者端点相同。拉直的作用是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty$</span> 替换为拉直后的曲率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa'_\\infty$</span>，从而在相同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下误差更小；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa'_\\infty=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 即精确。这正是第 12 节少步生成接口与第 15 节 Reflow 章接口的数学交汇点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-接口十-一个二维可积例子\">接口十：一个二维可积例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-接口十-一个二维可积例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=A x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\in\\mathbb R^{2\\times 2}$</span> 为常矩阵。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(x)=e^{tA}x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{s,t}(x)=e^{(t-s)A}x$</span>。命题 16.11.1 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{(t-s)A}e^{(s-r)A}=e^{(t-r)A}$</span>，成立。曲率上界为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa_\\infty=\\sup_{t\\in[0,1]}\\|A e^{tA}x_0\\| .$$</div>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 为反对称矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{tA}$</span> 为正交矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e^{tA}x_0\\|=\\|x_0\\|$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty=\\|A\\|\\,\\|x_0\\|$</span>。命题 16.11.4 给出误差界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|A\\|\\,\\|x_0\\|(e^{\\|A\\|}-1)/(2\\|A\\|N)=\\|x_0\\|(e^{\\|A\\|}-1)/(2N)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty=0$</span>，一步精确。该例子验证了命题 16.11.1、16.11.4 与推论 16.11.6 在矩阵指数情形下的自洽性，并说明曲率上界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的谱范数与初值范数共同决定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-接口十一-流映射接口的可检验恒等式汇总\">接口十一：流映射接口的可检验恒等式汇总<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-接口十一-流映射接口的可检验恒等式汇总\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把本节给出的接口恒等式写成可检验形式，供第 13、14 节代码节直接验证。对任意满足 (A2) 的速度场与任意初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>：</p>\n<p>(i) 半群性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{s,t}(\\Psi_{r,s}(x))=\\Psi_{r,t}(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le r\\le s\\le t\\le 1$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) 端点互逆：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_{1,0}(\\Psi_{0,1}(x))=x$</span>。</p>\n<p>(iii) 拉直端点不变：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi'_{0,1}(x)=\\Psi_{0,1}(x)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-几乎处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>。</p>\n<p>(iv) Euler 误差界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_k\\|\\hat x_k-x_k\\|\\le (e^{L_v}-1)\\kappa_\\infty/(2L_v N)$</span>。</p>\n<p>(v) 密度推前：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(y)=p_0(\\Phi_t^{-1}(y))|\\det J_t(\\Phi_t^{-1}(y))|^{-1}$</span>。</p>\n<p>这五条恒等式构成本节与 Flow Maps 接口的完整数学内容：半群性给出复合结构，互逆性给出可逆采样，拉直不变性给出端点语义，误差界给出少步生成的定量保证，密度推前给出测度传输语义。它们均在前序节符号体系内表述，不引入新对象，且每条均有显式假设与证明。第 13 节代码将逐条数值验证 (i)–(iv)，第 14 节代码将测量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_\\infty$</span> 并检验 (iv) 的紧性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fl16--h-与少步生成的接口\">与少步生成的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-与少步生成的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim\\mu_1$</span> 为两端分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 为给定耦合（联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>），线性插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)$</span> 为回归目标</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v=\\arg\\min_{v}\\ \\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2,\\qquad t\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}[0,1],$$</div>\n<p>直线 ODE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v(X_t,t)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 为该回归的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_t)$</span>-投影解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的分布。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{s}$</span> 为 ODE 从时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的流映射。本节新引入的符号如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>：数值积分步数（离散时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_k\\}_{k=0}^{N}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=k/N$</span>）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k:=t_{k+1}-t_k=1/N$</span>：步长；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat X^{(N)}$</span>：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步显式 Euler 离散化直线 ODE 得到的离散轨迹；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_N:=\\mathbb E\\|X_1-\\widehat X^{(N)}_1\\|^2$</span>：少步生成误差（以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 为参照的均方误差）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t):=\\mathbb E\\big[\\|\\nabla_t v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|\\,\\big]$</span>（沿轨迹的加速度范数期望），称为曲率速率；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(v^\\star)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数上界。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需假设：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1)（可积性与平方可积）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\|X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\|X_1\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,1]}\\mathbb E\\|X_t\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star\\in L^2(\\pi_t\\times\\mathrm dt)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2)（正则性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(\\cdot,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(v^\\star)=L&lt;\\infty$</span>，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t}\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_t v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3)（耦合非退化）</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0\\neq 0$</span>；即直线速度不恒为零，保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)$</span> 定义非平凡。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4)（边界通量消失）</strong> 在数值分析意义上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat X^{(N)}$</span> 的初值精确取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat X^{(N)}_0=X_0$</span> a.s.。</p>\n<p>以下命题均在 (A1)–(A4) 下陈述。凡涉及期望与极限交换处，均引用 Dominated Convergence（下称 DC）或 Fubini，并逐条验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-少步误差的分解恒等式\">少步误差的分解恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-少步误差的分解恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>少步生成的核心问题：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 很小（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1,2,4$</span>），Euler 离散轨迹终点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat X^{(N)}_1$</span> 与目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 的偏差有多大？本小节把该偏差分解为两项——<strong>离散化误差</strong>与<strong>曲率项</strong>——并证明曲率项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 速率消失，从而给出“拉直 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 少步可行”的定量接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.12.1（Euler 误差的曲率表示）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 1$</span>，存在仅依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_t v^\\star\\|^2$</span> 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，使得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big\\|X_1-\\widehat X^{(N)}_1\\big\\|^2\\ \\le\\ C\\Big(\\frac{1}{N^2}+\\frac{1}{N}\\int_0^1\\kappa(t)\\,\\mathrm dt\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=k/N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1/N$</span>。Euler 格式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\widehat X_{k+1}=\\widehat X_k+\\tau\\,v^\\star(\\widehat X_k,t_k),\\qquad \\widehat X_0=X_0.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，精确流满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_{k+1}}=\\Phi_{t_{k+1}}^{t_k}(X_{t_k})$</span>，且由 ODE 的积分形式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{t_{k+1}}=X_{t_k}+\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}v^\\star(X_s,s)\\,\\mathrm ds.$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_k,t_{k+1}]$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(X_s,s)=v^\\star(X_{t_k},t_k)+\\int_{t_k}^{s}\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm du}v^\\star(X_u,u)\\,\\mathrm du$</span>，其中全导数</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm du}v^\\star(X_u,u)=\\nabla_x v^\\star(X_u,u)\\,\\dot X_u+\\nabla_t v^\\star(X_u,u)=\\nabla_x v^\\star\\,v^\\star+\\nabla_t v^\\star.$$</div>\n<p>由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_x v^\\star\\|\\le L$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v^\\star\\|$</span> 在紧时间段上有界（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_t\\|^2$</span> 有界，用 Cauchy–Schwarz 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star\\|^2\\le 2L^2\\mathbb E\\|X_t\\|^2+2\\|v^\\star(0,t)\\|^2$</span>，后者关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续故有界）。于是单步局部截断误差</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big\\|X_{t_{k+1}}-X_{t_k}-\\tau v^\\star(X_{t_k},t_k)\\Big\\|\\le \\frac{\\tau^2}{2}\\sup_{u\\in[t_k,t_{k+1}]}\\Big\\|\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm du}v^\\star(X_u,u)\\Big\\|.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 求和并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz 的离散 Gronwall 型估计（标准 Euler 收敛性论证：相邻两条轨迹的偏差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+L\\tau)$</span> 放大），得到</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-\\widehat X^{(N)}_1\\|^2\\ \\le\\ C_1\\tau^2+C_2\\tau\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\Big\\|\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}v^\\star(X_t,t)\\Big\\|\\,\\mathrm dt.$$</div>\n<p>右端第二项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\int_0^1\\kappa(t)\\,\\mathrm dt$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 定义为该期望的积分）。第一项来自局部截断误差的平方累积，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star\\|^2$</span>。合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.12.2（曲率控制少步可行性）</strong> 若耦合使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)\\equiv 0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 沿轨迹不随时间变化，等价于轨迹为直线且速度恒定），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-\\widehat X^{(N)}_1\\|^2\\ \\le\\ C/N^2,$$</div>\n<p>即<strong>单步</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span>）Euler 即精确到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 常数倍的截断误差，且随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 二次收敛。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 16.12.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\equiv0$</span> 时第二项为零，仅剩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C/N^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与相邻概念的区别）</strong> 推论 16.12.2 中的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\equiv0$</span>”正是本章第 2 节“直线 ODE”与第 4 节“轨迹的可积性”所刻画的直线情形：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 独立时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 沿每条直线轨迹为常向量，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_t v^\\star=0$</span>。这与“OT 路径”（第 5 节）不同：OT 路径的直线性是<strong>耦合层面</strong>的最优性，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\equiv0$</span> 是<strong>速度场层面</strong>的可积性；二者在独立耦合下重合，在一般耦合下分离。本节只处理后者对数值步数的影响，不重复 OT 的讨论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-曲率速率-kappa-的可检验恒等式\">曲率速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的可检验恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-曲率速率-kappa-的可检验恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 与可观测的回归残差联系起来，本小节推导一个恒等式，使“拉直程度”可由训练损失直接读出。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.12.3（曲率–残差恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 为回归投影解，则对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\big\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>且沿轨迹的全导数满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2=2\\,\\mathbb E\\big\\langle v^\\star(X_t,t),\\ \\nabla_x v^\\star\\,v^\\star+\\nabla_t v^\\star\\big\\rangle.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(\\cdot,t)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_t)$</span> 上的正交投影（回归目标即最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 逐点变分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>）。正交分解给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|(X_1-X_0)-v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>移项即得。期望与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的积分交换用 Fubini，条件为 (A1) 的平方可积性。</p>\n<p>第二式：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导。将期望写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|v^\\star(x,t)\\|^2\\,\\pi_t(\\mathrm dx)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 的演化；由 ODE 的连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\pi_t+\\nabla\\cdot(\\pi_t v^\\star)=0$</span>（第 4 节已证），在测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v^\\star\\|^2$</span> 上积分并分部积分（边界通量消失，即 (A4) 的连续版本），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\int\\|v^\\star\\|^2\\pi_t=\\int\\big(2\\langle v^\\star,\\partial_t v^\\star\\rangle+\\langle v^\\star,\\nabla\\|v^\\star\\|^2\\rangle\\big)\\pi_t.$$</div>\n<p>第二项由分部积分化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\langle v^\\star,\\nabla_x v^\\star\\,v^\\star\\rangle\\pi_t$</span> 的两倍（对称性），合并即得所示全导数表达式。求导与积分交换用 Leibniz 法则，条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_t v^\\star\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>（(A2)）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 的紧支撑（由 (A1) 的有限二阶矩保证弱紧）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.12.4（拉直的可检验判据）</strong> 若训练损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(t):=\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上近似为常数且接近零，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star\\|^2\\approx\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 小；反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(t)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 显著变化，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 不可忽略，少步误差受命题 16.12.1 第二项支配。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 16.12.3 第一式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(t)=\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star\\|^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的变化率即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star\\|^2$</span>，由第二式等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\mathbb E\\langle v^\\star,\\nabla_x v^\\star v^\\star+\\nabla_t v^\\star\\rangle$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_t v^\\star$</span> 小时，该变化率被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\star v^\\star$</span> 项控制；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_t v^\\star\\|$</span> 直接度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_t$</span> 部分。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>-变差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 同阶。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-具体例子-独立耦合下的单步精确性\">具体例子：独立耦合下的单步精确性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-具体例子-独立耦合下的单步精确性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 16.12.5</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\mu_0\\otimes\\mu_1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1\\sim\\mathcal N(0,[(1-t)^2+t^2]I_d)$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x].$$</div>\n<p>由联合高斯条件期望公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1-X_0,X_t)=t\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1,X_1)-(1-t)\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0,X_0)=tI_d-(1-t)I_d=(2t-1)I_d$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_t)=[(1-t)^2+t^2]I_d$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star(x,t)=\\frac{2t-1}{(1-t)^2+t^2}\\,x.$$</div>\n<p>沿轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_t v^\\star(X_t,t)$</span> 计算如下：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(t)=2t-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b(t)=(1-t)^2+t^2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=a x/b$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_t v^\\star=\\frac{a'b-ab'}{b^2}x,\\qquad a'=2,\\quad b'=-2(1-t)+2t=4t-2.$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a'=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b'=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_t v^\\star=4x$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(1/2)=\\mathbb E\\|4X_{1/2}\\|=4\\mathbb E\\|X_{1/2}\\|$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{1/2}\\sim\\mathcal N(0,\\tfrac12 I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_{1/2}\\|=\\sqrt{d/2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2/\\pi}$</span>（半正态均值），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(1/2)=4\\sqrt{d/\\pi}$</span>。<strong>非零</strong>：即使独立耦合，高斯情形下轨迹并非严格直线速度恒定，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 通过方差比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a/b$</span>。这与本章第 2 节“若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 独立，轨迹为直线”并不矛盾——该断言指<strong>轨迹几何</strong>为直线（<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 的连线上），但<strong>速度大小</strong>沿直线可变，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_t v^\\star\\neq0$</span>。命题 16.12.1 的曲率项正捕捉这一速度变化。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例说明：直线几何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\neq$</span> 常速度；少步误差由后者（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>）而非前者控制。这正是“拉直”与“少步”之间的精细接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-与-Flow-Maps-接口的衔接\">与 Flow Maps 接口的衔接<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-与-Flow-Maps-接口的衔接\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 11 节定义了 Flow Map <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{s,t}:=\\Phi_t^s$</span>。少步生成可视为用<strong>单步映射</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat F_{0,1}^{(N)}$</span> 近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{0,1}$</span>。命题 16.12.1 给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|F_{0,1}(X_0)-\\widehat F_{0,1}^{(N)}(X_0)\\|^2\\le C\\Big(\\frac1{N^2}+\\frac1N\\int_0^1\\kappa\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>即 Flow Map 的少步近似误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的积分控制。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 被 Reflow（第 10 节）压低后，同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下误差上界收紧；这与第 10 节“拉直减少弯曲”的定性结论一致，本节给出其定量形式。注意此处只引用 Flow Map 记号，不重复第 11 节的构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-少步误差下界的构造与紧性\">少步误差下界的构造与紧性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-少步误差下界的构造与紧性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 16.12.1 给出的是上界。为使“曲率项不可省”的论断成立，本小节构造一个下界，说明当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 不小时，任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步 Euler 格式都无法把误差压到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N^2)$</span> 以下。这排除了“离散化项已足够、曲率项只是技术性余项”的误读。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.12.6（曲率项的下界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_t v^\\star$</span> 沿轨迹连续。则存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>（只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>）使得对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big\\|X_1-\\widehat X^{(N)}_1\\big\\|^2\\ \\ge\\ c\\,\\tau^2\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\mathbb E\\Big\\|\\nabla_t v^\\star(X_{t_k},t_k)\\Big\\|^2-\\tau^2\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\mathbb E\\big\\|\\nabla_x v^\\star(X_{t_k},t_k)\\,v^\\star(X_{t_k},t_k)\\big\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 关键在于精确解与 Euler 解在单步内的偏差主项。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat X_k=X_{t_k}$</span>（在比较两条轨迹时，把 Euler 轨迹的起点对齐到精确轨迹的对应点，误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz 传播，此处只取主项）。单步精确增量</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{t_{k+1}}-X_{t_k}=\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}v^\\star(X_s,s)\\,\\mathrm ds=\\tau v^\\star(X_{t_k},t_k)+\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}(s-t_k)\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm du}v^\\star(X_u,u)\\Big|_{u=s}\\,\\mathrm ds.$$</div>\n<p>Euler 增量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau v^\\star(X_{t_k},t_k)$</span>。故单步偏差</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_k:=\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}(s-t_k)\\Big(\\nabla_x v^\\star\\,v^\\star+\\nabla_t v^\\star\\Big)(X_s,s)\\,\\mathrm ds.$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=t_k$</span> 处展开并保留一阶：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k=\\tfrac{\\tau^2}{2}\\big(\\nabla_x v^\\star v^\\star+\\nabla_t v^\\star\\big)(X_{t_k},t_k)+O(\\tau^3)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta_k\\|^2$</span> 取期望并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|a+b\\|^2\\ge \\tfrac12\\|b\\|^2-\\|a\\|^2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\nabla_x v^\\star v^\\star$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=\\nabla_t v^\\star$</span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|\\delta_k\\|^2\\ \\ge\\ \\frac{\\tau^4}{8}\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_t v^\\star(X_{t_k},t_k)\\|^2-\\frac{\\tau^4}{4}\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_x v^\\star v^\\star\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>各步偏差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz 流下按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+L\\tau)$</span> 放大后累积到终点，累积放大因子介于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-L}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{L}$</span> 之间（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\le 1$</span>），故存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 使总和下界如命题所示。<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\tau^3)$</span> 项并入常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.12.7（曲率项的不可约性）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf_t\\kappa(t)\\ge\\kappa_0&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_x v^\\star v^\\star\\|^2\\le M$</span>，则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 充分小、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_0^2&gt;8M$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-\\widehat X^{(N)}_1\\|^2\\ge c'\\tau\\kappa_0^2$</span>，即误差至少以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 速率衰减，无法达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将命题 16.12.6 右端按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\tau^2=\\tau$</span> 合并：第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge c\\tau^2\\sum_k\\kappa_0^2=c\\tau\\kappa_0^2$</span>，第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\tau^2\\sum_k M=\\tau M$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 小使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\kappa_0^2&gt;M$</span> 时下界为正且为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta(\\tau)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论与命题 16.12.1 的上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(1/N^2+\\tfrac1N\\int\\kappa)$</span> 合起来给出：<strong>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 有正下界时，少步误差的收敛阶恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/N$</span>，曲率项是主导项而非可忽略的余项</strong>。这正是“拉直”作为少步生成前置条件的数学根据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-拉直前后误差上界的显式比较\">拉直前后误差上界的显式比较<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-拉直前后误差上界的显式比较\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 10 节（Reflow）构造了从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 出发、以直线 ODE 的终点为新的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 的耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(1)}$</span>，并证明其诱导的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(1)}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^{(1)}\\le\\kappa$</span>。本小节把这一比较写成显式不等式，作为本节与第 10 节的定量接口（不重复 Reflow 的构造证明）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.12.8（Reflow 后少步误差的收缩）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 诱导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span>、曲率速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>，经一次 Reflow 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(1)}$</span> 诱导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(1)}$</span>、曲率速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^{(1)}$</span>。在 (A1)–(A4) 对两者均成立的条件下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{\\pi^{(1)}}\\|X_1-\\widehat X^{(N)}_1\\|^2\\ \\le\\ C\\Big(\\frac1{N^2}+\\frac1N\\int_0^1\\kappa^{(1)}(t)\\,\\mathrm dt\\Big)\\ \\le\\ C\\Big(\\frac1{N^2}+\\frac1N\\int_0^1\\kappa(t)\\,\\mathrm dt\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一不等号即命题 16.12.1 应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(1)}$</span>。第二不等号用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^{(1)}\\le\\kappa$</span>（第 10 节已证：Reflow 的耦合由直线 ODE 的流给出，其速度场沿轨迹的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>-变化被原速度场的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>-变化所控制）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（接口的精确含义）</strong> 命题 16.12.8 只断言<strong>上界</strong>的单调收缩，不断言实际误差逐点收缩；后者需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(1)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 边缘上的一致性（Reflow 保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 边缘不变，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\pi^{(1)}}\\|X_1\\|^2=\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1\\|^2$</span>，两期望可比）。这一区分避免了把“上界收紧”误读为“误差必然下降”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-与少步采样器的接口-从-Euler-到高阶格式\">与少步采样器的接口：从 Euler 到高阶格式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-与少步采样器的接口-从-Euler-到高阶格式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>少步生成实践中常用 Euler 之外的单步或多步格式。本小节说明命题 16.12.1 的分解如何推广到一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阶显式 Runge–Kutta 格式，从而把“曲率控制”与“格式阶数”两个因素分离。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.12.9（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阶格式的误差分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 次连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\mathbb E\\|\\partial_t^p v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阶显式 Runge–Kutta 格式以步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1/N$</span> 离散直线 ODE，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-\\widehat X^{(N)}_1\\|^2\\ \\le\\ C_p\\Big(\\frac1{N^{2p}}+\\frac1{N}\\int_0^1\\kappa_p(t)\\,\\mathrm dt\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_p(t):=\\mathbb E\\|\\partial_t^p v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阶曲率速率，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_p$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\mathbb E\\|\\partial_t^p v^\\star\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阶格式的局部截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\tau^{p+1})$</span>，累积到终点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\tau^p)=O(1/N^p)$</span>，其平方给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N^{2p})$</span> 项。曲率项来自格式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t^p v^\\star$</span> 的采样：每一步的截断误差主项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{p+1}\\partial_t^p v^\\star$</span>，平方求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{2p+1}\\sum_k\\kappa_p^2$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1/N$</span> 下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\tau\\kappa_p^2)$</span> 量级，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac1N\\int\\kappa_p$</span> 的平方形式。合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.12.10（阶数与曲率的权衡）</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，提高格式阶数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 只能压低离散化项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N^{2p})$</span>，而曲率项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac1N\\int\\kappa_p$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 增大通常不减（高阶时间导数未必更小）。故<strong>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 主导的区域，提高格式阶数无益；唯一有效的途径是 Reflow 压低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span></strong>。这解释了为何少步生成的核心是拉直而非换积分器。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 16.12.9，两项独立相加。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac1N\\int\\kappa_p\\gg 1/N^{2p}$</span> 时，总误差由曲率项支配，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 无关（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_p$</span> 不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 衰减的前提下）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-一个可数值验证的恒等式-单步误差与-kappa-的比值\">一个可数值验证的恒等式：单步误差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的比值<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-一个可数值验证的恒等式-单步误差与-kappa-的比值\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为使本节结论可被代码节（第 13、14 节）直接检验，给出一个无量纲恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.12.11（单步误差–曲率比）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span>（单步 Euler，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span>），并设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\star v^\\star$</span> 项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 上的积分可忽略（即轨迹近似直线几何），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathbb E\\|X_1-\\widehat X^{(1)}_1\\|^2}{\\big(\\int_0^1\\kappa(t)\\,\\mathrm dt\\big)^2}\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\frac{1}{4}\\quad(\\text{在 }\\kappa\\to 0\\text{ 的一阶近似下}).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 单步偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_0=\\int_0^1(1-s)\\big(\\nabla_x v^\\star v^\\star+\\nabla_t v^\\star\\big)(X_s,s)\\,\\mathrm ds$</span>。忽略第一项后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_0\\approx\\int_0^1(1-s)\\nabla_t v^\\star(X_s,s)\\,\\mathrm ds$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 小时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_t v^\\star$</span> 沿轨迹缓变，可用其中点值近似：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_0\\approx\\tfrac12\\nabla_t v^\\star(X_{1/2},1/2)$</span>。取范数平方期望，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\delta_0\\|^2\\approx\\tfrac14\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_t v^\\star(X_{1/2},1/2)\\|^2\\approx\\tfrac14\\kappa(1/2)^2$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 近似常数时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\kappa\\approx\\kappa(1/2)$</span>，比值趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式给出代码节的检验目标：测量单步误差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 积分之比的平方根，应接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>（在直线几何近似下）。若显著偏离，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\star v^\\star$</span> 项不可忽略，即轨迹几何本身弯曲，此时应回到第 9 节的反例框架处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-接口的失效边界\">接口的失效边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-接口的失效边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本小节明确本节结论在何种条件下失效，以免被误用为无条件断言。</p>\n<p><strong>(B1) 非平方可积端点。</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_0\\|^2=\\infty$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|^2=\\infty$</span>，则 (A1) 失效，命题 16.12.1 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 不存在，误差分解无意义。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 可能为无穷，少步误差无有限上界。</p>\n<p><strong>(B2) 速度场非 Lipschitz。</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 仅有可测性而无 Lipschitz 性（如某些奇异耦合），则 Euler 轨迹可能不唯一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat X^{(N)}$</span> 无定义，命题 16.12.1 的 Gronwall 放大不成立。此时需改用第 4 节的可积性框架，且少步生成无收敛保证。</p>\n<p><strong>(B3) 曲率集中于测度零集。</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_t v^\\star$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span>-零集上非零（例如耦合使轨迹在某一时刻瞬时转向），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=0$</span> 但单步误差不为零——命题 16.12.1 的上界退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C/N^2$</span>，与实际不符。此时需以本质 supremum 替代期望，本节不展开，归入第 9 节反例节处理。</p>\n<p>以上三条界定了本节接口的适用域：平方可积、Lipschitz、曲率在测度意义下非退化。超出此域时，“拉直 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 少步”的定量蕴含不成立，只能回到定性讨论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-小结性的接口陈述-非本节小结\">小结性的接口陈述（非本节小结）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-小结性的接口陈述-非本节小结\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 16.12.1、16.12.6、16.12.8、16.12.9 与推论 16.12.10，本节建立的接口可压缩为一条双向蕴含链：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\text{Reflow 压低 }\\kappa\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\text{少步误差上界 }C\\big(\\tfrac1{N^2}+\\tfrac1N\\textstyle\\int\\kappa\\big)\\text{ 收紧}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\text{小 }N\\text{ 可行},$$</div>\n<p>反向地，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\text{小 }N\\text{ 下误差大}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\text{或离散化项大（提高 }p\\text{）或曲率项大（Reflow）},$$</div>\n<p>而推论 16.12.10 排除前者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 主导时的有效性。这条链是本节对本章主旨“拉直减少采样步数”的定量兑现，其每一环均有显式假设与证明，可直接被第 13、14 节的代码检验。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-少步误差的变分刻画\">少步误差的变分刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-少步误差的变分刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文从 Euler 离散化角度给出了误差上界与下界。本小节换一个角度：把少步生成视为对精确流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{0,1}$</span> 的一次<strong>函数逼近</strong>，并用变分法刻画其最优单步速度场。这补足了“接口”的另一半——不仅问“给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，误差多大”，还问“若允许重新选择单步速度场，最优能多好”。二者共同构成少步生成的理论边界。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.12.12（单步速度场的变分问题）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span>，考虑一切满足 (A2) 的可测速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，定义单步生成映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_u(x):=x+u(x,0)$</span>（Euler 单步，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>）。变分问题为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\inf_{u}\\ \\mathbb E_{\\mu_0}\\big\\|F_{0,1}(X_0)-\\Psi_u(X_0)\\big\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>记其最优解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^\\dagger$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.12.13（单步最优解的条件期望形式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，变分问题 16.12.12 的最优解由条件期望给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u^\\dagger(x,0)=\\mathbb E_{\\mu_0}\\big[F_{0,1}(X_0)-X_0\\ \\big|\\ X_0=x\\big]=F_{0,1}(x)-x,$$</div>\n<p>且最优值恰为零。换言之，<strong>单步精确生成当且仅当存在满足 (A2) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_u=F_{0,1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-a.e. 上成立</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|F_{0,1}(x)-x-u(x,0)\\|^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(x,0)$</span> 逐点凸，逐点最小化给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(x,0)=F_{0,1}(x)-x$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{0,1}$</span> 由 (A2) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz 速度场生成，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{0,1}$</span> 本身是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{L}$</span>-Lipschitz 的（标准流映射估计），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^\\dagger(x,0)=F_{0,1}(x)-x$</span> 满足 (A2) 的 Lipschitz 要求（常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^L+1$</span>）。代入得被积函数为零，最优值为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.12.14（Euler 单步误差即流映射的偏离）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=v^\\star(\\cdot,0)$</span>（即回归速度场在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的截面），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-\\widehat X^{(1)}_1\\|^2=\\mathbb E_{\\mu_0}\\big\\|F_{0,1}(X_0)-X_0-v^\\star(X_0,0)\\big\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat X^{(1)}_1=X_0+v^\\star(X_0,0)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=F_{0,1}(X_0)$</span>（精确流终点），故差即所示。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 16.12.14 把命题 16.12.1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 的误差写成“精确流映射减去其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处切向量”的范数。这正是流映射在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处的<strong>一阶 Taylor 余项</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{0,1}$</span> 沿直线匀速时余项为零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\equiv0$</span>），否则余项非零且由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 控制。这与命题 16.12.11 的比值恒等式互为印证：后者是该余项在中点展开的近似，前者是其精确形式。</p>\n<p><strong>注（与相邻概念的区别）</strong> 命题 16.12.13 的最优值零并不意味着“单步总能精确”，因为它要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^\\dagger$</span> 可表示为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{0,1}(x)-x$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{0,1}$</span> 一般不是仿射的；Euler 单步只能实现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_u$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto x+u(x,0)$</span> 的<strong>平移型</strong>映射，其像集是流映射的一个受限子类。少步误差的本质是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{0,1}$</span> 落在该子类之外的程度，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 正是这一偏离的度量。这与第 11 节 Flow Map 的一般逼近问题不同：那里允许任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{s,t}$</span> 的参数化，本节只允许单步平移。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-多步误差的累积与-kappa-的路径积分\">多步误差的累积与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的路径积分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-多步误差的累积与-kappa-的路径积分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 16.12.1 的曲率项以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\kappa(t)\\,\\mathrm dt$</span> 出现。本小节说明该积分不是形式记号，而是沿<strong>离散轨迹</strong>的曲率累积，并给出它与连续路径积分的偏差估计。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.12.15（离散曲率和的路径积分逼近）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_t v^\\star$</span> 沿轨迹关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L'$</span>-Lipschitz（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L'$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_t v^\\star$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\frac1N\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\mathbb E\\big\\|\\nabla_t v^\\star(\\widehat X_k,t_k)\\big\\|-\\int_0^1\\kappa(t)\\,\\mathrm dt\\Big|\\ \\le\\ \\frac{L'}{N}\\Big(1+\\sup_t\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t):=\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_t v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|$</span>。离散和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在网格点上的 Riemann 和，误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)\\cdot\\mathrm{Lip}(g)$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(g)\\le L'(1+\\sup_t\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star\\|)$</span>：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_t v^\\star$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L'$</span>-Lipschitz 性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的演化速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star\\|$</span> 相乘。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat X_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_k}$</span> 的偏差已由命题 16.12.1 控制，代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题保证：命题 16.12.1 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\kappa$</span> 可由离散轨迹上的样本平均无偏逼近，误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span>，与曲率项同阶——故在数值上，曲率项与离散化项不可通过“更细网格”分离，二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时同步消失。这从数值分析角度再次确认推论 16.12.10 的结论：提高 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 同时压低两项，但压低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 只压低第二项，是唯一能改变主导项的手段。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-与本章推导链的接口\">与本章推导链的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-与本章推导链的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本章第 16 节将给出推导链“拉直 = 减少弯曲”。本小节把该链在本节语境下的每一环写成可验证的蕴含，作为接口的收束（不重复第 16 节的展开）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.12.16（接口链的逐环蕴含）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，以下三条蕴含均成立：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\equiv0\\ \\Rightarrow\\ $</span> 单步 Euler 误差为零（推论 16.12.2 与命题 16.12.13 的最优值零重合）；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 有正下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow\\ $</span> 少步误差收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/N$</span>（推论 16.12.7）；</p>\n<p>(iii) Reflow 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^{(1)}\\le\\kappa\\ \\Rightarrow\\ $</span> 同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下少步误差上界不增（命题 16.12.8）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) 由命题 16.12.13，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\equiv0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{0,1}(x)-x=v^\\star(x,0)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^\\dagger=v^\\star(\\cdot,0)$</span>，Euler 单步即精确流。(ii) 即推论 16.12.7。(iii) 即命题 16.12.8 的第二不等号。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>三条蕴含合起来即“拉直 = 减少弯曲 = 少步可行”的定量版本：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 是弯曲的度量，Reflow 压低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>，命题 16.12.1 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 翻译成少步误差上界。本节至此完成对本章主旨的接口兑现，其每一环均有显式假设与证明，可直接被第 13、14 节的代码检验，并被第 16 节的推导链引用。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>少步生成误差被分解为离散化项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N^2)$</span> 与曲率项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\tfrac1N\\int\\kappa)$</span>；曲率速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)=\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_t v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|$</span> 是控制少步可行性的核心量（命题 16.12.1）。</li>\n<li>曲率可由训练残差读出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(t)=\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2-\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star\\|^2$</span>，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>-变差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 同阶（命题 16.12.3、推论 16.12.4），给出“拉直程度”的可检验判据。</li>\n<li>直线几何不等于常速度：独立高斯耦合下轨迹为直线但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\neq0$</span>（例 16.12.5），故少步误差由速度沿轨迹的变化率而非轨迹几何的直线性决定；Reflow 压低的正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>，从而收紧少步误差上界。</li>\n<li>少步生成误差被分解为离散化项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N^2)$</span> 与曲率项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\tfrac1N\\int\\kappa)$</span>；曲率速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)=\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_t v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|$</span> 是控制少步可行性的核心量，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 有正下界时误差收敛阶降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/N$</span>（命题 16.12.1、16.12.6、推论 16.12.7）。</li>\n<li>曲率可由训练残差读出（命题 16.12.3、推论 16.12.4），并可由离散轨迹样本平均无偏逼近（命题 16.12.15）；单步最优速度场的变分刻画（命题 16.12.13）表明少步误差本质是流映射偏离平移型的程度。</li>\n<li>直线几何不等于常速度：独立高斯耦合下轨迹为直线但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\neq0$</span>（例 16.12.5）；Reflow 压低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 从而收紧少步误差上界（命题 16.12.8），提高格式阶数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 主导时无益（推论 16.12.10），三条蕴含构成“拉直 = 少步可行”的定量接口（命题 16.12.16）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"fl16--h-代码-Rectified-Flow-训练\">代码：Rectified Flow 训练<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-代码-Rectified-Flow-训练\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：数据端点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim p_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim p_1$</span>，耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Pi(p_0,p_1)$</span>，线性插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta(x,t)$</span>，回归目标</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi}\\Big[\\int_0^1\\|v_\\theta(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>本节新引入的符号（写入符号表）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span>：状态维度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\in\\mathbb N$</span>：批量大小；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in\\mathbb N$</span>：时间离散网格点数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=1/(T-1)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$h_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>：参数化网络，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta(x,t):=h_\\theta(x,t)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n$</span>：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个样本、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个时间点对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 的 Monte Carlo 与梯形估计。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span>：学习率；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\text{clip}}&gt;0$</span>：梯度范数裁剪阈值。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>正则性假设（本节全部命题共用）：</p>\n<p>(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\pi}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(\\theta)&lt;\\infty$</span> 对任意使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|v_\\theta(X_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p>(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 连续且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x,t}\\|\\nabla_\\theta h_\\theta(x,t)\\|$</span> 在紧参数集上可积，以保证 Leibniz 法则交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A3) 采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0^{(i)},X_1^{(i)})_{i=1}^n$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> i.i.d.；时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_k\\}_{k=0}^{T-1}\\subset[0,1]$</span> 等距，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=k\\Delta t$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A4) 数值实现中所有张量以 float64 存储，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\text{clip}}=10^{-6}$</span> 防止除零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-算法契约-输入输出与张量形状\">算法契约：输入输出与张量形状<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-算法契约-输入输出与张量形状\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>输入：批量端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\in\\mathbb R^{n\\times d}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\in\\mathbb R^{n\\times d}$</span>（数值范围由数据决定，本实验取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-1,1]$</span>）；时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\mathbb R^{T}$</span>；网络参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。</p>\n<p>前向：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,k)$</span> 构造插值点</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t^{(i,k)}=(1-t_k)X_0^{(i)}+t_kX_1^{(i)}\\in\\mathbb R^d,$$</div>\n<p>堆叠为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf X\\in\\mathbb R^{n\\times T\\times d}$</span>；目标速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf U\\in\\mathbb R^{n\\times T\\times d}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf U^{(i,k)}=X_1^{(i)}-X_0^{(i)}$</span>（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 无关，沿时间轴广播）。网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathbf V}=h_\\theta(\\mathbf X,t)\\in\\mathbb R^{n\\times T\\times d}$</span>。</p>\n<p>损失：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n(\\theta)=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n\\sum_{k=0}^{T-1}w_k\\,\\|\\hat V^{(i,k)}-U^{(i)}\\|^2,\\qquad w_k=\\begin{cases}\\Delta t/2,&amp;k\\in\\{0,T-1\\},\\\\ \\Delta t,&amp;\\text{否则}.\\end{cases}$$</div>\n<p>输出：标量损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n$</span> 与梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n\\in\\mathbb R^{|\\theta|}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-核心更新推导与稳定性\">核心更新推导与稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-核心更新推导与稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell^{(i,k)}=\\|\\hat V^{(i,k)}-U^{(i)}\\|^2$</span>。由链式法则，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n=\\frac1n\\sum_{i,k}w_k\\cdot 2\\big(\\hat V^{(i,k)}-U^{(i)}\\big)^\\top\\frac{\\partial h_\\theta}{\\partial\\theta}\\big(X_t^{(i,k)},t_k\\big).$$</div>\n<p>更新 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\leftarrow\\theta-\\eta\\,\\mathrm{clip}(\\nabla_\\theta\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n,\\epsilon_{\\text{clip}})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{clip}(g,\\epsilon)=g\\cdot\\min(1,\\epsilon/\\|g\\|)$</span>。稳定性条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le 2/L$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数（梯度下降收敛的经典充分条件）；数值上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=10^{-2}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\approx 10$</span> 量级即可，本节代码只做单步验证，不做长循环。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（线性插值速度恒等式）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A3) 成立。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}X_t=X_1-X_0,\\qquad X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}[(1-t)X_0+tX_1]=-X_0+X_1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（回归目标的最优解）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A2) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_\\theta$</span> 的表达能力足以表示任意可测函数。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi\\otimes\\mathrm dt)$</span> 中的唯一极小点为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E\\big[X_1-X_0\\,\\big|\\,X_t=x\\big],$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(v^\\star)=\\mathbb E\\,\\mathrm{Var}(X_1-X_0\\mid X_t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|v(x,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)$</span> 是严格凸二次型，一阶条件给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)\\sim\\pi\\otimes\\mathrm dt$</span> 积分并用 Fubini（被积函数非负可测，条件 (A1) 保证可积）即得。方差分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|Y-\\mathbb E Y\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|Y\\|^2-\\|\\mathbb E Y\\|^2$</span> 给出最小值。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论（独立耦合下轨迹为直线）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=p_0\\otimes p_1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\perp X_1$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1]-\\mathbb E[X_0]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 无关，ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v^\\star$</span> 的解为直线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0+t(\\mathbb E X_1-\\mathbb E X_0)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 非独立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，轨迹弯曲——这与本章 canonical claim 一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-数值误差来源与量级\">数值误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-数值误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>三类误差：(i) Monte Carlo 误差，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-1/2})$</span>，由中心极限定理，标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma/\\sqrt n$</span>；(ii) 时间梯形离散误差，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>（被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 光滑时）；(iii) 浮点舍入，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}\\cdot\\text{条件数})\\approx10^{-15}$</span>。本节代码取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=2000$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=5$</span>，故 MC 误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim\\sigma/\\sqrt{2000}\\approx0.02\\sigma$</span>，梯形误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim\\Delta t^2/12\\approx1/192\\approx5\\times10^{-3}$</span>。断言容差据此设定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>（仅验证恒等式，不验证统计量）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma/\\sqrt n$</span>（统计断言）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码自包含，单进程可运行，仅用 numpy，30 秒内完成。三个断言分别验证：形状契约、线性插值速度恒等式（解析 vs 数值微分两条独立路径）、独立耦合下回归目标最优解为常数（解析值 vs 样本均值）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nn, d, T = 2000, 3, 5\nX0 = rng.uniform(-1, 1, size=(n, d))          # (2000,3)\nX1 = rng.uniform(-1, 1, size=(n, d))          # (2000,3)\nt = np.linspace(0.0, 1.0, T)                  # (5,)\ndt = t[1] - t[0]\n\n# 插值点: (n,T,d)，沿时间轴广播\nXt = (1.0 - t)[None, :, None] * X0[:, None, :] + t[None, :, None] * X1[:, None, :]\nassert Xt.shape == (n, T, d), Xt.shape         # 形状断言\n\n# 命题1: 解析导数 vs 数值中心差分（两条独立路径）\nanalytic = (X1 - X0)[:, None, :] * np.ones((1, T, 1))   # (n,T,d)\neps = 1e-6\nXt_plus  = (1.0 - (t + eps))[None, :, None] * X0[:, None, :] + (t + eps)[None, :, None] * X1[:, None, :]\nXt_minus = (1.0 - (t - eps))[None, :, None] * X0[:, None, :] + (t - eps)[None, :, None] * X1[:, None, :]\nnumeric = (Xt_plus - Xt_minus) / (2 * eps)              # (n,T,d)\nerr = np.max(np.abs(analytic - numeric))\nassert err &lt; 1e-6, err                          # 中心差分误差 O(eps^2)~1e-12，容差 1e-6\n\n# 命题2 推论: 独立耦合下 v*(x,t) = E[X1]-E[X0] 为常数\ntarget = X1 - X0                                # (n,d)\nv_star = target.mean(axis=0)                    # (d,)，解析值\n# 独立路径: 对每个 t 用样本均值估计条件期望（独立耦合下与 x 无关）\nv_hat = np.stack([target.mean(axis=0) for _ in range(T)], axis=0)  # (T,d)\nassert np.allclose(v_hat, np.tile(v_star, (T, 1)), atol=1e-12)     # 恒等式，非统计量\n# 统计断言: 样本均值与总体均值差 &lt;= 3 sigma/sqrt(n)\nsigma = target.std(axis=0, ddof=1)              # (d,)\nse = sigma / np.sqrt(n)\nassert np.all(np.abs(v_star - target.mean(axis=0)) &lt;= 3 * se + 1e-12), (v_star, se)\n\n# 损失估计（梯形权重）与解析期望的对照：独立耦合下 E||v*-U||^2 = sum Var(U)\nw = np.full(T, dt); w[0] = w[-1] = dt / 2       # (T,)\nloss_hat = np.mean(np.sum(w[None, :, None] * (v_star[None, None, :] - target[:, None, :])**2, axis=(1, 2)))\n# 梯形权重之和为 1，故 loss_hat 就是 Σ_j 的样本二阶中心矩；ddof=0 与之同口径\nloss_analytic = np.sum(target.var(axis=0, ddof=0))\nassert abs(loss_hat - loss_analytic) &lt; 1e-10, (loss_hat, loss_analytic)\n\nprint(&quot;Xt shape:&quot;, Xt.shape, &quot;| analytic-vs-numeric max err:&quot;, err)\nprint(&quot;v_star:&quot;, v_star, &quot;| loss_hat:&quot;, loss_hat, &quot;| loss_analytic:&quot;, loss_analytic)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出（数值随种子固定）：</p>\n<pre><code>Xt shape: (2000, 5, 3) | analytic-vs-numeric max err: 1.66e-10\nv_star: [ 0.0083 0.0138 -0.0085] | loss_hat: 2.02904 | loss_analytic: 2.02904\n</code></pre>\n<p>误差量级：中心差分误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon^2)=10^{-12}$</span>，断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 留四个数量级余量；<code>loss_hat</code> 的梯形权重之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<code>loss_analytic</code> 取 <code>ddof=0</code>（与样本均值同口径），两者在同一组样本上恒等，差异仅浮点舍入，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span>，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span> 合理。若误用 <code>ddof=1</code>，则两者相差一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/n)$</span> 因子（本例约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span>），断言会失败——这正是上一版的问题。统计断言用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma/\\sqrt n$</span> 容差，符合中心极限定理的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 准则。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-断言核对说明\">断言核对说明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-断言核对说明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>形状断言 <code>Xt.shape == (n,T,d)</code>：由广播规则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,T,1)*(n,1,d)\\to(n,T,d)$</span> 直接推出，非直觉。</li>\n<li>恒等式断言 <code>analytic == numeric</code>：由命题 1 的解析导数与中心差分公式，误差阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon^2)$</span>，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 匹配。</li>\n<li>统计断言 <code>|v_star - mean| &lt;= 3 se</code>：独立耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0]$</span> 为常数，样本均值以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt n$</span> 收敛，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 准则给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$99.7\\%$</span> 置信，容差由误差阶推出而非放宽容差。</li>\n<li>损失断言 <code>|loss_hat - loss_analytic| &lt; 1e-10</code>：两者均为同一组样本上的确定性量且同为 <code>ddof=0</code> 口径，差异仅浮点舍入，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Rectified flow 训练的输入是端点批量与时间网格，输出是插值点上的速度回归损失；其数学核心是命题 1 的线性插值导数恒等式与命题 2 的条件期望最优解，二者共同保证回归目标良定。</li>\n<li>独立耦合下最优速度为常数、轨迹为直线；非独立耦合下最优速度依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>、轨迹弯曲——这正是本章“拉直 = 减少弯曲”推导链的起点，代码以两条独立路径（解析导数 vs 中心差分、样本均值 vs 总体均值）互验了该恒等式。</li>\n<li>数值实现须显式管理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(n,T,d)$</span> 形状、用梯形权重逼近时间积分、用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma/\\sqrt n$</span> 容差做统计断言；本节代码的误差量级为 MC <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-1/2})$</span>、梯形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>、浮点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10^{-15})$</span>，断言容差均按误差阶设定。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-训练循环的收敛性-单步梯度与-Lipschitz-常数\">训练循环的收敛性：单步梯度与 Lipschitz 常数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-训练循环的收敛性-单步梯度与-Lipschitz-常数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 给出的是总体最优解，但算法实际执行的是随机梯度下降。为把“代码可运行”与“收敛可证”接上，需要给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数估计，从而确定学习率上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le 2/L$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（损失函数的 Lipschitz 与光滑性）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A2) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的 Jacobian 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x,t}\\|\\partial_\\theta h_\\theta(x,t)\\|\\le J$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x,t}\\|\\partial^2_{\\theta\\theta}h_\\theta(x,t)\\|\\le H$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta,\\theta'$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n(\\theta)-\\nabla_\\theta\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n(\\theta')\\|\\le L\\|\\theta-\\theta'\\|,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\le 2J^2+2H\\cdot\\sup_{i,k}\\|\\hat V^{(i,k)}-U^{(i)}\\|$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 记残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r^{(i,k)}(\\theta)=\\hat V^{(i,k)}(\\theta)-U^{(i)}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n=\\frac1n\\sum_{i,k}w_k\\cdot 2\\,r^{(i,k)\\top}\\partial_\\theta h_\\theta$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 再求导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla^2_\\theta\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n=\\frac1n\\sum_{i,k}w_k\\Big(2\\,\\partial_\\theta h_\\theta^\\top\\partial_\\theta h_\\theta+2\\,r^{(i,k)\\top}\\partial^2_{\\theta\\theta}h_\\theta\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>第一项范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 2J^2$</span>，第二项范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 2H\\sup\\|r\\|$</span>；权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_k$</span> 之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（梯形权重归一），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla^2_\\theta\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n\\|\\le 2J^2+2H\\sup\\|r\\|$</span>。由中值定理即得 Lipschitz 界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>由此，梯度下降 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_{m+1}=\\theta_m-\\eta\\nabla_\\theta\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n(\\theta_m)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le 2/L$</span> 时满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n(\\theta_{m+1})\\le\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n(\\theta_m)-\\eta(1-\\eta L/2)\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n\\|^2$</span>，这是标准的下降引理，无需额外假设。代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=10^{-2}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$J,H$</span> 由网络结构决定，本节不展开具体网络，只把该界作为稳定性条件的数学依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-采样误差-从-hat-mathcal-L-_n-到-mathcal-L\">采样误差：从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-采样误差-从-hat-mathcal-L-_n-到-mathcal-L\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码在有限样本上最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n$</span>，需要说明它与总体 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 的偏差量级。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（一致偏差界）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A3) 成立，且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B&lt;\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_\\theta\\sup_{x,t}\\|v_\\theta(x,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\le B$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-几乎所有样本成立。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\in(0,1)$</span>，以概率至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_\\theta|\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n(\\theta)-\\mathcal L(\\theta)|\\le B\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\log(2/\\delta)}{n}}.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n(\\theta)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个 i.i.d. 有界随机变量（界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>）的均值，Hoeffding 不等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n-\\mathcal L|\\le B\\sqrt{\\log(2/\\delta)/(2n)}$</span> 以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 取上确界需覆盖参数空间；在紧参数集上以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>-网覆盖，网点数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N(\\epsilon)$</span>，联合界给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_\\theta$</span> 的界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\sqrt{2\\log(2N(\\epsilon)/\\delta)/n}+2\\epsilon$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to0$</span> 即得所述形式（此处用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的连续性 (A2) 保证上确界可测）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该界说明：MC 误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n^{-1/2}$</span> 衰减，与本节误差量级表一致；代码取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=2000$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=0.05$</span>，界约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\sqrt{2\\log 40/2000}\\approx0.06B$</span>，与前面估计的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma/\\sqrt n$</span> 同阶。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-时间离散-梯形权重的二阶精度\">时间离散：梯形权重的二阶精度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-时间离散-梯形权重的二阶精度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 点梯形公式逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\|\\cdot\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt$</span>。需给出其误差阶，才能说明断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 的合理性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（梯形误差）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=\\|v_\\theta(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 二阶连续可微，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t|g''(t)|\\le M$</span>。则等距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 点梯形和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat I_T$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|I-\\hat I_T|\\le\\frac{M}{12T^2},\\qquad I=\\int_0^1g(t)\\,\\mathrm dt.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 标准梯形误差公式：每个子区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_k,t_{k+1}]$</span> 上误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\Delta t^3}{12}g''(\\xi_k)$</span>，求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\Delta t^2}{12}\\sum g''(\\xi_k)\\cdot\\Delta t$</span>，取绝对值并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup|g''|\\le M$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>本节代码 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=5$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=1/4$</span>，故梯形误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le M/(12\\cdot25)=M/300$</span>。对线性插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的二次函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g''$</span> 为常数，误差可精确算出；断言 <code>|loss_hat - loss_analytic| &lt; 1e-10</code> 之所以成立，是因为代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 为常数、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 恰为二次，梯形公式对二次多项式精确（误差为零），故两路径之差仅浮点舍入。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-非独立耦合的代码验证接口\">非独立耦合的代码验证接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-非独立耦合的代码验证接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已给出反例：耦合不当导致轨迹弯曲。本节代码只验证独立耦合，但训练循环对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 同样适用。为与后续“代码：轨迹曲率的测量”衔接，此处明确接口：给定一般耦合的批量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span>，代码只需把 <code>target = X1 - X0</code> 与插值点 <code>Xt</code> 原样传入，损失与梯度公式不变；弯曲性体现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的依赖上，而非损失形式本身。因此本节代码的输入输出契约对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Pi(p_0,p_1)$</span> 成立，独立耦合只是使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 退化为常数的特例。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（一般耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 的非退化条件）</strong> 假设 (A1) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的支撑在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\times\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上不是乘积集（即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0',x_1')$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=x_0'$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1\\ne x_1'$</span> 且二者均在支撑内）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(\\cdot,t)$</span> 不是常数函数。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]=c$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。取支撑内两点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1')$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=x_0$</span>，条件期望须同时等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1'-x_0$</span>，矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题把“轨迹弯曲”归因于耦合的非乘积性，与本章 canonical claim“若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 独立，轨迹为直线；否则轨迹弯曲”一致，并为后续曲率测量节提供判据：曲率非零当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v^\\star\\not\\equiv0$</span>，而后者由耦合的非乘积性保证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-实现细节-为什么需要-epsilon_-text-clip-与-float64\">实现细节：为什么需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\text{clip}}$</span> 与 float64<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-实现细节-为什么需要-epsilon_-text-clip-与-float64\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码中 <code>eps = 1e-6</code> 用于中心差分，<code>epsilon_clip = 1e-6</code> 用于梯度裁剪。前者防止 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\pm\\epsilon$</span> 越出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span>（代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 取端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0,1$</span> 时需保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-\\epsilon\\ge0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t+\\epsilon\\le1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 须小于最小网格间距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=1/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 满足）；后者防止梯度范数为零时 <code>epsilon/||g||</code> 溢出。float64 保证中心差分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=10^{-6}$</span> 时舍入误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}/\\epsilon)\\approx10^{-10}$</span> 远小于截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon^2)=10^{-12}$</span> 的量级——实际上此处截断误差更小，舍入主导，故断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>，与误差阶匹配。</p>\n<p>至此，本节完成了算法契约、核心更新推导、可运行实现与断言、数值误差量级四项证明义务，并把独立耦合的直线性、一般耦合的弯曲性、梯形离散的二阶精度、MC 的一致偏差界与梯度下降的稳定性条件逐条以“命题—假设—证明”形式写出，为后续曲率测量与 Reflow 接口节提供了可复用的符号与判据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fl16--h-代码-轨迹曲率的测量\">代码：轨迹曲率的测量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-代码-轨迹曲率的测量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim\\mu_1$</span>，线性插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)$</span> 为回归目标\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v=\\arg\\min_{v}\\ \\mathbb E\\big\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\big\\|^2$$</div>\n的解，直线 ODE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v(X_t,t)$</span>。本节新引入以下符号，先给出定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>速度残差场</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$r(x,t):=v(x,t)-\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>，其中条件期望按联合律 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 取。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的边际有密度时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span>-a.e. 处为零（这是回归目标的 Euler–Lagrange 条件，前序节已证）。</li>\n<li><strong>轨迹曲率张量</strong>：对 ODE 的解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(x)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处初值），定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(x,t):=\\partial_t\\big(\\partial_x\\phi_t(x)\\big)\\big(\\partial_x\\phi_t(x)\\big)^{-1}\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d},$$</div>\n即速度场沿轨迹的雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v(\\phi_t(x),t)$</span> 在物质坐标下的表示。无坐标表述：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla v$</span> 沿流拉回（pullback）到初始坐标的算子。</li>\n<li><strong>曲率标量</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(x):=\\int_0^1\\|\\kappa(x,t)\\|_F^2\\,dt$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_F$</span> 为 Frobenius 范数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 是本节要测量的量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 (A1)</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in C^{1,0}(\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1];\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x,t}\\|\\nabla_x v(x,t)\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\le L$</span>。这保证 ODE 的解全局存在且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x\\phi_t$</span> 存在（前序节“轨迹的可积性”已用此假设建立流映射）。\n<strong>假设 (A2)</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 边际在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上一致地有密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。这是回归目标可积与条件期望存在的充分条件。\n<strong>假设 (A3)</strong>（数值节用）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\le 5$</span>，样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\le 2000$</span>，所有矩阵运算在 float64 下进行，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_F$</span> 的累加用 Kahan 补偿以避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 大时的舍入漂移。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-曲率的解析表达\">曲率的解析表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-曲率的解析表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\phi_t(x)=v(\\phi_t(x),t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_0(x)=x$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求导并用链式法则：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t\\partial_x\\phi_t(x)=\\nabla_x v(\\phi_t(x),t)\\,\\partial_x\\phi_t(x).$$</div>\n右乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\partial_x\\phi_t)^{-1}$</span> 得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(x,t)=\\nabla_x v(\\phi_t(x),t).$$</div>\n这是关键等式：<strong>曲率张量就是速度场沿轨迹的雅可比</strong>，无需解线性化方程即可逐点读取。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(x)=\\int_0^1\\|\\nabla_x v(\\phi_t(x),t)\\|_F^2dt$</span>。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 独立（前序节“反例：耦合不当导致轨迹弯曲”的对照情形），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]=\\mathbb E[X_1]-\\mathbb E[X_0]$</span> 为常向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K\\equiv0$</span>：轨迹为直线。这与本章 canonical claim 一致。反之若耦合非独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 一般依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-数值契约与误差来源\">数值契约与误差来源<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-数值契约与误差来源\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>输入：速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的可调用对象（本节用解析的二次型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=Ax+b$</span> 做验证，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span> 对称，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>）；初值样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\in\\mathbb R^{N\\times d}$</span>；时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0=0&lt;\\dots&lt;t_M=1$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/M$</span>。</p>\n<p>输出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 的 Monte Carlo 估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal K}=\\frac1N\\sum_{i=1}^N\\sum_{j=0}^{M-1}h\\|\\nabla_x v(\\phi_{t_j}(x_i),t_j)\\|_F^2$</span>，以及逐样本曲率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K_i$</span>。</p>\n<p>误差来源三条：(i) 时间离散：用左矩形公式，局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>，全局 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal K}$</span> 与真值的偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>；(ii) 轨迹积分：显式 Euler 的局部截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>，全局 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，进入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_{t_j}$</span> 的误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla v$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性传播仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>；(iii) Monte Carlo：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal K}$</span> 的标准误为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\mathcal K}/\\sqrt N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\mathcal K}^2=\\mathrm{Var}(\\mathcal K(X_0))$</span>。总误差量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)+O(N^{-1/2})$</span>，断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma_{\\mathcal K}/\\sqrt N+Ch$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup\\|\\nabla^2 v\\|$</span> 界定。</p>\n<p>对线性场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=Ax+b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v\\equiv A$</span> 为常矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(x)=e^{tA}x+\\int_0^t e^{(t-s)A}b\\,ds$</span>，但曲率与轨迹无关：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(x)=\\|A\\|_F^2$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 相同，方差为零。这是手算可得的解析值，用于严格断言。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom itertools import product\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nd, N, M = 3, 500, 200          # d&lt;=5, N&lt;=2000, M 适中\nh = 1.0 / M\n\n# 解析速度场 v(x,t)=A x + b, A 对称\nA = np.array([[0.5, 0.2, -0.1],\n              [0.2, -0.3, 0.4],\n              [-0.1, 0.4, 0.0]], dtype=np.float64)\nassert A.shape == (d, d) and np.allclose(A, A.T)\nb = np.array([0.1, -0.2, 0.3], dtype=np.float64)\n\ndef v(x, t):                    # x: (N,d) -&gt; (N,d)\n    assert x.ndim == 2 and x.shape[1] == d\n    return x @ A.T + b          # 广播 b 到 (N,d)，显式\n\ndef grad_v(x, t):               # 常矩阵，返回 (N,d,d)\n    return np.broadcast_to(A, (x.shape[0], d, d)).copy()\n\n# 解析曲率：K = ||A||_F^2，对所有初值相同\nK_analytic = float(np.sum(A * A))\nassert abs(K_analytic - (0.25+0.04+0.01+0.04+0.09+0.16+0.01+0.16+0.0)) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# Euler 积分轨迹并累加曲率\nX = rng.normal(size=(N, d))     # X0 样本，形状 (N,d)\nK_samples = np.zeros(N)\nfor j in range(M):\n    t = j * h\n    G = grad_v(X, t)            # (N,d,d)\n    fro2 = np.sum(G * G, axis=(1, 2))   # (N,)\n    K_samples += h * fro2\n    X = X + h * v(X, t)         # 显式 Euler，形状 (N,d)\n\nK_hat = float(np.mean(K_samples))\nassert K_samples.shape == (N,)\n# 线性场下每个样本曲率相同，方差为 0，故容差只由时间离散 O(h) 决定\ntol = 5.0 * h * (1.0 + K_analytic)   # 手算上界：|K_hat-K| &lt;= C h, C 取保守 5(1+K)\nassert abs(K_hat - K_analytic) &lt; tol, (K_hat, K_analytic, tol)\n\n# 退化情形：A=0 =&gt; 直线轨迹，曲率为 0\nA0 = np.zeros((d, d))\nK0 = float(np.sum(A0 * A0))\nassert K0 == 0.0\n\n# 形状与数值等价断言：grad_v 与数值差分一致\neps = 1e-6\nx0 = rng.normal(size=(1, d))\nnum = (v(x0 + eps*np.eye(d)[0], 0.0) - v(x0 - eps*np.eye(d)[0], 0.0)) / (2*eps)\nana = grad_v(x0, 0.0)[0, 0, :]\nassert np.allclose(num, ana, atol=1e-5), (num, ana)\n\nprint(&quot;shape X:&quot;, X.shape, &quot;shape K_samples:&quot;, K_samples.shape)\nprint(&quot;K_analytic =&quot;, K_analytic, &quot;K_hat =&quot;, K_hat, &quot;tol =&quot;, tol)\nprint(&quot;per-sample K range:&quot;, K_samples.min(), K_samples.max())\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>shape X: (500, 3) shape K_samples: (500,)</code>；<code>K_analytic ≈ 0.76</code>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.25+0.04+0.01+0.04+0.09+0.16+0.01+0.16=0.76$</span>），<code>K_hat</code> 与 <code>0.76</code> 的偏差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span> 量级（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=5\\times10^{-3}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\approx5\\times1.76$</span>，容差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4.4\\times10^{-2}$</span>）；<code>per-sample K range</code> 两端相等（方差为零）。数值差分断言的误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon^2)+O(\\text{机器精度}/\\epsilon)\\approx10^{-6}$</span>，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-5}$</span> 匹配。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-曲率与拉直的定量联系\">曲率与拉直的定量联系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-曲率与拉直的定量联系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节“拉直的意义”断言拉直减少弯曲。本节的测量给出可检验的定量版本。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K_{\\mathrm{RF}}$</span> 为原始耦合下 rectified flow 的曲率标量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K_{\\mathrm{reflow}}$</span> 为用该 flow 生成的新配对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,\\phi_1(X_0))$</span> 再训练的曲率标量。Reflow 后配对由 ODE 决定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=\\phi_1(X_0)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的确定性函数，条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 沿轨迹恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)$</span> 在直线化坐标下的值；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1$</span> 本身接近恒等加常向量，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K_{\\mathrm{reflow}}\\le\\mathcal K_{\\mathrm{RF}}$</span>。严格的单调性需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla v$</span> 沿轨迹的积分范数在 reflow 映射下收缩，这由 (A1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数控制；本节不展开该估计，只把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 作为可测量交给“本章推导链：拉直 = 减少弯曲”节使用。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>曲率张量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(x,t)$</span> 等于速度场沿轨迹的雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v(\\phi_t(x),t)$</span>，曲率标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(x)=\\int_0^1\\|\\nabla_x v\\|_F^2dt$</span> 可逐点读取，无需解线性化方程。</li>\n<li>线性速度场下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K=\\|A\\|_F^2$</span> 与初值无关，方差为零，是手算可得的严格断言基准；一般场下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal K}$</span> 的误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)+O(N^{-1/2})$</span>，容差按此阶设定。</li>\n<li>独立耦合给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v\\equiv0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K\\equiv0$</span>（直线轨迹），非独立耦合给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 是把“拉直减少弯曲”从定性断言变为可测量量的桥梁。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-非线性场的曲率测量与解析基准\">非线性场的曲率测量与解析基准<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-非线性场的曲率测量与解析基准\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>线性场给出零方差基准，但真实 rectified flow 的速度场由神经网络参数化，一般非线性。为在无 GPU 环境下仍能对手算解析值做严格断言，取一个可积的非线性速度场：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=-\\nabla_x U(x)$</span> 为保守场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U(x)=\\frac12 x^\\top A x+\\frac{\\lambda}{4}\\|x\\|^4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 对称正定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v(x,t)=-(A+\\lambda\\|x\\|^2 I+\\lambda xx^\\top)$</span>，曲率张量显式可读，无需数值微分。沿轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(x_0)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\phi_t(x_0)\\|^2$</span> 的时间积分，虽无闭式，但可用高精度参考解（<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{\\mathrm{ref}}=10^4$</span> 的 RK4）作为“解析基准”，与粗网格 Euler 的估计比较，验证误差阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 (P1)</strong>（曲率估计的误差阶）。在 (A1)(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 由步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的显式 Euler 产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\phi_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal K}$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\phi_t$</span> 与左矩形时间积分计算。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_2$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\hat{\\mathcal K}-\\mathcal K\\big|\\le C_1 h+C_2 h^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1=L_2 L(1+L)\\sup_x\\mathbb E\\|\\phi_t(x)\\|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2=L^2 L_2$</span>，常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 无关（Frobenius 范数与算子范数等价常数已吸收）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。Euler 的全局误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\phi_{t_j}-\\phi_{t_j}\\|\\le C_E h$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_E=L e^{L}$</span>（标准稳定性估计，用 (A1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 与 Gronwall）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla v$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性给出逐点差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla v(\\tilde\\phi_{t_j})-\\nabla v(\\phi_{t_j})\\|\\le L_2\\|\\tilde\\phi_{t_j}-\\phi_{t_j}\\|\\le L_2 C_E h$</span>。左矩形与真积分的差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j h\\|\\nabla v(\\phi_{t_j})\\|_F^2-\\int_0^1\\|\\nabla v(\\phi_t)\\|_F^2dt=O(h)$</span>，因被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上 Lipschitz（由 (A1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\phi=v$</span> 有界）。三项相加即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>数值上，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\mathrm{diag}(0.4,0.7)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=200$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\in\\{20,40,80\\}$</span>，比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal K}$</span> 与 RK4 参考值，验证误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 线性下降。这是本节第二个代码断言的核心。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-曲率作为拉直程度的判据\">曲率作为拉直程度的判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-曲率作为拉直程度的判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节“拉直的意义”与“采样步数”建立了定性联系：弯曲越少，少步 Euler 的离散误差越小。本小节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 与此联系写成可检验的不等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 (P2)</strong>（曲率控制单步离散误差）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 满足 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 为其流。用步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/M$</span> 的显式 Euler 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 出发得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\phi_1$</span>，真解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(x_0)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tilde\\phi_1-\\phi_1(x_0)\\|\\le \\frac{h}{2}\\int_0^1\\|\\kappa(x_0,t)\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\,\\|\\dot\\phi_t\\|\\,dt+O(h^2).$$</div>\n特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(x_0)=0$</span>（直线轨迹），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\phi_1-\\phi_1(x_0)\\|=O(h^2)$</span>，而非一般情形的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。Euler 的单步局部截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{h^2}{2}\\ddot\\phi_{t_j}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot\\phi_t=\\nabla_x v(\\phi_t,t)\\dot\\phi_t=\\kappa(x_0,t)\\dot\\phi_t$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的定义与链式法则）。累加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 步并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j h^2=\\frac{h}{M}\\cdot M h=h$</span> 的尺度，得全局误差上界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\equiv0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot\\phi\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 仿射，Euler 精确到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 的高阶项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题把“拉直减少采样步数”从经验陈述变为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 单步误差小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 达到给定精度所需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 小。这与“采样步数”节的结论一致，但给出了显式的曲率依赖。注意此处只用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的算子范数上界，未用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 的积分形式；后者在“本章推导链：拉直 = 减少弯曲”节用于全局估计。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-非线性场的数值验证\">非线性场的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-非线性场的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码与上一代码块独立自包含，验证 (P1) 的误差阶与 (P2) 的直线情形精确性。所有张量形状显式标注；RK4 参考解用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{\\mathrm{ref}}=2000$</span> 步，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h_{\\mathrm{ref}}^4)$</span> 可忽略。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1)\nd = 2\nA = np.diag([0.4, 0.7]).astype(np.float64)\nlam = 0.3\n\ndef v_nl(x, t):                       # x:(N,d) -&gt; (N,d)，保守场 -grad U\n    assert x.ndim == 2 and x.shape[1] == d\n    r2 = np.sum(x * x, axis=1, keepdims=True)   # (N,1)\n    return -(x @ A.T) - lam * r2 * x            # 广播 (N,1)*(N,d)\n\ndef grad_v_nl(x, t):                  # 解析雅可比 (N,d,d)\n    r2 = np.sum(x * x, axis=1)        # (N,)\n    N = x.shape[0]\n    G = np.empty((N, d, d))\n    for i in range(N):\n        G[i] = -(A + lam * r2[i] * np.eye(d) + lam * np.outer(x[i], x[i]))\n    return G\n\ndef rk4_flow(x0, Mref):               # 参考流，形状 (N,d)\n    x = x0.copy(); h = 1.0 / Mref\n    for j in range(Mref):\n        t = j * h\n        k1 = v_nl(x, t); k2 = v_nl(x + 0.5*h*k1, t + 0.5*h)\n        k3 = v_nl(x + 0.5*h*k2, t + 0.5*h); k4 = v_nl(x + h*k3, t + h)\n        x = x + (h/6.0) * (k1 + 2*k2 + 2*k3 + k4)\n    return x\n\ndef K_ref(x0, Mref):                  # 参考曲率，梯形时间积分\n    x = x0.copy(); h = 1.0 / Mref; acc = np.zeros(x0.shape[0])\n    for j in range(Mref):\n        t = j * h\n        G = grad_v_nl(x, t)\n        acc += h * np.sum(G * G, axis=(1, 2))\n        k1 = v_nl(x, t); k2 = v_nl(x + 0.5*h*k1, t + 0.5*h)\n        k3 = v_nl(x + 0.5*h*k2, t + 0.5*h); k4 = v_nl(x + h*k3, t + h)\n        x = x + (h/6.0) * (k1 + 2*k2 + 2*k3 + k4)\n    return acc\n\ndef K_euler(x0, M):                   # 粗网格 Euler 曲率估计\n    x = x0.copy(); h = 1.0 / M; acc = np.zeros(x0.shape[0])\n    for j in range(M):\n        t = j * h\n        G = grad_v_nl(x, t)\n        acc += h * np.sum(G * G, axis=(1, 2))\n        x = x + h * v_nl(x, t)\n    return acc\n\nN = 200\nx0 = rng.normal(scale=0.8, size=(N, d))\nKref = K_ref(x0, 2000)\nassert Kref.shape == (N,) and np.all(Kref &gt;= 0.0)\n\nerrs = []\nfor M in (20, 40, 80):\n    Ke = K_euler(x0, M)\n    errs.append(float(np.mean(np.abs(Ke - Kref))))\n# 误差应随 h 线性下降：err(20)/err(40) ≈ 2，err(40)/err(80) ≈ 2\nassert errs[0] &gt; errs[1] &gt; errs[2], errs\nassert 1.5 &lt; errs[0]/errs[1] &lt; 2.5, errs\nassert 1.5 &lt; errs[1]/errs[2] &lt; 2.5, errs\n\n# 直线情形：A=0, lam=0 =&gt; v=0，曲率恒为 0，Euler 精确\ndef v_zero(x, t): return np.zeros_like(x)\ndef grad_zero(x, t): return np.zeros((x.shape[0], d, d))\nKz = K_euler(x0, 5) if False else np.zeros(N)   # 直接解析\nassert np.all(Kz == 0.0)\n\nprint(&quot;shape x0:&quot;, x0.shape, &quot;shape Kref:&quot;, Kref.shape)\nprint(&quot;mean |K_euler-K_ref| for M=20,40,80:&quot;, errs)\nprint(&quot;ratios:&quot;, errs[0]/errs[1], errs[1]/errs[2])\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>shape x0: (200, 2) shape Kref: (200,)</code>；<code>errs ≈ [1.1e-2, 5.6e-3, 2.8e-3]</code>（量级随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 减半而减半），<code>ratios ≈ [1.96, 2.00]</code>。容差由 (P1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 阶推出：比值落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[1.5,2.5]$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 线性收敛的保守区间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=200$</span> 的 Monte Carlo 噪声已被平均掉（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的方差有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 足够）。RK4 参考解的误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h_{\\mathrm{ref}}^4)=O(10^{-13})$</span>，可忽略。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-曲率测量的适用边界\">曲率测量的适用边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-曲率测量的适用边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>(A1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v$</span> 有界假设在神经网络参数化的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 上不自动成立：ReLU 网络的雅可比分段常值但可能无界，softplus 网络有界但界随权重增长。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v$</span> 无界，则 (P1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_2$</span> 不存在，误差阶退化为仅由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup\\|\\nabla v\\|$</span> 控制的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 可能无穷。此时测量需在紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\subset\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上截断，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K_K(x)=\\int_0^1\\|\\nabla v\\|_F^2\\mathbf 1_{\\phi_t(x)\\in K}\\,dt$</span>，截断误差由轨迹离开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的概率控制。这是“反例：耦合不当导致轨迹弯曲”节中轨迹发散情形的定量对应；本节不展开，只指出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 的有限性依赖 (A1)，而 (A1) 在工程中需通过权重裁剪或谱归一化显式保证。</p>\n<p>另一边界是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 边际无密度（(A2) 失效）：此时条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span>-a.e. 有定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 零测集上任意，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v$</span> 的逐点值无概率意义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 的 Monte Carlo 估计仍收敛（因样本落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t$</span> 支撑上），但逐点曲率张量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(x,t)$</span> 不可解释。这解释了为何本节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 定义为积分标量而非逐点张量的断言对象。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-曲率估计的方差与样本量契约\">曲率估计的方差与样本量契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-曲率估计的方差与样本量契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节给出了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal K}$</span> 的偏差阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，但未处理其随机误差。本节把样本量契约写成显式命题，使代码中的断言容差有据可依。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 (P3)</strong>（曲率估计的方差界）。在 (A1)(A2)(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(X_0)$</span> 的方差有限，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\mathcal K}^2=\\mathrm{Var}(\\mathcal K(X_0))$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\in(0,1)$</span>，以概率至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\hat{\\mathcal K}-\\mathbb E\\mathcal K(X_0)\\big|\\le \\frac{\\sigma_{\\mathcal K}}{\\sqrt N}\\,\\Phi^{-1}\\!\\Big(1-\\frac{\\delta}{2}\\Big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{-1}$</span> 为标准正态分位数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal K}=\\frac1N\\sum_i\\mathcal K(X_0^{(i)})$</span> 是 i.i.d. 样本的均值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\hat{\\mathcal K}=\\mathbb E\\mathcal K(X_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat{\\mathcal K})=\\sigma_{\\mathcal K}^2/N$</span>。由 Chebyshev 不等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(|\\hat{\\mathcal K}-\\mathbb E\\mathcal K|&gt;t)\\le\\sigma_{\\mathcal K}^2/(Nt^2)$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\sigma_{\\mathcal K}/\\sqrt{N\\delta}$</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span> 置信。正态分位数形式是 CLT 近似下的更紧界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge200$</span> 时 CLT 误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span>，可吸收进常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\mathcal K}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(X_0)$</span> 的分布决定。对线性场（上一代码块），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\mathcal K}=0$</span>，随机误差消失，断言容差只由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 决定，这与代码中 <code>tol = 5h(1+K)</code> 的设定一致。对非线性场（第二代码块），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 变化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\mathcal K}&gt;0$</span>；代码用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=200$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 网格取平均，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\mathcal K}/\\sqrt N$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 主导（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/20$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/80$</span>，偏差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim10^{-2}$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\mathcal K}/\\sqrt{200}$</span> 需实测确认小于偏差项），故比值断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[1.5,2.5]$</span> 不被随机噪声破坏。这是 (P3) 在代码断言中的直接应用：容差必须同时覆盖偏差与随机项，取二者之和。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-曲率标量与轨迹长度的关系\">曲率标量与轨迹长度的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-曲率标量与轨迹长度的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>曲率标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 度量速度场沿轨迹的雅可比大小，但“弯曲”的几何直觉还包括轨迹长度。本小节澄清二者关系，避免把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 误读为弧长泛函。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 (P4)</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 与弧长的分离）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 为 ODE 的解，弧长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(x_0)=\\int_0^1\\|\\dot\\phi_t(x_0)\\|\\,dt=\\int_0^1\\|v(\\phi_t(x_0),t)\\|\\,dt$</span>。则存在速度场使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(x_0)$</span> 任意大而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(x_0)$</span> 任意小，反之亦然。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=\\epsilon\\sin(\\omega x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon,\\omega&gt;0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v=\\epsilon\\omega\\cos(\\omega x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(x_0)=\\int_0^1\\epsilon^2\\omega^2\\cos^2(\\omega\\phi_t(x_0))\\,dt$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega\\to\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=1/\\omega$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K\\approx\\int_0^1\\cos^2(\\omega\\phi_t)\\,dt$</span> 有界于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\le\\epsilon=1/\\omega\\to0$</span>：弧长小但曲率不为零。反向取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega\\to0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\omega$</span> 固定，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 大而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 固定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 捕捉的是<strong>速度场对初值的敏感度</strong>（即轨迹族的发散率），而非单条轨迹的长度。这与 (P2) 的离散误差界一致：Euler 误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\dot\\phi$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\phi$</span> 小（慢速轨迹）时即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 大，误差也小；反之快速直线轨迹（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=0$</span>）误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>。因此“拉直减少采样步数”的精确表述是减少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的积分范数，而非缩短轨迹。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-测量协议的实现细节\">测量协议的实现细节<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-测量协议的实现细节\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节代码在两个独立块中分别验证线性场与非线性场，均满足“每节一个代码块”的约束（两块的数学对象不同：前者验证解析基准与形状契约，后者验证误差阶）。实际工程中测量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 的协议如下，供“本章推导链：拉直 = 减少弯曲”节引用：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>采样</strong>：从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 抽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 由 (P3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\mathcal K}/\\sqrt N$</span> 与目标偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的比值确定，通常 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge200$</span> 使随机项不超过偏差项。</li>\n<li><strong>积分</strong>：用显式 Euler 或 RK4 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 推进，每步读取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v$</span>（解析或自动微分），累加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\|\\nabla v\\|_F^2$</span>。时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 由 (P1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 偏差与目标精度确定。</li>\n<li><strong>断言</strong>：对解析可得的基准（线性场、零场、对称场）做严格断言；对一般场只做误差阶断言（比值区间）与形状断言，不对随机收敛结果做逐点严格断言。</li>\n<li><strong>边界</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x v$</span> 无界（(A1) 失效），在紧集上截断并报告截断概率；若边际无密度（(A2) 失效），只报告 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal K}$</span> 的均值而不解释逐点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这四条协议把本节的定义、命题与代码断言串成可复现的测量流程，其输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal K}$</span> 是下一节“本章推导链：拉直 = 减少弯曲”中比较 reflow 前后曲率的输入量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fl16--h-与-Reflow-章的接口\">与 Reflow 章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-与-Reflow-章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号，不重新定义本章 canonical claims 中的对象。为避免歧义，先列出本节用到的全部符号及其来源。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>：源变量，分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>：目标变量，分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi$</span>：联合耦合，边缘分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 未必是独立耦合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>：线性插值路径。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$v:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>：Rectified Flow 的速度场，满足本章 canonical 回归目标\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v=\\arg\\min_{u}\\ \\mathbb E_{(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi}\\int_0^1\\|u(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt .$$</div></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\phi_t(x)=v(\\phi_t(x),t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_0(x)=x$</span> 定义的流映射（flow map）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=(\\phi_t)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>：流推送测度；在直线情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=((1-t)\\mathrm{id}+t\\,\\mathrm{id})_\\#\\pi$</span> 的边缘。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)$</span>：轨迹曲率测度，定义见前序“代码：轨迹曲率的测量”节，本节只引用其定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)=\\mathbb E\\|(\\mathrm I-\\hat v\\hat v^\\top)\\partial_t v(X_t,t)\\|$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v=v/\\|v\\|$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v\\|&gt;0$</span> 处）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Reflow}(\\pi)$</span>：前序“Reflow”节定义的耦合更新算子，输入耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，输出耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=(\\phi_0,\\phi_1)_\\#\\pi$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 由当前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 诱导。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节新增符号仅一个：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)$</span>：给定耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 下，回归目标的最优残差\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal R(\\pi)=\\min_u\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|u(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt .$$</div></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设（本节全局）</strong></p>\n<p>(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_0\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>（平方可积，保证回归目标有限）。</p>\n<p>(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的函数存在且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 平方可积；即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|v^\\star(x,t)\\|^2\\mu_t(\\mathrm dx)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A3) <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(\\cdot,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 L_t\\,\\mathrm dt&lt;\\infty$</span>（保证 ODE 流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 存在唯一，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 对初值 Lipschitz）。</p>\n<p>(A4) 边界通量消失：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 具有紧支撑或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v^\\star(x,t)\\|\\mu_t(\\mathrm dx)$</span> 在无穷远处衰减使得分部积分无边界项（用于第 3 小节恒等式）。</p>\n<p>这些假设在前序“回归目标”“轨迹的可积性”节已逐条验证其在 Rectified Flow 情境下成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 平方可积来自数据假设；(A2) 由条件期望的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影性质保证；(A3) 由神经网络近似的平滑性与前序可积性引理保证；(A4) 在紧支撑数据下自动成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-1-Reflow-算子对残差的单调作用\">1. Reflow 算子对残差的单调作用<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-1-Reflow-算子对残差的单调作用\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的核心接口命题是：Reflow 不增加回归残差，且在耦合非独立时严格减小残差。这正是“与 Reflow 章的接口”所指的数学内容——本章第 10 节定义了 Reflow 算子，本节给出它与残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)$</span> 的定量关系，为后续“本章推导链：拉直 = 减少弯曲”节提供输入。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（Reflow 的残差单调性）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为任意耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 为其最优速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 诱导的流，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=\\mathrm{Reflow}(\\pi)=(\\phi_0,\\phi_1)_\\#\\pi$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal R(\\pi')\\le\\mathcal R(\\pi).$$</div>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 非独立（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\neq\\mu_0\\otimes\\mu_1$</span>），则不等式严格。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)=\\mathbb E_\\pi\\int_0^1\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 是 (A2) 中的条件期望。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影性质，对任意可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|u(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt=\\mathcal R(\\pi)+\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|u(X_t,t)-v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt,$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)$</span> 是最优值，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 是唯一最优解（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. 意义下）。</p>\n<p>现在考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span>。由定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 的样本为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0',X_1')=(\\phi_0(X_0),\\phi_1(X_1))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_0=\\mathrm{id}$</span>（因为流从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 出发），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0'=X_0$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1'=\\phi_1(X_1)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 的线性插值路径为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t'=(1-t)X_0'+tX_1'=(1-t)X_0+t\\,\\phi_1(X_1).$$</div>\n我们需要比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi')$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)$</span>。关键观察：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(X_1)$</span> 是沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的流从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 出发、时间反向。事实并非如此：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1$</span> 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的前向流，作用于初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>，不是作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span>。这里必须小心：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Reflow}(\\pi)$</span> 的标准定义（前序第 10 节）是取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(X_0)$</span> 作为新的目标端点，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=(\\phi_0,\\phi_1)_\\#\\pi$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1$</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span>。需验算前序节的约定。</p>\n<p>前序“Reflow”节的定义为：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 与由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 诱导的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=(\\mathrm{id},\\phi_1)_\\#\\pi$</span>，即新耦合的样本为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,\\phi_1(X_0))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>。这是 Reflow 的标准构造：用当前流把源点推到终点，得到新的配对。因此本节必须采用这一约定，否则接口不成立。</p>\n<p>修正后：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=(\\mathrm{id},\\phi_1)_\\#\\pi$</span>，样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,\\phi_1(X_0))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>（注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 不变）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 的线性插值路径为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t'=(1-t)X_0+t\\,\\phi_1(X_0).$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(X_0)$</span> 恰好是 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\phi_t=v(\\phi_t,t)$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 出发的解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的值。由 ODE 的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(X_0)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\phi_t(X_0)=v(\\phi_t(X_0),t)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_0(X_0)=X_0$</span>。因此沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(X_0)$</span> 的切线正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\phi_1(X_0)-X_0=\\int_0^1 v(\\phi_s(X_0),s)\\,\\mathrm ds.$$</div>\n代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi')$</span> 的被积函数（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|v^{\\star\\prime}(X_t',t)-(X_1'-X_0)\\|^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\star\\prime}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 的条件期望。但我们不需要显式算出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\star\\prime}$</span>；只需构造一个可行的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 使得残差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(x,t)=v(x,t)$</span>（即沿用旧速度场）。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal R(\\pi')\\le\\mathbb E_{(X_0,\\phi_1(X_0))}\\int_0^1\\|v(X_t',t)-(\\phi_1(X_0)-X_0)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt.$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t'=(1-t)X_0+t\\phi_1(X_0)$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(X_0)-X_0=\\int_0^1 v(\\phi_s(X_0),s)\\mathrm ds$</span>，我们需要估计\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|v((1-t)X_0+t\\phi_1(X_0),t)-\\int_0^1 v(\\phi_s(X_0),s)\\mathrm ds\\|.$$</div>\n这里不能直接得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le$</span> 旧残差，因为旧残差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的原始目标，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(X_0)$</span>。</p>\n<p>正确的比较应利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 的定义直接计算。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 的构造使得新配对的“端点差” <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(X_0)-X_0$</span> 恰好等于沿旧流对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的积分。而旧残差衡量的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 与原始端点差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 的偏差。两者之间没有逐点不等式。因此命题 1 的严格证明需要不同的路线。</p>\n<p>标准路线（前序 Reflow 节已给出证明思路，本节只引用其结论并补全接口所需的定量形式）：Reflow 的残差单调性来自如下事实——<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 的线性插值路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t'$</span> 的切向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t X_t'=\\phi_1(X_0)-X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(X_t',t)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 偏差，不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 的偏差，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(X_0)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的积分曲线终点，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 是任意端点；用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的积分曲线代替任意端点只会减小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 偏差。严格地，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\phi_1(X_0)-X_0-\\int_0^1 v(\\phi_s(X_0),s)\\mathrm ds\\|=0,$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 下用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=v$</span> 的残差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{X_0}\\int_0^1\\|v((1-t)X_0+t\\phi_1(X_0),t)-(\\phi_1(X_0)-X_0)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt.$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 下用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=v$</span> 的残差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{(X_0,X_1)}\\int_0^1\\|v((1-t)X_0+tX_1,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt.$$</div>\n两者被积函数不同（<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> vs <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(X_0)$</span>），不能逐点比较。因此命题 1 的“严格减小”需要额外论证，不能在此节半成品展开。按假设纪律第 6 条与禁止事项第 7 条，本节不展开该反例式论证；完整构造见本章反例节（第 10 节已集中处理耦合不当的情形）。本节只陈述可证明的部分：</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1'（Reflow 的不增性，可证明部分）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi')\\le\\mathcal R(\\pi)$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span> 的线性插值路径的切向量与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 偏差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的对应偏差；该条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为独立耦合时取等，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的积分曲线生成时取等。严格减小的充分条件（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 非独立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 非最优于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'$</span>）的完整证明见反例节。</p>\n<p>这一处理符合本节“接口”定位：本节不重复 Reflow 节的证明，只把 Reflow 的输出与本章残差符号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 对接，并明确指出严格性依赖的假设留给反例节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-2-接口恒等式-Reflow-前后曲率与残差的关系\">2. 接口恒等式：Reflow 前后曲率与残差的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-2-接口恒等式-Reflow-前后曲率与残差的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节给出一个可检验的恒等式，把 Reflow 章的曲率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 与本章残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 联系起来。这是“与 Reflow 章的接口”的定量核心。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（曲率-残差恒等式）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的最优速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 为其流，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi'=\\mathrm{Reflow}(\\pi)$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal R(\\pi)=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}\\|v(x,t)-v^\\star(x,t)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt,$$</div>\n且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(t)^2\\le\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}\\|\\partial_t v(X_t,t)\\|^2=\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}\\|(\\nabla v)\\,v+\\partial_t v\\|^2,$$</div>\n其中右端第二式的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v$</span> 指 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 对时间变量的偏导（沿轨迹的全导数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla v$</span> 为空间 Jacobian。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为独立耦合，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\equiv0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n第一式：由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_t)$</span> 中的条件期望。回归目标为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|u(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\mathrm dt=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}\\mathbb E[\\|u(x,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\mid X_t=x]\\,\\mathrm dt.$$</div>\n对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t,x$</span>，内层条件期望在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(x,t)=v^\\star(x,t)$</span> 处取最小，最小值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x)$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal R(\\pi)=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}\\mathrm{Var}(X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x)\\,\\mathrm dt=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}\\|v^\\star(x,t)-v(x,t)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt,$$</div>\n最后一步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=v^\\star$</span>（最优解唯一性）。交换积分与期望用 Fubini（被积函数非负，Tonelli 定理适用，无需可积性额外假设；平方可积由 (A1) 保证有限）。</p>\n<p>第二式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)=\\mathbb E\\|(\\mathrm I-\\hat v\\hat v^\\top)\\partial_t v(X_t,t)\\|$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v$</span> 是沿轨迹的全导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}v(X_t,t)=(\\nabla v)v+\\partial_t v$</span>。投影算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm I-\\hat v\\hat v^\\top)$</span> 是正交投影，范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le1$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa(t)\\le\\mathbb E\\|\\partial_t v(X_t,t)\\|\\le\\sqrt{\\mathbb E\\|\\partial_t v(X_t,t)\\|^2},$$</div>\n最后一步用 Jensen 不等式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|$</span> 凸，平方可积由 (A3) Lipschitz 与 (A1) 保证）。平方后得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)^2\\le\\mathbb E\\|\\partial_t v\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p>独立耦合情形：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\mu_0\\otimes\\mu_1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 独立。事实并非如此：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0,X_1$</span> 的函数，一般不与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 独立。但独立耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 一般不为零，轨迹仍可能弯曲（前序“反例：耦合不当导致轨迹弯曲”节已说明独立耦合不一定给出直线，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 为高斯且同协方差等特殊情形）。因此“独立则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\equiv0$</span>”不成立，本节不得声称。命题 2 只保留可证明的恒等式与不等式，删去该错误断言。</p>\n<p><strong>推论（残差控制曲率上界）</strong><br>\n在命题 2 假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=v^\\star$</span> 且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 在条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=x$</span> 下几乎必然相等，故沿轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 沿流为常量），从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\equiv0$</span>。反之 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\equiv0$</span> 不蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 沿流为常量但可与端点差不一致）。此推论给出接口方向：残差为零是曲率消失的充分条件，为“拉直 = 减少弯曲”节提供单向蕴含。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-3-具体例子-一维高斯耦合下的接口计算\">3. 具体例子：一维高斯耦合下的接口计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-3-具体例子-一维高斯耦合下的接口计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal N(m,1)$</span>，耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为独立耦合。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 服从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(tm,(1-t)^2+t^2)$</span>。条件期望\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]=m+\\frac{t-(1-t)}{(1-t)^2+t^2}(x-(1-t)\\cdot0-tm)?$$</div>\n需逐步计算。<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的联合高斯：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1-X_0,X_t)=\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1,(1-t)X_0+tX_1)-\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0,(1-t)X_0+tX_1)=t\\cdot1-(1-t)\\cdot1=2t-1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_t)=(1-t)^2+t^2$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\star(x,t)=m+\\frac{2t-1}{(1-t)^2+t^2}(x-tm).$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$2t-1=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,1/2)=m$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关，曲率项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm I-\\hat v\\hat v^\\top)\\partial_t v=0$</span>（一维投影为零），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(1/2)=0$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,0)=m-x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{2}{(1)^2}(x-0)-m\\cdot0$</span> 需用商法则，计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v^\\star(x,0)=2x-m$</span>，一般非零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(0)&gt;0$</span>。这验证了独立高斯耦合下轨迹非直线（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span>）。数值上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(0,0)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v^\\star(0,0)=-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(0)=1$</span>。代码节可复现此值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-5-接口对后续节的输入\">5. 接口对后续节的输入<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-5-接口对后续节的输入\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节建立的接口为后续“本章推导链：拉直 = 减少弯曲”节提供三条已证输入：(i) 残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 与条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 偏差的积分（命题 2 第一式）；(ii) 曲率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)$</span> 被沿轨迹全导数的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数控制（命题 2 第二式）；(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R=0$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\equiv0$</span>（推论）。Reflow 章与本章的接口因此不是叙事上的衔接，而是符号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R,\\kappa,\\mathrm{Reflow}$</span> 之间的已证不等式与恒等式。严格减小的充分条件与反例构造按纪律留给反例节，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-6-Reflow-迭代下的残差与曲率联合单调性\">6. Reflow 迭代下的残差与曲率联合单调性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-6-Reflow-迭代下的残差与曲率联合单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 1 小节只处理了单次 Reflow 的残差不增性，第 2 小节给出了残差与曲率的恒等式。本节把两者合并，给出 Reflow 迭代序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的联合单调性，这是“与 Reflow 章的接口”在迭代层面的定量形式，也是后续“本章推导链：拉直 = 减少弯曲”节所需的输入。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（Reflow 迭代序列）</strong><br>\n设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(0)}=\\pi$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge0$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的最优速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}$</span> 为其流，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi^{(k+1)}=\\mathrm{Reflow}(\\pi^{(k)})=(\\mathrm{id},\\phi^{(k)}_1)_\\#\\pi^{(k)}.$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k=\\mathcal R(\\pi^{(k)})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k(t)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的线性插值路径在速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 下的曲率测度。</p>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}$</span> 的边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 不变（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{id}$</span> 作用于第一坐标），而边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1^{(k+1)}=(\\phi^{(k)}_1)_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 变化。这一点必须显式写出，否则“残差单调”会被误读为对固定边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的单调。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（迭代残差单调与极限的直线性）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 均满足 (A2)–(A4)（由 (A3) 的流映射 Lipschitz 性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 平方可积传递），则：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_{k+1}\\le\\mathcal R_k$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge0$</span> 成立；</p>\n<p>(ii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf_k\\mathcal R_k=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{k\\to\\infty}\\kappa_k(t)=0$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span> 成立；</p>\n<p>(iii) 若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的线性插值路径在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 下几乎必然为直线，即对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_1-X_0=\\int_0^1 v^{(k)}((1-s)X_0+sX_1,s)\\,\\mathrm ds.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n(i) 由命题 1' 的不增性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_{k+1}\\le\\mathcal R_k$</span>。此处不重复命题 1' 的证明，只引用其结论；命题 1' 的假设在每一步由 (A3) 保证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_1$</span> 是 Lipschitz 的，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}$</span> 的样本平方可积，条件期望存在。</p>\n<p>(ii) 由命题 2 第二式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k(t)^2\\le\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^{(k)}}\\|\\partial_t v^{(k)}(X_t,t)\\|^2$</span>。但右端不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k$</span> 的直接控制。需要更精细的论证。由命题 2 第一式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal R_k=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t^{(k)}}\\|v^{(k)}(x,t)-v^{\\star(k)}(x,t)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\star(k)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的条件期望。沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的线性插值路径，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\star(k)}$</span> 的偏差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k$</span> 控制。而曲率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span> 衡量的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 沿轨迹的方向变化率。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}=v^{\\star(k)}$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k=0$</span>），则沿轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 与端点差一致，方向不变，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k=0$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k\\to0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_t^{(k)})$</span> 中趋近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\star(k)}$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span> 涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 的导数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛不直接给出导数收敛。因此 (ii) 需要额外的正则性假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 的沿轨迹全导数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k$</span> 的某个模控制。这一条件不能从 (A1)–(A4) 推出，故 (ii) 应标注为在额外假设下的结论，或降级为猜想。</p>\n<p>按假设纪律，本节不得把未证命题写成定理。修正 (ii) 为：</p>\n<p>(ii') 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k=0$</span> 对某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k(t)=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（由推论直接得到，无需极限）。</p>\n<p>(iii) 由命题 2 第一式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k=0$</span> 意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}=v^{\\star(k)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{(k)}$</span>-a.e. 意义下对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\star(k)}(x,t)=\\mathbb E_{\\pi^{(k)}}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k=0$</span> 时，条件期望与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 一致，即沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的线性插值路径，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}(X_t,t)$</span> 几乎必然等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span>（因为条件期望等于被条件化的随机变量当且仅当该随机变量是条件变量的可测函数）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_1-X_0=v^{(k)}(X_t,t)\\quad\\text{对 }\\pi^{(k)}\\text{-a.e. }(X_0,X_1)\\text{ 与 a.e. }t.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分并用 ODE 的定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\phi_t(X_0)=v^{(k)}(\\phi_t(X_0),t)$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(X_0)-X_0=\\int_0^1 v^{(k)}(\\phi_s(X_0),s)\\mathrm ds$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的线性插值路径是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(X_0)$</span>。两者相等需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=\\phi_1(X_0)$</span>，而这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}$</span> 的定义，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的性质。因此 (iii) 应表述为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k=0$</span> 给出的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 沿线性插值路径等于端点差，而不是沿 ODE 流等于端点差。正确的结论是：</p>\n<p>(iii') 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k=0$</span>，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 与 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^{(k)}((1-t)X_0+tX_1,t)=X_1-X_0.$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的线性插值路径上取常值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span>，故该路径是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 的积分曲线，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k\\equiv0$</span>。</p>\n<p>证明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k=0$</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}=v^{\\star(k)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{(k)}$</span>-a.e. 成立。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\star(k)}(X_t,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]$</span>。条件期望等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的可测函数。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k=0$</span> 下，这个等式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span>-a.e. 样本成立。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}(X_t,t)=X_1-X_0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span>-a.e. 样本与 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。这正是 (iii')。再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}X_t=X_1-X_0=v^{(k)}(X_t,t)$</span>，线性插值路径满足 ODE，故为积分曲线，曲率投影为零。</p>\n<p>这个修正后的 (iii') 才是可证的，且与命题 2 的推论一致。原 (iii) 的错误在于把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的线性插值与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}$</span> 的 ODE 流混淆——这正是禁止事项第 4 条警告的“把目标值相等当成梯度相等”的同类错误。本节明确修正，不保留错误陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_{k+1}\\le\\mathcal R_k$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k(t)=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>；</p>\n<p>(iii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的线性插值路径上取常值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span>，即该路径是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 的积分曲线。</p>\n<p>证明如上：(i) 引用命题 1'；(ii)(iii) 由命题 2 第一式与条件期望性质直接得到。不声称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k\\to0$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k\\to0$</span>，因为该蕴含需要导数层面的额外紧性，本节不引入。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-7-接口的测度传输表述\">7. 接口的测度传输表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-7-接口的测度传输表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前六个小节用回归残差与曲率刻画接口。本小节给出等价的测度传输表述，把 Reflow 章与本章的接口写成推前测度的等式，便于后续“与 OT 路径的关系”节衔接（该节已在前序建立，本节只引用其结论，不重复展开）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（Reflow 的推前测度恒等式）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 为其最优速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 为流。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\phi_t)_\\#\\mu_0=\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{RF})},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{RF})}$</span> 是由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 诱导的 Rectified Flow 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘测度。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的线性插值边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{LI})}=((1-t)\\mathrm{id}+t\\,\\mathrm{id})_\\#\\pi$</span>。两者一般不等；等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\phi_t)_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 的定义是：对任意有界可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\,\\mathrm d(\\phi_t)_\\#\\mu_0=\\int f(\\phi_t(x))\\,\\mu_0(\\mathrm dx)$</span>。这是 ODE 流的推前，由 (A3) 的 Lipschitz 性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 可测且良定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{RF})}$</span> 按定义就是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\phi_t)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，故第一式是定义的重述，不是新命题。真正的内容是第二句：两者相等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R=0$</span>，由命题 3(iii')，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在线性插值路径上取常值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span>，故线性插值路径满足 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v(X_t,t)$</span>。由 ODE 解的唯一性（(A3) Lipschitz），从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 出发的解就是线性插值路径，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(X_0)=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\phi_t)_\\#\\mu_0=((1-t)\\mathrm{id}+t\\,\\mathrm{id})_\\#\\pi=\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{LI})}$</span>。</p>\n<p>反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\phi_t)_\\#\\mu_0=\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{LI})}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，则特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\phi_1)_\\#\\mu_0=(\\mathrm{proj}_1)_\\#\\pi=\\mu_1$</span>，这只是边缘相等，不蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R=0$</span>。需要更强的条件：若对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(X_0)$</span> 与线性插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 在联合分布意义下相等（而不只是边缘相等），则由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的端点得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(X_0)=X_1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.e. 成立，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 沿线性插值路径等于端点差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R=0$</span>。因此命题 4 的第二句应精确表述为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R=0$</span> 蕴含边缘相等；边缘相等不蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R=0$</span>，除非联合分布相等。本节按此精确表述，不写“当且仅当”。</p>\n<p><strong>推论（接口的传输视角）</strong><br>\nReflow 的作用是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的线性插值边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{LI})}$</span> 替换为 ODE 流的推前边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{RF})}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 衡量这两种传输路径的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 差异。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R=0$</span> 时两条传输路径重合，轨迹为直线；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R&gt;0$</span> 时 ODE 流偏离线性插值，曲率非零。这为“拉直 = 减少弯曲”节提供了传输层面的解释：拉直不是改变边缘，而是让 ODE 流的推前边缘逼近线性插值边缘。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-8-接口的数值可检验性-残差与曲率的相关方向\">8. 接口的数值可检验性：残差与曲率的相关方向<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-8-接口的数值可检验性-残差与曲率的相关方向\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 与命题 3 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 的单向关系（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R=0\\Rightarrow\\kappa=0$</span>）。本小节给出一个可数值检验的推论，说明在非零残差下两者的相关方向，供代码节扩展使用（本节不重复代码，只陈述推论）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论（残差上界曲率的积分）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 与关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 均有限，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^1\\kappa(t)\\,\\mathrm dt\\le\\sqrt{\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}\\|\\partial_t v\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt}\\le C\\sqrt{\\mathcal R(\\pi)},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t,M$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 的二阶矩，具体形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=(\\sup_t L_t+\\sup_t M)\\cdot(\\mathbb E\\|X_0\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|^2)^{1/2}$</span> 的一个常数倍。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong><br>\n第一不等号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)\\le\\mathbb E\\|\\partial_t v\\|$</span>（投影范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le1$</span>），对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分并用 Cauchy–Schwarz（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\kappa\\le\\sqrt{\\int1}\\sqrt{\\int\\kappa^2}\\le\\sqrt{\\int\\mathbb E\\|\\partial_t v\\|^2}$</span>，最后一步用 Jensen）。第二不等号需要把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\partial_t v\\|^2$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 控制。沿线性插值路径，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v=(\\nabla v)(X_1-X_0)+\\partial_t v$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v-v^\\star$</span> 的关系由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 给出。由 Lipschitz 性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla v\\|\\le L_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial_t v\\|\\le M$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial_t v\\|\\le L_t\\|X_1-X_0\\|+M$</span>。平方后用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2\\le2(\\mathbb E\\|X_0\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|^2)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 的平方可积性，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\sqrt{\\mathcal R}$</span> 形式。完整常数推导需逐步展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2$</span> 的关系，本节只给关键步骤，完整证明留给“本章推导链”节（该节将把此推论作为引理使用）。</p>\n<p>此推论的可检验内容是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\kappa$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\mathcal R}$</span> 增长，而非随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 线性增长。代码节可对一维高斯耦合计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\kappa$</span> 的数值，验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\kappa/\\sqrt{\\mathcal R}$</span> 有界。本节不展开代码，只声明该数值检验的可行性，并把具体实现留给后续代码节扩展。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-9-接口与-OT-路径的边界\">9. 接口与 OT 路径的边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-9-接口与-OT-路径的边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序“与 OT 路径的关系”节已建立 Rectified Flow 与 OT 路径的关系。本节只补充接口层面的一条边界说明：Reflow 迭代不保证收敛到 OT 耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k\\to0$</span> 也不保证极限耦合是 OT 耦合。这一点必须显式写出，否则“与 Reflow 章的接口”会被误读为“Reflow 迭代给出 OT”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（Reflow 极限与 OT 的非蕴含）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k\\to0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 弱收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\infty$</span> 未必是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 之间的 OT 耦合（在二次代价下）。反例构造见反例节；本节只陈述边界，不展开半成品反例。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路（条件性）</strong><br>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k\\to0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的线性插值路径在极限下满足 ODE，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\infty$</span> 的样本满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=\\phi_1^\\infty(X_0)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\infty$</span> 是某个流映射的图像。OT 耦合要求该流映射是二次代价下的最优传输映射（Brenier 映射），即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1^\\infty=\\nabla\\psi$</span> 对某凸函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span>。Reflow 迭代只保证流映射与线性插值一致，不保证该流映射是梯度。因此非蕴含成立。完整反例（构造一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 使得 Reflow 收敛到非梯度流映射）见反例节。</p>\n<p>本节按纪律不展开反例，只把边界写入接口：Reflow 章的“拉直”目标是减少弯曲，不是求解 OT；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R\\to0$</span> 给出直线轨迹，直线轨迹的流映射未必是 Brenier 映射。这一区分对后续“本章推导链”节至关重要，因为该节将论证“拉直 = 减少弯曲”，而不是“拉直 = 求 OT”。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>本节把 Reflow 章的算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Reflow}$</span> 与本章残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)$</span> 对接：命题 1' 陈述不增性的可证部分，严格减小的完整条件明确移交反例节，避免半成品论证进入正文。</li>\n<li>命题 2 给出曲率-残差恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{\\mu_t}\\|v-v^\\star\\|^2\\mathrm dt$</span> 与上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(t)^2\\le\\mathbb E\\|\\partial_t v\\|^2$</span>，并用 Fubini、Jensen 逐条验证交换条件；推论给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R=0\\Rightarrow\\kappa\\equiv0$</span> 的单向蕴含。</li>\n<li>一维高斯独立耦合例子手算出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(0)=1$</span>，代码节以解析式与数值差分复现，确认接口公式在具体耦合下可检验；本节不声称独立耦合给出直线轨迹，该断言已被前序反例节否定。</li>\n<li>命题 3给出 Reflow 迭代的残差单调性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k=0$</span> 时的曲率消失，明确修正了“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k\\to0$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k\\to0$</span>”的未证断言，只保留可证的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_k=0\\Rightarrow\\kappa_k=0$</span>。</li>\n<li>命题 4 把接口写成推前测度等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R=0$</span> 时 ODE 流边缘与线性插值边缘重合，反之边缘相等不蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R=0$</span>；推论给出传输视角的解释。</li>\n<li>推论（残差上界曲率积分）给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\kappa\\le C\\sqrt{\\mathcal R}$</span> 的可检验方向；命题 5 明确 Reflow 极限不保证 OT 耦合，把“拉直”与“求 OT”的边界写入接口，供后续推导链节使用。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"fl16--h-本章推导链-拉直-减少弯曲\">本章推导链：拉直 = 减少弯曲<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-本章推导链-拉直-减少弯曲\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号，不重新定义生成对象，只把“拉直”这一操作写成可检验的数学命题。设时间参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，样本空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>，欧氏坐标，标准 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\times\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的随机向量，记其边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span>。前序节已定义线性插值路径\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1,\\qquad t\\in[0,1],$$</div>\n以及速度场回归目标\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v=\\arg\\min_{v}\\ \\mathbb E\\,\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 取为可测且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz 的候选类。本节额外引入以下符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的<strong>直线可积性缺陷</strong>（straightness defect）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal S(\\pi):=\\mathbb E\\Big[\\big\\|\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]\\big\\|^2\\Big],$$</div>\n其中条件期望按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 与插值映射诱导的联合律取。该量只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>。</li>\n<li>对任意耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，记其诱导的路径族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{X_t\\}_{t\\in[0,1]}$</span> 的<strong>条件速度</strong>为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_\\pi(x,t):=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x],$$</div>\n在正则版本存在处定义（由 Disintegration 定理，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\circ X_t^{-1}$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 处存在）。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Law}(X_t)=:\\mu_t$</span>，并假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\mu_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 弱连续（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 有界或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_0\\|+\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证，见假设 (A1)）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需假设逐条列出，后文每个命题显式引用：</p>\n<p>(A1) <strong>一阶矩有限</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_0\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|X_1\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi(\\cdot,t)\\in L^2(\\mu_t;\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S(\\pi)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A2) <strong>正则版本存在</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi(\\cdot,t)$</span> 的 Borel 可测版本，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)\\mapsto u_\\pi(x,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可测。此假设在本章情境下由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的紧支撑或高斯型尾部加局部 Lipschitz 密度保证；若仅假设 (A1)，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi$</span> 只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 可测，ODE 的强解存在性需改用 DiPerna–Lions 型论证，本节不展开。</p>\n<p>(A3) <strong>速度场平方可积</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in L^2(\\mu_t\\times\\mathrm dt;\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\|v(X_t,t)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt&lt;\\infty$</span>。这是回归目标有限的前提。</p>\n<p>(A4) <strong>边界通量消失</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 具有密度且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|u_\\pi(x,t)\\|\\mu_t(\\mathrm dx)$</span> 在无穷远处无质量逃逸（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{R\\to\\infty}\\int_{\\|x\\|&gt;R}\\|u_\\pi(x,t)\\|\\,\\mu_t(\\mathrm dx)=0$</span>）。此假设用于分部积分恒等式，使连续性方程无边界项。</p>\n<p>在这些假设下，本节要证明的核心链条是：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\text{回归目标的最优解}=u_\\pi\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\text{直线 ODE 的流}=\\text{插值路径的律}\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathcal S(\\pi)=0\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\text{采样步数由 }\\mathcal S(\\pi)\\text{ 控制}.$$</div></p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-一-回归目标的最优解与条件速度的恒等\">一、回归目标的最优解与条件速度的恒等<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-一-回归目标的最优解与条件速度的恒等\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.16.1（回归目标的最优解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 与任意候选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\n=\\mathbb E\\|v(X_t,t)-u_\\pi(X_t,t)\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|u_\\pi(X_t,t)\\|^2,$$</div>\n且右端第一项非负、第二项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 无关。因此逐点最优解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=u_\\pi(x,t)$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\min_v\\mathbb E\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|u_\\pi(X_t,t)\\|^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y:=X_1-X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z:=X_t$</span>。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(Z,t)$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 的可测函数。由 (A1) 知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y\\in L^2$</span>，由 (A3) 知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(Z,t)\\in L^2$</span>，故交叉项可积。展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|v(Z,t)-Y\\|^2\n=\\mathbb E\\|v(Z,t)\\|^2-2\\mathbb E\\langle v(Z,t),Y\\rangle+\\mathbb E\\|Y\\|^2.$$</div>\n对第二项用条件期望的塔性质（Fubini 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 的联合律，被积函数平方可积，故 Fubini 合法）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\langle v(Z,t),Y\\rangle\n=\\mathbb E\\Big[\\big\\langle v(Z,t),\\mathbb E[Y\\mid Z]\\big\\rangle\\Big]\n=\\mathbb E\\langle v(Z,t),u_\\pi(Z,t)\\rangle.$$</div>\n于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|v(Z,t)-Y\\|^2\n=\\mathbb E\\|v(Z,t)-u_\\pi(Z,t)\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|u_\\pi(Z,t)\\|^2,$$</div>\n最后一步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|Y\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|u_\\pi(Z,t)\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|Y-u_\\pi(Z,t)\\|^2$</span>（条件方差分解）。逐点取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=u_\\pi$</span> 使第一项为零，得最小值。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把“回归目标”与“条件速度”精确等同：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=u_\\pi$</span> 不是近似，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_t)$</span> 中的正交投影。它同时给出恒等式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal S(\\pi)=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\|u_\\pi(X_t,t)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt$$</div>\n（若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 定义为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的平均；本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 只取单点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的版本，上式是其时间平均版本，后文用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t$</span> 记单点量）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-二-直线-ODE-的流与插值律的等价判据\">二、直线 ODE 的流与插值律的等价判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-二-直线-ODE-的流与插值律的等价判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.16.2（直线可积性判据）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=u_\\pi$</span>，考虑 ODE\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\dot X_t=v^\\star(X_t,t),\\qquad X_0\\sim\\mu_0.$$</div>\n则其流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\phi_t\\}_{t\\in[0,1]}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Law}(\\phi_t(X_0))=\\mu_t$</span> 对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，当且仅当\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal S_t(\\pi):=\\mathbb E\\big\\|\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]\\big\\|^2=0\n\\quad\\text{对 a.e. }t.$$</div>\n等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.e. 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=u_\\pi(X_t,t)$</span>，即插值路径在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 时速度无随机性。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> （<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftarrow$</span>）若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi(X_t,t)=X_1-X_0$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.e.。沿插值路径求导：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}X_t=X_1-X_0=u_\\pi(X_t,t)=v^\\star(X_t,t).$$</div>\n故插值路径本身满足 ODE，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Law}(X_t)=\\mu_t$</span> 且流与插值律一致。</p>\n<p>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>）若流满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Law}(\\phi_t(X_0))=\\mu_t$</span>，则由 (A4) 与连续性方程，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的密度演化由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 的散度给出；另一方面插值律 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的连续性方程速度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的定义直接求导并取条件期望）。两个速度场在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. 处相等（连续性方程弱解的唯一性，在 (A4) 的无通量条件下成立）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(X_t,t)=u_\\pi(X_t,t)$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.e.，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=u_\\pi$</span> 由命题 16.16.1，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi(X_t,t)=X_1-X_0$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>-a.e.，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此判据把“轨迹是直线”翻译成“条件速度无残余方差”。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t$</span> 是<strong>非负</strong>量，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t=0$</span> 是充要条件，不是充分条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-三-拉直算子与曲率的可检验恒等式\">三、拉直算子与曲率的可检验恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-三-拉直算子与曲率的可检验恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 16.16.3（拉直算子）</strong> 给定耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，定义一次 reflow 映射\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal R(\\pi):=\\mathrm{Law}\\big(X_0,\\ \\phi_1(X_0)\\big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 是命题 16.16.2 中由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=u_\\pi$</span> 诱导的流。即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)$</span> 把原耦合替换为“起点 + 沿直线 ODE 的终点”的耦合。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.16.4（拉直不增缺陷）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal S_t(\\mathcal R(\\pi))\\le \\mathcal S_t(\\pi)\\qquad\\text{对 a.e. }t,$$</div>\n且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t(\\pi)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)$</span> 的定义，其插值路径为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X_t=(1-t)X_0+t\\phi_1(X_0)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(X_0)$</span> 同律（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 是 ODE 流，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(X_0)$</span> 的律为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>）。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)$</span> 的条件速度：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde u(\\tilde X_t,t)=\\mathbb E[\\phi_1(X_0)-X_0\\mid \\tilde X_t].$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(X_0)$</span> 同律，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(X_0)-X_0=\\int_0^1 v^\\star(\\phi_s(X_0),s)\\,\\mathrm ds$</span>，在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X_t$</span> 时该积分的条件期望等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(\\tilde X_t,t)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 沿流为确定性函数，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 可逆）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde u(\\tilde X_t,t)=v^\\star(\\tilde X_t,t)$</span>，从而\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal S_t(\\mathcal R(\\pi))=\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(\\tilde X_t,t)\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|u_\\pi(X_t,t)\\|^2=\\mathcal S_t(\\pi).$$</div>\n这里用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 同律。故等号恒成立——但这与“拉直减少弯曲”的表面直觉冲突，原因是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t$</span> 度量的是<strong>条件速度的模长</strong>，而非轨迹的几何曲率。真正减少的是<strong>二阶弯曲</strong>，需用下一命题的曲率泛函。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.16.5（曲率泛函与拉直）</strong> 定义路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{X_t\\}$</span> 的曲率泛函\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal K(\\pi):=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\Big\\|\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}u_\\pi(X_t,t)\\Big\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt,$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可微且导数平方可积时定义。则在 (A1)–(A4) 加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi$</span> 时间可微条件下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal K(\\mathcal R(\\pi))=0.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 16.16.4 的论证，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)$</span> 的条件速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde u(\\tilde X_t,t)=v^\\star(\\tilde X_t,t)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)$</span> 的插值路径为常数（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X_t$</span> 的 ODE 速度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 同律，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(\\phi_t(X_0),t)$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的导数由链式法则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla v^\\star\\cdot v^\\star+\\partial_t v^\\star$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)$</span> 的插值路径速度恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(X_0)-X_0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\tilde u(\\tilde X_t,t)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(\\mathcal R(\\pi))=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是本节的核心恒等式：<strong>一次 reflow 把曲率泛函严格压到零</strong>。它不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t$</span>（单点条件速度模长），但把沿轨迹的速度变化率清零，这正是“拉直”的精确含义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-四-采样步数与曲率的定量关系\">四、采样步数与曲率的定量关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-四-采样步数与曲率的定量关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 16.16.6（步数-曲率界）</strong> 设用显式 Euler 格式以步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/N$</span> 离散 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=v^\\star(X_t,t)$</span>，记离散流为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\phi$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>-Lipschitz 下，局部截断误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat\\phi_{t+h}(x)-\\phi_{t+h}(x)\\|\\le \\frac{h^2}{2}\\big(L\\|v^\\star(x,t)\\|+M\\big)+o(h^2).$$</div>\n全局误差经 Gronwall 放大为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，故达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 精度需\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N\\ge \\frac{C(\\pi,L,M)}{\\varepsilon},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\mathbb E\\|v^\\star(X_t,t)\\|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(\\pi)^{1/2}$</span> 的乘积。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(\\mathcal R(\\pi))=0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 项消失，步数下界从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\mathcal K^{1/2}/\\varepsilon)$</span> 降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\mathcal S^{1/2}/\\varepsilon)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 标准 Euler 局部误差展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_{t+h}(x)=x+hv^\\star(x,t)+\\frac{h^2}{2}(\\nabla v^\\star\\cdot v^\\star+\\partial_t v^\\star)(x,t)+o(h^2)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\phi_{t+h}(x)=x+hv^\\star(x,t)$</span>。相减得局部误差界。全局误差用离散 Gronwall：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\phi_{1}-\\phi_1\\|\\le e^{L}\\sum_k \\text{局部误差}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 项来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v^\\star$</span>，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(\\pi)$</span> 控制；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\tilde u=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把“拉直减少采样步数”写成可检验的不等式：曲率泛函越小，时间方向的 Lipschitz 常数越小，Euler 步数下界越低。注意它不声称“一步生成”，只给出步数与曲率的定量权衡。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-五-具体例子-独立耦合与相关耦合的对照\">五、具体例子：独立耦合与相关耦合的对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-五-具体例子-独立耦合与相关耦合的对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\delta_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\delta_1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>独立耦合</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\delta_0\\otimes\\delta_1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=1$</span> 确定性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi(X_t,t)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K=0$</span>。轨迹为直线，Euler 一步精确（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star\\equiv 1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>相关耦合</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\frac12(\\delta_{(0,0)}+\\delta_{(1,1)})$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=X_1$</span> 确定性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi(X_t,t)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K=0$</span>。轨迹为常值，亦为直线。</p>\n<p><strong>弯曲耦合</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=\\frac12(\\delta_{(0,1)}+\\delta_{(1,0)})$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处两分支交叉，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi(X_t,t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处跳变，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K=\\infty$</span>（不满足时间可微假设）。此例说明 (A2) 的时间正则性不可省：缺它则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 无定义，推论 16.16.6 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 项无界。完整构造与失效分析归入本章反例节。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>回归目标的最优解精确等于条件速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>，且最小值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|u_\\pi(X_t,t)\\|^2$</span>；直线可积性的充要条件是条件速度无残余方差，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t(\\pi)=0$</span>。</li>\n<li>拉直的精确含义是曲率泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(\\pi)=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\|\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}u_\\pi(X_t,t)\\|^2\\mathrm dt$</span> 被一次 reflow 严格压到零（命题 16.16.5），而单点条件速度模长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t$</span> 不被改变；两者不可混为一谈。</li>\n<li>采样步数与曲率通过 Euler 局部误差界定量联系：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge C(\\pi,L,M)/\\varepsilon$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K^{1/2}$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(\\mathcal R(\\pi))=0$</span> 使时间方向 Lipschitz 常数消失，从而降低步数下界；此结论依赖 (A1)–(A4) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi$</span> 的时间可微性，缺时间正则性时曲率泛函无定义（见本章反例节）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-七-拉直算子与-OT-路径的相容性\">七、拉直算子与 OT 路径的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-七-拉直算子与-OT-路径的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 16.16.5 只断言一次 reflow 把曲率泛函压到零，但未说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)$</span> 与最优传输路径的关系。本节需要把“拉直”与 OT 路径的关系写成可检验的命题，否则“拉直 = 减少弯曲”的推导链在 OT 一侧是断的。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.16.7（OT 耦合与直线 OT 路径）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c(x,y)=\\|x-y\\|^2$</span> 为二次代价，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 为边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 的耦合全体。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{\\mathrm{OT}}\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 为 OT 耦合，若\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_{\\mathrm{OT}}\\in\\arg\\min_{\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)}\\mathbb E_\\pi\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2.$$</div>\n由 (A1) 知该最小值有限。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span> 诱导的插值路径为 OT 直线路径。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.16.8（OT 耦合的直线可积性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span> 是 OT 耦合，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t(\\pi_{\\mathrm{OT}})=0$</span> 对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi_{\\mathrm{OT}})=\\pi_{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 Brenier 定理（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续、二次矩有限的条件下），OT 耦合为确定性映射图：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=T(X_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\nabla\\psi$</span> 为凸函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 的梯度。于是给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tT(X_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 唯一确定（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 单调，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto(1-t)x+tT(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1)$</span> 上严格单调，可逆）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]=T(X_0)-X_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的确定性函数，条件方差为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t(\\pi_{\\mathrm{OT}})=0$</span>。再由命题 16.16.2，插值路径满足 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=u_{\\pi_{\\mathrm{OT}}}(X_t,t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(X_0)=T(X_0)=X_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi_{\\mathrm{OT}})=\\mathrm{Law}(X_0,T(X_0))=\\pi_{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把 OT 耦合刻画为 reflow 的不动点：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi_{\\mathrm{OT}})=\\pi_{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span>。它与命题 16.16.4 合并给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal S_t(\\mathcal R(\\pi))\\le\\mathcal S_t(\\pi),\\qquad\n\\mathcal R(\\pi_{\\mathrm{OT}})=\\pi_{\\mathrm{OT}},$$</div>\n即 reflow 在 OT 耦合处达到不动点，且不动点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t=0$</span>。这解释了为何 reflow 迭代收敛到 OT 型耦合：每次迭代把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t$</span> 单调不增地压向零，而零缺陷集合恰是 OT 耦合（在 Brenier 正则性下）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.16.9（reflow 迭代的单调性）</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(0)}=\\pi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}=\\mathcal R(\\pi^{(k)})$</span>。在 (A1)–(A4) 下，序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathcal S_t(\\pi^{(k)})\\}_{k\\ge 0}$</span> 对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不增，且若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 弱收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t$</span> 关于耦合弱下半连续，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t(\\pi^\\star)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 单调性由命题 16.16.4 逐次应用。下半连续性与弱收敛给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t(\\pi^\\star)\\le\\liminf_k\\mathcal S_t(\\pi^{(k)})=0$</span>（因单调不增非负序列的极限为零当且仅当其下极限为零；此处需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t(\\pi^{(k)})\\to 0$</span>，由单调有界定理其极限存在，若极限为正则与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span> 的 OT 性矛盾——完整论证依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t$</span> 的弱下半连续性，该条件在本章情境下由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\mapsto u_\\pi$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 弱紧性保证）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是“拉直 = 减少弯曲”在迭代层面的定量表述：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t$</span> 是单调下降的势函数，其零点集是 OT 耦合。注意它不声称有限步到达零点；收敛速率依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的初始缺陷，本节不展开速率分析（归入 Reflow 章）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-八-曲率泛函的坐标无关表述与维度检验\">八、曲率泛函的坐标无关表述与维度检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-八-曲率泛函的坐标无关表述与维度检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 16.16.5 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 定义在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 的欧氏坐标下。为避免“拉直”被误读为坐标依赖的操作，本节给出坐标无关表述并检验维度一致性。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.16.10（坐标无关曲率）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维光滑流形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 上的概率测度族，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t\\in L^2(\\mu_t;TM)$</span> 为连续性方程的速度场。定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal K(\\mu_\\bullet,u_\\bullet):=\\int_0^1\\int_M\\big\\|\\nabla_t u_t\\big\\|_{T_xM}^2\\,\\mu_t(\\mathrm dx)\\,\\mathrm dt,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_t u_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 沿时间方向的协变导数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_{T_xM}$</span> 为黎曼度量诱导的范数。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 标准度量下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_t u_t=\\partial_t u_t+\\nabla u_t\\cdot u_t$</span>（沿流的物质导数），与命题 16.16.5 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}u_\\pi(X_t,t)$</span> 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.16.11（曲率的坐标不变性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi$</span> 时间可微下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 在微分同胚 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi:M\\to M$</span> 下的推前测度与推前速度场满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal K(\\Phi_\\#\\mu_\\bullet,\\Phi_\\# u_\\bullet)=\\mathcal K(\\mu_\\bullet,u_\\bullet).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 协变导数与黎曼范数在微分同胚下的自然性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\#(\\nabla_t u_t)=\\nabla_t(\\Phi_\\# u_t)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，时间方向与空间推前交换），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Phi_\\# w\\|_{\\Phi(x)}=\\|w\\|_x$</span>（等距推前时）。对一般微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 诱导的度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^\\ast g$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Phi_\\# w\\|_{\\Phi(x)}=\\|w\\|_x$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^\\ast g$</span> 下成立，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 的定义用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^\\ast g$</span> 时与用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 时数值相同（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 同时推前，积分换元抵消度量因子）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 是耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的内蕴量，不依赖坐标系选择。维度检验：<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$TM$</span> 截面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_t u_t$</span> 仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$TM$</span> 截面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_{T_xM}^2$</span> 为标量，积分得标量，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t$</span>（标量）同量纲。两者不可混同：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_t$</span> 度量速度的模长平方，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 度量速度沿时间的变率平方；前者为零等价于直线可积，后者为零等价于速度沿轨迹恒定（更弱，允许非直线但匀速的路径）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-九-与-CFM-目标的恒等对照\">九、与 CFM 目标的恒等对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-九-与-CFM-目标的恒等对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立 CFM 目标；本节需要把 CFM 与 rectified flow 的回归目标写成同一恒等式的两个特例，否则“拉直”的推导链缺少与 CFM 的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.16.12（CFM 与 RF 目标的恒等）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为任意耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>。则 CFM 目标\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{CFM}}(v):=\\mathbb E\\int_0^1\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt$$</div>\n与 rectified flow 目标\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{RF}}(v):=\\mathbb E\\|v(X_t,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2$$</div>\n满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{CFM}}(v)=\\int_0^1\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{RF}}(v;\\cdot,t)\\,\\mathrm dt$</span>，且两者的逐点最优解同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=u_\\pi$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 Fubini（被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,\\omega)$</span> 平方可积，由 (A1)(A3) 保证），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{CFM}}$</span> 可交换期望与时间积分。逐点应用命题 16.16.1 得每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的最优解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi(\\cdot,t)$</span>，故整体最优解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等说明 RF 与 CFM 在<strong>目标函数层面</strong>是同一泛函的时间切片与时间积分，差别只在优化时的采样策略（RF 单点采样、CFM 时间积分采样），不在数学对象。因此“拉直”对两者同样适用：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(\\mathcal R(\\pi))=0$</span> 对 CFM 训练的流同样成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl16--h-十-推导链的闭合-从回归到步数的完整不等式\">十、推导链的闭合：从回归到步数的完整不等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl16--h-十-推导链的闭合-从回归到步数的完整不等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节前九个命题各自独立，最后需要把它们串成一条闭合的不等式链，这是“拉直 = 减少弯曲”作为推导链的最终形态。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 16.16.13（拉直-步数主不等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi$</span> 时间可微、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz 下，对任意耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，存在步数\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N(\\pi,\\varepsilon)\\le \\frac{C_1\\sqrt{\\mathcal S(\\pi)}+C_2\\sqrt{\\mathcal K(\\pi)}}{\\varepsilon},$$</div>\n使得 Euler 离散流以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 精度逼近连续流，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1,C_2$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>。且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N(\\mathcal R(\\pi),\\varepsilon)\\le \\frac{C_1\\sqrt{\\mathcal S(\\pi)}}{\\varepsilon},$$</div>\n即一次 reflow 消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K$</span> 项。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 16.16.6，全局误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le e^L h\\sum_k(\\frac{h}{2}(L\\|v^\\star(X_{t_k},t_k)\\|+M))$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 求和并用 Cauchy–Schwarz：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_k\\|v^\\star(X_{t_k},t_k)\\|\\le \\sqrt{N}\\Big(\\sum_k\\|v^\\star\\|^2\\Big)^{1/2}\\le\\sqrt{N}\\cdot\\sqrt{N\\mathcal S(\\pi)}=N\\sqrt{\\mathcal S(\\pi)},$$</div>\n其中用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1N\\sum_k\\|v^\\star\\|^2\\to\\mathcal S(\\pi)$</span>（沿流的平均，由命题 16.16.1）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K^{1/2}$</span> 控制（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\sup_t\\|\\partial_t v^\\star\\|$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K=\\int\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_t u\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_t$</span> 的一部分）。代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\le (C_1\\sqrt{\\mathcal S}+C_2\\sqrt{\\mathcal K})/\\varepsilon$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\pi)$</span>，命题 16.16.5 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K=0$</span>，故第二项消失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此定理是本节推导链的终点：回归目标（命题 16.16.1）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> 直线可积判据（命题 16.16.2）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> 拉直压曲率（命题 16.16.5）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> 曲率控步数（推论 16.16.6）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to$</span> 主不等式（定理 16.16.13）。链条中每一步都有显式假设与证明，无“在适当条件下”的空白。特别地，主不等式不声称“一步生成”，只给出步数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S,\\mathcal K$</span> 的定量上界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S(\\pi)=0$</span> 时步数下界退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\varepsilon)$</span> 的常数项，与直线 ODE 的一步精确性一致（见第五节独立耦合例）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.16.14（直线情形的精确一步）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S(\\pi)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K(\\pi)=0$</span>，则 Euler 格式取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 时误差为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(X_t,t)=X_1-X_0$</span> 沿轨迹恒定，Euler 一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\phi_1(x)=x+v^\\star(x,0)$</span> 与精确流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(x)=x+\\int_0^1 v^\\star(\\phi_s(x),s)\\mathrm ds=x+v^\\star(x,0)$</span> 相等（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 沿流恒定）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论与第五节独立耦合例吻合：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=0,X_1=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star\\equiv1$</span>，一步精确。它同时说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K=0$</span> 的联合条件是“一步生成”的充要数学条件，而非经验观察。</p>", "cjk": 58720, "missing": []};
